head (below is negative).":"真っ直ぐ前からの上方向の角度（下は負の値）。","Degrees below your line of sight. More puts the card lower, out of the way of the HUD.":"視線から下に何度の位置か。大きいほどカードが下がり、HUD の邪魔になりません。","Degrees to the right of straight ahead (left is negative).":"真っ直ぐ前からの右方向の角度（左は負の値）。","Depth of field":"被写界深度","Depth of field and camera effects":"被写界深度とカメラ効果","Depth-of-field fields not found":"被写界深度のフィールドが見つかりません","Desktop window":"デスクトップウィンドウ","Detection details":"検出の詳細","Developer playtest checklist":"開発者向けプレイテストチェックリスト","Dialogue shots use a zoom lens your headset's wide view can't show, so people look small and far. This moves you nearer, per shot, so they keep this share of their 2D size. At 0 you stay at the game camera's own spot, 100 matches the 2D shot and above 100 comes closer still. Game camera in full VR only.":"会話シーンはズームレンズを使っており、ヘッドセットの広い視野では再現できず、人物が小さく遠くに見えます。これを上げるとシーンごとに近づき、2D での見かけの大きさをこの割合だけ保ちます。0 ではゲームカメラ本来の位置のまま、100 で 2D のショットに一致し、100 を超えるとさらに近づきます。フル VR のゲームカメラでのみ有効です。","Diorama (10×)":"ジオラマ（10 倍）","Diorama (miniature world)":"ジオラマ（ミニチュアの世界）","Diorama camera":"ジオラマカメラ","Diorama is on at %.0fx. This slider edits the normal scale restored when you turn it off in WuWa Controls.":"ジオラマは %.0f 倍で有効です。このスライダーは、WuWa Controls でオフにしたときに戻る通常のスケールを編集します。","Diorama mode (optional)":"ジオラマモード（任意）","Diorama needs Native Stereo. Choose it under Stereo rendering compatibility.":"ジオラマには Native Stereo が必要です。立体描画の互換性で選択してください。","Diorama on / off":"ジオラマの切替","Diorama scale":"ジオラマの倍率","Diorama uses a temporary miniature scale (Diorama scale on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page, 10x by default) with Native Stereo, with the portal on or off. Turning it off returns to your normal saved scale, including deliberate scale edits. It starts off each launch, settings reload and runtime reinitialization. Head movement is magnified; L3 + A recenters.":"ジオラマは Native Stereo で一時的にミニチュアの倍率（WuWa VR メニューのクイックページのジオラマの倍率、既定は 10 倍）を使用します（ポータルのオン／オフは問いません）。オフにすると、意図的なスケール変更も含め、保存済みの通常スケールに戻ります。起動時、設定の再読込時、ランタイムの再初期化時には毎回オフの状態で始まります。頭の動きが拡大されます。L3 + A で再センタリングします。","Diorama: forward / back":"ジオラマ：前 / 後","Diorama: right / left":"ジオラマ：右 / 左","Diorama: up / down":"ジオラマ：上 / 下","Direct PlayStation shortcuts are experimental. The game still receives their buttons. Steam Input is preferred when available; release all controls after changing input sources.":"PlayStation の直接ショートカットは実験的です。ゲームには引き続きボタン入力が送られます。利用可能な場合は Steam Input を推奨します。入力ソースを変更した後は、すべてのコントロールを離してください。","Discard unsent note":"未送信のメモを破棄","Distance":"距離","Do: ":"実行: ","Done":"完了","Double L3  Windows screenshot":"L3 を２回  Windows のスクリーンショット","Double R3":"R3 を２回押す","Double R3  Freecam on / off":"R3 を２回  フリーカメラの切替","Draws the missing eye of the world-label stage with its own camera and depth rectangle. Requires the matching candidate DLL and native stereo without Native Stereo Fix. Unsupported layouts keep the original rendering. NPC/bubble acceptance is pending; this does not repair reflections or character materials.":"ワールドラベル段階で欠けている片目を、専用のカメラと深度矩形で描画します。対応する候補 DLL と、Native Stereo Fix なしの Native Stereo が必要です。未対応のレイアウトでは元の描画のままです。NPC／吹き出しの受け入れは保留中です。反射やキャラクターのマテリアルは修復しません。","Drone response (higher = less drift)":"ドローンの応答（高いほどドリフトが少ない）","DualSense direct shortcuts (experimental)":"DualSense 直接ショートカット（実験）","DualShock 4 direct shortcuts (experimental)":"DualShock 4 直接ショートカット（実験）","ESC / overlay menus (detected)":"ESC／オーバーレイ（検出）","EXPECT":"期待値","Each eye: %u x %u pixels. Now about %.0f fps.":"片目あたり：%u x %u ピクセル。現在約 %.0f fps。","Early stereo view setup (experimental)":"ステレオビューの早期セットアップ（実験）","Edit the UTF-8 JSON files in your game profile's wuwa-languages folder. Missing entries fall back to English. Reload applies changes without restarting the game.":"ゲームプロファイルの wuwa-languages フォルダーにある UTF-8 の JSON ファイルを編集してください。存在しない項目は英語にフォールバックします。再読込すると、ゲームを再起動せずに変更が適用されます。","Edit translations":"翻訳を編集","Enable WuWa controller shortcuts":"WuWa コントローラーショートカットを有効化","Enable automatic switching":"自動切替を有効化","Enable controller mouse shortcuts":"コントローラーのマウスショートカットを有効化","End run":"ランを終了","End the temporary focus/motion test below before starting a comparison.":"比較を開始する前に、下の一時的なフォーカス／動作テストを終了してください。","Enter first person":"一人称視点に切り替え","Everyday controller shortcuts":"日常的なコントローラーショートカット","Everyone":"全員","Everything else: {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"その他：{L3}+{R3} で WuWa VR メニューを開く","Exact animation":"アニメーション通り","Exact animation (stick does not steer view)":"アニメ完全追従（視点操作なし）","Exit mouse mode now":"マウスモードを終了","Expect: ":"期待: ","Extract additional game menus (experimental)":"追加ゲームメニューを抽出（実験）","Extract game HUD into the VR panel":"HUD を VR パネルに抽出","Eyes don't match":"左右の目が合わない","FPV camera upward tilt (degrees)":"FPV カメラの上向きチルト（度）","Faces the view forward from where you are now.":"現在の位置から前方に視点を向けます。","Fail":"失敗","Far trees and props switch detail together in both eyes. Recommended.":"遠くの木やオブジェクトは両目で同時にディテールが切り替わります。推奨。","Fill whole frame (stretch)":"枠全体を埋める（引き伸ばし）","Finish only when you are done. Untested checks remain Not tested; no result is inferred from notes.":"終わったときだけ終了してください。未テストのチェックは「未テスト」のまま残ります。メモから結果が推測されることはありません。","Finish playtest":"プレイテストを終了","Finished":"完了","Finishing the video. Please wait.":"動画を保存しています。お待ちください。","First person":"一人称視点","First person character visibility":"一人称でのキャラ表示","First person forward offset":"一人称の前後オフセット","First person height offset":"一人称の高さオフセット","First person motion":"一人称の動き","First person on / off":"一人称視点オン／オフ","First person right offset":"一人称の左右オフセット","First person: full animation":"一人称：全アニメーション","First view":"初期視点","First-person position":"一人称の位置","First-person script status":"一人称スクリプトの状態","Fit to portal frame":"ポータル枠に合わせる","Fixed":"固定","Fixed camera distance (game units)":"固定カメラ距離（ゲーム単位）","Fixed camera height above pawn (game units)":"ポーンからの固定カメラ高さ（ゲーム単位）","Fixed per shot":"ショットごとに固定","Fixed third person":"固定三人称視点","Fixed: farther / closer":"固定：遠く／近く","Fixes":"修正","Flat screen; easiest on the eyes":"平面スクリーン：目に最もやさしい","Flat, like a monitor":"平面（モニターのように）","Flying style":"飛行スタイル","Focus game on controller reconnect":"コントローラー再接続時にゲームにフォーカス","Follow animated head / neck position (Custom)":"アニメーションする頭 / 首の位置に追従（カスタム）","Follow the focus":"フォーカスに追従","Follow view (player HUD)":"視点に追従（HUD）","Follow view keeps the HUD with your head. Distance still sets its stereo depth; choose a comfortable size and distance in the headset.":"追従視点では HUD が頭に付いてきます。距離は立体感（ステレオ奥行き）を決めるので、ヘッドセット内で見やすいサイズと距離を選んでください。","For exact edge alignment set WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature to 0. This HUD panel is flat; it does not bend with a curved aperture.":"端を正確に合わせるには、WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature を 0 に設定してください。この HUD パネルは平面なので、湾曲した開口部には沿いません。","For the WuWa VR menu, the controls cards and notices. The game's own language is set in the game.":"WuWa VR メニュー、操作カード、通知の言語です。ゲーム本体の言語はゲーム内で設定します。","For the whole scene":"シーン全体","For troubleshooting and comparisons. Leave these alone for everyday play; opening this section changes nothing.":"トラブルシューティングと比較用です。通常プレイではそのままにしてください。このセクションを開いても何も変わりません。","For troubleshooting. These controls can change rendering or input; opening this section changes nothing.":"トラブルシューティング用です。これらの項目は描画や入力に影響することがあります。このセクションを開いても何も変わりません。","Forward / back":"前 / 後","Forward Windows focus events (test)":"Windows のフォーカスイベントを転送（テスト）","Frame coverage (1 = full size)":"枠の充填率（1＝全体）","Frame rate":"フレームレート","Frames per second in the video.":"動画の 1 秒あたりのフレーム数。","Framing and theatre details":"フレーミングとシアターの詳細","Framing candidate refused; see diagnostic log":"画角候補を拒否。診断ログを確認してください","Framing matched both eyes in the owner's simulator replay. Headset comfort and rare prerecorded movies still need testing.":"フレーミングは製作者のシミュレーター再生で両眼が一致しました。ヘッドセットでの快適さと、まれな録画済み動画はまだ検証が必要です。","Framing repair matched both eyes in a simulator quest replay. Headset comfort remains untested; mono theatre is still available as a manual fallback.":"フレーミング修正はシミュレーターのクエスト再生で両眼が一致しました。ヘッドセットでの快適さは未検証です。モノラルシアターは手動の代替として引き続き利用できます。","Freecam":"フリーカメラ","Freecam collision (experimental)":"フリーカメラの衝突（実験）","Freecam movement speed":"フリーカメラの移動速度","Freecam movement style":"フリーカメラの移動方式","Freecam on / off":"フリーカメラの切替","Freecam turning speed":"フリーカメラの旋回速度","Freecam: LB descends; double RT = turbo":"フリーカメラ：LB で下降、RT を 2 回でターボ","Freecam: LT rises, RT boosts speed":"フリーカメラ：LT で上昇、RT で加速","Freecam: boost / turbo":"自由カメラ：加速／ターボ","Freecam: left stick moves, right looks":"フリーカメラ：左スティックで移動、右で視点","Freecam: move / look":"自由カメラ：移動／見回す","Freecam: rise / descend":"自由カメラ：上昇／下降","Front":"正面","Full VR":"フル VR","Full VR / stereo screen (click again to switch back)":"フル VR / 立体スクリーン（もう一度クリックで戻る）","Full VR draws two large eye images every frame, far more pixels than the stereo screen, so busy scenes such as dialogue run slower there. A lower resolution is smoother and a little softer.":"フル VR は毎フレーム 2 枚の大きな眼の映像を描画し、立体スクリーンよりはるかに多くのピクセルを扱うため、会話など負荷の高いシーンでは動作が重くなります。解像度を下げると滑らかになりますが、少しぼやけます。","Full VR: the game all around you. Stereo screen: a big 3D screen, for menus and scenes that look wrong in full VR. Mono theatre: a flat screen, the same picture in both eyes. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then hold R3 (hold again to go back).":"フル VR：ゲームが目の前に広がります。立体スクリーン：大きな 3D スクリーンで、フル VR では不自然に見えるメニューやシーン向けです。モノシアター：両眼に同じ映像を表示する平面スクリーンです。ショートカット：LT + RT を押したまま R3 を長押し（もう一度長押しで戻る）。","Full animation":"全アニメーション","Full animation follows character turns and can be intense. L3 + D-pad Down returns to your previous motion choice.":"全アニメーションはキャラクターの向きに追従し、酔いやすい場合があります。L3 + 十字キーの下で、前回の動き設定に戻ります。","Full animation is paused: headset/controller aim or Decoupled Pitch conflicts with animated head turning. Game-view rotation is being used; head position still follows the character.":"全アニメーションは一時停止中です：ヘッドセット／コントローラーの照準か上下角度の分離が、アニメーションする頭の回転と競合しています。ゲーム視点の回転を使用中ですが、頭の位置はキャラクターに追従します。","Full animation rotation (experimental)":"全アニメーション回転（実験）","Full animation: stick override":"全アニメーション：スティック優先","Full frame at 1 fills both axes of the portal rectangle. It stretches the HUD if its proportions differ from the frame. Preserve proportions leaves space on one axis. Safe fit also leaves a margin for rounded/feathered edges. Your separate HUD layout is retained.":"1 の全枠はポータル矩形の両軸を埋めます。HUD の縦横比が枠と異なる場合は引き伸ばされます。縦横比を維持すると片方の軸に余白が残ります。セーフフィットは角丸／ぼかしの縁のための余白も残します。別途設定した HUD レイアウトは保持されます。","Full speed while Polar walk is on":"Polar 歩行中は全速","Full-resolution translucent materials in stereo (candidate)":"立体表示で全解像度の半透明マテリアル（候補）","Fully hold both triggers first. R3: click to switch between full VR and the stereo screen, hold 0.8 seconds for mono theatre (hold again to go back); with the triggers still held you can click or hold R3 again. L3: click to turn blur on or off, hold 0.8 seconds for the stereo screen; release all controls before repeating an L3 shortcut. Available during dialogue; close UEVR and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first.":"まず両方のトリガーを最後まで押し込んでください。R3：クリックでフル VR と立体スクリーンを切り替え、0.8 秒長押しでモノシアター（もう一度長押しで戻る）。トリガーを押したままなら R3 を何度でもクリック・長押しできます。L3：クリックでぼかしのオン／オフ、0.8 秒長押しで立体スクリーン。L3 のショートカットを繰り返す前にはすべての操作を離してください。会話中に使用できます。先に UEVR を閉じ、HUD／マウス調整を終了してください。","GAME UI HIDDEN - MENUS ARE HIDDEN TOO":"ゲーム UI 非表示 - メニューも隠れます","GAME UI IS HIDDEN":"ゲーム UI は非表示です","GAME UI IS HIDDEN - menus are hidden too":"ゲーム UI は非表示です - メニューも隠れます","GENERAL":"一般","Game / fixed camera":"ゲーム／固定カメラ","Game camera":"ゲームカメラ","Game camera follows WuWa's own camera and its dialogue camera work. Close-up match brings you nearer in zoomed-in shots, so they frame people like the 2D view does.":"ゲームカメラは WuWa 本体のカメラとその会話シーンのカメラワークに追従します。クローズアップ一致を有効にすると、ズームインしたショットでより近づき、2D 表示と同じように人物を収めます。","Game camera: WuWa's own camera. Fixed third person: a steady camera behind you. Freecam: fly the camera anywhere, for cutscenes and photos. First person: through your character's eyes. Options for each are on the Camera page.":"ゲームカメラ：WuWa 本体のカメラ。固定三人称視点：背後で安定したカメラ。フリーカメラ：カットシーンや写真撮影用にカメラを自由に飛ばせます。一人称視点：キャラクターの目線。それぞれの設定はカメラページにあります。","Game focus only":"ゲームフォーカスのみ","Game lens":"ゲームレンズ","Game lens: the stereo screen frames every shot exactly like the 2D view, in 3D. Wide: the fixed 90 degree view used in older versions.":"ゲームレンズ：立体スクリーンがすべてのショットを 2D 表示とまったく同じように、3D で収めます。ワイド：以前のバージョンで使われていた固定 90 度の視点。","Game-view override shows the game's camera direction while either stick is used, then returns to animation 0.4 seconds after release. Full animation and headset view can still disagree with movement or target selection; aim alignment remains under investigation. These options never rotate or move the character for you.":"ゲーム視点オーバーライドは、どちらかのスティック操作中にゲームのカメラ方向を表示し、離してから 0.4 秒後にアニメーションに戻ります。全アニメーションとヘッドセット視点は、移動やターゲット選択と一致しないことがあります。照準の整合性は調査中です。これらの設定がキャラクターを勝手に回転・移動させることはありません。","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes.":"レターボックスシーンで両目に同じフレーミングを与えます。","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes. Leave on unless a scene looks cropped.":"レターボックスシーンで両目に同じフレーミングを与えます。シーンが切れて見える場合を除き、オンのままにしてください。","HUD":"HUD","HUD / MOUSE MODE ON":"HUD／マウスモード有効","HUD / mouse adjustment ON (L3 + LB toggles)":"HUD／マウス調整 オン（L3 + LB で切替）","HUD / mouse mode":"HUD／マウスモード","HUD / mouse mode is ON: gameplay buttons are redirected":"HUD／マウスモードがオン：ゲーム操作ボタンがリダイレクトされます","HUD POSITION":"HUD 位置","HUD and focus comfort":"HUD とフォーカスの快適性","HUD distance":"HUD 距離","HUD distance (meters)":"HUD 距離（m）","HUD down / up":"HUD を下／上へ","HUD follows decoupled pitch":"HUD が分離した上下角度に追従","HUD follows your head":"HUD が頭に追従","HUD height (meters)":"HUD 高さ（m）","HUD in the desktop window":"デスクトップウィンドウの HUD","HUD nearer / farther":"HUD を近く／遠くへ","HUD or menu":"HUD またはメニュー","HUD placement and visibility":"HUD の配置と表示","HUD refresh: done. Check the HUD in the headset.":"HUD 更新：完了しました。ヘッドセットで HUD を確認してください。","HUD refresh: not possible right now. Try again in a moment; the log has the details.":"HUD 更新：今はできません。少し待ってからもう一度お試しください。詳細はログにあります。","HUD refresh: the HUD already matches this view.":"HUD 更新：HUD はすでにこの表示に合っています。","HUD refresh: the HUD keeps changing. Open ESC or switch views to try again.":"HUD 更新：HUD が変化し続けています。ESC を開くか表示を切り替えてから再試行してください。","HUD refresh: working on it.":"HUD 更新：処理中です。","HUD right / left (meters)":"HUD 左右位置（m）","HUD shape (full VR)":"HUD 形状（フル VR）","HUD size":"HUD サイズ","HUD up / down (meters)":"HUD 上下位置（m）","Hand / finger demo (optional)":"手・指のデモ（任意）","Hand demo is off. Enable it only when you want to try bare-hand tracking.":"ハンドデモはオフです。素手トラッキングを試したいときだけ有効にしてください。","Hand tracking returned an error. Switch the demo off and on to retry.":"ハンドトラッキングでエラーが発生しました。デモをオフにしてからオンにし直すと再試行できます。","Head movement also scales up. Use Recenter if the view feels displaced. Starts off each launch and after reloading settings.":"頭の動きも拡大されます。視点がずれて感じる場合は再センタリングを使用してください。起動時および設定の再読み込み後はオフで始まります。","Headset aim selects Head and sends that direction to the game; the stick still turns. Right-stick pitch selects Game, disables control-rotation override and both pitch locks. Neither changes LB + Y or the selected utility.":"ヘッドセット照準は Head を選択し、その方向をゲームに送信します。スティックでの旋回は引き続き可能です。右スティックで上下を見るは Game を選択し、操作回転オーバーライドと両方の上下角度ロックを無効にします。どちらも LB + Y や選択中のユーティリティは変更しません。","Height":"高さ","Hidden":"非表示","Hidden UI stays quiet during normal gameplay. A recovery notice appears only when the game cursor or a known menu-rendering path indicates a menu. L3 + B restores UI. An unknown menu may not be detected; UEVR settings always retain the Show game UI button.":"非表示 UI は通常のゲームプレイ中は静かに保たれます。復帰通知は、ゲームカーソルまたは既知のメニュー描画パスがメニューを示したときにのみ表示されます。L3 + B で UI を復帰します。未知のメニューは検出されない可能性があります。UEVR 設定には常にゲーム UI を表示ボタンがあります。","Hide Kuro material reflections (workaround candidate)":"Kuro のマテリアル反射を隠す（回避策候補）","Hide body":"身体を隠す","Hide body in first person":"一人称で身体を非表示","Hide body, keep shadow":"身体を隠して影を保持","Hide body; keep original shadows":"身体を隠して元の影を保持","Hide character rim lighting (optional workaround)":"キャラのリムライトを隠す（任意の回避策）","Hide characters at your eyes":"目の前のキャラクターを隠す","Hide characters at your eyes on / off":"目の前のキャラクターを隠す オン／オフ","Hide head":"頭を隠す","Hide head bones keeps the visible body, but also removes the head from its shadow. Hide body; keep full character shadow requests hidden shadows only from the game's original visible shadow casters; it does not enable unused wings or effect rigs. Shadow support depends on the character/material.":"頭のボーンを非表示にすると身体は表示されたままですが、影からも頭が除かれます。身体を隠して全身の影を保持は、ゲーム本来の表示中の影の投影元からのみ影を非表示にするよう要求します。未使用の翼やエフェクトリグは有効化しません。影の対応はキャラクター／マテリアルによって異なります。","Hide head bones; full shadow copy":"頭のボーンを隠して全身の影を複製","Hide head bones; keep body":"頭のボーンを非表示・身体は表示","Hide head, full shadow":"頭を隠して全身の影","Hide player IDs":"プレイヤー ID を隠す","Hides the captured HUD and menus together. UEVR settings stay available; individual HUD elements cannot yet be moved separately.":"取り込んだ HUD とメニューをまとめて隠します。UEVR 設定は引き続き利用できます。個々の HUD 要素はまだ個別に移動できません。","Hiding off":"非表示オフ","Hiding on":"非表示オン","Higher follows the game camera more closely.":"高いほどゲームカメラに近く追従します。","Hint %d of %d. It then switches off; View hints on the WuWa VR menu's HUD page turns it back on.":"ヒント %d／%d。この後オフになります。WuWa VR メニューの HUD ページの「視点ヒント」で再びオンにできます。","Hold L3, or LT + RT, for half a second: a card rises under your view and shows what each button does, lighting each one as you press it. Let go and it sinks away.":"L3、または LT + RT を 0.5 秒間長押しすると、視界の下からカードが現れ、各ボタンが何をするかが表示され、押すたびにそのボタンが光ります。離すとカードは引っ込みます。","Hold L3, or both triggers, for half a second: a card rises under your view and lights each button as you use it. Let go and it sinks away. L3 + Menu keeps it open. Close UEVR settings to see it; it is absent from the game's flat spectator view.":"L3、または両方のトリガーを 0.5 秒間長押しすると、視界の下からカードが現れ、使うたびに各ボタンが光ります。離すとカードは引っ込みます。L3 + Menu で開いたままにできます。表示するには UEVR 設定を閉じてください。ゲームの平面スペクテイター表示には出ません。","Hold L3, then fully squeeze LT for the portal or RT for diorama. Keep the other trigger released; release all controls before repeating. Close UEVR and game menus and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first. Physical gamepad passthrough bypasses these shortcuts.":"L3 を押したまま、ポータルは LT を、ジオラマは RT を最後まで引き込みます。もう一方のトリガーは離しておいてください。繰り返す前にすべての操作を離します。先に UEVR とゲーム内メニューを閉じ、HUD／マウス調整を終了してください。物理ゲームパッドのパススルーでは、これらのショートカットは使われません。","Hold L3: controls card":"L3 を押す：操作カード","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for full VR / stereo screen (hold: mono theatre on / off), click L3 for blur on / off (hold: stereo screen), press Y to hide characters at your eyes. With the triggers held, R3 can be clicked again.":"LT + RT を押しながら：R3 を押すとフル VR / 立体スクリーン（押し続けるとモノシアターのオン／オフ）、L3 を押すとぼかしのオン／オフ（押し続けると立体スクリーン）、Y を押すと目の前のキャラクターを隠します。トリガーを押したままなら R3 をもう一度押せます。","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for the next view (full VR, stereo screen, mono), hold R3 for full VR; hold L3 for 0.8 s to toggle the screen. Screen off also exits mono. Mono keeps flat menu backgrounds and controls together.":"LT + RT を押しながら：R3 を押すと次の表示（フル VR、立体スクリーン、モノ）に切り替わり、R3 を押し続けるとフル VR になります。L3 を 0.8 秒押し続けるとスクリーンを切り替えます。スクリーンを切るとモノも終了します。モノではメニュー背景と操作が平らなまま一緒に表示されます。","Hold LT + RT: views card":"LT + RT を押す：表示カード","Hold RB":"RB 長押し","Hold RB: full speed if Polar walk is on":"RB を押し続ける：ポーラーウォークがオンのときは最高速度","Hold {L3} for everything else":"{L3} を押し続けるとその他すべて","Hold {L3}, then press":"{L3} を押したまま、次を押す","Hold {LT}+{RT} for views":"{LT}+{RT} を押し続けると表示切替","Hold {LT}+{RT}, then":"{LT}+{RT} を押したまま、次に","Hold: mono theatre on / off":"長押し：モノシアターのオン／オフ","Horizon level removes the game's camera pitch from the VR view. Turn it off for right-stick up/down look, and disable UEVR's Decoupled Pitch below. Head aiming is an alternative; grapple selection still needs game testing.":"水平維持は、ゲームカメラの上下角度を VR 視点から取り除きます。右スティックでの上下視点を使うにはオフにし、下にある UEVR の Decoupled Pitch も無効にしてください。ヘッドセット照準が代替になりますが、グラップルの選択はまだゲーム内で検証が必要です。","Hover drone":"ホバードローン","Hover drone (inertia)":"ホバードローン（慣性）","Hover drone: left stick moves horizontally, right stick looks, LT rises, LB descends, RT boosts. Release the stick to settle into a hover.":"ホバードローン：左スティックで水平移動、右スティックで視点操作、LT で上昇、LB で下降、RT でブースト。スティックを離すとホバー状態で安定します。","How big the world feels. Above 1 makes you smaller. Diorama uses its own scale and leaves this alone.":"世界の大きさの感じ方。1 より大きいほど自分が小さくなります。ジオラマは独自のスケールを使い、この設定には影響しません。","How far above or below your character's eyes your view sits. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"キャラクターの目に対する視点の高さ。ゲーム中：L3 を押しながら Y / X。L3 + Y + X の同時押しでデフォルトに戻ります。","How far away the HUD sits. Its stereo depth follows this distance.":"HUD がどれだけ離れて表示されるか。立体の奥行きはこの距離に従います。","How far away the card is.":"カードまでの距離。","How far away this menu floats. UEVR's classic window uses the same distance.":"このメニューがどれだけ離れて浮かぶか。UEVR のクラシックウィンドウも同じ距離を使います。","How far behind your character the camera stays, in game units (centimetres).":"カメラがキャラクターの後ろどれだけ離れるか（ゲーム内単位、センチメートル）。","How fast the freecam moves.":"フリーカメラの移動速度。","How fast the freecam turns.":"フリーカメラの旋回速度。","How high above your character the camera sits, in game units. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"キャラクターの上にカメラを置く高さ（ゲーム内単位）。ゲーム中：L3 を押しながら Y / X。L3 + Y + X の同時押しでデフォルトに戻ります。","How large the game's HUD and menus appear.":"ゲームの HUD とメニューの表示サイズ。","How large the game's HUD and menus appear. More HUD options are on the HUD page.":"ゲームの HUD とメニューの表示サイズ。HUD の詳細設定は HUD ページにあります。","How much of its layer this menu fills. Smaller also reads as further away.":"このメニューがレイヤーをどの程度埋めるか。小さくすると遠くにも見えます。","How near Close-up match may bring you to the person in the shot. Lower comes closer. Close-up match at 100 already gives the 2D size; this only stops it short when the shot is very tight.":"クローズアップマッチで、ショット内の人物にどこまで近づけるか。値を小さくすると近づきます。クローズアップマッチが 100 ならすでに 2D の大きさになり、これはショットが非常に寄っているときだけ手前で止めます。","How small the world gets in diorama. 10x is an action-figure view. The diorama has its own camera distance (Camera page).":"ジオラマで世界をどれだけ小さくするかです。10 倍はフィギュア視点です。ジオラマには専用のカメラ距離があります（カメラページ）。","How strong the 3D is on the stereo screen. 1x matches the headset's eye distance to the lens; 0 is flat.":"立体スクリーンでの 3D の強さ。1x はヘッドセットの眼とレンズの距離に一致し、0 は平面的になります。","How to use view toggles":"表示切替の使い方","How wide the controls card is.":"操作カードの幅。","I understand that untested checks remain Not tested":"未検証の項目は「未テスト」のままであることを理解しました","INSERT  =  OPEN UEVR":"INSERT＝UEVR を開く","INSERT > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"INSERT > WuWa Controls > ゲーム UI を表示","Idle":"待機","Ignore motion input while OpenXR is unfocused (test)":"OpenXR にフォーカスがないときはモーション入力を無視（テスト）","Ignores the game camera's up / down tilt, so only your head looks up and down. Steadier, and worth trying in gravity-flip areas such as Avinoleum.":"ゲームカメラの上下の傾きを無視し、頭だけが上下を見るようにします。安定し、Avinoleum のような重力反転エリアで試す価値があります。","Immersive VR":"没入 VR","In full VR the game lays out its HUD for a 4:3 screen, which then looks squashed; 1.33 undoes that. Raise it if round icons still look like flat ovals. The stereo screen and mono theatre always keep the game's own shape.":"フル VR では、ゲームは 4:3 スクリーン向けに HUD を配置するため、それがつぶれて見えます。1.33 にするとそれが解消されます。丸いアイコンがまだ平たい楕円に見える場合は値を上げてください。立体スクリーンとモノシアターは常にゲーム本来の形を保ちます。","In story and dialogue shots, hold L3 and press Y to move nearer or X to move back; L3 + Y + X goes back to the game's spot. Keyboard: Page Up, Page Down and Home. It moves along the game camera's view and keeps following the shot's own camera moves. Game camera in full VR only.":"ストーリーや会話のショットで、L3 を押したまま Y で近づき、X で下がります。L3 + Y + X でゲームの位置に戻ります。キーボード：Page Up、Page Down、Home。ゲームカメラの視線に沿って動き、そのショット自身のカメラワークに追従し続けます。フル VR のゲームカメラのみ。","In story close-ups nothing nearer than this is drawn. It slices characters and props open, so it is off by default (10 cm, the game's own value); Hide characters at your eyes is the cleaner fix. Game camera in full VR only.":"ストーリーのクローズアップで、これより近いものは描画されません。キャラクターや小物が切れて見えるため、既定ではオフ（10 cm、ゲーム本来の値）です。「目の前のキャラクターを隠す」の方がきれいに解決できます。フル VR のゲームカメラのみ。","In story close-ups, a character right at your eyes but outside the flat shot (VR shows more around it) is hidden whole while it is there. Anyone the flat shot shows stays. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then press Y.":"ストーリーのクローズアップで、目の前にいるのに平面の画面の外にいるキャラクター（VR では画面の周りも見えます）を、そこにいる間まるごと隠します。平面の画面に映っている人は残ります。ショートカット：LT + RT を押しながら Y。","Include camera and controller data":"カメラとコントローラーのデータを含める","Input candidates start off. Their effect on WuWa's intermittent combinations is not confirmed.":"入力候補は初期状態ではオフです。WuWa の断続的な組み合わせへの効果は確認されていません。","Input still pauses when WuWa loses focus. Real game menus temporarily restore the game camera and character visibility.":"WuWa がフォーカスを失うと入力は引き続き一時停止します。実際のゲーム内メニューでは、ゲームカメラとキャラ表示が一時的に元に戻ります。","Invalid profile value: ":"無効なプロファイル値: ","Invert acro pitch stick":"アクロのピッチ操作を反転","Joint inspector (left-eye preview)":"ジョイントインスペクター（左目プレビュー）","Just mark the moment":"この瞬間をマークするだけ","Keep WuWa VR Launcher running to record from here. Its browser tab can be closed.":"ここから録画するには WuWa VR Launcher を起動したままにしてください。ブラウザタブは閉じてもかまいません。","Keep both triggers held to click or hold R3 again.":"両方のトリガーを押したままなら R3 を何度でもクリック・長押しできます。","Keep camera and head hiding during Alt-Tab / UEVR settings":"Alt-Tab／UEVR 設定中もカメラと頭の非表示を維持","Keep current view":"現在の表示を維持","Keep entire character visible":"全身を表示","Keep first person horizon level (Custom)":"一人称の水平維持（カスタム）","Keep matched far-object detail (recommended)":"遠景オブジェクトの精細さを両目で揃える（推奨）","Keep stereo camera transitions together":"立体カメラの切替を同期","Keep the controls card open":"操作カードを開いたままにする","Keep the mouse in the game window":"マウスをゲームウィンドウ内に留める","Keep the nudge":"調整を保持","Keep this card open":"このカードを開いたままにする","Keeps distant trees and props on the same level of detail in both eyes. This is the normal foliage repair; legacy comparison tests are separate.":"遠くの木やオブジェクトを両目で同じ詳細度に保ちます。これは通常の植生修復です。旧式の比較テストは別です。","Keeps the HUD where you expect it while decoupled pitch is on.":"上下角度の分離が有効なとき、HUD を期待どおりの位置に保ちます。","Keeps the horizon level in first person. Custom motion only.":"一人称で水平を維持します。カスタムの動きのみ。","Kuro character materials in both eyes (candidate)":"Kuro キャラのマテリアルを両目に（候補）","L grip":"左グリップ","L stick":"左スティック","L trigger":"左トリガー","L3 + A":"L3 + A","L3 + A     Recenter view / portal":"L3 + A     視点／ポータルを再センタリング","L3 + A also resets headset position (seated)":"L3 + A はヘッドセット位置もリセットします（座位）","L3 + A resets position too":"L3 + A でも位置をリセット","L3 + B":"L3 + B","L3 + B     Show / hide game UI":"L3 + B     ゲーム UI の表示切替","L3 + B  =  SHOW UI":"L3 + B＝UI を表示","L3 + D-pad Down":"L3 + 十字キー下","L3 + D-pad Down toggles full animation follow and your previous first-person motion. Custom keeps your saved settings. The other choices sample the head after animation. Animated position preserves normal stick aiming. Full animation follows character turns and bone rotation; it can be intense.":"L3 + 十字キー下で全アニメーション追従と以前の一人称の動きを切り替えます。カスタムは保存済み設定を維持します。その他の選択肢はアニメーション後の頭を参照します。アニメ位置は通常のスティック照準を保ちます。全アニメーションはキャラの向きとボーンの回転に追従し、激しい動きになることがあります。","L3 + D-pad Down: animation follow on / off (first person)":"L3 + 十字キー下：アニメーション追従の切替（一人称）","L3 + LB    Return to normal game controls":"L3 + LB    通常のゲーム操作に戻る","L3 + LB    Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"L3 + LB    HUD／マウス調整を切替","L3 + LB  =  RETURN TO GAME CONTROLS":"L3 + LB＝ゲーム操作に戻る","L3 + LB exits manual adjustment. Release all controls afterwards.":"L3 + LB で手動調整を終了します。その後、すべての操作を離してください。","L3 + LB, release":"L3 + LB、離す","L3 + LT / F7":"L3 + LT / F7","L3 + LT / F7   Portal on / off":"L3 + LT / F7   ポータルの切替","L3 + Menu":"L3 + Menu","L3 + Menu  Keep the controls card open":"L3 + Menu  操作カードを開いたまま","L3 + R3":"L3 + R3","L3 + R3    WuWa VR menu":"L3 + R3    WuWa VR メニュー","L3 + RB":"L3 + RB","L3 + RB    Game / fixed camera":"L3 + RB    ゲーム／固定カメラ","L3 + RT":"L3 + RT","L3 + RT    Diorama on / off":"L3 + RT    ジオラマの切替","L3 + View":"L3 + View","L3 + View  First person on / off":"L3 + View  一人称視点オン／オフ","L3 + View toggles first person. These settings apply when first person is active.":"L3 + View で一人称視点を切り替えます。これらの設定は一人称が有効なときに適用されます。","L3 + Y / X":"L3 + Y / X","L3 + Y/X   Height; in story: nearer / back":"L3 + Y/X   高さ／ストーリー中：近づく / 下がる","L3 means click and hold the left stick, then press B.":"左スティック（L3）を押し込みながら B。","LB + LT/RT Fixed camera farther / closer":"LB + LT/RT 固定カメラを遠く／近く","LB + R3 utility shortcut remains available outside adjustment":"LB + R3 のユーティリティショートカットは調整モード外でも使用できます","LB + R3: V once; hold 0.8 s for Tab wheel":"LB + R3：V を1回押す／0.8 秒長押しで Tab ホイール","LB/RB      HUD down / up":"LB/RB      HUD 下 / 上","LT + RT, L3: blur (hold: stereo screen)":"LT + RT、L3：ブラー（長押し：立体スクリーン）","LT + RT, R3: full VR / stereo (hold: mono)":"LT + RT、R3：フル VR / 立体（長押し：モノ）","LT + RT, then Y":"LT + RT を押したまま Y を押す","LT + RT, then click L3":"LT + RT を押したまま L3 を押す","LT + RT, then click R3":"LT + RT を押したまま R3 を押す","LT + RT, then hold L3":"LT + RT を押したまま L3 を長押し","LT + RT, then hold R3":"LT + RT を押したまま R3 を長押し","LT/RT      HUD nearer / farther":"LT/RT      HUD 近 / 遠","Language":"言語","Language / WuWa":"言語 / WuWa","Larger menu following view":"大きな追従メニュー","Laser asleep: move the left controller or press a VR button.":"レーザー休止中：左コントローラーを動かすか、VR ボタンを押してください。","Laser asleep: move the right controller or press a VR button.":"レーザー休止中：右コントローラーを動かすか、VR ボタンを押してください。","Laser on: point the left controller and pull its trigger.":"レーザーオン：左コントローラーで指してトリガーを引いてください。","Laser on: point the right controller and pull its trigger.":"レーザーオン：右コントローラーで指してトリガーを引いてください。","Laser: no VR controllers found.":"レーザー：VR コントローラーが見つかりません。","Last run: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"前回のラン：%s、歩行 %s、ゲーム内 %.2f km。","Last used wins":"最後に使用したものを優先","Launch settings include any custom settings saved before starting this game. Supplied profile controls are the build's original choices, not UEVR factory defaults.":"起動設定には、このゲーム開始前に保存されたカスタム設定が含まれます。付属のプロファイル操作設定はビルドの初期設定であり、UEVR の初期デフォルトではありません。","Launch settings restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"起動設定を復元しました。続行する前にすべての操作を離してください。","Leave first person":"一人称を終了","Leave freecam":"フリーカメラを終了","Left":"左","Left / right":"左 / 右","Left / right moves between steps without answering. Your answers stay saved.":"左右キーで回答せずにステップ間を移動できます。回答内容は保存されます。","Left / right picks the kind of problem.":"左右キーで問題の種類を選択します。","Left / right stick":"左／右スティック","Left stick":"左スティック","Left stick Cursor    A Click    B Back":"左スティック カーソル    A クリック    B 戻る","Left stick Y (Mode 2)":"左スティック Y（Mode 2）","Legacy automatic mouse can intercept game menu buttons. Manual L3 + LB adjustment remains the normal choice.":"従来の自動マウスはゲームメニューボタンを妨害する可能性があります。通常は L3 + LB による手動調整を使用してください。","Legacy pitch-only override is active; choose either option above to replace it.":"従来のピッチのみオーバーライドが有効です。上記のいずれかを選択して置き換えてください。","Legacy stereo comparison bench (60-second tests)":"従来の立体比較ベンチ（60 秒テスト）","Level horizon":"水平維持","Link latest recording":"最新の録画をリンク","Linking saves the recording ID only. Review the video and add precise timestamps in the launcher.":"リンクすると録画 ID のみが保存されます。動画を確認して、ランチャーで正確なタイムスタンプを追加してください。","Live input tests. Change one option, close this menu, then repeat the same action.":"ライブ入力テスト。1 つのオプションを変更し、このメニューを閉じてから、同じ操作を繰り返してください。","Local controller and camera data only, about 30 samples/sec. The clean-video recorder starts this automatically. It never presses buttons. Video/sidecar alignment uses timestamps, not a claim of GPU-frame synchronization.":"ローカルのコントローラーとカメラデータのみ（約 30 サンプル/秒）。クリーンビデオレコーダーが自動的に開始します。ボタンは一切押しません。動画とサイドカーの同期はタイムスタンプを使用しており、GPU フレーム同期を保証するものではありません。","Looks wrong? Hold LT + RT, then click R3 for the stereo screen (hold R3: mono).":"見え方が違う場合は、LT + RT を長押ししてから R3 を押すと立体スクリーンに切替（R3 長押し：モノ）します。","Low":"下","Lower eye level by 5":"目の高さを 5 下げる","Manual override; waiting for this scene to end":"手動で上書き中。このシーンの終了を待っています","Mark this moment":"この瞬間をマーク","Match cinematic framing":"シネマティックなフレーミングに合わせる","Match cinematic framing between eyes (default on)":"両目のフレーミングをシネマティックに合わせる（デフォルトオン）","Match far detail between eyes":"遠景のディテールを両目で揃える","Maximum pixels per eye":"片目あたりの最大幅（ピクセル）","Maximum thrust / weight":"最大推力 / 重量","Menu":"メニュー","Menu distance":"メニュー距離","Menu left / right":"メニューの左右位置","Menu place":"メニューの配置場所","Menu size":"メニューサイズ","Menu up / down":"メニューの上下位置","Miniature world (this launch only)":"ミニチュアワールド（この起動時のみ）","Mode 2: centered left stick means 50%% throttle. An Xbox stick springs back to center; hold it down for zero throttle.":"Mode 2：左スティック中央でスロットル 50%%。Xbox スティックは中央に戻るため、下げ続けるとスロットル 0 になります。","Mono preserves your saved stereo-screen choice; screen off exits both screen modes. Neither changes portal or normal world scale. Manual toggles take priority over automatic cinema for the current scene.":"モノでは保存済みの立体スクリーン設定が維持されます。スクリーンオフは両方のスクリーンモードを終了します。どちらもポータルや通常のワールドスケールは変更しません。現在のシーンでは、手動切替が自動シネマより優先されます。","Mono shows the same scene and HUD to both eyes. Use it for troublesome cutscenes or flat menus.":"モノでは両目に同じシーンと HUD が表示されます。問題が起きるカットシーンや平面メニューに使います。","Mono theatre":"モノシアター","Mono theatre (flat 2D)":"モノシアター（平面 2D）","Mono theatre (no stereo)":"モノシアター（立体なし）","Mono theatre on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"モノシアターのオン／オフ（0.8 秒長押し）","Motion":"モーション","Move cursor":"カーソル移動","Move map":"マップ移動","Move menu":"メニューを移動","Moves supported menus into the VR panel, including with Native Stereo Fix on. The supplied profile enables this. Some flat backgrounds still move separately; mono theatre is the manual fallback.":"対応メニューを VR パネルに移動します（Native Stereo Fix 有効時も同様）。付属プロファイルではこれが有効です。一部の平面背景は別に動くため、手動の代替としてモノシアターがあります。","Moves the HUD sideways.":"HUD を左右に移動します。","Moves the HUD up or down.":"HUD を上下に移動します。","Moves your diorama viewpoint sideways.":"ジオラマでの視点を左右に動かします。","Moves your diorama viewpoint up, to look down on the miniature, or down.":"ジオラマでの視点を上に動かしてミニチュアを見下ろすか、下に動かします。","Moves your viewpoint forward from the game camera. Forward brings dialogue close-ups nearer, closer to how the 2D shot frames them. Applies in normal play too.":"ゲームカメラから視点を前後に移動します。前へ動かすと会話のクローズアップが近づき、2D 映像の構図に近くなります。通常プレイでも適用されます。","Moves your viewpoint sideways from the game camera.":"ゲームカメラから視点を左右に移動します。","Moves your viewpoint up or down from the game camera.":"ゲームカメラから視点を上下に移動します。","Moving the menu: point where you want it, thumbstick up / down for distance, then pull the trigger.":"メニューを移動中：置きたい場所を指し、スティック上下で距離を調整してからトリガーを引きます。","Moving the menu: stick, D-pad or arrow keys. Right stick or Page Up / Down: distance. A or Enter: put it down.":"メニューを移動中：スティック、十字キー、矢印キー。右スティックか Page Up / Down：距離。A か Enter：置く。","Multiplies the blur in full VR. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"フル VR でのブラーを倍率で調整します。1x は 2D 表示と同じ見え方です。","Multiplies the blur on the stereo screen and mono theatre. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"立体スクリーンとモノシアターのブラーを倍率で調整します。1x は 2D 表示と同じ見え方です。","NOT SAVING":"保存しない","Native Stereo":"Native Stereo","Native Stereo Fix frame timing (experimental)":"Native Stereo Fix のフレームタイミング（実験）","Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix":"Native Stereo Fix 併用の Native Stereo","Native game camera active (headset check pending)":"ゲーム本来のカメラ有効（ヘッドセットでの確認待ち）","Native game camera unavailable; compatibility fallback":"ゲーム本来のカメラは使えません。互換方式で表示します","Navigate / activate / back":"選択／決定／戻る","Near clip in close-ups":"クローズアップのニアクリップ","New:":"新機能：","No active playtest connection. Keep the launcher running and open Developer playtests to start or resume a session.":"有効なプレイテスト接続がありません。ランチャーを起動したまま、Developer playtests を開いてセッションを開始または再開してください。","No run yet. Start one here, or open Reality Runner and walk.":"まだランはありません。ここで開始するか、Reality Runner を開いて歩いてください。","No supported direct PlayStation controller detected":"対応するダイレクト PlayStation コントローラーが検出されません","Normal scale: %.3fx. Your saved scale and camera presets stay unchanged; intentional scale edits become the new normal value.":"通常スケール：%.3fx。保存済みのスケールとカメラプリセットは変更されません。意図的なスケール変更は新しい通常値になります。","Not saved: %s":"保存できませんでした：%s","Not tested":"未検証","Note when someone is at your eyes":"目の前に誰かいるときに通知","Now: %s":"現在：%s","Observation":"観察","Off":"オフ","Off: UEVR opens its classic window, as before. You can turn this menu back on under VR > WuWa Controls.":"オフ：これまでどおり UEVR は従来のウィンドウを開きます。このメニューは VR > WuWa Controls で再びオンにできます。","On":"オン","On by default. Detected story videos use mono; story pictures and story scenes use your choices above. Manual view changes take priority.":"既定でオン。検出したストーリー動画はモノシアター、ストーリーの絵とストーリーシーンは上の選択を使います。手動の表示切替が優先されます。","On by default: both eyes render with a symmetric view, so its shading matches on rocks, hills and roofs. Off is a little faster.":"既定はオン：両目を左右対称の視野で描画するため、岩、丘、屋根の陰影が一致します。オフにすると少し軽くなります。","On uses our LGUI capture. Off shows the game's original HUD in the eye images. This does not hide the UEVR settings panel.":"オンでは LGUI キャプチャを使用します。オフでは各目の映像にゲーム本来の HUD が表示されます。これは UEVR 設定パネルを隠しません。","On: full VR lays out the HUD and menus like the flat game (16:9): round icons, story pictures whole, and the mouse hits what it points at. Off: 1.2.2's taller layout, where the Terminal fits on one page and the character screen's floor reflection keeps updating, but icons look flatter (HUD shape) and the mouse can miss.":"オン：フル VR で HUD とメニューを通常のゲームと同じ 16:9 で配置します。丸いアイコンは丸く、ストーリーの絵は欠けず、マウスは指した場所に当たります。オフ：1.2.2 の縦長レイアウトで、ターミナルが 1 ページに収まり、キャラクター画面の床の反射も更新され続けますが、アイコンが平たく見え（HUD 形状）、マウスがずれることがあります。","On: the HUD stays in front of your eyes. Off: it stays put in the world and you look at it.":"オン：HUD は目の前に固定されます。オフ：ワールド上に固定され、そちらを見る形になります。","On: while the game is in front, the mouse stops at the window's edges, as in the flat game, so it cannot slip onto another monitor. Alt-Tab frees it. Off: the mouse moves freely between monitors.":"オン：ゲームが前面にある間、通常のゲームと同じくマウスはウィンドウの端で止まり、別のモニターへはみ出しません。Alt-Tab で解除されます。オフ：マウスはモニター間を自由に動きます。","On: your settings are saved whenever this menu opens or closes. Off: try things freely; nothing is saved, and the game starts with your saved settings next time. Turning it back on saves what you have now. For each setting, the help at the bottom says whether it is saved and what its default is.":"オン：このメニューを開閉するたびに設定が保存されます。オフ：自由に試せます。何も保存されず、次回は保存済みの設定でゲームが始まります。オンに戻すと現在の設定が保存されます。各設定について、下部の説明に保存されるかどうかと既定値が表示されます。","Only in first person and the fixed camera":"一人称視点と固定カメラでのみ有効","Only slot 0":"スロット 0 のみ","Only slot 1":"スロット 1 のみ","Only slot 2":"スロット 2 のみ","Only slot 3":"スロット 3 のみ","Only the VR controllers work while on; the Xbox pad on this slot is ignored until you turn them off.":"オンの間は VR コントローラーのみ動作し、このスロットの Xbox パッドはオフにするまで無視されます。","Open / close the WuWa VR menu":"WuWa VR メニューを開閉","Open the WuWa VR menu instead of this window":"このウィンドウの代わりに WuWa VR メニューを開く","Opens UEVR's full settings window. Every setting here edits the same values.":"UEVR の全設定ウィンドウを開きます。ここでの設定はすべて同じ値を編集します。","Optical joint data received. Headset alignment and comfort still need a physical check.":"光学ジョイントデータを受信しました。ヘッドセットの位置合わせと快適さは、実際に装着して確認する必要があります。","Optional experiments and diagnostics":"任意の実験と診断","Optional workaround, off by default. Removes toon-depth rim lighting from all characters using it, including nearby characters. This hides the observed extra eye contour; it does not repair the underlying stereo cause. Restores the prior value when disabled, in 2D screen mode, or when native VR is inactive.":"任意の回避策で、初期設定はオフです。使用しているすべてのキャラクター（近くのキャラクターを含む）からトゥーン深度のリムライトを除去します。これにより、確認された目の輪郭の重複を隠しますが、根本的なステレオ描画の原因は修復しません。無効時、2D スクリーンモード時、またはネイティブ VR が非アクティブの場合は、元の値に戻します。","Or hold the left Menu button for 1 second to turn them on or off; a buzz confirms. A quick press is still Start. Controllers without a Menu button (such as Index): while off, hold both stick clicks for 1 second to turn them on.":"または左の Menu ボタンを 1 秒間長押ししてオン／オフを切り替えます。振動で確認できます。短く押すと従来どおり Start です。Menu ボタンのないコントローラー（Index など）：オフのときは両方のスティック押し込みを 1 秒間長押しするとオンになります。","Or: UEVR > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"または：UEVR > WuWa Controls > ゲーム UI を表示","Pass":"合格","Paused in the diorama":"ジオラマ中は一時停止","Paused: game camera in full VR only":"一時停止：フル VR のゲームカメラのみ","Physical gamepad passthrough (test)":"物理ゲームパッドのパススルー（テスト）","Pick what went wrong and save. The time, the video position and your settings go into the wuwa-reports folder of the UEVR profile. Share it together with the video.":"問題点を選んで保存してください。時刻、動画の位置、設定が UEVR プロファイルの wuwa-reports フォルダに保存されます。動画と一緒に共有してください。","Picture size":"映像サイズ","Pinned":"固定","Pitch / roll rate (degrees / second)":"ピッチ / ロール速度（度 / 秒）","Pixels per eye compared with what your headset asks for. Lower is smoother in full VR. It changes after a moment.":"ヘッドセットが要求する値と比較した片目あたりのピクセル数。低いほどフル VR で滑らかになります。しばらくすると変化します。","Plan finished. Thank you!":"プランが完了しました。ありがとうございます！","Plan finished. Your answers are saved for Claude in wuwa-steps / results.jsonl.":"プランが完了しました。回答は wuwa-steps / results.jsonl に Claude 用として保存されました。","Plane":"飛行機","Plane FPV":"飛行機 FPV","Plane cruise speed (game units / second)":"飛行機の巡航速度（ゲーム単位 / 秒）","Plane: right stick pitches/banks, left stick X steers yaw. RT increases cruise speed, LT decreases it. Hold LB to brake, RB to boost. Double R3 exits. Cruise pauses when focus or controller samples are lost; release controls then move a stick to rearm after Alt-Tab.":"飛行機：右スティックでピッチ／バンク、左スティック X でヨーを操縦します。RT で巡航速度が上がり、LT で下がります。LB 長押しでブレーキ、RB でブースト。R3 を２回押すと終了します。フォーカスまたはコントローラーのサンプルが失われると巡航は一時停止します。Alt-Tab 後は、操作を離してからスティックを動かすと再び有効になります。","PlayStation connected; waiting for input reports and release":"PlayStation 接続済み。入力レポートと解放を待っています","PlayStation disconnected; waiting to reconnect":"PlayStation 切断済み。再接続を待っています","PlayStation input is unavailable or held exclusively; use Steam Input if available":"PlayStation 入力が利用できないか排他的に占有されています。可能なら Steam Input を使用してください","PlayStation input received":"PlayStation 入力を受信しました","PlayStation reader has not started":"PlayStation リーダーが起動していません","PlayStation reader stopped; use Steam Input if available":"PlayStation リーダーが停止しました。可能なら Steam Input を使用してください","PlayStation reader unavailable":"PlayStation リーダーを利用できません","PlayStation reader unavailable: cannot retain backend module":"PlayStation リーダーを利用できません：バックエンドモジュールを保持できません","PlayStation reports stopped; release controls after reconnecting":"PlayStation レポートが停止しました。再接続後に操作を解放してください","PlayStation shortcuts paused: WuWa shortcuts disabled":"PlayStation ショートカット一時停止中：WuWa ショートカットが無効です","PlayStation shortcuts paused: an XInput slot is selected":"PlayStation ショートカット一時停止中：XInput スロットが選択されています","PlayStation shortcuts paused: controller passthrough enabled":"PlayStation ショートカット一時停止中：コントローラーのパススルーが有効です","PlayStation: L1/R1 = LB/RB, L2/R2 = LT/RT, Cross/Circle/Square/Triangle = A/B/X/Y, Share/Create = View, Options = Menu.":"PlayStation：L1/R1＝LB/RB、L2/R2＝LT/RT、Cross/Circle/Square/Triangle＝A/B/X/Y、Share/Create＝View、Options＝Menu。","Playtest launcher connection changed. Check whether the previous action was saved.":"プレイテストランチャーの接続が変わりました。前の操作が保存されたか確認してください。","Playtest launcher is not connected.":"プレイテストランチャーが接続されていません。","Playtest launcher status is stale or belongs to another game.":"プレイテストランチャーの状態が古いか、別のゲームのものです。","Playtest request was not acknowledged. Check the launcher before repeating it.":"プレイテスト要求が確認されませんでした。繰り返す前にランチャーを確認してください。","Point and pull the trigger, or click. Scroll to see more.":"ポイントしてトリガーを引くか、クリックします。スクロールするとさらに表示されます。","Point with a controller and pull the trigger to put it down. Or use a stick, the D-pad, the arrow keys or WASD, and the right stick or Page Up / Down for distance; A, Enter or B puts it down. Gamepad shortcut: Y. Keyboard: M. Mouse: drag with the right button at any time.":"コントローラーでポイントしてトリガーを引くと設置します。またはスティック、十字キー、方向キー、WASD、そして距離には右スティックまたは Page Up / Down を使います。A、Enter、B で設置します。ゲームパッドのショートカット：Y。キーボード：M。マウス：いつでも右ボタンのドラッグで操作できます。","Polar fly":"ポーラーフライ","Polar fly: left stick moves along view, right stick looks. LT rises, LB descends; RT boosts, double RT gives turbo.":"ポーラーフライ：左スティックで視点に沿って移動、右スティックで見回します。LT で上昇、LB で下降。RT でブースト、RT を２回押すとターボになります。","Polar fly: simple flying. Hover drone: floats and drifts to a stop. Plane: always moves forward. Acro drone: full manual control.":"ポーラーフライ：シンプルな飛行。ホバードローン：浮かんで減速しながら停止。飛行機：常に前進。アクロドローン：完全手動操作。","Polar shortcuts are disabled or bypassed.":"Polar ショートカットは無効、またはバイパスされています。","Portal HUD sizing":"ポータル HUD サイズ","Portal is off: using your separate HUD layout until it is enabled.":"ポータルがオフです。有効になるまで、別の HUD レイアウトを使用します。","Portal on / off":"ポータルの切替","Portal window":"ポータルウィンドウ","Post-process block ambiguous":"ポストプロセスのブロックを特定できません","Post-process block not found in the view (try again outside a story scene)":"表示内にポストプロセスのブロックが見つかりません（ストーリーシーンの外で再試行してください）","PostProcessSettings not found":"PostProcessSettings が見つかりません","Preserve proportions at frame edges":"縦横比を維持して枠に合わせる","Preserves both deactivation and keyboard focus events, including while this overlay is open. It applies to future events: after enabling, Alt-Tab away and back once. It does not bring the game to the foreground automatically.":"非アクティブ化とキーボードフォーカスの両方のイベントを保持します（このオーバーレイが開いている間も同様）。これは今後のイベントに適用されます。有効化した後、Alt-Tab で一度離れて戻ってください。ゲームを自動的に前面に出すことはありません。","Press: hide characters at your eyes":"押す：目の前のキャラクターを隠す","Privacy box placement":"プライバシーマスクの配置","Profile ID bottom":"プロフィール ID：下","Profile ID left":"プロフィール ID：左","Profile ID right":"プロフィール ID：右","Profile ID top":"プロフィール ID：上","Quick":"クイック","R grip":"R グリップ","R stick":"R スティック","R trigger":"R トリガー","RT / double RT":"RT／RT を２回","Raise eye level by 5":"目の高さを 5 上げる","Readable HUD following view":"見やすい追従 HUD","Ready":"準備完了","Reality Runner and other treadmills: keep Sharing on Both together and Controller slot on Automatic, so walking and the VR controllers work at the same time.":"Reality Runner などのトレッドミル：共有は「両方同時」、コントローラーのスロットは「自動」のままにすると、歩行と VR コントローラーを同時に使えます。","Reality Runner is open: 10 seconds of walking starts a run.":"Reality Runner が起動中：10 秒歩くとランが始まります。","Recenter headset / portal":"ヘッドセット / ポータルを再センター","Recenter keeps world scale and camera offsets. Simulator Home resets only the simulator, not the game's VR origin.":"再センターはワールドスケールとカメラオフセットを維持します。シミュレーターの Home はシミュレーターのみをリセットし、ゲームの VR 原点はリセットしません。","Recenter view":"視点を再センター","Recentering with L3 + A also moves your seated position back to the middle.":"L3 + A での再センターは、着座位置も中央に戻します。","Record":"録画","Record camera and Xbox diagnostics":"カメラと Xbox の診断を記録","Record video":"動画を録画","Recorder: failed. See WuWa Controls > Recording in the classic menu.":"レコーダー：失敗しました。従来のメニューの WuWa Controls > 録画 を確認してください。","Recorder: missing from this launcher package.":"レコーダー：このランチャーパッケージに含まれていません。","Recorder: open the WuWa VR app (launcher) to record.":"レコーダー：録画するには WuWa VR アプリ（ランチャー）を開いてください。","Recorder: ready.":"レコーダー：準備完了。","Recorder: recording. Reports and marks note the time in the video.":"レコーダー：録画中。レポートとマークに動画内の時刻を記録します。","Recorder: saved. Open recordings from the launcher.":"レコーダー：保存しました。録画はランチャーから開けます。","Recorder: saving the video.":"レコーダー：動画を保存中。","Recorder: starting.":"レコーダー：開始中。","Recorder: waiting for the launcher...":"レコーダー：ランチャーを待っています…","Recording":"録画中","Recording and privacy":"録画とプライバシー","Recording failed. See the message below.":"録画に失敗しました。下のメッセージを確認してください。","Recording saved. Use Open recordings in the launcher.":"録画を保存しました。ランチャーの「録画を開く」を使用してください。","Recording video. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"動画を録画しています。クリアな映像にするには UEVR メニューを閉じてください。","Records the headset view through the WuWa VR app, which must be open. Player IDs are covered while it records (Hide player IDs, on the Record page).":"WuWa VR アプリ（起動必須）を通じてヘッドセットの映像を録画します。録画中はプレイヤー ID が隠されます（録画ページの「プレイヤー ID を隠す」）。","Refill far lighting now":"遠景ライティングを今すぐ再充填","Reflection capture correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"反射キャプチャ補正が停止したか、このゲームビルドを検証できませんでした。診断ログを確認してください。","Reflection correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"反射補正が停止したか、このゲームビルドを検証できませんでした。診断ログを確認してください。","Reflection projection correction":"反射プロジェクション補正","Refresh HUD layout":"HUD レイアウトを更新","Refresh far lighting":"遠景ライティングを更新","Refresh far-lighting cache (limited workaround)":"遠景ライティングのキャッシュを更新（限定的な回避策）","Refresh position before drawing (Custom)":"描画前に位置を更新（カスタム）","Refresh queued; requires the supplied Comfort script.":"更新を予約しました。付属の Comfort スクリプトが必要です。","Refreshes the far-lighting cache so distant lighting matches between eyes. A limited workaround.":"両目で遠景のライティングが一致するように、遠景ライティングのキャッシュを更新します。限定的な回避策です。","Release RT (Xbox) or pull left stick fully down (Mode 2), then tap RB to arm. Tap RB again or hold LB to pause/disarm. LB + RB levels the drone and stops it. Double R3 exits. Focus loss, menus and shortcut chords pause/disarm it; arm again to resume.":"RT（Xbox）を離すか、左スティックを一番下まで倒して（Mode 2）から、RB をタップしてアームします。もう一度 RB をタップするか LB を長押しすると一時停止／解除します。LB + RB でドローンを水平にして停止します。R3 を２回押すと終了します。フォーカス喪失、メニュー、ショートカットの同時押しで一時停止／解除されます。再びアームすると再開します。","Release all controls after entering/leaving":"出入り後にすべての操作を解除","Reload language files":"言語ファイルを再読込","Render resolution":"レンダリング解像度","Rendering comparisons (live)":"描画の比較（リアルタイム）","Report a problem":"問題を報告","Requests a HUD layout refresh without opening ESC. If this game version is unsupported, the status explains why; saved HUD size and position stay unchanged.":"ESC を開かずに HUD レイアウトの更新を要求します。このゲームバージョンが非対応の場合は理由がステータスに表示されます。保存された HUD サイズと位置は変更されません。","Requests a bounded cascade-lighting-volume refresh after stereo starts or resumes, after detected teleports, or on request. It helped the tested ship/wheel lighting case; it is not a general fix for dark objects or character rims. Each refill can cause a short hitch.":"ステレオ開始または再開後、テレポート検出後、または要求時に、範囲を限定したカスケード ライティング ボリュームの更新を要求します。テストした船／車輪のライティング事例には効果がありましたが、暗いオブジェクトやキャラの輪郭に対する一般的な修正ではありません。再充填のたびに短い引っかかりが生じることがあります。","Requires Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass. Applies the pass correction before game-side view setup. Turn off to return to the previous correction. Culling and lighting acceptance is pending.":"Native Stereo Fix と Use Same Stereo Pass が必要です。ゲーム側のビュー設定前にパス補正を適用します。オフにすると以前の補正に戻ります。カリングとライティングの検証は保留中です。","Reset HUD aspect":"HUD のアスペクト比をリセット","Reset HUD shape":"HUD の形状をリセット","Reset camera offset":"カメラオフセットをリセット","Reset diorama camera":"ジオラマカメラをリセット","Reset headset position and direction now":"ヘッドセットの位置と向きを今すぐリセット","Restart plan":"プランをやり直す","Restore all controller slots":"すべてのコントローラースロットを復元","Restore controls from this launch":"起動時の操作設定に戻す","Restore input settings from before comparisons":"比較前の入力設定に戻す","Restore profile settings":"プロファイル設定を復元","Restore renderer from before this comparison":"この比較前のレンダラーに戻す","Restore supplied profile controls":"付属プロファイルの操作設定に戻す","Restore this build's supplied controls, first-person/freecam settings, camera scale, aiming and HUD layout. Rendering and runtime selection are preserved. Temporary HUD/mouse mode is always turned off. You can undo the reset below.":"このビルドに付属の操作設定、一人称／フリーカメラ設定、カメラスケール、照準、HUD 配置を復元します。レンダリングとランタイムの選択は保持されます。一時的な HUD／マウスモードは常にオフになります。リセットは下から元に戻せます。","Returns Windows XInput unchanged, bypassing VR and Lua gamepad processing. Use Insert and the mouse for this settings panel; gamepad shortcuts and VR controller mapping are unavailable in this mode.":"Windows の XInput を変更せずに返し、VR と Lua のゲームパッド処理を迂回します。この設定パネルでは Insert とマウスを使用してください。このモードでは、ゲームパッドのショートカットと VR コントローラーの割り当ては利用できません。","Right":"右","Right / left":"右 / 左","Right trigger (Xbox)":"右トリガー（Xbox）","Right-stick pitch; animated yaw and roll":"右スティックの上下視点、アニメーションのヨーとロール","Rim restoration failed; the original is retained. Toggle off, then on to retry restoration first.":"リムの復元に失敗しました。元の状態を保持しています。まず復元を再試行するには、オフにしてからオンに戻してください。","Rim suppression was not verified. Toggle off, then on to retry safely.":"リムの抑制を確認できませんでした。オフにしてからオンに戻すと、安全に再試行できます。","Rim variable is unavailable. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"リム変数を利用できません。オフにしてからオンに戻して再試行してください。","Rim workaround is off.":"リム回避策はオフです。","Rim workaround waits for active native stereo with 2D screen off.":"リム回避策は、2D スクリーンがオフの状態でアクティブな Native Stereo を待ちます。","Rim workaround waits for the current graphics comparison to end.":"リム回避策は、現在のグラフィック比較が終了するのを待ちます。","Room panel (stays put)":"空間パネル（位置固定）","Run on: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"ラン中：%s、歩行 %s、ゲーム内 %.2f km。","Safe fit inside rounded edges":"角丸の内側に収める","Save changes for next time":"変更を次回のために保存","Save observation":"観察を保存","Save or discard your unsent note before finishing.":"終了する前に、未送信のメモを保存するか破棄してください。","Save report":"レポートを保存","Saves \"skipped\" and shows the next step.":"「スキップ」として保存し、次のステップを表示します。","Saves the camera and controller movement next to the video, to help find what went wrong.":"カメラとコントローラーの動きを動画と一緒に保存し、問題の特定に役立てます。","Saves the report now. Recording first makes it easy to find in the video.":"今すぐレポートを保存します。先に録画しておくと、動画内でその場面を見つけやすくなります。","Saves the time and current settings, so the moment is easy to find later.":"時刻と現在の設定を保存し、後でその瞬間を見つけやすくします。","Saves this answer with the settings now in use, then shows the next step.":"この回答を現在使用中の設定とともに保存し、次のステップを表示します。","Saving":"保存中","Scene ending; restoring previous view":"シーン終了中。以前の表示に戻しています","Screen lens":"スクリーンレンズ","Screen view on / off":"スクリーン表示の切替","Screen views and cutscene options are in VR > WuWa Controls > View modes and cutscenes.":"スクリーン表示とカットシーンのオプションは VR > WuWa Controls > 表示モードとカットシーン にあります。","Screenshot":"スクリーンショット","Scroll":"スクロール","Second view":"セカンドビュー","Second view does not match the first":"セカンドビューが初期視点と一致しません","Second view not writable; copy skipped":"セカンドビューに書き込めないため、コピーをスキップしました","Seconds of smoothing in the steady desktop window. More is calmer and trails turns more.":"安定化したデスクトップウィンドウの平滑化の秒数。大きいほど穏やかになり、振り向きへの遅れも大きくなります。","Selected build: %s":"選択中のビルド: %s","Send aim to player control rotation":"照準をプレイヤー制御に反映","Separate eyes: Synchronized Sequential":"目を分離: 同期シーケンシャル","Separate-eye rendering produced a black scene with HUD in the September 26 playtest. Native stereo is the working baseline. Submission metadata has been repaired, but separate-eye rendering is still an experiment, not a fix for labels/reflections/materials. Return to Native if the scene disappears.":"9月26日のプレイテストでは、目を分離した描画で HUD 付きの真っ黒なシーンになりました。Native Stereo が動作する基準です。提出メタデータは修復済みですが、目を分離した描画はまだ実験であり、ラベル/反射/マテリアルの修正手段ではありません。シーンが消える場合は Native に戻してください。","Set portal toggle key":"ポータル切替キーを設定","Set show / hide UI key":"UI 表示 / 非表示キーを設定","Sets all three offsets back to 0, the game camera's own position.":"3 つのオフセットをすべて 0（ゲームカメラ本来の位置）に戻します。","Settings from before the reset restored; mouse mode remains off.":"リセット前の設定を復元しました。マウスモードはオフのままです。","Settings: D-pad selects, A activates, left stick scrolls the focused pane. Mouse wheel also scrolls. Release RT first: holding it adjusts the camera instead.":"設定：十字キーで選択、A で決定、左スティックでフォーカス中のペインをスクロールします。マウスホイールでもスクロールできます。先に RT を離してください：押したままだとカメラの調整になります。","Sharing with Xbox / treadmill":"Xbox / トレッドミルとの共有","Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then click L3 to turn the blur on or off.":"ショートカット：LT + RT を押したまま L3 をクリックすると、ぼかしをオン／オフできます。","Show / hide game HUD and menus":"ゲーム HUD・メニューの表示切替","Show / hide game UI":"ゲーム UI の表示切替","Show UI to see this menu":"UI を表示するとメニューが見えます","Show all":"すべて表示","Show extracted game UI":"抽出したゲーム UI を表示","Show game UI now":"ゲーム UI を表示","Show hover-drone / plane camera roll":"ホバードローン／飛行機のカメラロールを表示","Show optical hands (this launch only)":"光学式の手を表示（今回の起動のみ）","Showcase: one eye, steady, 16:9":"ショーケース：片目、安定化、16:9","Showcase: the left eye as a normal 16:9 video, steadied, with the HUD where you see it, at the game's own frame rate. Picture size 720, 1024 or 1280 px gives 720p, 1080p or 1440p. Needs SteamVR. Side by side: both eyes, to help find what went wrong.":"ショーケース：左目を通常の 16:9 動画として、安定化し、HUD を見える位置に表示して、ゲーム本来のフレームレートで録画します。映像サイズ 720、1024、1280 px はそれぞれ 720p、1080p、1440p になります。SteamVR が必要です。横並び：両目を録画し、問題の原因を探すのに役立ちます。","Shows 3 times, then turns itself off (Cinema page).":"3 回表示すると自動でオフになります（Cinema ページ）。","Shows the L3 card without holding anything. Shortcut: L3 + Menu. A loaded test plan shows its step there instead.":"何も押さずに L3 カードを表示します。ショートカット：L3 + Menu。テストプランを読み込んでいる場合は、代わりにそのステップを表示します。","Shows the current step where the controls card usually is. Off shows the controls card, as a public release does; the plan stays loaded here.":"通常は操作カードが表示される場所に、現在のステップを表示します。オフでは公開版と同じく操作カードを表示し、プランはここに読み込まれたままです。","Shows the world as a miniature around you, with the portal on or off. Needs Native Stereo. This launch only.":"ポータルのオン／オフにかかわらず、周囲の世界をミニチュアとして表示します。Native Stereo が必要です。今回の起動のみ。","Shrinks the world by the Diorama scale (%.0fx, set on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page) for an action-figure view, seen from the diorama camera (Camera page). Turn off to return to your normal scale. Works with or without the portal window.":"ジオラマの倍率（%.0f 倍、WuWa VR メニューのクイックページで設定）で世界を縮小し、ジオラマカメラ（カメラページ）から見るフィギュア視点にします。オフにすると通常のスケールに戻ります。ポータルウィンドウの有無に関わらず機能します。","Simulator: keep its preview open, choose Both eyes / side-by-side, and turn Full render off. Recording uses the preview size.":"シミュレーター：プレビューを開いたままにし、両目 / サイドバイサイドを選び、フルレンダリングをオフにしてください。録画はプレビューのサイズを使用します。","Skip this step":"このステップをスキップ","Slot 0":"スロット 0","Slot 1":"スロット 1","Slot 2":"スロット 2","Slot 3":"スロット 3","Smooth camera tilt":"カメラの上下を滑らかに","Smooth camera turns":"カメラの旋回を滑らかに","Smooth transition between animation and game view":"アニメとゲーム視点を滑らかに切替","Smoothing blends stick handovers and reported movement-state changes, such as takeoff/landing. It starts enabled on the supplied profile. Head position stays current; ordinary aiming and animation are immediate after the handover. Off restores the instant switch.":"スムージングは、スティックの切り替えや離陸・着陸などの報告された移動状態の変化を滑らかにします。付属プロファイルでは最初から有効です。頭の位置は最新のまま保たれ、通常の照準とアニメーションは切り替え後すぐに反映されます。オフでは即時切り替えに戻ります。","Smoothing speed":"スムージング速度","Smoothness":"滑らかさ","Smooths head shake out of the game window for OBS recordings. The window then trails quick head turns a little, so leave it off while you play. The headset image is not changed.":"OBS 録画のため、ゲームウィンドウから頭の揺れを取り除きます。素早く振り向くとウィンドウが少し遅れるので、プレイ中はオフにしてください。ヘッドセットの映像は変わりません。","Smooths head shake out of the game window, so OBS records a calm, full-resolution view with game audio. The headset image is not changed. The window shows a slightly narrower view so the picture can move inside it.":"ゲームウィンドウから頭の揺れを取り除き、OBS がゲーム音声付きの落ち着いたフル解像度の映像を録画できるようにします。ヘッドセットの映像は変わりません。ウィンドウは少し狭い視野を表示し、その中で映像が動けるようにします。","Smooths the game camera's left / right turns, so quick camera swings feel gentler.":"ゲームカメラの左 / 右の旋回を滑らかにし、素早いカメラの振りがより穏やかに感じられるようにします。","Smooths the game camera's up / down tilt.":"ゲームカメラの上 / 下の傾きを滑らかにします。","Soft contact shadows in corners and under objects. On by default. It keeps the game's own setting and renders both eyes with a symmetric view, so rocks, hills and roofs shade the same in each eye; the picture is slightly softer. Off is a little faster.":"隅や物の下にできる柔らかな接地影。既定はオン。ゲーム本来の設定を保ち、両目を左右対称の視野で描画するため、岩、丘、屋根の陰影が両目で一致します。画像はわずかに柔らかくなります。オフにすると少し軽くなります。","Something else":"その他","Speed":"速度","Stand where the far tree freezes, start a window, close the menu and look, then press what you saw. Each start or stop may cause a one-frame blur.":"遠くの木が止まって見える場所に立ち、ウィンドウを開始し、メニューを閉じて見て、見えたものを押してください。開始または停止のたびに 1 フレームのぶれが発生することがあります。","Start a developer playtest in the launcher, then save your observations here. Nothing passes automatically.":"ランチャーで開発者プレイテストを開始し、観察結果をここに保存してください。自動的に合格することはありません。","Start and end runs automatically":"ランを自動で開始・終了","Start and end treadmill runs automatically":"トレッドミルランを自動で開始・終了","Start motion sidecar (5 minutes max)":"動作データ記録（最大 5 分）","Start run":"ランを開始","Start video recording":"動画の録画を開始","Starting":"開始中","Starting the recorder. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"レコーダーを開始しています。クリアな映像のために UEVR メニューを閉じてください。","Starts again from step 1.":"ステップ 1 からやり直します。","Status: VR controllers need the OpenXR runtime.":"状態：VR コントローラーには OpenXR ランタイムが必要です。","Status: blocked by Physical gamepad passthrough. Turn passthrough off to use VR controllers.":"状態：物理ゲームパッドのパススルーによりブロックされています。VR コントローラーを使うにはパススルーをオフにしてください。","Status: blocked by the XInput controller slot filter. Allow slot %d or choose another slot.":"状態：XInput コントローラースロットフィルターによりブロックされています。スロット %d を許可するか、別のスロットを選んでください。","Status: off. Xbox only.":"状態：オフ。Xbox のみ。","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on.":"状態：オン、VR コントローラーを待機中。両方を起こし、ヘッドセットを装着したままにしてください。","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on; the Xbox still works.":"状態：オン、VR コントローラーを待機中。両方を起こし、ヘッドセットを装着したままにしてください。Xbox も引き続き使用できます。","Status: on, waiting for game focus. Click the game window.":"状態：オン、ゲームのフォーカスを待機中。ゲームウィンドウをクリックしてください。","Status: on, waiting for the game to read controller slot %d. It is asked again a few times a minute; keep the game window focused.":"状態：オン。ゲームがコントローラーのスロット %d を読むのを待っています。1 分に数回再要求します。ゲームウィンドウをフォーカスしたままにしてください。","Status: on. Every controller steers this menu; the game gets no input until it closes.":"状態：オン。すべてのコントローラーがこのメニューを操作し、閉じるまでゲームには入力が届きません。","Status: on. VR controllers and Xbox both working.":"状態：オン。VR コントローラーと Xbox の両方が動作中。","Status: on. VR controllers in control; use the Xbox to switch.":"状態：オン。VR コントローラーが操作中。切り替えるには Xbox を使用してください。","Status: on. VR controllers working.":"状態：オン。VR コントローラーが動作中。","Status: on. Xbox in control; use a VR control to switch.":"状態：オン。Xbox が操作中。切り替えるには VR コントローラーを使用してください。","Status: paused by the diagnostic motion-input mute.":"状態：診断用のモーション入力ミュートにより一時停止中。","Steadiness":"安定度","Steadiness (seconds of smoothing)":"安定度（スムージング秒数）","Steady desktop view (for OBS and streaming)":"デスクトップ視点を安定化（OBS・配信用）","Steady desktop window":"デスクトップウィンドウを安定化","SteamVR and the updated OpenXR Simulator are supported. VDXR capture is not available yet. Video has no audio and stops after five minutes. Actual frame rate depends on the game.":"SteamVR と更新された OpenXR Simulator に対応しています。VDXR のキャプチャはまだ利用できません。動画に音声はなく、5 分後に停止します。実際のフレームレートはゲームによって異なります。","Step":"ステップ","Step card below you":"足元のステップカード","Stereo rendering compatibility":"立体描画の互換性","Stereo screen":"立体スクリーン","Stereo screen (3D depth)":"立体スクリーン（3D の奥行き）","Stereo screen on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"立体スクリーンの切替（0.8 秒長押し）","Stick expo (softens center)":"スティックの指数カーブ（中央を緩やかに）","Stop motion sidecar":"動作データ記録を停止","Stop now":"今すぐ停止","Stop the voice note or transcription in the launcher before finishing.":"完了する前に、ランチャーのボイスメモまたは文字起こしを停止してください。","Stop video recording":"動画の録画を停止","Stop voice activity and confirm untested checks before finishing.":"完了する前に、ボイス操作を停止し、未確認のチェックを確認してください。","Stopped":"停止しました","Stopped: a write or restore failed. Restart the game before trying again.":"停止しました：書き込みまたは復元に失敗しました。再試行する前にゲームを再起動してください。","Stops the freecam at walls and the ground. Experimental.":"フリーカメラを壁や地面で停止させます。実験的機能。","Story camera nudge":"ストーリーカメラの微調整","Story camera nudge now: %s cm":"ストーリーカメラの微調整：現在 %s cm","Story camera nudge: waiting for a story shot":"ストーリーカメラの微調整：ストーリーのショットを待機中","Story cutscenes and dialogue":"ストーリーのカットシーンと会話","Story pictures":"ストーリーの絵","Story pictures use":"ストーリーの絵で使用","Story scenes in 16:9":"ストーリーシーンは 16:9","Story scenes use":"ストーリーシーンで使用","Story shots: camera nearer / back (L3 + Y + X resets; keyboard Page Up / Page Down / Home)":"ストーリーのショット：カメラを近づける / 下げる（L3 + Y + X でリセット、キーボードは Page Up / Page Down / Home）","Streamer privacy: cover player IDs":"配信プライバシー：ID を隠す","Stutter or freeze":"カクつき・フリーズ","Supplied profile restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"付属プロファイルを復元しました。続行する前にすべての操作を離してください。","Swap the eyes' poses and projections (stereo looks inverted)":"左右の目の姿勢と投影を入れ替える（立体視が反転して見える）","Swap the eyes' render targets (stereo looks inverted)":"左右の目のレンダーターゲットを入れ替える（立体視が反転して見える）","Sweeps the camera against surfaces that block the game's Visibility trace. Slides along contact surfaces. Unsupported queries hold movement and report a reason below. Physical headset leaning is not constrained. Starts off; world geometry still needs live verification.":"ゲームの Visibility トレースを遮る面に対してカメラを走査します。接触面に沿ってスライドします。未対応のクエリでは移動を保持し、下に理由を表示します。ヘッドセットを実際に傾ける動きは制限されません。初期状態はオフ。ワールド形状の実地検証はまだ必要です。","Switches to a screen while a story video (mono theatre) or a story picture plays, then back to the view you had. Story scenes keep your view unless you choose otherwise below.":"ストーリー動画（モノシアター）やストーリーの絵の再生中はスクリーンに切り替え、終わると元の表示に戻ります。下で別の選択をしない限り、ストーリーシーンは今の表示のままです。","Sync left eye LOD to right eye (fix candidate)":"左目の LOD を右目に同期（修正候補）","TEST":"テスト","Target recording rate":"目標録画フレームレート","Test":"テスト","Tests the game's default texture in place of custom reflections for the two main eyes. This is an effect-removal workaround, not a projection repair, and can also remove correct custom reflections. Starts off and restores on the next rendered views when disabled.":"2 つのメインアイについて、カスタム反射の代わりにゲームのデフォルトテクスチャを試します。これはエフェクトを除去する回避策であり、投影の修復ではありません。正しいカスタム反射も除去される場合があります。初期状態はオフで、無効にすると次に描画されるビューで復元されます。","The 2D view's background blur, in full VR and on the stereo screen. In full VR the blur is scaled for the headset's wider lens and the focus follows Close-up match.":"2D ビューの背景ぼかし。フル VR と立体スクリーンの両方に適用されます。フル VR では、ぼかしはヘッドセットのより広いレンズに合わせて調整され、フォーカスは Close-up match に従います。","The Kuro material candidate stopped or could not verify this build. See the diagnostic log.":"Kuro のマテリアル候補が停止したか、このビルドを検証できませんでした。診断ログを参照してください。","The card is blocked by FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor. Turn that off to display it.":"カードは FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor によってブロックされています。表示するにはこれをオフにしてください。","The game builds one eye from a plain default camera, so that eye misses the shot's camera settings. Blur only copies the depth of field across; All camera effects also copies grading, vignette, exposure and the rest.":"ゲームは片方の目を素のデフォルトカメラから構築するため、その目にはショットのカメラ設定が反映されません。Blur は被写界深度のみをコピーします。All camera effects はカラーグレーディング、ビネット、露出などもコピーします。","The hand demo needs OpenXR with optical hand tracking. Xbox gameplay is unchanged.":"ハンドデモには光学式ハンドトラッキング対応の OpenXR が必要です。Xbox のゲーム操作は変わりません。","The hand overlay renderer is unavailable. The joint inspector remains available; see the UEVR log for details.":"ハンドオーバーレイのレンダラーは利用できません。ジョイントインスペクターは引き続き利用できます。詳細は UEVR ログを参照してください。","The hold gesture is unavailable while Enable motion-controller input is on; use this checkbox.":"Enable motion-controller input がオンの間は長押しジェスチャーを利用できません。このチェックボックスを使用してください。","The playtest session changed. Review it before saving.":"プレイテストセッションが変更されました。保存する前に確認してください。","The previous character rim value was restored and verified.":"以前のキャラクターリム値を復元し、検証しました。","The recorder is missing from this launcher package.":"このランチャーパッケージにレコーダーがありません。","The rim variable changed; no old pointer was used. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"リム変数が変更されました。古いポインターは使用されていません。オフにしてからオンに戻して再試行してください。","The selected package is recorded; this is not proof of the DLL loaded by the game.":"選択したパッケージは記録されていますが、これはゲームが読み込んだ DLL の証明ではありません。","The session changed. Review your unsent note before adding it to this session.":"セッションが変更されました。このセッションに追加する前に、未送信のメモを確認してください。","The supplied profile enables this for Native Stereo Fix with OpenXR. Headset timing acceptance is still limited; disable only for a deliberate comparison.":"付属プロファイルは Native Stereo Fix と OpenXR でこれを有効にします。ヘッドセットのタイミング許容はまだ限定的です。意図的な比較のためだけに無効にしてください。","The top-left box normally follows the ESC/overlay menu render path, including gamepad menus. Other popups using that same path may also show it. The bottom-right UID box stays on. Check your recording; unknown menu layouts are not guaranteed to be covered. Always is a manual fallback.":"左上のボックスは通常、ゲームパッドのメニューを含む ESC／オーバーレイメニューの描画経路に従います。同じ経路を使う他のポップアップにも表示される場合があります。右下の UID ボックスは常に表示されたままです。録画を確認してください。未知のメニューレイアウトが隠れることは保証されません。Always は手動のフォールバックです。","These are UEVR's existing global aim settings, shared with VR > Input. They are not limited to first person.":"これらは UEVR 既存の全体照準設定で、VR > Input と共有されます。一人称視点専用ではありません。","These buttons use UEVR's existing live rendering options. The image may pause while render targets rebuild. They leave camera, HUD placement and controller settings alone. Opening this section changes nothing; UEVR saves whichever renderer you leave selected.":"これらのボタンは UEVR 既存のリアルタイム描画オプションを使用します。レンダーターゲットの再構築中は映像が一時停止することがあります。カメラ、HUD の配置、コントローラー設定は変更しません。このセクションを開いても何も変わりません。UEVR は最後に選択したレンダラーを保存します。","These modes move the viewpoint; the character stays put. Acro is a camera flight model, without motor, propeller or battery simulation.":"これらのモードは視点を移動させ、キャラクターはその場に留まります。アクロはカメラの飛行モデルで、モーター・プロペラ・バッテリーのシミュレーションはありません。","These old comparison tests are separate from the normal far-object repair. Some deliberately invert or duplicate eye data; they are not recommended player settings.":"これらの旧比較テストは通常の遠景オブジェクト修復とは別物です。一部は意図的に眼のデータを反転または複製します。プレイヤー向けの推奨設定ではありません。","This OpenXR runtime or headset does not provide hand tracking.":"この OpenXR ランタイムまたはヘッドセットはハンドトラッキングに対応していません。","This is a flat rectangular HUD: corners can extend over rounded/feathered edges. Use Safe fit to keep every corner inside, or use a rectangular portal for exact alignment.":"これは平坦な長方形の HUD です。角が丸み／ぼかしの付いた縁からはみ出すことがあります。「角丸の内側に収める」を使うと四隅を内側に保て、長方形ポータルを使うと正確に位置合わせできます。","This launch only: not saved.":"今回の起動のみ：保存されません。","This older profile has no supplied-defaults file. Reset this build in the launcher while the game is closed, or use this launch's settings below.":"この古いプロファイルには付属のデフォルト設定ファイルがありません。ゲームを閉じた状態でランチャーのこのビルドをリセットするか、以下にある今回の起動時の設定を使用してください。","This runtime cannot identify optical hands. Controller-derived joints are not shown.":"このランタイムは光学式ハンドを識別できません。コントローラー由来の関節は表示されません。","Times your run and saves your route in the game once a second, with a sync flash for OBS videos. With Reality Runner open, walking starts a run by itself (Controllers page).":"ランの時間を計り、ゲーム内のルートを毎秒保存します。OBS 動画用の同期フラッシュ付き。Reality Runner を開いていれば、歩くとランが自動で始まります（コントローラーページ）。","Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"HUD／マウス調整を切替","Trace mesh triangles when supported":"対応している場合はメッシュ三角形をトレース","Track the camera":"カメラを追跡","Track the camera: the distance is measured at each cut, then follows only the game camera's own moves, so a focus change cannot move you. Fixed per shot: the distance stays as it was at the cut. Follow the focus: it also moves when the game changes focus.":"カメラを追跡：距離は各カットで測定され、その後はゲームカメラ自身の動きにのみ追従するため、フォーカス変更で移動することはありません。ショットごとに固定：距離はカット時のままです。フォーカスに追従：ゲームがフォーカスを変えたときも動きます。","Transition duration (seconds)":"切替時間（秒）","Translucency correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"半透明補正が停止したか、このゲームビルドを検証できませんでした。診断ログを参照してください。","Treadmill":"トレッドミル","Treadmill run":"トレッドミルラン","Try headset aim":"ヘッドセット照準を試す","Turn speed":"旋回速度","Turn this note off in the menu, Cinema page.":"この通知はメニューの Cinema ページでオフにできます。","Turn this off to isolate your physical gamepad. Head tracking stays enabled.":"これをオフにすると物理ゲームパッドのみを使用します。ヘッドトラッキングは有効のままです。","UEVR > WuWa Controls > Exit mouse mode now":"UEVR > WuWa Controls > マウスモードを終了","UI placement":"UI の配置","UID bottom":"UID 下","UID left":"UID 左","UID right":"UID 右","UID top":"UID 上","Unavailable while another graphics test runs.":"別のグラフィックステストの実行中は使用できません。","Unavailable: %s":"利用不可：%s","Unavailable: the eye pair is not verified yet (or this game build is not supported).":"使用できません：眼のペアがまだ検証されていない（またはこのゲームビルドが未対応）ためです。","Undo last controls reset":"直前の操作設定リセットを元に戻す","Unoccluded hand skeleton demo: hands draw over the game. No grabbing, collisions or gesture controls. Xbox remains gameplay.":"遮蔽なしのハンドスケルトンデモ：手がゲームの上に描画されます。掴む・衝突・ジェスチャー操作はありません。Xbox はそのままゲーム操作です。","Unsupported PlayStation input report; use Steam Input if available":"未対応の PlayStation 入力レポートです。可能なら Steam Input を使用してください","Until the next cut":"次のカットまで","Until the next cut: each shot starts at the game's spot again. For the whole scene: your nudge stays until the story shots end.":"次のカットまで：各ショットはゲームの位置から始まります。シーン全体：ストーリーのショットが終わるまで調整が保持されます。","Up / down":"上 / 下","Use a keyboard for text. Voice notes require explicit microphone consent in the developer web panel.":"テキスト入力にはキーボードを使用してください。音声メモには開発者用ウェブパネルでの明示的なマイク許可が必要です。","Use game aim for full animation":"全アニメーションでゲーム照準を使用","Use game view while either stick moves":"スティック操作中はゲーム視点","Use native stereo":"Native Stereo を使用","Use right-stick pitch":"右スティックで上下を見る","Use separate-eye renderer":"左右別レンダラーを使用","Use the VR controllers as an Xbox pad for walking and sightseeing. Holding the left Menu button for 1 second also turns them on or off.":"VR コントローラーを Xbox パッドとして歩行や観光に使用します。左の Menu ボタンを 1 秒長押ししてもオン／オフを切り替えられます。","Use this menu when opening UEVR":"UEVR を開くときにこのメニューを使用","Used instead of the offsets above while the diorama is on. The diorama makes your eyes far apart, so a camera that suits normal play puts the character too close and crosses your eyes. The default, 5 m back, shows it about an arm's length away at 10x.":"ジオラマがオンの間、上のオフセットの代わりに使われます。ジオラマでは両目の間隔が大きく広がるため、通常のプレイに合うカメラではキャラクターが近すぎて寄り目になります。既定の 5 m 後方なら、10 倍でキャラクターが腕の長さほど先に見えます。","Uses one game camera pose for both eyes during the same frame, while preserving headset movement and eye separation. Requires Native Stereo Fix. The owner confirmed the ultimate return-to-gameplay fix. Other scene transitions remain under test; this does not repair foliage.":"同じフレーム内で両眼にゲームカメラの同一ポーズを使用しつつ、ヘッドセットの動きと眼の間隔を保持します。Native Stereo Fix が必要です。オーナーがゲーム操作復帰の最終的な修正として確認済みです。その他のシーン遷移はまだテスト中で、草木は修復されません。","Uses the game's full-resolution translucency path for ordinary two-eye views. Compare Lynae, Mornye and Iuno in both eyes. May cost performance. Requires Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off; other renderers keep their normal behavior.":"通常の両眼表示でゲームのフル解像度の半透明パスを使用します。両眼で Lynae、Mornye、Iuno を比較してください。パフォーマンスが低下する場合があります。Native Stereo と Native Stereo Fix、Extreme Compatibility オフが必要です。その他のレンダラーは通常どおり動作します。","V once; hold 0.8 s for the Tab wheel":"V を 1 回、0.8 秒長押しで Tab ホイール","VR controllers":"VR コントローラー","VR controllers for walking (optional)":"歩行用 VR コントローラー（任意）","VR controllers on (this launch)":"VR コントローラー有効（今回の起動）","VR controllers: point and pull the trigger, or use either stick and A. B closes, the grips change page. Xbox: D-pad or stick, A, B, LB / RB. Keyboard: arrows, Enter, Esc, Tab. Mouse: click and scroll.":"VR コントローラー：ポイントしてトリガーを引くか、どちらかのスティックと A を使用します。B で閉じ、グリップでページを切り替えます。Xbox：十字キーまたはスティック、A、B、LB / RB。キーボード：矢印キー、Enter、Esc、Tab。マウス：クリックとスクロール。","VR only (Xbox ignored)":"VR のみ（Xbox は無視）","Video style":"動画スタイル","View":"View","View hints":"視点ヒント","View modes and cutscenes":"視点モードとカットシーン","Views hold unexpected values; copy skipped":"視点の値が想定外のため、コピーをスキップしました","WHILE ADJUSTMENT IS ON":"調整中","Wait for an active playtest in the launcher.":"ランチャーで有効なプレイテストを待っています。","Wait for the launcher operation to finish.":"ランチャーの操作が完了するまでお待ちください。","Waiting for a close-up (lens now %s degrees)":"クローズアップ待ち（現在のレンズ %s 度）","Waiting for a stereo frame":"ステレオフレームを待っています","Waiting for a valid portal anchor.":"有効なポータルアンカーを待っています。","Waiting for a verified cinematic signal":"確認済みのシネマ信号を待っています","Waiting for an authored constrained camera":"オリジナルの画角制限カメラを待っています","Waiting for fresh optical hands. Keep hands visible to the headset and enable tracking forwarding in Virtual Desktop when using VDXR.":"新しい光学ハンドの検出を待っています。VDXR 使用時は Virtual Desktop でトラッキング転送を有効にし、手をヘッドセットに見せてください。","Waiting for native game camera":"ゲーム本来のカメラを待っています","Waiting for playtest acknowledgement...":"プレイテストの承認を待っています…","Waiting for the launcher...":"ランチャーを待っています…","Walk by default":"デフォルトで歩行","Walk by default; hold RB for normal speed":"デフォルトで歩行：RB 長押しで通常速度","Walk instead of run; hold RB for normal speed.":"走行ではなく歩行：RB 長押しで通常速度。","Warn when a menu opens with game UI hidden":"UI 非表示でメニューを開いたら警告","What automatic switching shows during story scenes and conversations. Keep current view leaves full VR, the stereo screen or mono as you have it.":"ストーリーシーンと会話の間に自動切替で表示するもの。「現在の表示を維持」はフル VR、立体スクリーン、モノを今のまま保ちます。","What automatic switching shows while a story picture fills the screen.":"ストーリーの絵が画面いっぱいに表示される間、自動切替で表示するもの。","What happened":"何が起きましたか","What you see of your own character. Hiding the head stops it from blocking the view.":"一人称視点で自分のキャラが見える範囲。頭を非表示にすると視界を遮りません。","When a letterboxed cinematic camera starts in full VR, a short note in view reminds you of the screen shortcut. A fallback for when automatic switching misses a scene.":"フル VR で横帯の映画カメラが開始した際、画面ショートカットを画面内に短く表示します。自動切替がシーンを検出できない場合の代替手段です。","When to show the profile ID box":"プロフィール ID を隠すタイミング","Where this menu floats around you. Full VR and the screen views each keep their own place; on a screen view Low sits just under the picture, whatever its size and distance, and the menu always stays in front of it.":"このメニューが表示される位置。フル VR と画面表示はそれぞれ別の位置を記憶します。画面表示では「低」位置が画像サイズや距離に関わらず画像のすぐ下に配置され、常に画像の手前に表示されます。","Where your viewpoint sits in the diorama, from the game camera. Back (minus) moves the miniature farther away.":"ジオラマでの視点の位置（ゲームカメラ基準）です。後ろ（マイナス）にするとミニチュアが遠くなります。","Where: ":"配置：","Which Xbox controller slot the VR controllers share. Automatic uses the one with a controller, such as a treadmill's virtual pad.":"VR コントローラーが共有する Xbox コントローラーのスロット。自動は、トレッドミルの仮想パッドなど、コントローラーがあるスロットを使います。","Whichever you used last controls the game; the other waits until you press or push something on it.":"最後に操作したコントローラーがゲームを操作します。もう一方は何か操作されるまで待機します。","While hiding is off: a short note with the shortcut, once per scene, when a character is right at your eyes. After 3 notes it turns itself off.":"非表示がオフのとき：キャラクターが目の前に来ると、シーンごとに一度だけショートカットを短く通知します。3 回通知すると自動でオフになります。","While playing in first person, hold L3 + Y to raise eye level or L3 + X to lower it. This lets you see the result with this menu closed.":"一人称視点中に L3 + Y で目の高さを上げ、L3 + X で下げられます。このメニューを閉じた状態で結果を確認できます。","While recording":"録画中","While recording: the boxes appear while the WuWa VR app records and during treadmill runs. Recording with other software (OBS) at other times needs Always.":"録画中：WuWa VR アプリの録画中とトレッドミルラン中にボックスを表示します。それ以外の時間にほかのソフト（OBS）で録画するなら「常時」が必要です。","Wide 90 degrees":"広角 90 度","Width per eye. Larger is sharper and makes bigger files.":"片目あたりの幅。大きいほど鮮明になりますが、ファイルサイズも大きくなります。","Window alignment down / up":"ウィンドウの上下位置調整","Window alignment left / right":"ウィンドウの左右位置調整","With Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass on, keeps the source eye's projection for supported custom reflection captures. With Native Stereo Fix off, selects verified two-eye atlas parameters. Visual acceptance is pending.":"Native Stereo Fix と Use Same Stereo Pass が有効な場合、対応するカスタム反射キャプチャでは元の目の投影を維持します。Native Stereo Fix が無効な場合は、検証済みの 2 眼アトラス用パラメータを使用します。見え方の妥当性は検証中です。","With Reality Runner open, 10 seconds of walking starts a run and 5 minutes without walking ends it. The WuWa VR menu has the same switch on its Controllers page.":"Reality Runner を開いていると、10 秒歩くとランが始まり、5 分歩かないと終わります。WuWa VR メニューのコントローラーページにも同じスイッチがあります。","With Reality Runner open, 10 seconds of walking starts a run and 5 minutes without walking ends it. Your route is saved in the UEVR profile, wuwa-runs folder.":"Reality Runner を開いていると、10 秒歩くとランが始まり、5 分歩かないと終わります。ルートは UEVR プロファイルの wuwa-runs フォルダーに保存されます。","With the 16:9 layout off: every conversation (story scenes and chats with people in the world) and story videos switch to 16:9 while they play, so story pictures show whole, then the taller layout comes back. Follows the game's own dialogue state, so it works with any controls and with the game UI hidden.":"16:9 レイアウトがオフのとき：すべての会話（ストーリーシーンとワールドの人との会話）とストーリー動画の再生中は 16:9 に切り替わり、ストーリーの絵が欠けずに表示され、終わると縦長のレイアウトに戻ります。ゲーム自身の会話状態に従うので、どの操作方法でも、ゲーム UI を非表示にしていても動作します。","With the 16:9 layout on: the character screen (Resonators) uses the taller layout while it is open, so its floor reflection keeps showing the current character, then 16:9 comes back. Its icons look flatter there and the mouse can miss.":"16:9 レイアウトがオンのとき：キャラクター画面（共鳴者）を開いている間は縦長レイアウトを使い、床の反射が常に現在のキャラクターを映します。閉じると 16:9 に戻ります。この画面ではアイコンが平たく見え、マウスがずれることがあります。","Within a shot":"カット内","World scale":"ワールドスケール","World-space labels in both eyes (candidate)":"両眼の空間ラベル（修正候補）","Write a short observation before saving.":"保存前に簡単なメモを記入してください。","WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"WuWa Controls > ゲーム UI を表示","WuWa VR menu":"WuWa VR メニュー","WuWa controls and shortcut pages only. Base UEVR, game text and some technical help remain English. Translations are community-editable drafts.":"WuWa の操作・ショートカットページのみ日本語化されています。UEVR 本体やゲームテキスト、一部の技術説明は英語のままです。翻訳はコミュニティ編集による草案です。","X + left stick":"X＋左スティック","X + stick  Scroll    D-pad Move map":"X + スティック：スクロール    十字キー：マップ移動","X or Delete: back to the default.":"X または Delete：既定値に戻す。","XInput controller slot (test)":"XInput コントローラースロット（テスト）","Xbox / Steam Input has priority; direct PlayStation shortcuts are waiting":"Xbox／Steam Input が優先されます。PlayStation の直接ショートカットは待機中です。","Y + X together: back to default":"Y + X 同時押し：デフォルトに戻す","Yaw rate (degrees / second)":"ヨー回転速度（度／秒）","You are in the scene":"シーン内にいます","Your answer: ":"回答：","Your answers are saved. Restart it from the menu's Test page.":"回答は保存されました。メニューのテストページから再開してください。","Your body":"自分の身体","Your route in the game is saved once a second (UEVR profile > wuwa-runs), so no map screenshots are needed. Each start and end flashes a magenta square in the desktop view, so an OBS video lines up with the route.":"ゲーム内のルートを毎秒保存するので（UEVR プロファイル > wuwa-runs）、地図のスクリーンショットは不要です。開始と終了のたびにデスクトップ表示にマゼンタの四角が光り、OBS 動画とルートを合わせられます。","Your unsent note is retained in this menu until the game closes.":"未送信のメモはゲーム終了までこのメニューに保持されます。","depth of field forced on":"被写界深度を強制的にオン","depth of field: %s":"被写界深度：%s","depth of field: not in this game build":"被写界深度：このゲームバージョンにはありません","game focus":"ゲームのピント","held behind the person in front (%s m)":"手前の人物の後ろで停止（%s m）","hiding anything nearer than %s cm":"%s cm より近いものを非表示","hold {L3} or {LT}+{RT} to see what each button does · {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"{L3} または {LT}+{RT} 長押しでボタン説明を表示 · {L3}+{R3} で WuWa VR メニューを開く","now":"今","stopped at the closest %s cm":"最短距離 %s cm で停止","subject":"被写体","{LT}+{RT}, click {R3} for full VR":"{LT}+{RT}、{R3} を押してフル VR へ","{LT}+{RT}, click {R3} for the stereo screen":"{LT}+{RT}、{R3} を押して立体スクリーンへ","{LT}+{RT}, hold {R3} to leave mono":"{LT}+{RT}、{R3} を長押しでモノを終了"}},"ko":{"schema":1,"language":"ko","name":"Korean","direction":"ltr","font":"kr","review":"draft; native-speaker review welcome","strings":{"%+.0f cm":"%+.0f cm","%+.2f m":"%+.2f m","%.0f cm":"%.0f cm","%.0f deg":"%.0f도","%.0fx":"%.0f배","%.1f m":"%.1f m","%.1fx":"%.1f배","%.2f m":"%.2f m","%.2f s":"%.2f초","%.2fx":"%.2f배","%.3fx":"%.3f배","%s: %u samples":"%s: %u 샘플",". Answer again to change it.":". 다시 답하면 변경됩니다.","01  HOLD L3":"01  L3 길게 누르기","02  HOLD LT + RT":"02  LT + RT 길게 누르기","03  CAMERAS":"03  카메라","04  MENUS & HUD":"04  메뉴 & HUD","05  WUWA VR MENU":"05  WuWa VR 메뉴","1024 px":"1024 px","1280 px":"1280 px","16:9 UI layout":"16:9 UI 레이아웃","30 fps":"30 fps","3D depth":"3D 깊이","45 fps":"45 fps","60 fps":"60 fps","720 px":"720 px","A VR button or stick held from before is ignored until you let go of it.":"이전부터 눌려 있던 VR 버튼이나 스틱은 떼기 전까지 무시됩니다.","A big 3D screen; best for cutscenes":"큰 3D 화면, 컷신에 적합","A hidden head bone has no usable animated pose: the neck supplies an approximation. For actual head-bone tracking choose Keep entire character visible or Hide body; keep full character shadow. Separate accessories without a head bone may remain visible in head-only mode. Exit and re-enter first person in a neutral pose to recalibrate. Offsets use game units. L3 + A recenters headset/simulator displacement.":"숨겨진 머리 본은 쓸 수 있는 애니메이션 자세가 없어 목이 근사치를 대신합니다. 실제 머리 본 추적을 원하면 캐릭터 전체 표시 또는 몸 숨김, 전체 그림자 복사를 선택하세요. 머리 본이 없는 별도 액세서리는 머리만 모드에서 계속 보일 수 있습니다. 중립 자세로 1인칭을 나갔다 다시 들어가면 재보정됩니다. 오프셋은 게임 단위를 사용합니다. L3 + A는 헤드셋/시뮬레이터 변위를 다시 중앙에 맞춥니다.","A select  ·  Left / right change  ·  LB / RB pages  ·  B close":"A 선택  ·  좌 / 우 변경  ·  LB / RB 페이지  ·  B 닫기","A-D restore all controller slots for a fair comparison. Each records until stopped or 1000 changes. Close with Insert, test LB+Y before and after Alt-Tab, then return with Insert. Restore above to undo this batch. UEVR saves the current settings on exit.":"A-D는 공정한 비교를 위해 모든 컨트롤러 슬롯을 복원합니다. 각 기록은 중지하거나 변경 1000회에 도달할 때까지 계속됩니다. Insert로 닫고, Alt-Tab 전후로 LB+Y를 테스트한 뒤 Insert로 돌아오세요. 위의 복원으로 이번 묶음을 취소할 수 있습니다. UEVR은 종료 시 현재 설정을 저장합니다.","A. Physical gamepad baseline":"A. 실제 게임패드 기준","A/B/X/Y keep their labels. Triggers = LT/RT, grips = LB/RB, stick clicks = L3/R3. Left Menu tap = Start; left grip + Menu tap = View. Both stick clicks open the WuWa VR menu. D-pad actions are not mapped.":"A/B/X/Y는 라벨을 유지합니다. 트리거 = LT/RT, 그립 = LB/RB, 스틱 클릭 = L3/R3. 왼쪽 Menu 짧게 = Start, 왼쪽 그립 + Menu 짧게 = View. 양쪽 스틱 클릭은 WuWa VR 메뉴를 엽니다. 방향 패드 기능은 매핑되지 않습니다.","Acro drone":"아크로 드론","Acro drone (manual)":"아크로 드론 (수동)","Acro throttle control":"아크로 스로틀 조작","Acro: right stick controls roll/pitch rates; left stick X controls yaw. Stick forward pitches down. Centered sticks stop rotation without levelling. Gravity, thrust and momentum keep acting while armed. Full camera roll is part of this mode.":"아크로: 오른쪽 스틱은 롤/피치 속도를, 왼쪽 스틱 X는 요를 조작합니다. 스틱을 앞으로 밀면 아래로 기웁니다. 스틱을 중앙에 두면 수평을 맞추지 않고 회전만 멈춥니다. 무장한 동안 중력, 추력, 관성은 계속 작용합니다. 전체 카메라 롤이 이 모드에 포함됩니다.","Action":"기능","Activated automatically in this menu: cursor only. L3 + R3 opens the WuWa VR menu.":"이 메뉴에서 자동으로 활성화됩니다: 커서만. L3 + R3은 WuWa VR 메뉴를 엽니다.","Active: %s (targets swapped %llu, constructed %llu)":"활성: %s (대상 교체 %llu, 생성 %llu)","Active: %s, %llu s left, applied %llu, restored %llu":"활성: %s, %llu초 남음, 적용 %llu, 복원 %llu","Adds the missing second-eye pass for the custom material path used by Lynae, Mornye and Iuno. Preserves the first eye. Requires Native Stereo, with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off. Visual acceptance pending.":"Lynae, Mornye, Iuno가 사용하는 사용자 지정 머티리얼 경로에 누락된 두 번째 눈 패스를 추가합니다. 첫 번째 눈은 유지합니다. Native Stereo가 필요하며 Native Stereo Fix와 Extreme Compatibility는 꺼야 합니다. 시각적 검증 대기 중.","Advanced compatibility and diagnostics":"고급 호환성 및 진단","Advanced rendering and script diagnostics":"고급 렌더링 및 스크립트 진단","After you switch views, a line shows for 3 seconds with how to go on or come back. It switches itself off after 5 switches.":"시점을 전환하면 계속 전환하거나 돌아가는 방법이 3초 동안 표시됩니다. 5번 전환하면 자동으로 꺼집니다.","Aim direction":"조준 방향","Aiming and right-stick pitch":"조준 및 오른쪽 스틱 상하 시점","Air drag (per second)":"공기 저항 (초당)","All camera effects":"모든 카메라 효과","All camera effects copied into the first view":"모든 카메라 효과를 첫 시점에 복사했습니다","All camera effects copied into the second view":"모든 카메라 효과를 두 번째 시점에 복사했습니다","All detected menus":"감지된 모든 메뉴","All settings (classic UEVR menu)":"모든 설정 (클래식 UEVR 메뉴)","All shortcut contexts":"모든 단축키","All slots (unchanged)":"모든 슬롯 (변경 없음)","All slots preserves normal input. Select one slot to exclude the others from WuWa's XInput state calls. Check the raw controller states below while pressing a button to identify your pad. Slot numbers can change after reconnecting; this does not hide Windows devices or filter other input APIs. Vibration commands stay available, including motor stop requests.":"모든 슬롯은 일반 입력을 유지합니다. 슬롯 하나를 선택하면 나머지 슬롯을 WuWa의 XInput 상태 호출에서 제외합니다. 버튼을 누르면서 아래의 원시 컨트롤러 상태를 확인해 자신의 패드를 식별하세요. 슬롯 번호는 다시 연결하면 바뀔 수 있습니다. 이 기능은 Windows 장치를 숨기거나 다른 입력 API를 필터링하지 않습니다. 진동 명령은 모터 정지 요청을 포함해 계속 사용할 수 있습니다.","All stick overrides (includes legacy pitch-only)":"모든 스틱 우선 (기존 피치 전용 포함)","Allow VR motion-controller input":"VR 모션 컨트롤러 입력 허용","Also cover the ESC profile ID row":"ESC 프로필 ID 행도 가리기","Also hide the profile ID row":"프로필 ID 행도 가리기","Alternating / AFR":"교대 / AFR","Always":"항상","Always (manual mask)":"항상 (수동 가림)","Ambient occlusion":"앰비언트 오클루전","Ambient occlusion (soft contact shadows)":"앰비언트 오클루전 (부드러운 접촉 그림자)","An automated stereo comparison is active. These three settings return to your choices when it ends (at most 60 seconds).":"자동 입체 비교가 진행 중입니다. 이 세 설정은 비교가 끝나면(최대 60초) 원래 선택으로 돌아갑니다.","Animated":"애니메이션","Animated position + stick pitch":"애니메이션 위치 + 스틱 상하 시점","Animation comfort":"애니메이션 편안함","Animation off: stable height relative to the character root. On: follow the head, or reconstruct it from a visible parent bone when the head is hidden. This follows leaning and sprinting but can add bobbing. Missing rig support falls back to the stable anchor; see the status below.":"애니메이션 끄기: 캐릭터 루트 기준으로 높이가 고정됩니다. 켜기: 머리를 따라가거나, 머리가 숨겨진 경우 보이는 부모 본에서 재구성합니다. 이는 기울기와 달리기를 따라가지만 흔들림이 더해질 수 있습니다. 리그 지원이 없으면 고정 기준점으로 대체됩니다. 아래 상태를 참고하세요.","Another playtest request is pending. Wait for the launcher.":"다른 플레이테스트 요청이 대기 중입니다. 런처를 기다리세요.","Another setting changed the rim value; it was left untouched. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"다른 설정이 림 값을 변경하여 그대로 두었습니다. 끈 다음 다시 켜서 재시도하세요.","Answer in the menu: L3 + R3 (or Insert), Test page.":"메뉴에서 답하세요: L3 + R3 (또는 Insert), 테스트 페이지.","As in the headset":"헤드셋과 동일","As in the headset: the HUD sits where you see it in VR, at its distance and size. Flat: the HUD fills the window like on a monitor, a steady reference while you play. Full VR only; the stereo screen and mono theatre always show it flat.":"헤드셋과 동일: HUD가 VR에서 보이는 위치에 같은 거리와 크기로 표시됩니다. 평면: HUD가 모니터처럼 창을 가득 채워 플레이 중 안정적인 기준이 됩니다. 전체 VR 전용이며, 입체 화면과 모노 극장에서는 항상 평면으로 표시됩니다.","Asks the game to lay out its HUD again. Try it if the HUD looks stretched or cut off after switching views.":"게임에 HUD를 다시 배치하도록 요청합니다. 시점 전환 후 HUD가 늘어나거나 잘려 보이면 사용해 보세요.","Authored framing applied (headset check pending)":"원본 구도 적용됨 (헤드셋 확인 대기)","Auto":"자동","Auto uses the eye that has the camera's focus. If both eyes stay sharp or look wrong, try First or Second.":"자동은 카메라 초점이 맞는 눈을 사용합니다. 양쪽 눈이 모두 선명하거나 잘못 보이면 첫 번째 또는 두 번째를 사용해 보세요.","Automatic":"자동","Automatic cinematic screen":"자동 시네마틱 화면","Automatic cinematic screen (experimental)":"자동 시네마틱 화면 (실험)","Automatic cutscene switching":"자동 컷신 전환","Automatic lease expired; restoration waits for the next game tick":"자동 임대가 만료됨. 복원은 다음 게임 틱에 진행됩니다","Automatic mono theatre active":"자동 모노 극장 활성","Automatic presentation lease expired; previous view restored":"자동 표시 임대가 만료되어 이전 화면으로 복원됨","Automatic slot: using slot %d.":"자동 슬롯: 슬롯 %d 사용 중.","Automatic stereo screen active":"자동 입체 화면 활성","Automatic story switching did not activate in the latest reported replay. Prerecorded video switching has not been tested. Missing or changed signals leave the normal view unchanged.":"자동 스토리 전환이 최근 보고된 재생에서 작동하지 않았습니다. 사전 녹화 영상 전환은 테스트되지 않았습니다. 신호가 없거나 변경되면 일반 시점이 그대로 유지됩니다.","Automatic uses the slot that has a controller, such as a treadmill's virtual pad while the real pad is hidden. Choose a fixed slot only if it picks the wrong one: launcher Troubleshooting > Controller check lists them.":"자동은 컨트롤러가 연결된 슬롯을 사용합니다(실제 패드가 숨겨진 상태의 트레드밀 가상 패드 등). 잘못 고를 때만 고정 슬롯을 선택하세요. 런처의 문제 해결 > 컨트롤러 확인에서 슬롯 목록을 볼 수 있습니다.","Automatically use mouse in game menus (legacy)":"게임 메뉴에서 마우스 자동 사용 (레거시)","B. Windows focus forwarding":"B. Windows 포커스 전달","Back to 1.33, the full VR default.":"1.33으로 복귀, 전체 VR 기본값.","Back to the WuWa VR menu":"WuWa VR 메뉴로 돌아가기","Back to the diorama defaults: 5 m back, centred. The normal offsets stay as they are.":"디오라마 기본값으로 되돌립니다: 5m 뒤, 가운데. 일반 오프셋은 그대로 유지됩니다.","Back to the game camera.":"게임 카메라로 돌아가기.","Black bars":"검은 띠","Black bars in cutscenes? In WuWa's graphics settings, change Cinematic from Cutscene to Fullscreen. The bars go and cutscenes fill your view.":"컷신에 검은 여백이 보이나요? WuWa 그래픽 설정에서 Cinematic을 Cutscene에서 Fullscreen으로 변경하세요. 여백이 사라지고 컷신이 화면을 가득 채웁니다.","Black boxes cover the bottom-right UID and the ESC profile ID row in the extracted game UI, including its VR/portal and spectator copies. Check a short recording before sharing: other layouts, names, chat and diagnostics are not anonymized.":"검은 상자가 추출된 게임 UI의 오른쪽 아래 UID와 ESC 프로필 ID 행을 가립니다. VR/포털 및 관전자 복사본도 포함됩니다. 공유 전에 짧은 녹화를 확인하세요: 다른 레이아웃, 이름, 채팅, 진단 정보는 익명 처리되지 않습니다.","Black boxes over your UID in the corner and the profile ID row in menus. While recording: while the WuWa VR app records or a treadmill run is on, so the boxes never cover HUD you need in play. Always: for OBS and other recorders at any time. The boxes are approximate; check a short video before sharing. Other names and chat are not hidden.":"구석의 UID와 메뉴의 프로필 ID 줄을 검은 상자로 가립니다. 녹화 중: WuWa VR 앱이 녹화 중이거나 트레드밀 러닝이 켜져 있을 때만 표시하므로, 플레이에 필요한 HUD를 가리지 않습니다. 항상: OBS 등 다른 녹화 프로그램용으로 언제나 표시합니다. 상자 위치는 대략적이니 공유하기 전에 짧은 영상으로 확인하세요. 다른 이름과 채팅은 가려지지 않습니다.","Blocked":"차단됨","Blur (depth of field) on / off":"블러 (피사계 심도) 켜기 / 끄기","Blur copied into the first view":"흐림을 첫 시점에 복사했습니다","Blur copied into the second view":"흐림을 두 번째 시점에 복사했습니다","Blur off":"블러 끔","Blur on":"블러 켬","Blur only":"블러만","Blur strength, full VR":"블러 강도, 전체 VR","Blur strength, screens":"블러 강도, 화면","Both eyes get":"양쪽 눈","Both eyes, side by side":"양쪽 눈 나란히","Both eyes: %s":"양쪽 눈: %s","Both together":"둘 다 함께","Both together: buttons combine and each stick follows whichever is pushed further, so treadmill walking keeps working while you look around with VR. Last used wins: the other waits until you use it. VR only: the Xbox pad is ignored while VR controllers are on.":"둘 다 함께: 버튼은 합쳐지고 각 스틱은 더 많이 민 쪽을 따르므로, VR로 둘러보는 동안에도 트레드밀 걷기가 계속됩니다. 마지막 사용 우선: 다른 쪽은 사용할 때까지 기다립니다. VR만: VR 컨트롤러가 켜져 있는 동안 Xbox 패드는 무시됩니다.","Both work at once: buttons combine and each stick follows whichever is pushed further, so treadmill walking keeps working.":"둘 다 동시에 작동합니다: 버튼은 결합되고 각 스틱은 더 많이 밀린 쪽을 따르므로, 트레드밀 걷기가 계속 작동합니다.","Build left view like the first eye (K5)":"첫 번째 눈처럼 왼쪽 시점 구성 (K5)","Buttons":"버튼","C. Gamepad passthrough":"C. 게임패드 전달","CAMERA":"카메라","Camera":"카메라","Camera / HUD layouts: LuaLoader > Script UI > WuWa VR comfort controls.":"카메라 / HUD 레이아웃: LuaLoader > Script UI > WuWa VR comfort controls.","Camera and controller data":"카메라 및 컨트롤러 데이터","Camera and gameplay controls":"카메라 및 조작","Camera collision radius (game units)":"카메라 충돌 반경 (게임 단위)","Camera customization":"카메라 사용자 설정","Camera position":"카메라 위치","Camera up / down":"카메라 상하","Camera view":"카메라 시점","Cannot write playtest request.":"플레이테스트 요청을 작성할 수 없습니다.","Card distance":"카드 거리","Card height":"카드 높이","Card size":"카드 크기","Card width (meters)":"카드 너비 (m)","Change page":"페이지 변경","Character screen in the taller layout":"캐릭터 화면은 세로로 긴 레이아웃","Character toon-depth rim is suppressed; the previous value is retained.":"캐릭터 툰 심도 림이 억제되었습니다. 이전 값이 유지됩니다.","Character toon-depth rim was already zero; no write was needed.":"캐릭터 툰 깊이 림이 이미 0이라 쓸 필요가 없었습니다.","Character visibility details":"캐릭터 표시 세부 설정","Characters in the shot":"화면 속 캐릭터","Characters in the shot: the person the game focuses on (or nearest the middle of the 2D frame), and Close-up match stops behind anyone in front of them, as in over-the-shoulder shots. Game focus only: aims by the game's focus distance alone and does not look for people.":"화면 속 캐릭터: 게임이 집중하는 대상(또는 2D 프레임 중앙에 가장 가까운 대상)이며, 클로즈업 맞춤은 어깨 너머 샷처럼 앞에 있는 대상 뒤에서 멈춥니다. 게임 포커스 전용: 게임의 초점 거리만으로 맞추며 사람을 찾지 않습니다.","Checklist item":"체크리스트 항목","Choose First person under View modes if wanted; camera and aiming settings stay unchanged.":"원하면 시점 모드에서 1인칭을 선택하세요. 카메라 및 조준 설정은 변경되지 않습니다.","Choose a checklist item in this playtest.":"이 플레이테스트에서 체크리스트 항목을 선택하세요.","Cinema":"시네마","Cinematic scene":"시네마틱 장면","Cinematic scene note":"시네마틱 장면 메모","Click / go back":"클릭 / 뒤로","Click left stick + left bumper, then release all controls.":"왼쪽 스틱 클릭 + 왼쪽 범퍼를 누른 뒤 모두 놓으세요.","Click twice":"두 번 클릭","Click: blur on / off":"클릭: 블러 켜기 / 끄기","Click: full VR / stereo screen":"클릭: 전체 VR / 입체 화면","Close UEVR before using these shortcuts. L3/R3 mean clicking the sticks; View is the two-squares button and Menu is the three-lines button.":"이 단축키를 사용하기 전에 UEVR을 닫으세요. L3/R3는 스틱을 누르는 것이고, View는 네모 두 개 버튼, Menu는 줄 세 개 버튼입니다.","Close UEVR, press L3 + LB once, then release the controller. Left stick moves the cursor; A clicks, B goes back, X + stick scrolls. LT/RT moves the HUD nearer/farther; LB/RB lowers/raises it. L3 + LB again returns to normal controls. Adjustment pauses freecam flight and starts off each launch.":"UEVR을 닫고 L3 + LB를 한 번 누른 뒤 컨트롤러에서 손을 떼세요. 왼쪽 스틱은 커서를 움직이고, A는 클릭, B는 뒤로, X + 스틱은 스크롤합니다. LT/RT는 HUD를 가까이/멀리 이동시키고, LB/RB는 HUD를 내리거나 올립니다. L3 + LB를 다시 누르면 일반 조작으로 돌아갑니다. 조정 중에는 자유 카메라 비행이 일시 중지되며, 실행할 때마다 꺼진 상태로 시작합니다.","Close-up aims at":"클로즈업 대상","Close-up at %s degrees: %s %s m away, moved %s m nearer":"클로즈업 %s도: %s까지 %s m, %s m 더 가까이 이동","Close-up at %s degrees: the game sets no focus in this shot, view at the game camera":"클로즈업 %s도: 이 장면에서는 게임이 초점을 정하지 않아 게임 카메라 위치에서 봅니다","Close-up match":"클로즈업 맞춤","Closest distance":"최근접 거리","Collide with the world":"월드와 충돌","Comfort":"편안함","Comfort keeps your height steady and the horizon level. Animated follows your character's head as it moves. Full animation also follows its turns (experimental). Custom uses the options in the classic menu.":"편안함은 높이를 고정하고 수평을 유지합니다. 애니메이션은 캐릭터의 머리 움직임을 따라갑니다. 전체 애니메이션은 회전까지 따라갑니다 (실험). 사용자 지정은 클래식 메뉴의 옵션을 사용합니다.","Comfort: stable height, level horizon":"편안함: 높이 고정, 수평 유지","Compare controller fixes in this run":"이번 실행에서 컨트롤러 수정 사항 비교","Confirming cinematic signal":"시네마틱 신호 확인 중","Controller shortcuts":"컨트롤러 단축키","Controller slot":"컨트롤러 슬롯","Controllers":"컨트롤러","Controls":"조작","Controls cards":"조작 카드","Controls cards (hold L3, or LT + RT)":"조작 카드 (L3 또는 LT + RT 길게)","Copy failed":"복사 실패","Copy from":"복사 원본","Covers the ID row on the ESC profile screen too.":"ESC 프로필 화면의 ID 행도 가립니다.","Current renderer: %s":"현재 렌더러: %s","Current result: %s":"현재 결과: %s","Custom":"사용자 지정","Custom / saved behavior":"사용자 지정 / 저장된 설정","Custom motion settings":"사용자 지정 동작 설정","Custom-reflection comparison stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"사용자 지정 반사 비교가 중단되었거나 이 게임 빌드를 확인할 수 없습니다. 진단 로그를 확인하세요.","Custom: Extreme Compatibility":"사용자 지정: 최대 호환성","D-pad":"방향 패드","D-pad / A / B":"방향 패드 / A / B","D. Focus forwarding + passthrough":"D. 포커스 전달 + 패스스루","DO":"DO","Decouple game camera pitch":"게임 카메라 상하 각도 분리","Decoupled pitch":"상하 각도 분리","Default: %s. Saved for next time.":"기본값: %s. 다음에도 저장됩니다.","Default: F7. Xbox: hold L3, then squeeze LT. Release both before repeating. Portal size and curvature are preserved; enabling anchors it in front of you.":"기본: F7. Xbox: L3를 누른 채 LT를 당깁니다. 반복하기 전에 둘 다 놓으세요. 포털 크기와 곡률은 유지되며, 켜면 앞에 고정됩니다.","Default: keeps the body visible and head bones hidden, with a full shadow copy. Original non-casting/hidden equipment stays excluded. Copies are removed on exit, menus, rig changes or script reset. Unsupported rigs report a fallback below.":"기본: 몸은 표시하고 머리 본은 숨기며, 전체 그림자를 복사합니다. 원래 그림자를 드리우지 않거나 숨겨진 장비는 제외됩니다. 복사본은 종료, 메뉴, 리그 변경 또는 스크립트 재설정 시 제거됩니다. 지원되지 않는 리그는 아래에 대체 동작을 보고합니다.","Degrees above straight ahead (below is negative).":"정면보다 위쪽 각도 (아래는 음수).","Degrees below your line of sight. More puts the card lower, out of the way of the HUD.":"시선 아래로 몇 도인지입니다. 클수록 카드가 낮아져 HUD를 가리지 않습니다.","Degrees to the right of straight ahead (left is negative).":"정면보다 오른쪽 각도 (왼쪽은 음수).","Depth of field":"피사계 심도","Depth of field and camera effects":"피사계 심도 및 카메라 효과","Depth-of-field fields not found":"피사계 심도 필드를 찾을 수 없음","Desktop window":"데스크톱 창","Detection details":"감지 세부 정보","Developer playtest checklist":"개발자 플레이테스트 체크리스트","Dialogue shots use a zoom lens your headset's wide view can't show, so people look small and far. This moves you nearer, per shot, so they keep this share of their 2D size. At 0 you stay at the game camera's own spot, 100 matches the 2D shot and above 100 comes closer still. Game camera in full VR only.":"대화 장면은 헤드셋의 넓은 시야로는 보여줄 수 없는 망원 렌즈를 사용하기 때문에 사람들이 작고 멀리 보입니다. 이 설정은 장면마다 더 가까이 이동시켜 2D 크기의 이 비율만큼 유지하게 합니다. 0이면 게임 카메라 위치에 그대로 있고, 100이면 2D 장면과 일치하며, 100보다 크면 더 가까워집니다. 게임 카메라는 완전 VR에서만 작동합니다.","Diorama (10×)":"디오라마 (10×)","Diorama (miniature world)":"디오라마 (미니어처 세계)","Diorama camera":"디오라마 카메라","Diorama is on at %.0fx. This slider edits the normal scale restored when you turn it off in WuWa Controls.":"디오라마가 %.0f배로 켜져 있습니다. 이 슬라이더는 WuWa Controls에서 끌 때 복원되는 일반 배율을 조정합니다.","Diorama mode (optional)":"디오라마 모드 (선택)","Diorama needs Native Stereo. Choose it under Stereo rendering compatibility.":"디오라마는 Native Stereo가 필요합니다. 입체 렌더링 호환성에서 선택하세요.","Diorama on / off":"디오라마 켜기 / 끄기","Diorama scale":"디오라마 배율","Diorama uses a temporary miniature scale (Diorama scale on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page, 10x by default) with Native Stereo, with the portal on or off. Turning it off returns to your normal saved scale, including deliberate scale edits. It starts off each launch, settings reload and runtime reinitialization. Head movement is magnified; L3 + A recenters.":"디오라마는 포털이 켜져 있든 꺼져 있든 Native Stereo와 함께 임시 축소 배율(WuWa VR 메뉴 빠른 설정 페이지의 디오라마 배율, 기본 10배)을 사용합니다. 끄면 의도적으로 수정한 배율을 포함해 저장된 일반 배율로 돌아갑니다. 게임 실행, 설정 다시 불러오기, 런타임 재초기화 때마다 꺼진 상태로 시작합니다. 머리 움직임이 확대되며, L3 + A로 다시 중앙에 맞춥니다.","Diorama: forward / back":"디오라마: 앞 / 뒤","Diorama: right / left":"디오라마: 오른쪽 / 왼쪽","Diorama: up / down":"디오라마: 위 / 아래","Direct PlayStation shortcuts are experimental. The game still receives their buttons. Steam Input is preferred when available; release all controls after changing input sources.":"PlayStation 직접 단축키는 실험적입니다. 게임은 여전히 해당 버튼을 수신합니다. 가능하면 Steam Input을 권장합니다. 입력 소스를 변경한 후에는 모든 컨트롤을 놓으세요.","Discard unsent note":"보내지 않은 메모 버리기","Distance":"거리","Do: ":"실행: ","Done":"완료","Double L3  Windows screenshot":"L3 두 번  Windows 스크린샷","Double R3":"R3 두 번 클릭","Double R3  Freecam on / off":"R3 두 번  자유 카메라 켜기 / 끄기","Draws the missing eye of the world-label stage with its own camera and depth rectangle. Requires the matching candidate DLL and native stereo without Native Stereo Fix. Unsupported layouts keep the original rendering. NPC/bubble acceptance is pending; this does not repair reflections or character materials.":"자체 카메라와 깊이 사각형으로 월드 라벨 단계의 누락된 눈을 그립니다. 일치하는 후보 DLL과 Native Stereo Fix가 없는 네이티브 스테레오가 필요합니다. 지원되지 않는 레이아웃은 원래 렌더링을 유지합니다. NPC/말풍선 검증은 보류 중이며, 반사나 캐릭터 재질은 복구하지 않습니다.","Drone response (higher = less drift)":"드론 반응 (높을수록 덜 흔들림)","DualSense direct shortcuts (experimental)":"DualSense 직접 단축키 (실험)","DualShock 4 direct shortcuts (experimental)":"DualShock 4 직접 단축키 (실험)","ESC / overlay menus (detected)":"ESC / 오버레이 메뉴 (감지)","EXPECT":"예상","Each eye: %u x %u pixels. Now about %.0f fps.":"한쪽 눈: %u x %u 픽셀. 현재 약 %.0f fps.","Early stereo view setup (experimental)":"입체 시점 조기 설정 (실험)","Edit the UTF-8 JSON files in your game profile's wuwa-languages folder. Missing entries fall back to English. Reload applies changes without restarting the game.":"게임 프로필의 wuwa-languages 폴더에 있는 UTF-8 JSON 파일을 편집하세요. 누락된 항목은 영어로 대체됩니다. 다시 불러오기는 게임을 재시작하지 않고 변경 사항을 적용합니다.","Edit translations":"번역 편집","Enable WuWa controller shortcuts":"WuWa 컨트롤러 단축키 사용","Enable automatic switching":"자동 전환 사용","Enable controller mouse shortcuts":"컨트롤러 마우스 단축키 사용","End run":"러닝 종료","End the temporary focus/motion test below before starting a comparison.":"비교를 시작하기 전에 아래의 임시 포커스/모션 테스트를 종료하세요.","Enter first person":"1인칭 시작","Everyday controller shortcuts":"일상 컨트롤러 단축키","Everyone":"모두","Everything else: {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"그 밖의 기능: {L3}+{R3}로 WuWa VR 메뉴 열기","Exact animation":"애니메이션 그대로","Exact animation (stick does not steer view)":"애니메이션 그대로 (스틱 시점 조작 없음)","Exit mouse mode now":"마우스 모드 종료","Expect: ":"예상: ","Extract additional game menus (experimental)":"추가 게임 메뉴 추출 (실험)","Extract game HUD into the VR panel":"게임 HUD를 VR 패널로 추출","Eyes don't match":"양쪽 눈 화면 불일치","FPV camera upward tilt (degrees)":"FPV 카메라 위쪽 기울기 (도)","Faces the view forward from where you are now.":"지금 위치에서 시점을 정면으로 향하게 합니다.","Fail":"실패","Far trees and props switch detail together in both eyes. Recommended.":"멀리 있는 나무와 오브젝트가 양쪽 눈에서 함께 디테일이 전환됩니다. 권장.","Fill whole frame (stretch)":"프레임 전체 채우기 (늘이기)","Finish only when you are done. Untested checks remain Not tested; no result is inferred from notes.":"완료했을 때만 종료하세요. 테스트하지 않은 항목은 미테스트로 남으며, 메모에서 결과를 추정하지 않습니다.","Finish playtest":"플레이테스트 종료","Finished":"완료","Finishing the video. Please wait.":"동영상을 저장하는 중입니다. 잠시 기다려 주세요.","First person":"1인칭","First person character visibility":"1인칭 캐릭터 표시","First person forward offset":"1인칭 앞뒤 오프셋","First person height offset":"1인칭 높이 오프셋","First person motion":"1인칭 움직임","First person on / off":"1인칭 켜기 / 끄기","First person right offset":"1인칭 좌우 오프셋","First person: full animation":"1인칭: 전체 애니메이션","First view":"첫 시점","First-person position":"1인칭 위치","First-person script status":"1인칭 스크립트 상태","Fit to portal frame":"포털 프레임에 맞춤","Fixed":"고정","Fixed camera distance (game units)":"고정 카메라 거리 (게임 단위)","Fixed camera height above pawn (game units)":"폰 위 고정 카메라 높이 (게임 단위)","Fixed per shot":"장면마다 고정","Fixed third person":"고정 3인칭","Fixed: farther / closer":"고정: 멀리 / 가까이","Fixes":"수정","Flat screen; easiest on the eyes":"평면 화면, 눈이 가장 편안함","Flat, like a monitor":"평면, 모니터처럼","Flying style":"비행 방식","Focus game on controller reconnect":"컨트롤러 재연결 시 게임 포커스","Follow animated head / neck position (Custom)":"애니메이션 머리 / 목 위치 추적 (사용자 지정)","Follow the focus":"초점 따라가기","Follow view (player HUD)":"시점 따라가기 (HUD)","Follow view keeps the HUD with your head. Distance still sets its stereo depth; choose a comfortable size and distance in the headset.":"시점 따라가기는 HUD를 머리와 함께 움직입니다. 거리는 여전히 입체 깊이를 결정하니, 헤드셋에서 편안한 크기와 거리를 선택하세요.","For exact edge alignment set WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature to 0. This HUD panel is flat; it does not bend with a curved aperture.":"가장자리를 정확히 맞추려면 WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature를 0으로 설정하세요. 이 HUD 패널은 평면이라 곡면 조리개에 맞춰 휘지 않습니다.","For the WuWa VR menu, the controls cards and notices. The game's own language is set in the game.":"WuWa VR 메뉴, 조작 카드, 알림의 언어입니다. 게임 자체의 언어는 게임에서 설정합니다.","For the whole scene":"장면 전체","For troubleshooting and comparisons. Leave these alone for everyday play; opening this section changes nothing.":"문제 해결 및 비교용입니다. 일상 플레이에서는 건드리지 마세요. 이 섹션을 열어도 아무것도 바뀌지 않습니다.","For troubleshooting. These controls can change rendering or input; opening this section changes nothing.":"문제 해결용입니다. 이 조작은 렌더링이나 입력을 바꿀 수 있습니다. 이 섹션을 열어도 아무것도 바뀌지 않습니다.","Forward / back":"앞 / 뒤","Forward Windows focus events (test)":"Windows 포커스 이벤트 전달 (테스트)","Frame coverage (1 = full size)":"프레임 채움 (1 = 전체)","Frame rate":"프레임 속도","Frames per second in the video.":"동영상의 초당 프레임 수입니다.","Framing and theatre details":"프레이밍 및 시어터 세부 설정","Framing candidate refused; see diagnostic log":"구도 후보가 거부됨. 진단 로그를 확인하세요","Framing matched both eyes in the owner's simulator replay. Headset comfort and rare prerecorded movies still need testing.":"프레이밍은 제작자의 시뮬레이터 리플레이에서 양쪽 눈 모두 일치했습니다. 헤드셋 편안함과 드물게 쓰이는 사전 녹화 영상은 아직 테스트가 필요합니다.","Framing repair matched both eyes in a simulator quest replay. Headset comfort remains untested; mono theatre is still available as a manual fallback.":"프레이밍 수정은 시뮬레이터 퀘스트 리플레이에서 양쪽 눈 모두 일치했습니다. 헤드셋 편안함은 아직 테스트되지 않았으며, 모노 시어터를 수동 대체 수단으로 여전히 사용할 수 있습니다.","Freecam":"자유 카메라","Freecam collision (experimental)":"자유 카메라 충돌 (실험)","Freecam movement speed":"자유 카메라 이동 속도","Freecam movement style":"자유 카메라 이동 방식","Freecam on / off":"자유 카메라 켜기 / 끄기","Freecam turning speed":"자유 카메라 회전 속도","Freecam: LB descends; double RT = turbo":"자유 카메라: LB 하강, RT 두 번 = 터보","Freecam: LT rises, RT boosts speed":"자유 카메라: LT 상승, RT 속도 증가","Freecam: boost / turbo":"자유 카메라: 부스트 / 터보","Freecam: left stick moves, right looks":"자유 카메라: 왼쪽 스틱 이동, 오른쪽 스틱 시점","Freecam: move / look":"자유 카메라: 이동 / 둘러보기","Freecam: rise / descend":"자유 카메라: 상승 / 하강","Front":"앞","Full VR":"전체 VR","Full VR / stereo screen (click again to switch back)":"전체 VR / 입체 화면 (다시 클릭하면 되돌아감)","Full VR draws two large eye images every frame, far more pixels than the stereo screen, so busy scenes such as dialogue run slower there. A lower resolution is smoother and a little softer.":"전체 VR은 매 프레임 두 개의 큰 눈 이미지를 그려 입체 화면보다 픽셀이 훨씬 많으므로, 대화처럼 복잡한 장면에서는 더 느리게 실행됩니다. 해상도를 낮추면 더 부드럽고 약간 흐릿해집니다.","Full VR: the game all around you. Stereo screen: a big 3D screen, for menus and scenes that look wrong in full VR. Mono theatre: a flat screen, the same picture in both eyes. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then hold R3 (hold again to go back).":"전체 VR: 게임이 주위를 둘러쌉니다. 입체 화면: 큰 3D 화면으로, 메뉴나 전체 VR에서 이상하게 보이는 장면에 사용합니다. 모노 시어터: 평면 화면으로 양쪽 눈에 같은 그림이 보입니다. 단축키: LT + RT를 누른 채 R3을 길게 누르기 (다시 길게 누르면 되돌아감).","Full animation":"전체 애니메이션","Full animation follows character turns and can be intense. L3 + D-pad Down returns to your previous motion choice.":"전체 애니메이션은 캐릭터 회전을 따라가며 멀미가 심할 수 있습니다. L3 + 방향 패드 아래로 이전 움직임 설정으로 돌아갑니다.","Full animation is paused: headset/controller aim or Decoupled Pitch conflicts with animated head turning. Game-view rotation is being used; head position still follows the character.":"전체 애니메이션이 일시 중지되었습니다: 헤드셋/컨트롤러 조준 또는 상하 각도 분리가 애니메이션 머리 회전과 충돌합니다. 게임 시점 회전이 사용되며, 머리 위치는 여전히 캐릭터를 따라갑니다.","Full animation rotation (experimental)":"전체 애니메이션 회전 (실험)","Full animation: stick override":"전체 애니메이션: 스틱 우선","Full frame at 1 fills both axes of the portal rectangle. It stretches the HUD if its proportions differ from the frame. Preserve proportions leaves space on one axis. Safe fit also leaves a margin for rounded/feathered edges. Your separate HUD layout is retained.":"1에서 프레임 전체 채우기는 포털 사각형의 양쪽 축을 모두 채웁니다. HUD 비율이 프레임과 다르면 HUD가 늘어납니다. 비율 유지하여 프레임 맞춤은 한쪽 축에 여백을 남깁니다. 둥근 테두리 안에 맞춤은 둥글거나 부드러운 가장자리를 위한 여백도 남깁니다. 별도의 HUD 배치는 그대로 유지됩니다.","Full speed while Polar walk is on":"Polar 걷기 사용 중 전속력","Full-resolution translucent materials in stereo (candidate)":"입체에서 전체 해상도 반투명 재질 (후보)","Fully hold both triggers first. R3: click to switch between full VR and the stereo screen, hold 0.8 seconds for mono theatre (hold again to go back); with the triggers still held you can click or hold R3 again. L3: click to turn blur on or off, hold 0.8 seconds for the stereo screen; release all controls before repeating an L3 shortcut. Available during dialogue; close UEVR and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first.":"먼저 두 트리거를 끝까지 누르세요. R3: 클릭하면 전체 VR과 입체 화면 사이를 전환, 0.8초 길게 누르면 모노 시어터 (다시 길게 누르면 되돌아감). 트리거를 누른 채로 R3을 다시 클릭하거나 길게 누를 수 있습니다. L3: 클릭하면 블러 켜기/끄기, 0.8초 길게 누르면 입체 화면. L3 단축키를 반복하기 전에 모든 조작을 떼세요. 대화 중에도 사용 가능하며, 먼저 UEVR을 닫고 HUD/마우스 조정을 종료하세요.","GAME UI HIDDEN - MENUS ARE HIDDEN TOO":"게임 UI 숨김 - 메뉴도 숨겨집니다","GAME UI IS HIDDEN":"게임 UI가 숨겨져 있습니다","GAME UI IS HIDDEN - menus are hidden too":"게임 UI 숨김 - 메뉴도 숨겨집니다","GENERAL":"일반","Game / fixed camera":"게임 / 고정 카메라","Game camera":"게임 카메라","Game camera follows WuWa's own camera and its dialogue camera work. Close-up match brings you nearer in zoomed-in shots, so they frame people like the 2D view does.":"게임 카메라는 WuWa의 기본 카메라와 대화 장면 카메라를 따릅니다. 클로즈업 매칭은 줌 인된 장면에서 시점을 더 가깝게 이동시켜 2D 화면처럼 인물을 프레임에 맞춥니다.","Game camera: WuWa's own camera. Fixed third person: a steady camera behind you. Freecam: fly the camera anywhere, for cutscenes and photos. First person: through your character's eyes. Options for each are on the Camera page.":"게임 카메라: WuWa의 기본 카메라. 고정 3인칭: 캐릭터 뒤에서 고정된 카메라. 자유 카메라: 컷씬이나 사진 촬영을 위해 카메라를 자유롭게 이동. 1인칭: 캐릭터의 시점으로 플레이. 각 모드 설정은 '카메라' 페이지에서 변경할 수 있습니다.","Game focus only":"게임 포커스 전용","Game lens":"게임 렌즈","Game lens: the stereo screen frames every shot exactly like the 2D view, in 3D. Wide: the fixed 90 degree view used in older versions.":"게임 렌즈: 입체 화면이 모든 장면을 2D 화면과 정확히 동일하게 3D로 프레임합니다. 와이드: 이전 버전에서 사용되던 고정 90도 시점입니다.","Game-view override shows the game's camera direction while either stick is used, then returns to animation 0.4 seconds after release. Full animation and headset view can still disagree with movement or target selection; aim alignment remains under investigation. These options never rotate or move the character for you.":"스틱을 조작하는 동안 게임 카메라 방향을 우선적으로 표시하고, 조작을 멈춘 뒤 0.4초 후 애니메이션 시점으로 돌아갑니다. 전체 애니메이션 시점과 헤드셋 시점은 이동이나 타겟 선택과 일치하지 않을 수 있으며, 조준 정렬은 아직 조사 중입니다. 이 옵션들은 캐릭터를 자동으로 회전하거나 이동시키지 않습니다.","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes.":"레터박스 장면에서 양쪽 눈에 동일한 프레임을 제공합니다.","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes. Leave on unless a scene looks cropped.":"레터박스 장면에서 양쪽 눈에 동일한 프레임을 제공합니다. 장면이 잘려 보이지 않는 한 이 옵션을 켜 두는 것을 권장합니다.","HUD":"HUD","HUD / MOUSE MODE ON":"HUD / 마우스 모드 켜짐","HUD / mouse adjustment ON (L3 + LB toggles)":"HUD / 마우스 조정 켜짐 (L3 + LB로 전환)","HUD / mouse mode":"HUD / 마우스 모드","HUD / mouse mode is ON: gameplay buttons are redirected":"HUD / 마우스 모드 켜짐: 게임 조작 버튼이 마우스 조작으로 전환됩니다","HUD POSITION":"HUD 위치","HUD and focus comfort":"HUD 및 초점 편안함","HUD distance":"HUD 거리","HUD distance (meters)":"HUD 거리 (m)","HUD down / up":"HUD 아래 / 위","HUD follows decoupled pitch":"HUD가 분리된 상하 시점에 따라 움직임","HUD follows your head":"HUD가 머리 움직임을 따름","HUD height (meters)":"HUD 높이 (m)","HUD in the desktop window":"데스크톱 창의 HUD","HUD nearer / farther":"HUD 가까이 / 멀리","HUD or menu":"HUD 또는 메뉴","HUD placement and visibility":"HUD 위치 및 표시","HUD refresh: done. Check the HUD in the headset.":"HUD 새로 고침: 완료. 헤드셋에서 HUD를 확인하세요.","HUD refresh: not possible right now. Try again in a moment; the log has the details.":"HUD 새로 고침: 지금은 할 수 없습니다. 잠시 후 다시 시도하세요. 자세한 내용은 로그에 있습니다.","HUD refresh: the HUD already matches this view.":"HUD 새로 고침: HUD가 이미 이 화면에 맞습니다.","HUD refresh: the HUD keeps changing. Open ESC or switch views to try again.":"HUD 새로 고침: HUD가 계속 바뀝니다. ESC를 열거나 화면을 바꾼 뒤 다시 시도하세요.","HUD refresh: working on it.":"HUD 새로 고침: 처리 중입니다.","HUD right / left (meters)":"HUD 좌우 위치 (m)","HUD shape (full VR)":"HUD 모양 (전체 VR)","HUD size":"HUD 크기","HUD up / down (meters)":"HUD 상하 위치 (m)","Hand / finger demo (optional)":"손/손가락 데모 (선택 사항)","Hand demo is off. Enable it only when you want to try bare-hand tracking.":"손 트래킹 데모가 꺼져 있습니다. 핸즈 트래킹을 사용해 보고 싶을 때만 켜 주세요.","Hand tracking returned an error. Switch the demo off and on to retry.":"손 트래킹에서 오류가 발생했습니다. 데모를 껐다가 다시 켜서 재시도해 주세요.","Head movement also scales up. Use Recenter if the view feels displaced. Starts off each launch and after reloading settings.":"머리 움직임도 함께 확대됩니다. 시점이 어긋나 보이면 리센터(중심 재조정)를 사용하세요. 이 기능은 게임 실행 시마다, 그리고 설정을 다시 불러올 때마다 기본적으로 꺼집니다.","Headset aim selects Head and sends that direction to the game; the stick still turns. Right-stick pitch selects Game, disables control-rotation override and both pitch locks. Neither changes LB + Y or the selected utility.":"헤드셋 조준을 선택하면 '헤드셋' 모드가 활성화되어 조준 방향이 게임에 전달되며, 스틱으로도 회전할 수 있습니다. 오른쪽 스틱 상하 시점을 '게임'으로 선택하면 제어 회전 우선 옵션과 상하 각도 고정 옵션이 모두 비활성화됩니다. 두 옵션 모두 LB + Y 또는 선택된 유틸리티 설정에는 영향을 주지 않습니다.","Height":"높이","Hidden":"숨김","Hidden UI stays quiet during normal gameplay. A recovery notice appears only when the game cursor or a known menu-rendering path indicates a menu. L3 + B restores UI. An unknown menu may not be detected; UEVR settings always retain the Show game UI button.":"UI를 숨기면 일반적인 플레이 중에는 알림이 표시되지 않습니다. 게임 커서가 나타나거나 감지된 메뉴 경로가 인식될 때만 복구 알림이 표시됩니다. L3 + B를 눌러 UI를 다시 표시할 수 있습니다. 알 수 없는 메뉴는 감지되지 않을 수 있으며, UEVR 설정 창에서는 항상 '게임 UI 표시' 버튼을 사용할 수 있습니다.","Hide Kuro material reflections (workaround candidate)":"Kuro 머티리얼 반사 숨기기 (임시 해결책 후보)","Hide body":"몸 숨기기","Hide body in first person":"1인칭에서 몸 숨기기","Hide body, keep shadow":"몸 숨김, 그림자 유지","Hide body; keep original shadows":"몸 숨김, 원래 그림자 유지","Hide character rim lighting (optional workaround)":"캐릭터 림 라이트 숨기기 (선택적 임시 해결책)","Hide characters at your eyes":"눈앞의 캐릭터 숨기기","Hide characters at your eyes on / off":"눈앞의 캐릭터 숨기기 켜기 / 끄기","Hide head":"머리 숨기기","Hide head bones keeps the visible body, but also removes the head from its shadow. Hide body; keep full character shadow requests hidden shadows only from the game's original visible shadow casters; it does not enable unused wings or effect rigs. Shadow support depends on the character/material.":"머리 본을 숨기면 몸은 표시되지만, 머리가 캐릭터 그림자에서 제외됩니다. '몸 숨김, 원래 그림자 유지' 옵션은 게임에서 원래 표시되던 그림자 캐스터의 그림자만 숨기도록 요청하며, 사용되지 않는 날개나 이펙트 리그를 활성화하지 않습니다. 그림자 표시 여부는 캐릭터 및 머티리얼에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.","Hide head bones; full shadow copy":"머리 본 숨김, 전체 그림자 복사","Hide head bones; keep body":"머리 본 숨김, 몸 유지","Hide head, full shadow":"머리 숨김, 전체 그림자","Hide player IDs":"플레이어 ID 숨기기","Hides the captured HUD and menus together. UEVR settings stay available; individual HUD elements cannot yet be moved separately.":"캡처된 HUD와 메뉴를 함께 숨깁니다. UEVR 설정 창은 계속 사용할 수 있지만, 개별 HUD 요소를 따로 이동하거나 숨기는 기능은 아직 지원되지 않습니다.","Hiding off":"숨기기 끔","Hiding on":"숨기기 켬","Higher follows the game camera more closely.":"값이 높을수록 게임 카메라를 더 밀접하게 따릅니다.","Hint %d of %d. It then switches off; View hints on the WuWa VR menu's HUD page turns it back on.":"힌트 %d/%d. 이후 꺼집니다. WuWa VR 메뉴의 HUD 페이지에서 '시점 힌트'로 다시 켤 수 있습니다.","Hold L3, or LT + RT, for half a second: a card rises under your view and shows what each button does, lighting each one as you press it. Let go and it sinks away.":"L3을 누르거나 LT + RT를 0.5초간 길게 누르면 시야 아래에 버튼 가이드 카드가 나타나고, 버튼을 누를 때마다 해당 버튼이 강조되어 동작을 보여줍니다. 손을 떼면 카드가 사라집니다.","Hold L3, or both triggers, for half a second: a card rises under your view and lights each button as you use it. Let go and it sinks away. L3 + Menu keeps it open. Close UEVR settings to see it; it is absent from the game's flat spectator view.":"L3을 누르거나 양쪽 트리거를 0.5초간 길게 누르면 시야 아래에 버튼 가이드 카드가 나타나고, 버튼을 사용할 때마다 강조 표시됩니다. 손을 떼면 카드가 사라집니다. L3 + Menu를 누르면 카드를 계속 열어둘 수 있습니다. 이 카드는 UEVR 설정 창을 닫았을 때만 표시되며, 게임의 플랫 관전 모드에서는 표시되지 않습니다.","Hold L3, then fully squeeze LT for the portal or RT for diorama. Keep the other trigger released; release all controls before repeating. Close UEVR and game menus and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first. Physical gamepad passthrough bypasses these shortcuts.":"L3를 누른 상태에서 LT를 끝까지 당기면 포털, RT를 끝까지 당기면 디오라마가 열립니다. 반대쪽 트리거는 놓아 두세요. 반복하려면 모든 조작을 놓았다가 다시 하세요. 먼저 UEVR와 게임 메뉴를 닫고 HUD/마우스 조정에서 나오세요. 실제 게임패드 패스스루를 사용하면 이 단축키는 적용되지 않습니다.","Hold L3: controls card":"L3 길게: 조작 카드","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for full VR / stereo screen (hold: mono theatre on / off), click L3 for blur on / off (hold: stereo screen), press Y to hide characters at your eyes. With the triggers held, R3 can be clicked again.":"LT + RT 길게: R3 클릭으로 전체 VR / 입체 화면(길게: 모노 시어터 켜기 / 끄기), L3 클릭으로 블러 켜기 / 끄기(길게: 입체 화면), Y로 눈앞의 캐릭터 숨기기. 트리거를 누른 채로 R3을 다시 클릭할 수 있습니다.","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for the next view (full VR, stereo screen, mono), hold R3 for full VR; hold L3 for 0.8 s to toggle the screen. Screen off also exits mono. Mono keeps flat menu backgrounds and controls together.":"LT + RT 길게: R3 클릭으로 다음 시점(전체 VR, 입체 화면, 모노), R3 길게로 전체 VR; L3를 0.8초 길게 누르면 화면 전환. 화면 끄기는 모노도 종료합니다. 모노는 평면 메뉴 배경과 조작부를 함께 유지합니다.","Hold LT + RT: views card":"LT + RT 길게: 시점 카드","Hold RB":"RB 길게 누르기","Hold RB: full speed if Polar walk is on":"RB 길게: 폴라 워크가 켜져 있으면 최고 속도","Hold {L3} for everything else":"그 외 모든 기능은 {L3} 길게","Hold {L3}, then press":"{L3} 길게 누른 뒤 누르기","Hold {LT}+{RT} for views":"시점은 {LT}+{RT} 길게","Hold {LT}+{RT}, then":"{LT}+{RT} 길게 누른 뒤","Hold: mono theatre on / off":"길게: 모노 시어터 켜기 / 끄기","Horizon level removes the game's camera pitch from the VR view. Turn it off for right-stick up/down look, and disable UEVR's Decoupled Pitch below. Head aiming is an alternative; grapple selection still needs game testing.":"수평 유지는 VR 시점에서 게임 카메라의 상하 각도를 제거합니다. 오른쪽 스틱 상하 시점을 쓰려면 이 기능을 끄고, 아래의 UEVR Decoupled Pitch도 비활성화하세요. 헤드셋 조준이 대안이지만, 그래플 선택은 아직 게임에서 테스트가 필요합니다.","Hover drone":"호버 드론","Hover drone (inertia)":"호버 드론 (관성)","Hover drone: left stick moves horizontally, right stick looks, LT rises, LB descends, RT boosts. Release the stick to settle into a hover.":"호버 드론: 왼쪽 스틱은 수평 이동, 오른쪽 스틱은 시점, LT는 상승, LB는 하강, RT는 부스트. 스틱을 놓으면 호버 상태로 안정됩니다.","How big the world feels. Above 1 makes you smaller. Diorama uses its own scale and leaves this alone.":"세계가 얼마나 크게 느껴지는지. 1보다 크면 더 작아집니다. 디오라마는 자체 배율을 사용하며 이 값은 건드리지 않습니다.","How far above or below your character's eyes your view sits. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"캐릭터 눈 기준으로 시점이 위아래로 놓이는 높이. 게임 중: L3를 누른 채 Y / X. L3 + Y + X를 동시에 누르면 기본값으로 돌아갑니다.","How far away the HUD sits. Its stereo depth follows this distance.":"HUD가 얼마나 멀리 위치하는지. 입체 깊이는 이 거리를 따릅니다.","How far away the card is.":"카드까지의 거리입니다.","How far away this menu floats. UEVR's classic window uses the same distance.":"이 메뉴가 얼마나 멀리 떠 있는지. UEVR 클래식 창도 같은 거리를 사용합니다.","How far behind your character the camera stays, in game units (centimetres).":"카메라가 캐릭터 뒤에 얼마나 떨어져 있는지, 게임 단위(cm)입니다.","How fast the freecam moves.":"자유 카메라가 얼마나 빠르게 이동하는지.","How fast the freecam turns.":"자유 카메라가 얼마나 빠르게 회전하는지.","How high above your character the camera sits, in game units. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"캐릭터 위로 카메라가 놓이는 높이(게임 단위). 게임 중: L3를 누른 채 Y / X. L3 + Y + X를 동시에 누르면 기본값으로 돌아갑니다.","How large the game's HUD and menus appear.":"게임 HUD와 메뉴가 얼마나 크게 표시되는지.","How large the game's HUD and menus appear. More HUD options are on the HUD page.":"게임 HUD와 메뉴가 얼마나 크게 표시되는지. 더 많은 HUD 옵션은 HUD 페이지에 있습니다.","How much of its layer this menu fills. Smaller also reads as further away.":"이 메뉴가 해당 레이어를 얼마나 채우는지. 작을수록 더 멀리 있는 것처럼 보입니다.","How near Close-up match may bring you to the person in the shot. Lower comes closer. Close-up match at 100 already gives the 2D size; this only stops it short when the shot is very tight.":"클로즈업 매치가 화면 속 인물에게 얼마나 가까이 다가갈 수 있는지. 낮을수록 더 가까워집니다. 클로즈업 매치 100은 이미 2D 크기를 제공하며, 이 값은 샷이 매우 타이트할 때 거기서 멈추게 할 뿐입니다.","How small the world gets in diorama. 10x is an action-figure view. The diorama has its own camera distance (Camera page).":"디오라마에서 세계가 얼마나 작아지는지입니다. 10배는 액션 피규어 시점입니다. 디오라마에는 자체 카메라 거리가 있습니다(카메라 페이지).","How strong the 3D is on the stereo screen. 1x matches the headset's eye distance to the lens; 0 is flat.":"입체 화면에서 3D가 얼마나 강한지. 1x는 헤드셋의 눈 간격을 렌즈에 맞추고, 0은 평면입니다.","How to use view toggles":"시점 전환 사용법","How wide the controls card is.":"조작 카드의 너비입니다.","I understand that untested checks remain Not tested":"테스트하지 않은 항목은 '테스트 안 함'으로 남는다는 것을 이해합니다","INSERT  =  OPEN UEVR":"INSERT = UEVR 열기","INSERT > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"INSERT > WuWa Controls > 게임 UI 표시","Idle":"대기","Ignore motion input while OpenXR is unfocused (test)":"OpenXR가 포커스를 잃은 동안 모션 입력 무시 (테스트)","Ignores the game camera's up / down tilt, so only your head looks up and down. Steadier, and worth trying in gravity-flip areas such as Avinoleum.":"게임 카메라의 상하 기울기를 무시하여 머리만 위아래를 봅니다. 더 안정적이며, 아비놀레움 같은 중력 반전 구역에서 시도해 볼 만합니다.","Immersive VR":"몰입형 VR","In full VR the game lays out its HUD for a 4:3 screen, which then looks squashed; 1.33 undoes that. Raise it if round icons still look like flat ovals. The stereo screen and mono theatre always keep the game's own shape.":"전체 VR에서 게임은 4:3 화면 기준으로 HUD를 배치하므로 납작하게 보입니다. 1.33이 이를 되돌립니다. 둥근 아이콘이 여전히 납작한 타원으로 보이면 값을 높이세요. 입체 화면과 모노 시어터는 항상 게임 본래의 비율을 유지합니다.","In story and dialogue shots, hold L3 and press Y to move nearer or X to move back; L3 + Y + X goes back to the game's spot. Keyboard: Page Up, Page Down and Home. It moves along the game camera's view and keeps following the shot's own camera moves. Game camera in full VR only.":"스토리 및 대화 장면에서 L3를 누른 채 Y를 누르면 가까이, X를 누르면 뒤로 이동합니다. L3 + Y + X는 게임의 원래 위치로 돌아갑니다. 키보드: Page Up, Page Down, Home. 게임 카메라의 시선을 따라 움직이며 해당 장면의 카메라 움직임을 계속 따라갑니다. 전체 VR의 게임 카메라 전용.","In story close-ups nothing nearer than this is drawn. It slices characters and props open, so it is off by default (10 cm, the game's own value); Hide characters at your eyes is the cleaner fix. Game camera in full VR only.":"스토리 클로즈업에서 이보다 가까운 것은 그리지 않습니다. 캐릭터와 소품이 잘려 보이므로 기본값은 꺼짐(10 cm, 게임 자체 값)입니다. '눈앞의 캐릭터 숨기기'가 더 깔끔한 해결책입니다. 전체 VR의 게임 카메라에서만.","In story close-ups, a character right at your eyes but outside the flat shot (VR shows more around it) is hidden whole while it is there. Anyone the flat shot shows stays. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then press Y.":"스토리 클로즈업에서 눈앞에 있지만 평면 화면 밖에 있는 캐릭터(VR에서는 화면 주변이 더 보입니다)를 그 자리에 있는 동안 통째로 숨깁니다. 평면 화면에 보이는 사람은 남습니다. 단축키: LT + RT를 누른 채 Y.","Include camera and controller data":"카메라 및 컨트롤러 데이터 포함","Input candidates start off. Their effect on WuWa's intermittent combinations is not confirmed.":"입력 후보는 기본적으로 꺼져 있습니다. WuWa의 간헐적 조합에 대한 효과는 확인되지 않았습니다.","Input still pauses when WuWa loses focus. Real game menus temporarily restore the game camera and character visibility.":"WuWa가 포커스를 잃으면 입력은 여전히 일시 정지됩니다. 실제 게임 메뉴는 게임 카메라와 캐릭터 표시를 일시적으로 복원합니다.","Invalid profile value: ":"잘못된 프로필 값: ","Invert acro pitch stick":"아크로 피치 스틱 반전","Joint inspector (left-eye preview)":"관절 검사기 (왼쪽 눈 미리보기)","Just mark the moment":"이 순간만 표시","Keep WuWa VR Launcher running to record from here. Its browser tab can be closed.":"여기서 녹화하려면 WuWa VR Launcher를 계속 실행해 두세요. 브라우저 탭은 닫아도 됩니다.","Keep both triggers held to click or hold R3 again.":"두 트리거를 누른 채로 R3을 다시 클릭하거나 길게 누를 수 있습니다.","Keep camera and head hiding during Alt-Tab / UEVR settings":"Alt-Tab / UEVR 설정 중에도 카메라와 머리 숨김 유지","Keep current view":"현재 보기 유지","Keep entire character visible":"캐릭터 전체 표시","Keep first person horizon level (Custom)":"1인칭 수평선 유지 (사용자 지정)","Keep matched far-object detail (recommended)":"원거리 물체 상세도 일치 유지 (권장)","Keep stereo camera transitions together":"입체 카메라 전환 동기화 유지","Keep the controls card open":"조작 카드 열어두기","Keep the mouse in the game window":"마우스를 게임 창 안에 두기","Keep the nudge":"조정 유지","Keep this card open":"이 카드 열어두기","Keeps distant trees and props on the same level of detail in both eyes. This is the normal foliage repair; legacy comparison tests are separate.":"원거리 나무와 소품의 상세도를 양쪽 눈에서 동일하게 유지합니다. 이는 일반적인 식생 복구 기능이며, 이전 비교 테스트와는 별개입니다.","Keeps the HUD where you expect it while decoupled pitch is on.":"상하 각도 분리 시 HUD를 예상 위치에 유지합니다.","Keeps the horizon level in first person. Custom motion only.":"1인칭에서 수평선을 유지합니다. 사용자 지정 모션에서만 적용됩니다.","Kuro character materials in both eyes (candidate)":"양쪽 눈에 Kuro 캐릭터 머티리얼 적용 (시험)","L grip":"왼쪽 그립","L stick":"왼쪽 스틱","L trigger":"왼쪽 트리거","L3 + A":"L3 + A","L3 + A     Recenter view / portal":"L3 + A     시점 / 포털 중앙 정렬","L3 + A also resets headset position (seated)":"L3 + A는 헤드셋 위치도 초기화합니다 (앉은 자세)","L3 + A resets position too":"L3 + A는 위치도 초기화합니다","L3 + B":"L3 + B","L3 + B     Show / hide game UI":"L3 + B     게임 UI 표시 / 숨김","L3 + B  =  SHOW UI":"L3 + B = UI 표시","L3 + D-pad Down":"L3 + 방향 패드 아래","L3 + D-pad Down toggles full animation follow and your previous first-person motion. Custom keeps your saved settings. The other choices sample the head after animation. Animated position preserves normal stick aiming. Full animation follows character turns and bone rotation; it can be intense.":"L3 + 방향 패드 아래: 전체 애니메이션 추적과 이전 1인칭 움직임을 전환합니다. 사용자 지정은 저장된 설정을 유지합니다. 다른 옵션은 애니메이션 후 머리 위치를 기준으로 합니다. 애니메이션 위치는 일반 스틱 조준을 유지합니다. 전체 애니메이션은 캐릭터 회전과 본 회전을 따르며, 강하게 느껴질 수 있습니다.","L3 + D-pad Down: animation follow on / off (first person)":"L3 + 방향 패드 아래: 애니메이션 추적 켜기 / 끄기 (1인칭)","L3 + LB    Return to normal game controls":"L3 + LB    일반 게임 조작으로 복귀","L3 + LB    Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"L3 + LB    HUD / 마우스 조정 전환","L3 + LB  =  RETURN TO GAME CONTROLS":"L3 + LB = 게임 조작 복귀","L3 + LB exits manual adjustment. Release all controls afterwards.":"L3 + LB로 수동 조정을 종료합니다. 종료 후 모든 조작을 놓아주세요.","L3 + LB, release":"L3 + LB, 놓기","L3 + LT / F7":"L3 + LT / F7","L3 + LT / F7   Portal on / off":"L3 + LT / F7   포털 켜기 / 끄기","L3 + Menu":"L3 + Menu","L3 + Menu  Keep the controls card open":"L3 + Menu  조작 카드 열어두기","L3 + R3":"L3 + R3","L3 + R3    WuWa VR menu":"L3 + R3    WuWa VR 메뉴","L3 + RB":"L3 + RB","L3 + RB    Game / fixed camera":"L3 + RB    게임 / 고정 카메라","L3 + RT":"L3 + RT","L3 + RT    Diorama on / off":"L3 + RT    디오라마 켜기 / 끄기","L3 + View":"L3 + View","L3 + View  First person on / off":"L3 + View  1인칭 켜기 / 끄기","L3 + View toggles first person. These settings apply when first person is active.":"L3 + View로 1인칭을 전환합니다. 이 설정은 1인칭이 활성화된 상태에서 적용됩니다.","L3 + Y / X":"L3 + Y / X","L3 + Y/X   Height; in story: nearer / back":"L3 + Y/X   높이; 스토리: 가까이 / 뒤로","L3 means click and hold the left stick, then press B.":"왼쪽 스틱(L3)을 누른 채 B를 누르세요.","LB + LT/RT Fixed camera farther / closer":"LB + LT/RT 고정 카메라 원거리 / 근거리","LB + R3 utility shortcut remains available outside adjustment":"LB + R3 유틸리티 단축키는 조정 모드 밖에서도 사용할 수 있습니다","LB + R3: V once; hold 0.8 s for Tab wheel":"LB + R3: 한 번 누르면 V, 0.8초 길게 누르면 Tab 휠","LB/RB      HUD down / up":"LB/RB      HUD 내리기 / 올리기","LT + RT, L3: blur (hold: stereo screen)":"LT + RT, L3: 블러 (길게: 입체 화면)","LT + RT, R3: full VR / stereo (hold: mono)":"LT + RT, R3: 전체 VR / 입체 (길게: 모노)","LT + RT, then Y":"LT + RT, 그다음 Y","LT + RT, then click L3":"LT + RT, 그다음 L3 클릭","LT + RT, then click R3":"LT + RT, 그다음 R3 클릭","LT + RT, then hold L3":"LT + RT, 그다음 L3 길게 누르기","LT + RT, then hold R3":"LT + RT, 그다음 R3 길게 누르기","LT/RT      HUD nearer / farther":"LT/RT      HUD 가까이 / 멀리","Language":"언어","Language / WuWa":"언어 / WuWa","Larger menu following view":"큰 시점 추적 메뉴","Laser asleep: move the left controller or press a VR button.":"레이저 대기: 왼쪽 컨트롤러를 움직이거나 VR 버튼을 누르세요.","Laser asleep: move the right controller or press a VR button.":"레이저 대기: 오른쪽 컨트롤러를 움직이거나 VR 버튼을 누르세요.","Laser on: point the left controller and pull its trigger.":"레이저 켜짐: 왼쪽 컨트롤러로 가리키고 트리거를 당기세요.","Laser on: point the right controller and pull its trigger.":"레이저 켜짐: 오른쪽 컨트롤러로 가리키고 트리거를 당기세요.","Laser: no VR controllers found.":"레이저: VR 컨트롤러를 찾을 수 없습니다.","Last run: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"지난 러닝: %s, 걷기 %s, 게임 속 %.2f km.","Last used wins":"마지막으로 사용한 설정 우선","Launch settings include any custom settings saved before starting this game. Supplied profile controls are the build's original choices, not UEVR factory defaults.":"실행 설정에는 이 게임을 시작하기 전에 저장한 사용자 지정 설정이 포함됩니다. 제공된 프로필 조작은 이 빌드의 원래 선택이며, UEVR 기본값이 아닙니다.","Launch settings restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"실행 설정을 복원했습니다. 계속하기 전에 모든 컨트롤에서 손을 떼세요.","Leave first person":"1인칭 종료","Leave freecam":"자유 카메라 종료","Left":"왼쪽","Left / right":"왼쪽 / 오른쪽","Left / right moves between steps without answering. Your answers stay saved.":"왼쪽 / 오른쪽으로 답변하지 않고 단계 사이를 이동합니다. 답변은 그대로 저장됩니다.","Left / right picks the kind of problem.":"왼쪽 / 오른쪽으로 문제 종류를 선택합니다.","Left / right stick":"왼쪽 / 오른쪽 스틱","Left stick":"왼쪽 스틱","Left stick Cursor    A Click    B Back":"왼쪽 스틱 커서    A 클릭    B 뒤로","Left stick Y (Mode 2)":"왼쪽 스틱 Y (모드 2)","Legacy automatic mouse can intercept game menu buttons. Manual L3 + LB adjustment remains the normal choice.":"레거시 자동 마우스는 게임 메뉴 버튼을 가로챌 수 있습니다. 수동 L3 + LB 조정이 일반적인 선택입니다.","Legacy pitch-only override is active; choose either option above to replace it.":"레거시 피치 전용 오버라이드가 활성화되어 있습니다. 위의 두 옵션 중 하나를 선택해 대체하세요.","Legacy stereo comparison bench (60-second tests)":"레거시 입체 비교 벤치 (60초 테스트)","Level horizon":"수평 유지","Link latest recording":"최근 녹화 연결","Linking saves the recording ID only. Review the video and add precise timestamps in the launcher.":"연결은 녹화 ID만 저장합니다. 영상을 확인하고 런처에서 정확한 타임스탬프를 추가하세요.","Live input tests. Change one option, close this menu, then repeat the same action.":"실시간 입력 테스트. 옵션 하나를 변경하고 이 메뉴를 닫은 다음 같은 동작을 반복하세요.","Local controller and camera data only, about 30 samples/sec. The clean-video recorder starts this automatically. It never presses buttons. Video/sidecar alignment uses timestamps, not a claim of GPU-frame synchronization.":"로컬 컨트롤러 및 카메라 데이터만, 초당 약 30 샘플. 클린 동영상 녹화기가 이를 자동으로 시작합니다. 버튼을 누르지는 않습니다. 영상/동작 데이터 정렬은 타임스탬프를 사용하며, GPU 프레임 동기화를 보장하지는 않습니다.","Looks wrong? Hold LT + RT, then click R3 for the stereo screen (hold R3: mono).":"이상해 보이나요? LT + RT를 길게 누른 뒤 R3를 클릭해 입체 화면으로 (R3 길게: 모노).","Low":"아래","Lower eye level by 5":"눈높이 5 낮추기","Manual override; waiting for this scene to end":"수동 재정의 중. 이 장면이 끝나기를 기다립니다","Mark this moment":"이 순간 표시","Match cinematic framing":"시네마틱 프레이밍 맞춤","Match cinematic framing between eyes (default on)":"양안 간 시네마틱 프레이밍 맞춤 (기본 켜짐)","Match far detail between eyes":"양안 간 원거리 디테일 맞춤","Maximum pixels per eye":"눈 하나당 최대 너비(픽셀)","Maximum thrust / weight":"최대 추력 / 중량","Menu":"메뉴","Menu distance":"메뉴 거리","Menu left / right":"메뉴 좌우","Menu place":"메뉴 배치","Menu size":"메뉴 크기","Menu up / down":"메뉴 상하","Miniature world (this launch only)":"미니어처 월드 (이번 실행만)","Mode 2: centered left stick means 50%% throttle. An Xbox stick springs back to center; hold it down for zero throttle.":"모드 2: 왼쪽 스틱 중앙이 스로틀 50%%입니다. Xbox 스틱은 중앙으로 되돌아가므로, 아래로 누르고 있으면 스로틀 0이 됩니다.","Mono preserves your saved stereo-screen choice; screen off exits both screen modes. Neither changes portal or normal world scale. Manual toggles take priority over automatic cinema for the current scene.":"모노는 저장된 입체 화면 설정을 유지하며, 화면 끄기는 두 화면 모드를 모두 종료합니다. 둘 다 포털이나 일반 월드 크기를 변경하지 않습니다. 현재 장면에서는 수동 전환이 자동 시네마보다 우선합니다.","Mono shows the same scene and HUD to both eyes. Use it for troublesome cutscenes or flat menus.":"모노는 양쪽 눈에 같은 장면과 HUD를 보여줍니다. 문제가 있는 컷신이나 평면 메뉴에 사용하세요.","Mono theatre":"모노 극장","Mono theatre (flat 2D)":"모노 극장 (평면 2D)","Mono theatre (no stereo)":"모노 극장 (입체 없음)","Mono theatre on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"모노 시어터 켜기 / 끄기 (0.8초 길게)","Motion":"움직임","Move cursor":"커서 이동","Move map":"지도 이동","Move menu":"메뉴 이동","Moves supported menus into the VR panel, including with Native Stereo Fix on. The supplied profile enables this. Some flat backgrounds still move separately; mono theatre is the manual fallback.":"지원되는 메뉴를 VR 패널로 이동합니다. Native Stereo Fix가 켜져 있어도 마찬가지입니다. 제공된 프로필에서 이 기능을 켭니다. 일부 평면 배경은 여전히 따로 움직이며, 모노 극장이 수동 대안입니다.","Moves the HUD sideways.":"HUD를 좌우로 이동합니다.","Moves the HUD up or down.":"HUD를 상하로 이동합니다.","Moves your diorama viewpoint sideways.":"디오라마 시점을 옆으로 이동합니다.","Moves your diorama viewpoint up, to look down on the miniature, or down.":"디오라마 시점을 위로 올려 미니어처를 내려다보거나 아래로 내립니다.","Moves your viewpoint forward from the game camera. Forward brings dialogue close-ups nearer, closer to how the 2D shot frames them. Applies in normal play too.":"게임 카메라에서 시점을 앞으로 이동합니다. 값을 높이면 대화 클로즈업이 더 가까워져 2D 화면의 구도에 가까워집니다. 일반 플레이에도 적용됩니다.","Moves your viewpoint sideways from the game camera.":"게임 카메라에서 시점을 좌우로 이동합니다.","Moves your viewpoint up or down from the game camera.":"게임 카메라에서 시점을 상하로 이동합니다.","Moving the menu: point where you want it, thumbstick up / down for distance, then pull the trigger.":"메뉴 이동 중: 놓을 곳을 가리키고, 스틱 위/아래로 거리를 조절한 뒤 트리거를 당기세요.","Moving the menu: stick, D-pad or arrow keys. Right stick or Page Up / Down: distance. A or Enter: put it down.":"메뉴 이동 중: 스틱, 방향 패드 또는 방향키. 오른쪽 스틱 또는 Page Up / Down: 거리. A 또는 Enter: 내려놓기.","Multiplies the blur in full VR. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"풀 VR에서 블러를 배수로 조정합니다. 1x는 2D 화면의 느낌입니다.","Multiplies the blur on the stereo screen and mono theatre. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"입체 화면과 모노 극장의 블러를 배수로 조정합니다. 1x는 2D 화면의 느낌입니다.","NOT SAVING":"저장 안 함","Native Stereo":"Native Stereo","Native Stereo Fix frame timing (experimental)":"Native Stereo Fix 프레임 타이밍 (실험)","Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix":"Native Stereo Fix 사용한 Native Stereo","Native game camera active (headset check pending)":"게임 기본 카메라 활성 (헤드셋 확인 대기)","Native game camera unavailable; compatibility fallback":"게임 기본 카메라를 사용할 수 없어 호환 방식으로 표시합니다","Navigate / activate / back":"이동 / 실행 / 뒤로","Near clip in close-ups":"클로즈업 근거리 클립","New:":"새 기능:","No active playtest connection. Keep the launcher running and open Developer playtests to start or resume a session.":"활성화된 플레이테스트 연결이 없습니다. 런처를 실행한 채로 Developer playtests를 열어 세션을 시작하거나 재개하세요.","No run yet. Start one here, or open Reality Runner and walk.":"아직 러닝이 없습니다. 여기서 시작하거나 Reality Runner를 열고 걸으세요.","No supported direct PlayStation controller detected":"지원되는 PlayStation 직결 컨트롤러가 감지되지 않았습니다","Normal scale: %.3fx. Your saved scale and camera presets stay unchanged; intentional scale edits become the new normal value.":"일반 크기: %.3fx. 저장된 크기와 카메라 프리셋은 그대로 유지되며, 의도적으로 수정한 크기가 새로운 일반 값이 됩니다.","Not saved: %s":"저장되지 않음: %s","Not tested":"테스트 안 함","Note when someone is at your eyes":"눈앞에 누가 있을 때 알림","Now: %s":"현재: %s","Observation":"관찰","Off":"끔","Off: UEVR opens its classic window, as before. You can turn this menu back on under VR > WuWa Controls.":"끔: UEVR이 이전처럼 기본 창을 엽니다. VR > WuWa Controls에서 이 메뉴를 다시 켤 수 있습니다.","On":"켬","On by default. Detected story videos use mono; story pictures and story scenes use your choices above. Manual view changes take priority.":"기본으로 켜져 있습니다. 감지된 스토리 영상은 모노 극장을, 스토리 그림과 스토리 장면은 위의 선택을 사용합니다. 수동 보기 변경이 우선합니다.","On by default: both eyes render with a symmetric view, so its shading matches on rocks, hills and roofs. Off is a little faster.":"기본값은 켬: 양쪽 눈을 대칭 시야로 렌더링하므로 바위, 언덕, 지붕의 음영이 일치합니다. 끄면 조금 더 빠릅니다.","On uses our LGUI capture. Off shows the game's original HUD in the eye images. This does not hide the UEVR settings panel.":"켬은 LGUI 캡처를 사용합니다. 끔은 게임의 원래 HUD를 눈 이미지에 표시합니다. UEVR 설정 패널은 숨기지 않습니다.","On: full VR lays out the HUD and menus like the flat game (16:9): round icons, story pictures whole, and the mouse hits what it points at. Off: 1.2.2's taller layout, where the Terminal fits on one page and the character screen's floor reflection keeps updating, but icons look flatter (HUD shape) and the mouse can miss.":"켬: 전체 VR에서 HUD와 메뉴를 일반 게임처럼 16:9로 배치합니다. 둥근 아이콘은 둥글게, 스토리 그림은 잘리지 않으며, 마우스는 가리키는 곳을 정확히 누릅니다. 끔: 1.2.2의 세로로 긴 레이아웃으로, 터미널이 한 페이지에 들어가고 캐릭터 화면의 바닥 반사가 계속 갱신되지만, 아이콘이 납작해 보이고(HUD 모양) 마우스가 빗나갈 수 있습니다.","On: the HUD stays in front of your eyes. Off: it stays put in the world and you look at it.":"켬: HUD가 눈앞에 고정됩니다. 끔: 월드에 고정되어 있어 고개를 돌려 봐야 합니다.","On: while the game is in front, the mouse stops at the window's edges, as in the flat game, so it cannot slip onto another monitor. Alt-Tab frees it. Off: the mouse moves freely between monitors.":"켬: 게임 창이 앞에 있는 동안 일반 게임처럼 마우스가 창 가장자리에서 멈춰 다른 모니터로 넘어가지 않습니다. Alt-Tab으로 풀 수 있습니다. 끔: 마우스가 여러 모니터 사이를 자유롭게 움직입니다.","On: your settings are saved whenever this menu opens or closes. Off: try things freely; nothing is saved, and the game starts with your saved settings next time. Turning it back on saves what you have now. For each setting, the help at the bottom says whether it is saved and what its default is.":"켬: 이 메뉴를 열거나 닫을 때마다 설정이 저장됩니다. 끔: 마음껏 시도해 보세요. 아무것도 저장되지 않으며, 다음에는 저장된 설정으로 게임이 시작됩니다. 다시 켜면 현재 설정이 저장됩니다. 각 설정마다 아래쪽 도움말에 저장 여부와 기본값이 표시됩니다.","Only in first person and the fixed camera":"1인칭과 고정 카메라에서만 작동","Only slot 0":"슬롯 0만","Only slot 1":"슬롯 1만","Only slot 2":"슬롯 2만","Only slot 3":"슬롯 3만","Only the VR controllers work while on; the Xbox pad on this slot is ignored until you turn them off.":"켜져 있는 동안에는 VR 컨트롤러만 작동하며, 이 슬롯의 Xbox 패드는 끌 때까지 무시됩니다.","Open / close the WuWa VR menu":"WuWa VR 메뉴 열기 / 닫기","Open the WuWa VR menu instead of this window":"이 창 대신 WuWa VR 메뉴 열기","Opens UEVR's full settings window. Every setting here edits the same values.":"UEVR의 전체 설정 창을 엽니다. 여기의 모든 설정은 같은 값을 편집합니다.","Optical joint data received. Headset alignment and comfort still need a physical check.":"광학 관절 데이터를 받았습니다. 헤드셋 정렬과 착용감은 여전히 직접 확인해야 합니다.","Optional experiments and diagnostics":"선택적 실험 및 진단","Optional workaround, off by default. Removes toon-depth rim lighting from all characters using it, including nearby characters. This hides the observed extra eye contour; it does not repair the underlying stereo cause. Restores the prior value when disabled, in 2D screen mode, or when native VR is inactive.":"선택적 임시 해결책, 기본적으로 꺼져 있습니다. 이를 사용하는 모든 캐릭터(주변 캐릭터 포함)에서 툰 깊이 림 라이트를 제거합니다. 관찰된 여분의 눈 윤곽을 가릴 뿐, 근본적인 입체 원인을 해결하지는 않습니다. 비활성화할 때, 2D 화면 모드일 때, 또는 네이티브 VR이 비활성 상태일 때 이전 값을 복원합니다.","Or hold the left Menu button for 1 second to turn them on or off; a buzz confirms. A quick press is still Start. Controllers without a Menu button (such as Index): while off, hold both stick clicks for 1 second to turn them on.":"또는 왼쪽 Menu 버튼을 1초간 길게 눌러 켜거나 끌 수 있습니다. 진동으로 확인됩니다. 짧게 누르면 여전히 Start입니다. Menu 버튼이 없는 컨트롤러(예: Index): 꺼진 상태에서 양쪽 스틱 클릭을 1초간 길게 누르면 켜집니다.","Or: UEVR > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"또는: UEVR > WuWa Controls > 게임 UI 표시","Pass":"통과","Paused in the diorama":"디오라마에서 일시 정지","Paused: game camera in full VR only":"일시 정지: 전체 VR의 게임 카메라에서만","Physical gamepad passthrough (test)":"실제 게임패드 패스스루 (테스트)","Pick what went wrong and save. The time, the video position and your settings go into the wuwa-reports folder of the UEVR profile. Share it together with the video.":"무엇이 잘못됐는지 선택하고 저장하세요. 시간, 영상 위치, 설정이 UEVR 프로필의 wuwa-reports 폴더에 저장됩니다. 영상과 함께 공유하세요.","Picture size":"화면 크기","Pinned":"고정됨","Pitch / roll rate (degrees / second)":"피치 / 롤 속도 (도 / 초)","Pixels per eye compared with what your headset asks for. Lower is smoother in full VR. It changes after a moment.":"헤드셋이 요구하는 값과 비교한 눈 하나당 픽셀. 낮을수록 전체 VR에서 더 부드럽습니다. 잠시 후 변경됩니다.","Plan finished. Thank you!":"계획이 끝났습니다. 감사합니다!","Plan finished. Your answers are saved for Claude in wuwa-steps / results.jsonl.":"계획이 끝났습니다. 답변이 Claude를 위해 wuwa-steps / results.jsonl에 저장되었습니다.","Plane":"비행기","Plane FPV":"비행기 FPV","Plane cruise speed (game units / second)":"비행기 순항 속도 (게임 단위 / 초)","Plane: right stick pitches/banks, left stick X steers yaw. RT increases cruise speed, LT decreases it. Hold LB to brake, RB to boost. Double R3 exits. Cruise pauses when focus or controller samples are lost; release controls then move a stick to rearm after Alt-Tab.":"비행기: 오른쪽 스틱은 피치/뱅크, 왼쪽 스틱 X는 요 조향. RT는 순항 속도 증가, LT는 감소. LB 길게 눌러 제동, RB로 부스트. R3 두 번 클릭으로 종료. 포커스나 컨트롤러 샘플을 잃으면 순항이 일시 중지됩니다. Alt-Tab 후에는 조작을 놓은 다음 스틱을 움직여 다시 활성화하세요.","PlayStation connected; waiting for input reports and release":"PlayStation 연결됨, 입력 보고와 해제를 기다리는 중","PlayStation disconnected; waiting to reconnect":"PlayStation 연결 끊김, 다시 연결을 기다리는 중","PlayStation input is unavailable or held exclusively; use Steam Input if available":"PlayStation 입력을 사용할 수 없거나 독점적으로 점유됨, 가능하면 Steam Input을 사용하세요","PlayStation input received":"PlayStation 입력 받음","PlayStation reader has not started":"PlayStation 리더가 시작되지 않았습니다","PlayStation reader stopped; use Steam Input if available":"PlayStation 리더가 중지됨, 가능하면 Steam Input을 사용하세요","PlayStation reader unavailable":"PlayStation 리더를 사용할 수 없음","PlayStation reader unavailable: cannot retain backend module":"PlayStation 리더를 사용할 수 없음: 백엔드 모듈을 유지할 수 없습니다","PlayStation reports stopped; release controls after reconnecting":"PlayStation 보고가 중지됨, 다시 연결한 후 조작을 놓으세요","PlayStation shortcuts paused: WuWa shortcuts disabled":"PlayStation 단축키 일시 중지됨: WuWa 단축키 비활성화됨","PlayStation shortcuts paused: an XInput slot is selected":"PlayStation 단축키 일시 중지됨: XInput 슬롯이 선택됨","PlayStation shortcuts paused: controller passthrough enabled":"PlayStation 단축키 일시 중지됨: 컨트롤러 패스스루 활성화됨","PlayStation: L1/R1 = LB/RB, L2/R2 = LT/RT, Cross/Circle/Square/Triangle = A/B/X/Y, Share/Create = View, Options = Menu.":"PlayStation: L1/R1 = LB/RB, L2/R2 = LT/RT, 크로스/서클/스퀘어/트라이앵글 = A/B/X/Y, Share/Create = View, Options = Menu.","Playtest launcher connection changed. Check whether the previous action was saved.":"플레이테스트 런처 연결이 변경되었습니다. 이전 작업이 저장되었는지 확인하세요.","Playtest launcher is not connected.":"플레이테스트 런처가 연결되지 않았습니다.","Playtest launcher status is stale or belongs to another game.":"플레이테스트 런처 상태가 오래되었거나 다른 게임에 속해 있습니다.","Playtest request was not acknowledged. Check the launcher before repeating it.":"플레이테스트 요청이 확인되지 않았습니다. 반복하기 전에 런처를 확인하세요.","Point and pull the trigger, or click. Scroll to see more.":"가리키고 트리거를 당기거나 클릭하세요. 스크롤하여 더 보세요.","Point with a controller and pull the trigger to put it down. Or use a stick, the D-pad, the arrow keys or WASD, and the right stick or Page Up / Down for distance; A, Enter or B puts it down. Gamepad shortcut: Y. Keyboard: M. Mouse: drag with the right button at any time.":"컨트롤러로 가리키고 트리거를 당겨 배치하세요. 또는 스틱, 방향 패드, 방향키 또는 WASD로 이동하고 오른쪽 스틱이나 Page Up / Down으로 거리를 조절하세요. A, Enter 또는 B로 배치합니다. 게임패드 단축키: Y. 키보드: M. 마우스: 언제든 오른쪽 버튼으로 드래그하세요.","Polar fly":"폴라 플라이","Polar fly: left stick moves along view, right stick looks. LT rises, LB descends; RT boosts, double RT gives turbo.":"폴라 플라이: 왼쪽 스틱은 시점 방향으로 이동, 오른쪽 스틱은 시점 회전. LT 상승, LB 하강; RT 부스트, RT 두 번 클릭 시 터보.","Polar fly: simple flying. Hover drone: floats and drifts to a stop. Plane: always moves forward. Acro drone: full manual control.":"폴라 플라이: 간단한 비행. 호버 드론: 떠서 관성으로 멈춤. 비행기: 항상 앞으로 이동. 아크로 드론: 완전 수동 조작.","Polar shortcuts are disabled or bypassed.":"Polar 단축키가 꺼져 있거나 우회되었습니다.","Portal HUD sizing":"포털 HUD 크기","Portal is off: using your separate HUD layout until it is enabled.":"포털이 꺼져 있습니다: 활성화될 때까지 별도의 HUD 배치를 사용합니다.","Portal on / off":"포털 켜기 / 끄기","Portal window":"포털 창","Post-process block ambiguous":"후처리 블록이 모호함","Post-process block not found in the view (try again outside a story scene)":"화면에서 후처리 블록을 찾을 수 없음 (스토리 장면 밖에서 다시 시도하세요)","PostProcessSettings not found":"PostProcessSettings를 찾을 수 없음","Preserve proportions at frame edges":"비율 유지하여 프레임 맞춤","Preserves both deactivation and keyboard focus events, including while this overlay is open. It applies to future events: after enabling, Alt-Tab away and back once. It does not bring the game to the foreground automatically.":"이 오버레이가 열려 있는 동안을 포함해 비활성화와 키보드 포커스 이벤트를 모두 보존합니다. 이후 이벤트에 적용됩니다: 활성화한 후 Alt-Tab으로 나갔다가 한 번 돌아오세요. 게임을 자동으로 전면으로 가져오지는 않습니다.","Press: hide characters at your eyes":"누르기: 눈앞의 캐릭터 숨기기","Privacy box placement":"프라이버시 가림 위치","Profile ID bottom":"프로필 ID 아래","Profile ID left":"프로필 ID 왼쪽","Profile ID right":"프로필 ID 오른쪽","Profile ID top":"프로필 ID 위","Quick":"빠름","R grip":"오른쪽 그립","R stick":"오른쪽 스틱","R trigger":"오른쪽 트리거","RT / double RT":"RT / RT 두 번","Raise eye level by 5":"눈높이 5 높이기","Readable HUD following view":"읽기 쉬운 시점 추적 HUD","Ready":"준비됨","Reality Runner and other treadmills: keep Sharing on Both together and Controller slot on Automatic, so walking and the VR controllers work at the same time.":"Reality Runner 등 트레드밀: 공유는 둘 다 함께, 컨트롤러 슬롯은 자동으로 두면 걷기와 VR 컨트롤러를 동시에 쓸 수 있습니다.","Reality Runner is open: 10 seconds of walking starts a run.":"Reality Runner가 열려 있음: 10초 걸으면 러닝이 시작됩니다.","Recenter headset / portal":"헤드셋 / 포털 재정렬","Recenter keeps world scale and camera offsets. Simulator Home resets only the simulator, not the game's VR origin.":"재정렬은 월드 스케일과 카메라 오프셋을 유지합니다. 시뮬레이터 Home은 시뮬레이터만 초기화하며 게임의 VR 원점은 초기화하지 않습니다.","Recenter view":"시점 재정렬","Recentering with L3 + A also moves your seated position back to the middle.":"L3 + A로 재정렬하면 착석 위치도 가운데로 돌아갑니다.","Record":"녹화","Record camera and Xbox diagnostics":"카메라와 Xbox 진단 기록","Record video":"동영상 녹화","Recorder: failed. See WuWa Controls > Recording in the classic menu.":"녹화기: 실패했습니다. 클래식 메뉴의 WuWa Controls > 녹화를 확인하세요.","Recorder: missing from this launcher package.":"녹화기: 이 런처 패키지에 없습니다.","Recorder: open the WuWa VR app (launcher) to record.":"녹화기: 녹화하려면 WuWa VR 앱(런처)을 여세요.","Recorder: ready.":"녹화기: 준비됨.","Recorder: recording. Reports and marks note the time in the video.":"녹화기: 녹화 중. 신고와 마크에 영상 속 시간이 기록됩니다.","Recorder: saved. Open recordings from the launcher.":"녹화기: 저장됨. 녹화본은 런처에서 열 수 있습니다.","Recorder: saving the video.":"녹화기: 영상 저장 중.","Recorder: starting.":"녹화기: 시작 중.","Recorder: waiting for the launcher...":"녹화기: 런처를 기다리는 중...","Recording":"녹화 중","Recording and privacy":"녹화 및 개인정보 보호","Recording failed. See the message below.":"녹화에 실패했습니다. 아래 메시지를 확인하세요.","Recording saved. Use Open recordings in the launcher.":"녹화가 저장되었습니다. 런처에서 '녹화 열기'를 사용하세요.","Recording video. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"동영상 녹화 중입니다. 깨끗한 화면을 위해 UEVR 메뉴를 닫으세요.","Records the headset view through the WuWa VR app, which must be open. Player IDs are covered while it records (Hide player IDs, on the Record page).":"헤드셋 화면을 WuWa VR 앱을 통해 기록합니다. 앱이 열려 있어야 합니다. 녹화 중에는 플레이어 ID가 가려집니다 (녹화 페이지의 '플레이어 ID 가리기').","Refill far lighting now":"원거리 조명 지금 다시 채우기","Reflection capture correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"반사 캡처 보정이 중단되었거나 이 게임 빌드를 확인할 수 없습니다. 진단 로그를 확인하세요.","Reflection correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"반사 보정이 중단되었거나 이 게임 빌드를 확인할 수 없습니다. 진단 로그를 확인하세요.","Reflection projection correction":"반사 투영 보정","Refresh HUD layout":"HUD 레이아웃 새로 고침","Refresh far lighting":"원거리 조명 새로 고침","Refresh far-lighting cache (limited workaround)":"원거리 조명 캐시 새로 고침 (제한적 임시 조치)","Refresh position before drawing (Custom)":"그리기 전 위치 새로 고침 (사용자 지정)","Refresh queued; requires the supplied Comfort script.":"새로 고침이 대기열에 추가되었습니다. 제공된 Comfort 스크립트가 필요합니다.","Refreshes the far-lighting cache so distant lighting matches between eyes. A limited workaround.":"원거리 조명 캐시를 새로 고쳐 양쪽 눈의 원거리 조명이 일치하도록 합니다. 제한적인 임시 조치입니다.","Release RT (Xbox) or pull left stick fully down (Mode 2), then tap RB to arm. Tap RB again or hold LB to pause/disarm. LB + RB levels the drone and stops it. Double R3 exits. Focus loss, menus and shortcut chords pause/disarm it; arm again to resume.":"RT(Xbox)를 놓거나 왼쪽 스틱을 완전히 아래로 당기면(모드 2) RB를 눌러 작동을 시작합니다. RB를 다시 누르거나 LB를 길게 눌러 일시 중지/해제합니다. LB + RB는 드론을 수평으로 만들고 정지시킵니다. R3 두 번 클릭으로 종료합니다. 포커스를 잃거나 메뉴 및 단축키 조합에서 일시 중지/해제되며, 다시 시작하면 재개됩니다.","Release all controls after entering/leaving":"진입/이탈 후 모든 조작 해제","Reload language files":"언어 파일 다시 불러오기","Render resolution":"렌더링 해상도","Rendering comparisons (live)":"렌더링 비교 (실시간)","Report a problem":"문제 신고","Requests a HUD layout refresh without opening ESC. If this game version is unsupported, the status explains why; saved HUD size and position stay unchanged.":"ESC를 열지 않고 HUD 레이아웃 새로 고침을 요청합니다. 이 게임 버전이 지원되지 않으면 상태에 이유가 표시되며, 저장된 HUD 크기와 위치는 변경되지 않습니다.","Requests a bounded cascade-lighting-volume refresh after stereo starts or resumes, after detected teleports, or on request. It helped the tested ship/wheel lighting case; it is not a general fix for dark objects or character rims. Each refill can cause a short hitch.":"입체 렌더링 시작/재개 후, 텔레포트 감지 후, 또는 요청 시 제한된 캐스케이드 조명 볼륨 새로 고침을 요청합니다. 테스트된 선박/바퀴 조명 사례에 도움이 되었으며 어두운 물체나 캐릭터 테두리에 대한 일반적인 해결책은 아닙니다. 새로 채울 때마다 짧은 끊김이 발생할 수 있습니다.","Requires Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass. Applies the pass correction before game-side view setup. Turn off to return to the previous correction. Culling and lighting acceptance is pending.":"Native Stereo Fix와 Use Same Stereo Pass가 필요합니다. 게임 측 뷰 설정 전에 패스 보정을 적용합니다. 끄면 이전 보정으로 돌아갑니다. 컬링 및 조명 검증은 보류 중입니다.","Reset HUD aspect":"HUD 비율 초기화","Reset HUD shape":"HUD 모양 초기화","Reset camera offset":"카메라 오프셋 초기화","Reset diorama camera":"디오라마 카메라 초기화","Reset headset position and direction now":"헤드셋 위치와 방향 지금 초기화","Restart plan":"계획 다시 시작","Restore all controller slots":"모든 컨트롤러 슬롯 복원","Restore controls from this launch":"이번 실행의 조작 설정 복원","Restore input settings from before comparisons":"비교 전 입력 설정 복원","Restore profile settings":"프로필 설정 복원","Restore renderer from before this comparison":"이번 비교 전 렌더러 복원","Restore supplied profile controls":"제공된 프로필 조작 복원","Restore this build's supplied controls, first-person/freecam settings, camera scale, aiming and HUD layout. Rendering and runtime selection are preserved. Temporary HUD/mouse mode is always turned off. You can undo the reset below.":"이 빌드에 포함된 조작, 1인칭/자유 카메라 설정, 카메라 배율, 조준 및 HUD 배치를 복원합니다. 렌더링 및 런타임 선택은 유지됩니다. 임시 HUD/마우스 모드는 항상 꺼집니다. 아래에서 초기화를 취소할 수 있습니다.","Returns Windows XInput unchanged, bypassing VR and Lua gamepad processing. Use Insert and the mouse for this settings panel; gamepad shortcuts and VR controller mapping are unavailable in this mode.":"Windows XInput을 변경 없이 전달하여 VR 및 Lua 게임패드 처리를 우회합니다. 이 설정 패널에는 Insert와 마우스를 사용하세요. 이 모드에서는 게임패드 단축키와 VR 컨트롤러 매핑을 사용할 수 없습니다.","Right":"오른쪽","Right / left":"오른쪽 / 왼쪽","Right trigger (Xbox)":"오른쪽 트리거 (Xbox)","Right-stick pitch; animated yaw and roll":"오른쪽 스틱 상하 시점; 애니메이션 좌우 회전 및 기울기","Rim restoration failed; the original is retained. Toggle off, then on to retry restoration first.":"림 복원에 실패했습니다. 원본이 유지됩니다. 껐다가 다시 켜서 먼저 복원을 재시도하세요.","Rim suppression was not verified. Toggle off, then on to retry safely.":"림 억제가 확인되지 않았습니다. 껐다가 다시 켜서 안전하게 재시도하세요.","Rim variable is unavailable. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"림 변수를 사용할 수 없습니다. 껐다가 다시 켜서 재시도하세요.","Rim workaround is off.":"림 해결 방법이 꺼져 있습니다.","Rim workaround waits for active native stereo with 2D screen off.":"림 해결 방법은 2D 화면이 꺼진 상태에서 네이티브 스테레오가 활성화되기를 기다립니다.","Rim workaround waits for the current graphics comparison to end.":"림 해결 방법은 현재 그래픽 비교가 끝나기를 기다립니다.","Room panel (stays put)":"공간 패널 (위치 고정)","Run on: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"러닝 중: %s, 걷기 %s, 게임 속 %.2f km.","Safe fit inside rounded edges":"둥근 테두리 안에 맞춤","Save changes for next time":"다음을 위해 변경 사항 저장","Save observation":"관찰 저장","Save or discard your unsent note before finishing.":"마치기 전에 저장하지 않은 메모를 저장하거나 삭제하세요.","Save report":"보고서 저장","Saves \"skipped\" and shows the next step.":"\"건너뜀\"을 저장하고 다음 단계를 표시합니다.","Saves the camera and controller movement next to the video, to help find what went wrong.":"무엇이 잘못되었는지 찾는 데 도움이 되도록 동영상 옆에 카메라와 컨트롤러 움직임을 저장합니다.","Saves the report now. Recording first makes it easy to find in the video.":"지금 보고서를 저장합니다. 먼저 녹화하면 동영상에서 쉽게 찾을 수 있습니다.","Saves the time and current settings, so the moment is easy to find later.":"나중에 그 순간을 쉽게 찾을 수 있도록 시간과 현재 설정을 저장합니다.","Saves this answer with the settings now in use, then shows the next step.":"현재 사용 중인 설정과 함께 이 답변을 저장한 후 다음 단계를 표시합니다.","Saving":"저장 중","Scene ending; restoring previous view":"장면 종료 중. 이전 화면으로 복원합니다","Screen lens":"화면 렌즈","Screen view on / off":"화면 시점 켜기 / 끄기","Screen views and cutscene options are in VR > WuWa Controls > View modes and cutscenes.":"화면 시점 및 컷신 옵션은 VR > WuWa Controls > 시점 모드 및 컷신에 있습니다.","Screenshot":"스크린샷","Scroll":"스크롤","Second view":"두 번째 시점","Second view does not match the first":"두 번째 시점이 첫 시점과 맞지 않음","Second view not writable; copy skipped":"두 번째 시점에 쓸 수 없어 복사를 건너뜀","Seconds of smoothing in the steady desktop window. More is calmer and trails turns more.":"데스크톱 창 안정화의 부드러움(초). 클수록 차분해지지만 고개를 돌릴 때 더 늦게 따라옵니다.","Selected build: %s":"선택한 빌드: %s","Send aim to player control rotation":"조준을 플레이어 제어 회전에 전달","Separate eyes: Synchronized Sequential":"눈 분리: 동기화 순차","Separate-eye rendering produced a black scene with HUD in the September 26 playtest. Native stereo is the working baseline. Submission metadata has been repaired, but separate-eye rendering is still an experiment, not a fix for labels/reflections/materials. Return to Native if the scene disappears.":"9월 26일 플레이 테스트에서 눈 분리 렌더링은 HUD가 있는 검은 화면을 생성했습니다. 네이티브 스테레오가 작동 기준입니다. 제출 메타데이터는 복구되었지만 눈 분리 렌더링은 여전히 실험이며 라벨/반사/재질에 대한 해결책이 아닙니다. 화면이 사라지면 Native로 돌아가세요.","Set portal toggle key":"포털 전환 키 설정","Set show / hide UI key":"UI 표시 / 숨김 키 설정","Sets all three offsets back to 0, the game camera's own position.":"세 오프셋을 모두 0, 즉 게임 카메라 자체 위치로 되돌립니다.","Settings from before the reset restored; mouse mode remains off.":"초기화 전 설정이 복원되었습니다. 마우스 모드는 꺼진 상태로 유지됩니다.","Settings: D-pad selects, A activates, left stick scrolls the focused pane. Mouse wheel also scrolls. Release RT first: holding it adjusts the camera instead.":"설정: 방향 패드로 선택, A로 실행, 왼쪽 스틱으로 포커스된 창 스크롤. 마우스 휠로도 스크롤됩니다. RT를 먼저 놓으세요: 누르고 있으면 대신 카메라가 조정됩니다.","Sharing with Xbox / treadmill":"Xbox / 트레드밀과 공유","Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then click L3 to turn the blur on or off.":"단축키: LT + RT를 누른 상태에서 L3을 클릭하여 블러를 켜거나 끕니다.","Show / hide game HUD and menus":"게임 HUD와 메뉴 표시 / 숨김","Show / hide game UI":"게임 UI 표시 / 숨김","Show UI to see this menu":"이 메뉴를 보려면 UI를 표시하세요","Show all":"모두 표시","Show extracted game UI":"추출한 게임 UI 표시","Show game UI now":"게임 UI 표시","Show hover-drone / plane camera roll":"호버 드론 / 비행기 카메라 롤 표시","Show optical hands (this launch only)":"광학 손 표시 (이번 실행만)","Showcase: one eye, steady, 16:9":"쇼케이스: 한쪽 눈, 안정화, 16:9","Showcase: the left eye as a normal 16:9 video, steadied, with the HUD where you see it, at the game's own frame rate. Picture size 720, 1024 or 1280 px gives 720p, 1080p or 1440p. Needs SteamVR. Side by side: both eyes, to help find what went wrong.":"쇼케이스: 왼쪽 눈을 일반 16:9 영상으로, 안정화하고 HUD를 보이는 위치에 두어 게임 자체 프레임 속도로 녹화합니다. 화면 크기 720, 1024, 1280 px는 720p, 1080p, 1440p가 됩니다. SteamVR이 필요합니다. 나란히: 양쪽 눈을 녹화해 문제를 찾는 데 도움이 됩니다.","Shows 3 times, then turns itself off (Cinema page).":"3번 표시된 뒤 자동으로 꺼집니다 (Cinema 페이지).","Shows the L3 card without holding anything. Shortcut: L3 + Menu. A loaded test plan shows its step there instead.":"아무것도 누르지 않고 L3 카드를 표시합니다. 단축키: L3 + Menu. 불러온 테스트 계획이 있으면 그 단계를 대신 표시합니다.","Shows the current step where the controls card usually is. Off shows the controls card, as a public release does; the plan stays loaded here.":"보통 조작 카드가 있는 자리에 현재 단계를 표시합니다. 끄면 정식 배포판처럼 조작 카드를 표시하며, 계획은 여기에 로드된 상태로 유지됩니다.","Shows the world as a miniature around you, with the portal on or off. Needs Native Stereo. This launch only.":"포털을 켜거나 끈 상태로 주변 세계를 축소 모형으로 표시합니다. Native Stereo가 필요합니다. 이번 실행만.","Shrinks the world by the Diorama scale (%.0fx, set on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page) for an action-figure view, seen from the diorama camera (Camera page). Turn off to return to your normal scale. Works with or without the portal window.":"디오라마 배율(%.0f배, WuWa VR 메뉴의 빠른 설정 페이지에서 설정)로 세계를 줄여 디오라마 카메라(카메라 페이지)에서 보는 액션 피규어 시점을 만듭니다. 끄면 정상 크기로 돌아갑니다. 포털 창이 있든 없든 작동합니다.","Simulator: keep its preview open, choose Both eyes / side-by-side, and turn Full render off. Recording uses the preview size.":"시뮬레이터: 미리보기를 열어 두고 양쪽 눈 / 나란히 보기를 선택한 뒤 Full render를 끄세요. 녹화는 미리보기 크기를 사용합니다.","Skip this step":"이 단계 건너뛰기","Slot 0":"슬롯 0","Slot 1":"슬롯 1","Slot 2":"슬롯 2","Slot 3":"슬롯 3","Smooth camera tilt":"부드러운 카메라 상하 기울기","Smooth camera turns":"부드러운 카메라 회전","Smooth transition between animation and game view":"애니메이션과 게임 시점 간 부드러운 전환","Smoothing blends stick handovers and reported movement-state changes, such as takeoff/landing. It starts enabled on the supplied profile. Head position stays current; ordinary aiming and animation are immediate after the handover. Off restores the instant switch.":"부드럽게 처리는 스틱 전환과 이착륙 같은 보고된 이동 상태 변경을 자연스럽게 이어 줍니다. 제공된 프로필에서 기본으로 켜져 있습니다. 머리 위치는 실시간으로 유지되며, 일반적인 조준과 애니메이션은 전환 직후 즉시 반영됩니다. 끄면 즉시 전환으로 돌아갑니다.","Smoothing speed":"부드러움 속도","Smoothness":"부드러움 정도","Smooths head shake out of the game window for OBS recordings. The window then trails quick head turns a little, so leave it off while you play. The headset image is not changed.":"OBS 녹화를 위해 게임 창에서 머리 흔들림을 없앱니다. 빠르게 고개를 돌리면 창이 조금 늦게 따라오므로 플레이 중에는 꺼 두세요. 헤드셋 화면은 바뀌지 않습니다.","Smooths head shake out of the game window, so OBS records a calm, full-resolution view with game audio. The headset image is not changed. The window shows a slightly narrower view so the picture can move inside it.":"게임 창에서 머리 흔들림을 부드럽게 처리하여 OBS가 게임 오디오와 함께 안정적인 전체 해상도 화면을 녹화하도록 합니다. 헤드셋 화면은 변경되지 않습니다. 창은 화면이 내부에서 움직일 수 있도록 약간 좁은 시야를 표시합니다.","Smooths the game camera's left / right turns, so quick camera swings feel gentler.":"게임 카메라의 좌우 회전을 부드럽게 처리하여 빠른 카메라 전환이 더 완만하게 느껴지도록 합니다.","Smooths the game camera's up / down tilt.":"게임 카메라의 상하 기울기를 부드럽게 처리합니다.","Soft contact shadows in corners and under objects. On by default. It keeps the game's own setting and renders both eyes with a symmetric view, so rocks, hills and roofs shade the same in each eye; the picture is slightly softer. Off is a little faster.":"구석과 물체 아래의 부드러운 접촉 그림자. 기본값은 켬. 게임 자체 설정을 유지하고 양쪽 눈을 대칭 시야로 렌더링하여 바위, 언덕, 지붕의 음영이 양쪽 눈에서 같아집니다. 화면은 약간 부드러워집니다. 끄면 조금 더 빠릅니다.","Something else":"기타","Speed":"속도","Stand where the far tree freezes, start a window, close the menu and look, then press what you saw. Each start or stop may cause a one-frame blur.":"먼 나무가 멈추는 곳에 서서 창을 시작하고, 메뉴를 닫고 바라본 뒤, 본 것을 누르세요. 시작하거나 중지할 때마다 한 프레임 흐려질 수 있습니다.","Start a developer playtest in the launcher, then save your observations here. Nothing passes automatically.":"런처에서 개발자 플레이테스트를 시작한 다음, 관찰 내용을 여기에 저장하세요. 자동으로 통과되는 것은 없습니다.","Start and end runs automatically":"러닝 자동 시작 및 종료","Start and end treadmill runs automatically":"트레드밀 러닝 자동 시작 및 종료","Start motion sidecar (5 minutes max)":"동작 데이터 기록 시작 (최대 5분)","Start run":"러닝 시작","Start video recording":"동영상 녹화 시작","Starting":"시작 중","Starting the recorder. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"녹화기를 시작합니다. 깨끗한 화면을 위해 UEVR 메뉴를 닫으세요.","Starts again from step 1.":"1단계부터 다시 시작합니다.","Status: VR controllers need the OpenXR runtime.":"상태: VR 컨트롤러에는 OpenXR 런타임이 필요합니다.","Status: blocked by Physical gamepad passthrough. Turn passthrough off to use VR controllers.":"상태: 물리 게임패드 패스스루로 차단됨. VR 컨트롤러를 사용하려면 패스스루를 끄세요.","Status: blocked by the XInput controller slot filter. Allow slot %d or choose another slot.":"상태: XInput 컨트롤러 슬롯 필터로 차단됨. 슬롯 %d을(를) 허용하거나 다른 슬롯을 선택하세요.","Status: off. Xbox only.":"상태: 꺼짐. Xbox 전용.","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on.":"상태: 켜짐, VR 컨트롤러 대기 중. 둘 다 깨우고 헤드셋을 착용한 상태로 유지하세요.","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on; the Xbox still works.":"상태: 켜짐, VR 컨트롤러 대기 중. 둘 다 깨우고 헤드셋을 착용한 상태로 유지하세요. Xbox는 계속 작동합니다.","Status: on, waiting for game focus. Click the game window.":"상태: 켜짐, 게임 포커스 대기 중. 게임 창을 클릭하세요.","Status: on, waiting for the game to read controller slot %d. It is asked again a few times a minute; keep the game window focused.":"상태: 켜짐, 게임이 컨트롤러 슬롯 %d을(를) 읽기를 기다리는 중. 1분에 몇 번 다시 요청합니다. 게임 창에 포커스를 유지하세요.","Status: on. Every controller steers this menu; the game gets no input until it closes.":"상태: 켜짐. 모든 컨트롤러가 이 메뉴를 조작합니다. 이 메뉴가 닫힐 때까지 게임에는 입력이 전달되지 않습니다.","Status: on. VR controllers and Xbox both working.":"상태: 켜짐. VR 컨트롤러와 Xbox 모두 작동 중.","Status: on. VR controllers in control; use the Xbox to switch.":"상태: 켜짐. VR 컨트롤러가 조작 중입니다. 전환하려면 Xbox를 사용하세요.","Status: on. VR controllers working.":"상태: 켜짐. VR 컨트롤러 작동 중.","Status: on. Xbox in control; use a VR control to switch.":"상태: 켜짐. Xbox가 조작 중입니다. 전환하려면 VR 컨트롤을 사용하세요.","Status: paused by the diagnostic motion-input mute.":"상태: 진단용 동작 입력 음소거로 일시 정지됨.","Steadiness":"안정도","Steadiness (seconds of smoothing)":"안정화 (스무딩 시간, 초)","Steady desktop view (for OBS and streaming)":"데스크톱 시점 고정 (OBS 및 스트리밍용)","Steady desktop window":"데스크톱 창 안정화","SteamVR and the updated OpenXR Simulator are supported. VDXR capture is not available yet. Video has no audio and stops after five minutes. Actual frame rate depends on the game.":"SteamVR 및 업데이트된 OpenXR Simulator가 지원됩니다. VDXR 캡처는 아직 지원되지 않습니다. 동영상에는 오디오가 없으며 5분 후 자동으로 중지됩니다. 실제 프레임 속도는 게임에 따라 달라집니다.","Step":"단계","Step card below you":"아래 카드로 이동","Stereo rendering compatibility":"입체 렌더링 호환성","Stereo screen":"입체 화면","Stereo screen (3D depth)":"입체 화면 (3D 깊이)","Stereo screen on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"입체 화면 켜기 / 끄기 (0.8초 길게)","Stick expo (softens center)":"스틱 엑스포 (중앙부 부드럽게)","Stop motion sidecar":"동작 데이터 기록 중지","Stop now":"지금 중지","Stop the voice note or transcription in the launcher before finishing.":"완료하기 전에 런처에서 음성 메모 또는 음성 텍스트 변환을 중지하세요.","Stop video recording":"동영상 녹화 중지","Stop voice activity and confirm untested checks before finishing.":"완료하기 전에 음성 입력을 중지하고 테스트되지 않은 항목을 확인하세요.","Stopped":"중지됨","Stopped: a write or restore failed. Restart the game before trying again.":"중지됨: 저장 또는 복원에 실패했습니다. 다시 시도하기 전에 게임을 다시 시작하세요.","Stops the freecam at walls and the ground. Experimental.":"자유 카메라가 벽과 지면에서 멈춥니다. (실험적 기능)","Story camera nudge":"스토리 카메라 미세 조정","Story camera nudge now: %s cm":"스토리 카메라 미세 조정: 현재 %s cm","Story camera nudge: waiting for a story shot":"스토리 카메라 미세 조정: 스토리 장면 대기 중","Story cutscenes and dialogue":"스토리 컷신 및 대화","Story pictures":"스토리 그림","Story pictures use":"스토리 그림에서 사용","Story scenes in 16:9":"스토리 장면은 16:9","Story scenes use":"스토리 장면에서 사용","Story shots: camera nearer / back (L3 + Y + X resets; keyboard Page Up / Page Down / Home)":"스토리 장면: 카메라 가까이 / 뒤로 (L3 + Y + X 초기화, 키보드 Page Up / Page Down / Home)","Streamer privacy: cover player IDs":"방송 프라이버시: 플레이어 ID 가리기","Stutter or freeze":"끊김 또는 멈춤","Supplied profile restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"제공된 프로필이 복원되었습니다. 계속하기 전에 모든 컨트롤 입력을 해제하세요.","Swap the eyes' poses and projections (stereo looks inverted)":"양안의 위치와 투영을 교체 (입체 영상이 반전됨)","Swap the eyes' render targets (stereo looks inverted)":"양안의 렌더 타겟을 교체 (입체 영상이 반전됨)","Sweeps the camera against surfaces that block the game's Visibility trace. Slides along contact surfaces. Unsupported queries hold movement and report a reason below. Physical headset leaning is not constrained. Starts off; world geometry still needs live verification.":"게임의 가시성 추적을 차단하는 표면에 대해 카메라를 스윕합니다. 접촉면을 따라 미끄러집니다. 지원되지 않는 쿼리의 경우 이동이 정지되며 아래에 사유가 표시됩니다. 물리적 헤드셋 기울기는 제한되지 않습니다. 기본값은 꺼짐 상태이며, 월드 지오메트리는 실시간 검증이 필요합니다.","Switches to a screen while a story video (mono theatre) or a story picture plays, then back to the view you had. Story scenes keep your view unless you choose otherwise below.":"스토리 영상(모노 극장)이나 스토리 그림이 재생되는 동안 화면으로 전환하고, 끝나면 원래 보기로 돌아갑니다. 아래에서 다르게 고르지 않으면 스토리 장면은 지금 보기를 유지합니다.","Sync left eye LOD to right eye (fix candidate)":"왼쪽 눈 LOD를 오른쪽 눈과 동기화 (수정 후보)","TEST":"테스트","Target recording rate":"목표 녹화 프레임 속도","Test":"테스트","Tests the game's default texture in place of custom reflections for the two main eyes. This is an effect-removal workaround, not a projection repair, and can also remove correct custom reflections. Starts off and restores on the next rendered views when disabled.":"두 눈의 커스텀 반사 대신 게임 기본 텍스처를 테스트합니다. 이는 투영 수리가 아닌 효과 제거 우회 방식으로, 올바른 커스텀 반사도 제거될 수 있습니다. 기본값은 꺼짐이며, 비활성화 시 다음 렌더링 시점에 복원됩니다.","The 2D view's background blur, in full VR and on the stereo screen. In full VR the blur is scaled for the headset's wider lens and the focus follows Close-up match.":"전체 VR 및 입체 화면에서 2D 시점의 배경 블러입니다. 전체 VR에서는 헤드셋의 넓은 렌즈에 맞게 블러 강도가 조정되며, 초점은 클로즈업 매칭을 따릅니다.","The Kuro material candidate stopped or could not verify this build. See the diagnostic log.":"Kuro 머티리얼 후보가 중지되었거나 이 빌드를 검증할 수 없습니다. 진단 로그를 확인하세요.","The card is blocked by FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor. Turn that off to display it.":"이 카드는 FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor 설정에 의해 차단됩니다. 표시하려면 해당 설정을 끄세요.","The game builds one eye from a plain default camera, so that eye misses the shot's camera settings. Blur only copies the depth of field across; All camera effects also copies grading, vignette, exposure and the rest.":"게임은 기본 카메라로 한쪽 눈을 생성하므로, 해당 눈은 촬영 시의 카메라 설정이 적용되지 않습니다. '블러만 복사'는 피사계심도만 복사하며, '모든 카메라 효과 복사'는 색 보정, 비네팅, 노출 등 모든 효과를 복사합니다.","The hand demo needs OpenXR with optical hand tracking. Xbox gameplay is unchanged.":"핸드 데모는 광학 핸드 트래킹이 지원되는 OpenXR이 필요합니다. Xbox 조작에는 영향이 없습니다.","The hand overlay renderer is unavailable. The joint inspector remains available; see the UEVR log for details.":"핸드 오버레이 렌더러를 사용할 수 없습니다. 관절 검사기는 계속 사용할 수 있으며, 자세한 내용은 UEVR 로그를 확인하세요.","The hold gesture is unavailable while Enable motion-controller input is on; use this checkbox.":"'모션 컨트롤러 입력 사용'이 켜져 있는 동안 홀드 제스처는 사용할 수 없습니다. 이 체크박스를 대신 사용하세요.","The playtest session changed. Review it before saving.":"플레이테스트 세션이 변경되었습니다. 저장하기 전에 검토하세요.","The previous character rim value was restored and verified.":"이전 캐릭터 림 값이 복원되고 검증되었습니다.","The recorder is missing from this launcher package.":"이 런처 패키지에 녹화기가 없습니다.","The rim variable changed; no old pointer was used. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"림 변수가 변경되어 이전 포인터를 사용할 수 없습니다. 끄고 다시 켜서 재시도하세요.","The selected package is recorded; this is not proof of the DLL loaded by the game.":"선택한 패키지가 기록되었지만, 게임에 실제 로드된 DLL을 증명하지는 않습니다.","The session changed. Review your unsent note before adding it to this session.":"세션이 변경되었습니다. 이 세션에 메모를 추가하기 전에 보낼 예정이었던 메모를 검토하세요.","The supplied profile enables this for Native Stereo Fix with OpenXR. Headset timing acceptance is still limited; disable only for a deliberate comparison.":"제공된 프로필은 OpenXR 환경의 Native Stereo Fix에 대해 이 옵션을 활성화합니다. 헤드셋 타이밍 수용성은 여전히 제한적이므로, 의도적인 비교를 위해서만 비활성화하세요.","The top-left box normally follows the ESC/overlay menu render path, including gamepad menus. Other popups using that same path may also show it. The bottom-right UID box stays on. Check your recording; unknown menu layouts are not guaranteed to be covered. Always is a manual fallback.":"왼쪽 상단 상자는 일반적으로 게임패드 메뉴를 포함한 ESC/오버레이 메뉴 렌더 경로를 따릅니다. 동일한 경로를 사용하는 다른 팝업도 이 상자를 표시할 수 있습니다. 오른쪽 하단 UID 상자는 계속 표시됩니다. 녹화를 확인하세요. 알 수 없는 메뉴 레이아웃은 항상 가려지지 않을 수 있습니다. '항상 (수동 가림)'은 수동 대체 옵션입니다.","These are UEVR's existing global aim settings, shared with VR > Input. They are not limited to first person.":"UEVR의 기존 전역 조준 설정이며 VR > Input과 공유됩니다. 1인칭에만 국한되지 않습니다.","These buttons use UEVR's existing live rendering options. The image may pause while render targets rebuild. They leave camera, HUD placement and controller settings alone. Opening this section changes nothing; UEVR saves whichever renderer you leave selected.":"이 버튼들은 UEVR의 기존 실시간 렌더링 옵션을 사용합니다. 렌더 타깃을 다시 만들 때 화면이 잠시 멈출 수 있습니다. 카메라, HUD 위치, 컨트롤러 설정은 그대로 둡니다. 이 섹션을 열어도 아무것도 바뀌지 않으며, 선택한 채로 둔 렌더러를 UEVR이 저장합니다.","These modes move the viewpoint; the character stays put. Acro is a camera flight model, without motor, propeller or battery simulation.":"이 모드들은 시점만 움직이며 캐릭터는 제자리에 있습니다. 아크로는 모터, 프로펠러, 배터리 시뮬레이션 없는 카메라 비행 모델입니다.","These old comparison tests are separate from the normal far-object repair. Some deliberately invert or duplicate eye data; they are not recommended player settings.":"이 오래된 비교 테스트들은 일반적인 원거리 물체 수정과 별개입니다. 일부는 눈 데이터를 의도적으로 반전하거나 복제하므로 권장되는 플레이어 설정이 아닙니다.","This OpenXR runtime or headset does not provide hand tracking.":"이 OpenXR 런타임 또는 헤드셋은 핸드 트래킹을 제공하지 않습니다.","This is a flat rectangular HUD: corners can extend over rounded/feathered edges. Use Safe fit to keep every corner inside, or use a rectangular portal for exact alignment.":"평평한 직사각형 HUD로, 모서리가 둥글거나 부드럽게 처리된 가장자리 밖으로 나갈 수 있습니다. Safe fit을 사용하면 모든 모서리를 안쪽에 유지할 수 있고, 정확한 정렬이 필요하면 직사각형 포털을 사용하세요.","This launch only: not saved.":"이번 실행만: 저장되지 않습니다.","This older profile has no supplied-defaults file. Reset this build in the launcher while the game is closed, or use this launch's settings below.":"이 오래된 프로필에는 제공된 기본값 파일이 없습니다. 게임을 종료한 상태에서 런처로 이 빌드를 초기화하거나, 아래의 이번 실행 설정을 사용하세요.","This runtime cannot identify optical hands. Controller-derived joints are not shown.":"이 런타임은 광학 손을 식별할 수 없습니다. 컨트롤러에서 파생된 관절은 표시되지 않습니다.","Times your run and saves your route in the game once a second, with a sync flash for OBS videos. With Reality Runner open, walking starts a run by itself (Controllers page).":"러닝 시간을 재고 게임 속 경로를 1초마다 저장하며, OBS 영상용 동기화 플래시를 냅니다. Reality Runner가 열려 있으면 걷기만 해도 러닝이 시작됩니다(컨트롤러 페이지).","Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"HUD / 마우스 조정 전환","Trace mesh triangles when supported":"지원되는 경우 메시 삼각형 추적","Track the camera":"카메라 추적","Track the camera: the distance is measured at each cut, then follows only the game camera's own moves, so a focus change cannot move you. Fixed per shot: the distance stays as it was at the cut. Follow the focus: it also moves when the game changes focus.":"카메라 추적: 거리는 컷마다 측정된 뒤 게임 카메라 자체의 움직임만 따라가므로 초점이 바뀌어도 이동하지 않습니다. 장면마다 고정: 거리가 컷 시점 그대로 유지됩니다. 초점 따라가기: 게임이 초점을 바꿀 때도 함께 움직입니다.","Transition duration (seconds)":"전환 시간 (초)","Translucency correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"반투명 보정이 중지되었거나 이 게임 빌드를 확인할 수 없습니다. 진단 로그를 참고하세요.","Treadmill":"트레드밀","Treadmill run":"트레드밀 러닝","Try headset aim":"헤드셋 조준 사용","Turn speed":"회전 속도","Turn this note off in the menu, Cinema page.":"메뉴의 Cinema 페이지에서 이 알림을 끌 수 있습니다.","Turn this off to isolate your physical gamepad. Head tracking stays enabled.":"이 기능을 끄면 실제 게임패드를 분리합니다. 헤드 트래킹은 계속 켜져 있습니다.","UEVR > WuWa Controls > Exit mouse mode now":"UEVR > WuWa Controls > 마우스 모드 종료","UI placement":"UI 배치","UID bottom":"UID 아래쪽","UID left":"UID 왼쪽","UID right":"UID 오른쪽","UID top":"UID 위쪽","Unavailable while another graphics test runs.":"다른 그래픽 테스트가 실행 중일 때는 사용할 수 없습니다.","Unavailable: %s":"사용할 수 없음: %s","Unavailable: the eye pair is not verified yet (or this game build is not supported).":"사용할 수 없음: 눈 쌍이 아직 검증되지 않았습니다 (또는 이 게임 빌드가 지원되지 않습니다).","Undo last controls reset":"마지막 조작 초기화 취소","Unoccluded hand skeleton demo: hands draw over the game. No grabbing, collisions or gesture controls. Xbox remains gameplay.":"가려지지 않은 손 골격 데모: 손이 게임 위에 그려집니다. 잡기, 충돌, 제스처 조작은 없습니다. Xbox는 계속 게임 조작입니다.","Unsupported PlayStation input report; use Steam Input if available":"지원되지 않는 PlayStation 입력 리포트입니다. 가능하면 Steam Input을 사용하세요.","Until the next cut":"다음 컷까지","Until the next cut: each shot starts at the game's spot again. For the whole scene: your nudge stays until the story shots end.":"다음 컷까지: 각 장면은 다시 게임의 원래 위치에서 시작합니다. 장면 전체: 스토리 장면이 끝날 때까지 조정이 유지됩니다.","Up / down":"위 / 아래","Use a keyboard for text. Voice notes require explicit microphone consent in the developer web panel.":"텍스트 입력에는 키보드를 사용하세요. 음성 메모는 개발자 웹 패널에서 마이크 동의를 명시적으로 해야 합니다.","Use game aim for full animation":"전체 애니메이션에 게임 조준 사용","Use game view while either stick moves":"스틱 조작 중 게임 시점 사용","Use native stereo":"Native Stereo 사용","Use right-stick pitch":"오른쪽 스틱 상하 시점 사용","Use separate-eye renderer":"분리 눈 렌더러 사용","Use the VR controllers as an Xbox pad for walking and sightseeing. Holding the left Menu button for 1 second also turns them on or off.":"VR 컨트롤러를 걷기와 관광을 위한 Xbox 패드로 사용합니다. 왼쪽 Menu 버튼을 1초 동안 길게 눌러도 켜거나 끌 수 있습니다.","Use this menu when opening UEVR":"UEVR을 열 때 이 메뉴 사용","Used instead of the offsets above while the diorama is on. The diorama makes your eyes far apart, so a camera that suits normal play puts the character too close and crosses your eyes. The default, 5 m back, shows it about an arm's length away at 10x.":"디오라마가 켜져 있는 동안 위의 오프셋 대신 사용됩니다. 디오라마는 두 눈 사이를 크게 벌리므로, 일반 플레이에 맞는 카메라로는 캐릭터가 너무 가까워 눈이 모입니다. 기본값인 5m 뒤에서는 10배일 때 캐릭터가 팔 길이쯤 떨어져 보입니다.","Uses one game camera pose for both eyes during the same frame, while preserving headset movement and eye separation. Requires Native Stereo Fix. The owner confirmed the ultimate return-to-gameplay fix. Other scene transitions remain under test; this does not repair foliage.":"같은 프레임 동안 두 눈에 하나의 게임 카메라 포즈를 사용하며, 헤드셋 움직임과 눈 간격은 유지합니다. Native Stereo Fix가 필요합니다. 제작자가 궁극적인 게임 복귀 수정을 확인했습니다. 다른 장면 전환은 아직 테스트 중이며, 이 기능은 나뭇잎을 수정하지 않습니다.","Uses the game's full-resolution translucency path for ordinary two-eye views. Compare Lynae, Mornye and Iuno in both eyes. May cost performance. Requires Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off; other renderers keep their normal behavior.":"일반적인 양안 시점에 게임의 전체 해상도 반투명 경로를 사용합니다. Lynae, Mornye, Iuno를 양쪽 눈으로 비교해 보세요. 성능이 저하될 수 있습니다. Native Stereo Fix가 있는 Native Stereo가 필요하고 Extreme Compatibility는 꺼져 있어야 하며, 다른 렌더러는 정상 동작을 유지합니다.","V once; hold 0.8 s for the Tab wheel":"V 한 번, 0.8초 누르면 Tab 휠","VR controllers":"VR 컨트롤러","VR controllers for walking (optional)":"걷기용 VR 컨트롤러 (선택 사항)","VR controllers on (this launch)":"VR 컨트롤러 켜짐 (이번 실행)","VR controllers: point and pull the trigger, or use either stick and A. B closes, the grips change page. Xbox: D-pad or stick, A, B, LB / RB. Keyboard: arrows, Enter, Esc, Tab. Mouse: click and scroll.":"VR 컨트롤러: 가리킨 뒤 트리거를 당기거나 아무 스틱과 A를 사용하세요. B는 닫기, 그립은 페이지 넘기기입니다. Xbox: 방향 패드 또는 스틱, A, B, LB / RB. 키보드: 방향키, Enter, Esc, Tab. 마우스: 클릭 및 스크롤.","VR only (Xbox ignored)":"VR 전용 (Xbox 무시)","Video style":"영상 스타일","View":"보기","View hints":"시점 힌트","View modes and cutscenes":"시점 모드 및 컷신","Views hold unexpected values; copy skipped":"시점 값이 예상과 달라 복사를 건너뜀","WHILE ADJUSTMENT IS ON":"조정이 켜져 있는 동안","Wait for an active playtest in the launcher.":"런처에서 활성 플레이테스트를 기다리세요.","Wait for the launcher operation to finish.":"런처 작업이 끝날 때까지 기다리세요.","Waiting for a close-up (lens now %s degrees)":"클로즈업 대기 중 (현재 렌즈 %s도)","Waiting for a stereo frame":"입체 프레임을 기다리는 중","Waiting for a valid portal anchor.":"유효한 포털 기준점을 기다리는 중입니다.","Waiting for a verified cinematic signal":"확인된 시네마틱 신호를 기다리는 중","Waiting for an authored constrained camera":"원본 비율 제한 카메라를 기다리는 중","Waiting for fresh optical hands. Keep hands visible to the headset and enable tracking forwarding in Virtual Desktop when using VDXR.":"광학 손 추적을 기다리는 중입니다. 헤드셋에 손이 보이게 유지하고, VDXR 사용 시 Virtual Desktop에서 트래킹 전달을 켜세요.","Waiting for native game camera":"게임 기본 카메라를 기다리는 중","Waiting for playtest acknowledgement...":"플레이테스트 확인을 기다리는 중...","Waiting for the launcher...":"런처를 기다리는 중...","Walk by default":"기본 걸음","Walk by default; hold RB for normal speed":"기본은 걷기, RB를 누르면 보통 속도","Walk instead of run; hold RB for normal speed.":"달리기 대신 걷기, RB를 누르면 보통 속도.","Warn when a menu opens with game UI hidden":"UI 숨김 중 메뉴 열 때 경고","What automatic switching shows during story scenes and conversations. Keep current view leaves full VR, the stereo screen or mono as you have it.":"스토리 장면과 대화 중에 자동 전환이 표시하는 것. '현재 보기 유지'는 전체 VR, 입체 화면, 모노를 지금 상태 그대로 둡니다.","What automatic switching shows while a story picture fills the screen.":"스토리 그림이 화면을 가득 채우는 동안 자동 전환이 표시하는 것.","What happened":"무슨 일이 있었는지","What you see of your own character. Hiding the head stops it from blocking the view.":"내 캐릭터가 보이는 정도입니다. 머리를 숨기면 시야를 가리지 않습니다.","When a letterboxed cinematic camera starts in full VR, a short note in view reminds you of the screen shortcut. A fallback for when automatic switching misses a scene.":"풀 VR에서 레터박스 시네마틱 카메라가 시작되면 시야에 짧은 안내가 떠서 화면 단축키를 알려줍니다. 자동 전환이 장면을 놓쳤을 때를 위한 대비책입니다.","When to show the profile ID box":"프로필 ID 가림 표시 시점","Where this menu floats around you. Full VR and the screen views each keep their own place; on a screen view Low sits just under the picture, whatever its size and distance, and the menu always stays in front of it.":"이 메뉴가 주변 어디에 떠 있는지입니다. 풀 VR과 화면 보기는 각각 자신의 위치를 유지하며, 화면 보기에서 낮음은 화면 크기와 거리에 상관없이 그림 바로 아래에 놓이고 메뉴는 항상 화면 앞에 유지됩니다.","Where your viewpoint sits in the diorama, from the game camera. Back (minus) moves the miniature farther away.":"게임 카메라를 기준으로 한 디오라마 시점의 위치입니다. 뒤(마이너스)로 하면 미니어처가 더 멀어집니다.","Where: ":"위치: ","Which Xbox controller slot the VR controllers share. Automatic uses the one with a controller, such as a treadmill's virtual pad.":"VR 컨트롤러가 함께 쓰는 Xbox 컨트롤러 슬롯입니다. 자동은 트레드밀의 가상 패드처럼 컨트롤러가 있는 슬롯을 사용합니다.","Whichever you used last controls the game; the other waits until you press or push something on it.":"마지막으로 사용한 쪽이 게임을 조작하며, 다른 쪽은 무언가 누르거나 밀 때까지 대기합니다.","While hiding is off: a short note with the shortcut, once per scene, when a character is right at your eyes. After 3 notes it turns itself off.":"숨기기가 꺼져 있을 때: 캐릭터가 눈앞에 붙으면 장면마다 한 번 단축키를 짧게 알려 줍니다. 3번 알린 뒤 자동으로 꺼집니다.","While playing in first person, hold L3 + Y to raise eye level or L3 + X to lower it. This lets you see the result with this menu closed.":"1인칭으로 플레이 중 L3 + Y를 누르고 있으면 눈높이가 올라가고 L3 + X는 내려갑니다. 이 메뉴를 닫은 상태로 결과를 볼 수 있습니다.","While recording":"녹화 중","While recording: the boxes appear while the WuWa VR app records and during treadmill runs. Recording with other software (OBS) at other times needs Always.":"녹화 중: WuWa VR 앱이 녹화하는 동안과 트레드밀 러닝 중에 상자가 표시됩니다. 그 밖의 시간에 다른 프로그램(OBS)으로 녹화하려면 항상이 필요합니다.","Wide 90 degrees":"넓게 90도","Width per eye. Larger is sharper and makes bigger files.":"눈 하나당 너비입니다. 클수록 선명하지만 파일이 커집니다.","Window alignment down / up":"창 정렬 아래 / 위","Window alignment left / right":"창 정렬 왼쪽 / 오른쪽","With Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass on, keeps the source eye's projection for supported custom reflection captures. With Native Stereo Fix off, selects verified two-eye atlas parameters. Visual acceptance is pending.":"Native Stereo Fix와 동일 입체 패스 사용이 켜져 있으면 지원되는 사용자 지정 반사 캡처에 원본 눈의 투영을 유지합니다. Native Stereo Fix가 꺼져 있으면 검증된 양안 아틀라스 매개변수를 선택합니다. 시각적 검수는 아직 대기 중입니다.","With Reality Runner open, 10 seconds of walking starts a run and 5 minutes without walking ends it. The WuWa VR menu has the same switch on its Controllers page.":"Reality Runner가 열려 있으면 10초 걸을 때 러닝이 시작되고 5분 동안 걷지 않으면 끝납니다. WuWa VR 메뉴의 컨트롤러 페이지에도 같은 스위치가 있습니다.","With Reality Runner open, 10 seconds of walking starts a run and 5 minutes without walking ends it. Your route is saved in the UEVR profile, wuwa-runs folder.":"Reality Runner가 열려 있으면 10초 걸을 때 러닝이 시작되고 5분 동안 걷지 않으면 끝납니다. 경로는 UEVR 프로필의 wuwa-runs 폴더에 저장됩니다.","With the 16:9 layout off: every conversation (story scenes and chats with people in the world) and story videos switch to 16:9 while they play, so story pictures show whole, then the taller layout comes back. Follows the game's own dialogue state, so it works with any controls and with the game UI hidden.":"16:9 레이아웃이 꺼져 있을 때: 모든 대화(스토리 장면과 월드 속 인물과의 대화)와 스토리 영상이 재생되는 동안 16:9로 바뀌어 스토리 그림이 잘리지 않고, 끝나면 세로로 긴 레이아웃으로 돌아옵니다. 게임 자체의 대화 상태를 따르므로 어떤 조작 방식에서도, 게임 UI를 숨겨도 작동합니다.","With the 16:9 layout on: the character screen (Resonators) uses the taller layout while it is open, so its floor reflection keeps showing the current character, then 16:9 comes back. Its icons look flatter there and the mouse can miss.":"16:9 레이아웃이 켜져 있을 때: 캐릭터 화면(공명자)을 여는 동안 세로로 긴 레이아웃을 사용해 바닥 반사에 현재 캐릭터가 계속 비치고, 닫으면 16:9로 돌아옵니다. 이 화면에서는 아이콘이 납작해 보이고 마우스가 빗나갈 수 있습니다.","Within a shot":"샷 안에서","World scale":"월드 스케일","World-space labels in both eyes (candidate)":"양쪽 눈 공간 라벨 (후보 수정)","Write a short observation before saving.":"저장하기 전에 짧은 관찰을 적으세요.","WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"WuWa Controls > 게임 UI 표시","WuWa VR menu":"WuWa VR 메뉴","WuWa controls and shortcut pages only. Base UEVR, game text and some technical help remain English. Translations are community-editable drafts.":"WuWa 조작 및 단축키 페이지만 해당됩니다. 기본 UEVR, 게임 텍스트 및 일부 기술 도움말은 영어로 유지됩니다. 번역은 커뮤니티에서 편집할 수 있는 초안입니다.","X + left stick":"X + 왼쪽 스틱","X + stick  Scroll    D-pad Move map":"X + 스틱  스크롤    방향 패드 지도 이동","X or Delete: back to the default.":"X 또는 Delete: 기본값으로 되돌리기.","XInput controller slot (test)":"XInput 컨트롤러 슬롯 (테스트)","Xbox / Steam Input has priority; direct PlayStation shortcuts are waiting":"Xbox / Steam Input이 우선이며, 직접 PlayStation 단축키는 대기 중입니다","Y + X together: back to default":"Y + X 동시에: 기본값으로","Yaw rate (degrees / second)":"요 회전 속도 (도 / 초)","You are in the scene":"장면 안에 있습니다","Your answer: ":"답변: ","Your answers are saved. Restart it from the menu's Test page.":"답변이 저장되었습니다. 메뉴의 테스트 페이지에서 다시 시작하세요.","Your body":"내 몸","Your route in the game is saved once a second (UEVR profile > wuwa-runs), so no map screenshots are needed. Each start and end flashes a magenta square in the desktop view, so an OBS video lines up with the route.":"게임 속 경로를 1초마다 저장하므로(UEVR 프로필 > wuwa-runs) 지도 스크린샷이 필요 없습니다. 시작과 종료 때마다 데스크톱 화면에 자홍색 사각형이 깜박여 OBS 영상과 경로를 맞출 수 있습니다.","Your unsent note is retained in this menu until the game closes.":"보내지 않은 메모는 게임이 종료될 때까지 이 메뉴에 남아 있습니다.","depth of field forced on":"피사계 심도 강제 켬","depth of field: %s":"피사계 심도: %s","depth of field: not in this game build":"피사계 심도: 이 게임 버전에는 없음","game focus":"게임 초점","held behind the person in front (%s m)":"앞사람 뒤에서 멈춤 (%s m)","hiding anything nearer than %s cm":"%s cm보다 가까운 것 숨김","hold {L3} or {LT}+{RT} to see what each button does · {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"{L3} 또는 {LT}+{RT}를 누르고 있으면 각 버튼의 기능을 볼 수 있습니다 · {L3}+{R3}는 WuWa VR 메뉴를 엽니다","now":"지금","stopped at the closest %s cm":"가장 가까운 %s cm에서 멈춤","subject":"피사체","{LT}+{RT}, click {R3} for full VR":"{LT}+{RT}, {R3} 클릭하여 전체 VR","{LT}+{RT}, click {R3} for the stereo screen":"{LT}+{RT}, {R3} 클릭하여 입체 화면","{LT}+{RT}, hold {R3} to leave mono":"{LT}+{RT}, {R3} 길게 눌러 모노 종료"}},"pt-BR":{"schema":1,"language":"pt-BR","name":"Portuguese (Brazil)","direction":"ltr","font":"latin","review":"draft; native-speaker review welcome","strings":{"%+.0f cm":"%+.0f cm","%+.2f m":"%+.2f m","%.0f cm":"%.0f cm","%.0f deg":"%.0f°","%.0fx":"%.0fx","%.1f m":"%.1f m","%.1fx":"%.1fx","%.2f m":"%.2f m","%.2f s":"%.2f s","%.2fx":"%.2fx","%.3fx":"%.3fx","%s: %u samples":"%s: %u amostras",". Answer again to change it.":". Responda de novo para alterar.","01  HOLD L3":"01  SEGURE L3","02  HOLD LT + RT":"02  SEGURE LT + RT","03  CAMERAS":"03  CÂMERAS","04  MENUS & HUD":"04  MENUS E HUD","05  WUWA VR MENU":"05  MENU DO WUWA VR","1024 px":"1024 px","1280 px":"1280 px","16:9 UI layout":"Layout da interface 16:9","30 fps":"30 fps","3D depth":"Profundidade 3D","45 fps":"45 fps","60 fps":"60 fps","720 px":"720 px","A VR button or stick held from before is ignored until you let go of it.":"Um botão ou analógico de VR que já estava pressionado é ignorado até você soltá-lo.","A big 3D screen; best for cutscenes":"Uma tela 3D grande; ideal para cenas","A hidden head bone has no usable animated pose: the neck supplies an approximation. For actual head-bone tracking choose Keep entire character visible or Hide body; keep full character shadow. Separate accessories without a head bone may remain visible in head-only mode. Exit and re-enter first person in a neutral pose to recalibrate. Offsets use game units. L3 + A recenters headset/simulator displacement.":"Um osso de cabeça oculto não tem pose animada utilizável: o pescoço fornece uma aproximação. Para rastrear de fato o osso da cabeça, escolha Mostrar personagem inteiro ou Ocultar corpo; manter sombra completa do personagem. Acessórios separados sem osso de cabeça podem continuar visíveis no modo só cabeça. Saia e entre de novo em primeira pessoa numa pose neutra para recalibrar. Os deslocamentos usam unidades do jogo. L3 + A recentraliza o deslocamento do headset/simulador.","A select  ·  Left / right change  ·  LB / RB pages  ·  B close":"A seleciona  ·  Esquerda / direita altera  ·  LB / RB páginas  ·  B fecha","A-D restore all controller slots for a fair comparison. Each records until stopped or 1000 changes. Close with Insert, test LB+Y before and after Alt-Tab, then return with Insert. Restore above to undo this batch. UEVR saves the current settings on exit.":"A-D restauram todos os slots de controle para uma comparação justa. Cada um grava até ser parado ou atingir 1000 alterações. Feche com Insert, teste LB+Y antes e depois de Alt-Tab, depois volte com Insert. Use Restaurar acima para desfazer este lote. O UEVR salva os ajustes atuais ao sair.","A. Physical gamepad baseline":"A. Referência do controle físico","A/B/X/Y keep their labels. Triggers = LT/RT, grips = LB/RB, stick clicks = L3/R3. Left Menu tap = Start; left grip + Menu tap = View. Both stick clicks open the WuWa VR menu. D-pad actions are not mapped.":"A/B/X/Y mantêm seus rótulos. Gatilhos = LT/RT, grips = LB/RB, cliques dos analógicos = L3/R3. Toque no Menu esquerdo = Start; grip esquerdo + toque no Menu = View. Os dois cliques de analógico abrem o menu do WuWa VR. As ações do direcional não são mapeadas.","Acro drone":"Drone acro","Acro drone (manual)":"Drone acro (manual)","Acro throttle control":"Controle de aceleração acro","Acro: right stick controls roll/pitch rates; left stick X controls yaw. Stick forward pitches down. Centered sticks stop rotation without levelling. Gravity, thrust and momentum keep acting while armed. Full camera roll is part of this mode.":"Acro: o analógico direito controla as taxas de rolagem/arfagem; o X do analógico esquerdo controla a guinada. Analógico para frente inclina para baixo. Analógicos centralizados param a rotação sem nivelar. Gravidade, empuxo e inércia continuam agindo enquanto armado. A rolagem completa da câmera faz parte deste modo.","Action":"Ação","Activated automatically in this menu: cursor only. L3 + R3 opens the WuWa VR menu.":"Ativado automaticamente neste menu: apenas cursor. L3 + R3 abre o menu do WuWa VR.","Active: %s (targets swapped %llu, constructed %llu)":"Ativo: %s (alvos trocados %llu, construídos %llu)","Active: %s, %llu s left, applied %llu, restored %llu":"Ativo: %s, %llu s restantes, aplicados %llu, restaurados %llu","Adds the missing second-eye pass for the custom material path used by Lynae, Mornye and Iuno. Preserves the first eye. Requires Native Stereo, with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off. Visual acceptance pending.":"Adiciona a passada do segundo olho que falta no caminho de material personalizado usado por Lynae, Mornye e Iuno. Preserva o primeiro olho. Requer Native Stereo, com Native Stereo Fix e Compatibilidade Extrema desativados. Aceitação visual pendente.","Advanced compatibility and diagnostics":"Compatibilidade avançada e diagnóstico","Advanced rendering and script diagnostics":"Renderização avançada e diagnóstico de scripts","After you switch views, a line shows for 3 seconds with how to go on or come back. It switches itself off after 5 switches.":"Ao trocar de visão, uma linha mostra por 3 segundos como continuar ou voltar. Ela se desliga sozinha após 5 trocas.","Aim direction":"Direção da mira","Aiming and right-stick pitch":"Mira e inclinação pelo analógico direito","Air drag (per second)":"Arrasto do ar (por segundo)","All camera effects":"Todos os efeitos de câmera","All camera effects copied into the first view":"Todos os efeitos de câmera copiados para a primeira visão","All camera effects copied into the second view":"Todos os efeitos de câmera copiados para a segunda visão","All detected menus":"Todos os menus detectados","All settings (classic UEVR menu)":"Todos os ajustes (menu clássico do UEVR)","All shortcut contexts":"Todos os atalhos","All slots (unchanged)":"Todos os slots (inalterados)","All slots preserves normal input. Select one slot to exclude the others from WuWa's XInput state calls. Check the raw controller states below while pressing a button to identify your pad. Slot numbers can change after reconnecting; this does not hide Windows devices or filter other input APIs. Vibration commands stay available, including motor stop requests.":"Todos os slots preservam a entrada normal. Selecione um slot para excluir os outros das chamadas de estado XInput do WuWa. Confira os estados brutos dos controles abaixo enquanto pressiona um botão para identificar seu controle. Os números dos slots podem mudar após reconectar; isso não oculta dispositivos do Windows nem filtra outras APIs de entrada. Os comandos de vibração continuam disponíveis, incluindo pedidos de parada do motor.","All stick overrides (includes legacy pitch-only)":"Todas as substituições de analógico (inclui apenas arfagem legada)","Allow VR motion-controller input":"Permitir entrada do controle de movimento VR","Also cover the ESC profile ID row":"Ocultar também ID no ESC","Also hide the profile ID row":"Ocultar também a linha de ID do perfil","Alternating / AFR":"Alternado / AFR","Always":"Sempre","Always (manual mask)":"Sempre (máscara manual)","Ambient occlusion":"Oclusão de ambiente","Ambient occlusion (soft contact shadows)":"Oclusão de ambiente (sombras de contato suaves)","An automated stereo comparison is active. These three settings return to your choices when it ends (at most 60 seconds).":"Uma comparação estereoscópica automatizada está ativa. Estes três ajustes voltam às suas escolhas quando ela termina (no máximo 60 segundos).","Animated":"Animado","Animated position + stick pitch":"Posição animada + inclinação pelo analógico","Animation comfort":"Conforto de animação","Animation off: stable height relative to the character root. On: follow the head, or reconstruct it from a visible parent bone when the head is hidden. This follows leaning and sprinting but can add bobbing. Missing rig support falls back to the stable anchor; see the status below.":"Animação desligada: altura estável em relação à raiz do personagem. Ligada: segue a cabeça, ou a reconstrói a partir de um osso pai visível quando a cabeça está oculta. Isso acompanha inclinações e corridas, mas pode adicionar balanço. A falta de suporte do rig volta à âncora estável; veja o status abaixo.","Another playtest request is pending. Wait for the launcher.":"Outra solicitação de teste está pendente. Aguarde o launcher.","Another setting changed the rim value; it was left untouched. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"Outro ajuste alterou o valor da borda; ele foi deixado intacto. Desligue e ligue de novo para tentar.","Answer in the menu: L3 + R3 (or Insert), Test page.":"Responda no menu: L3 + R3 (ou Insert), página Teste.","As in the headset":"Como no headset","As in the headset: the HUD sits where you see it in VR, at its distance and size. Flat: the HUD fills the window like on a monitor, a steady reference while you play. Full VR only; the stereo screen and mono theatre always show it flat.":"Como no headset: o HUD fica onde você o vê em VR, na mesma distância e tamanho. Plano: o HUD preenche a janela como em um monitor, uma referência estável enquanto você joga. Somente VR completo; a tela estéreo e o cinema mono sempre o mostram plano.","Asks the game to lay out its HUD again. Try it if the HUD looks stretched or cut off after switching views.":"Pede ao jogo para reorganizar o HUD. Tente se o HUD parecer esticado ou cortado depois de trocar de visão.","Authored framing applied (headset check pending)":"Enquadramento original aplicado (verificação no headset pendente)","Auto":"Auto","Auto uses the eye that has the camera's focus. If both eyes stay sharp or look wrong, try First or Second.":"Auto usa o olho que tem o foco da câmera. Se os dois olhos ficarem nítidos ou parecerem errados, tente Primeiro ou Segundo.","Automatic":"Automático","Automatic cinematic screen":"Tela cinematográfica automática","Automatic cinematic screen (experimental)":"Tela cinematográfica automática (experimental)","Automatic cutscene switching":"Troca automática de cena","Automatic lease expired; restoration waits for the next game tick":"A concessão automática expirou; a restauração aguarda o próximo tick do jogo","Automatic mono theatre active":"Cinema mono automático ativo","Automatic presentation lease expired; previous view restored":"A apresentação automática expirou; visão anterior restaurada","Automatic slot: using slot %d.":"Slot automático: usando o slot %d.","Automatic stereo screen active":"Tela estéreo automática ativa","Automatic story switching did not activate in the latest reported replay. Prerecorded video switching has not been tested. Missing or changed signals leave the normal view unchanged.":"A troca automática de história não foi ativada na última reprodução relatada. A troca de vídeo pré-gravado não foi testada. Sinais ausentes ou alterados deixam a visão normal inalterada.","Automatic uses the slot that has a controller, such as a treadmill's virtual pad while the real pad is hidden. Choose a fixed slot only if it picks the wrong one: launcher Troubleshooting > Controller check lists them.":"Automático usa o slot que tem um controle, como o controle virtual de uma esteira enquanto o controle real está oculto. Escolha um slot fixo só se ele errar: Solução de problemas > Verificação de controle, no inicializador, lista os slots.","Automatically use mouse in game menus (legacy)":"Usar mouse automaticamente nos menus do jogo (legado)","B. Windows focus forwarding":"B. Encaminhamento de foco do Windows","Back to 1.33, the full VR default.":"Voltar para 1,33, o padrão do VR completo.","Back to the WuWa VR menu":"Voltar ao menu do WuWa VR","Back to the diorama defaults: 5 m back, centred. The normal offsets stay as they are.":"Volta aos padrões do diorama: 5 m para trás, centralizado. Os deslocamentos normais ficam como estão.","Back to the game camera.":"Voltar à câmera do jogo.","Black bars":"Barras pretas","Black bars in cutscenes? In WuWa's graphics settings, change Cinematic from Cutscene to Fullscreen. The bars go and cutscenes fill your view.":"Barras pretas nas cenas? Nas configurações gráficas do WuWa, mude Cinematic de Cutscene para Fullscreen. As barras somem e as cenas preenchem sua visão.","Black boxes cover the bottom-right UID and the ESC profile ID row in the extracted game UI, including its VR/portal and spectator copies. Check a short recording before sharing: other layouts, names, chat and diagnostics are not anonymized.":"Caixas pretas cobrem o UID no canto inferior direito e a linha de ID do perfil no ESC na interface extraída do jogo, incluindo as cópias de VR/portal e de espectador. Verifique uma gravação curta antes de compartilhar: outros layouts, nomes, chat e diagnósticos não são anonimizados.","Black boxes over your UID in the corner and the profile ID row in menus. While recording: while the WuWa VR app records or a treadmill run is on, so the boxes never cover HUD you need in play. Always: for OBS and other recorders at any time. The boxes are approximate; check a short video before sharing. Other names and chat are not hidden.":"Caixas pretas sobre seu UID no canto e a linha do ID de perfil nos menus. Durante a gravação: enquanto o app WuWa VR grava ou uma corrida na esteira está ligada, para que as caixas nunca cubram o HUD de que você precisa no jogo. Sempre: para o OBS e outros gravadores a qualquer momento. As caixas são aproximadas; confira um vídeo curto antes de compartilhar. Outros nomes e o chat não são ocultados.","Blocked":"Bloqueado","Blur (depth of field) on / off":"Desfoque (profundidade de campo) ligar / desligar","Blur copied into the first view":"Desfoque copiado para a primeira visão","Blur copied into the second view":"Desfoque copiado para a segunda visão","Blur off":"Desfoque desligado","Blur on":"Desfoque ligado","Blur only":"Somente desfoque","Blur strength, full VR":"Intensidade do desfoque, VR completo","Blur strength, screens":"Intensidade do desfoque, telas","Both eyes get":"Os dois olhos recebem","Both eyes, side by side":"Ambos os olhos, lado a lado","Both eyes: %s":"Ambos os olhos: %s","Both together":"Os dois juntos","Both together: buttons combine and each stick follows whichever is pushed further, so treadmill walking keeps working while you look around with VR. Last used wins: the other waits until you use it. VR only: the Xbox pad is ignored while VR controllers are on.":"Os dois juntos: os botões se combinam e cada analógico segue o que estiver mais empurrado, então andar na esteira continua funcionando enquanto você olha em volta na VR. Vence o último usado: o outro espera até você usá-lo. Só VR: o controle Xbox é ignorado enquanto os controles VR estão ligados.","Both work at once: buttons combine and each stick follows whichever is pushed further, so treadmill walking keeps working.":"Os dois funcionam ao mesmo tempo: os botões se combinam e cada analógico segue o que for empurrado mais longe, então a caminhada na esteira continua funcionando.","Build left view like the first eye (K5)":"Montar a visão esquerda como o primeiro olho (K5)","Buttons":"Botões","C. Gamepad passthrough":"C. Repasse do controle","CAMERA":"CÂMERA","Camera":"Câmera","Camera / HUD layouts: LuaLoader > Script UI > WuWa VR comfort controls.":"Layouts de câmera / HUD: LuaLoader > Script UI > Controles de conforto do WuWa VR.","Camera and controller data":"Dados da câmera e do controle","Camera and gameplay controls":"Câmera e controles","Camera collision radius (game units)":"Raio de colisão da câmera (unidades do jogo)","Camera customization":"Personalizar câmera","Camera position":"Posição da câmera","Camera up / down":"Câmera cima / baixo","Camera view":"Visão da câmera","Cannot write playtest request.":"Não foi possível escrever a solicitação de teste.","Card distance":"Distância do cartão","Card height":"Altura do cartão","Card size":"Tamanho do card","Card width (meters)":"Largura do card (metros)","Change page":"Trocar página","Character screen in the taller layout":"Tela de personagens no layout mais alto","Character toon-depth rim is suppressed; the previous value is retained.":"A borda de profundidade toon do personagem foi suprimida; o valor anterior é mantido.","Character toon-depth rim was already zero; no write was needed.":"A borda de profundidade toon do personagem já estava em zero; nenhuma gravação foi necessária.","Character visibility details":"Detalhes de visibilidade do personagem","Characters in the shot":"Personagens no enquadramento","Characters in the shot: the person the game focuses on (or nearest the middle of the 2D frame), and Close-up match stops behind anyone in front of them, as in over-the-shoulder shots. Game focus only: aims by the game's focus distance alone and does not look for people.":"Personagens no enquadramento: a pessoa em que o jogo foca (ou a mais próxima do centro do quadro 2D), e a correspondência de close-up para atrás de quem estiver na frente dela, como em planos por cima do ombro. Apenas foco do jogo: mira só pela distância de foco do jogo e não procura pessoas.","Checklist item":"Item da lista","Choose First person under View modes if wanted; camera and aiming settings stay unchanged.":"Escolha Primeira pessoa em Modos de visão, se quiser; as configurações de câmera e mira permanecem iguais.","Choose a checklist item in this playtest.":"Escolha um item da lista neste teste.","Cinema":"Cinema","Cinematic scene":"Cena cinematográfica","Cinematic scene note":"Nota da cena cinematográfica","Click / go back":"Clicar / voltar","Click left stick + left bumper, then release all controls.":"Clique o analógico esquerdo + botão superior esquerdo; depois solte tudo.","Click twice":"Clique duas vezes","Click: blur on / off":"Clique: desfoque ligar / desligar","Click: full VR / stereo screen":"Clique: VR completo / tela estéreo","Close UEVR before using these shortcuts. L3/R3 mean clicking the sticks; View is the two-squares button and Menu is the three-lines button.":"Feche o UEVR antes de usar estes atalhos. L3/R3 significa clicar nos analógicos; View é o botão dos dois quadrados e Menu é o botão das três linhas.","Close UEVR, press L3 + LB once, then release the controller. Left stick moves the cursor; A clicks, B goes back, X + stick scrolls. LT/RT moves the HUD nearer/farther; LB/RB lowers/raises it. L3 + LB again returns to normal controls. Adjustment pauses freecam flight and starts off each launch.":"Feche o UEVR, pressione L3 + LB uma vez e solte o controle. O analógico esquerdo move o cursor; A clica, B volta, X + analógico rola. LT/RT aproxima/afasta o HUD; LB/RB abaixa/eleva o HUD. L3 + LB de novo volta aos controles normais. O ajuste pausa o voo da câmera livre e começa desativado a cada inicialização.","Close-up aims at":"Close-up mira em","Close-up at %s degrees: %s %s m away, moved %s m nearer":"Close-up a %s graus: %s a %s m, aproximado %s m","Close-up at %s degrees: the game sets no focus in this shot, view at the game camera":"Close-up a %s graus: o jogo não define foco nesta tomada, visão na câmera do jogo","Close-up match":"Correspondência de close-up","Closest distance":"Distância mínima","Collide with the world":"Colidir com o mundo","Comfort":"Conforto","Comfort keeps your height steady and the horizon level. Animated follows your character's head as it moves. Full animation also follows its turns (experimental). Custom uses the options in the classic menu.":"Conforto mantém sua altura estável e o horizonte nivelado. Animado segue a cabeça do seu personagem enquanto ela se move. Animação completa também segue os giros dela (experimental). Personalizado usa as opções do menu clássico.","Comfort: stable height, level horizon":"Conforto: altura e horizonte estáveis","Compare controller fixes in this run":"Comparar correções de controle nesta sessão","Confirming cinematic signal":"Confirmando o sinal cinematográfico","Controller shortcuts":"Atalhos do controle","Controller slot":"Slot do controle","Controllers":"Controles","Controls":"Controles","Controls cards":"Cartões de controles","Controls cards (hold L3, or LT + RT)":"Cartões de controles (segure L3, ou LT + RT)","Copy failed":"Falha ao copiar","Copy from":"Copiar de","Covers the ID row on the ESC profile screen too.":"Cobre também a linha de ID na tela de perfil do ESC.","Current renderer: %s":"Renderizador atual: %s","Current result: %s":"Resultado atual: %s","Custom":"Personalizado","Custom / saved behavior":"Personalizado / salvo","Custom motion settings":"Configurações de movimento personalizado","Custom-reflection comparison stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"A comparação de reflexo personalizado foi interrompida ou não pôde verificar esta versão do jogo. Consulte o registro de diagnóstico.","Custom: Extreme Compatibility":"Personalizado: Compatibilidade extrema","D-pad":"Direcional","D-pad / A / B":"Direcional / A / B","D. Focus forwarding + passthrough":"D. Encaminhamento de foco + passthrough","DO":"FAÇA","Decouple game camera pitch":"Desacoplar inclinação da câmera","Decoupled pitch":"Inclinação desacoplada","Default: %s. Saved for next time.":"Padrão: %s. Salvo para a próxima vez.","Default: F7. Xbox: hold L3, then squeeze LT. Release both before repeating. Portal size and curvature are preserved; enabling anchors it in front of you.":"Padrão: F7. Xbox: segure L3 e aperte LT. Solte os dois antes de repetir. O tamanho e a curvatura do portal são preservados; ao ativar, ele se fixa à sua frente.","Default: keeps the body visible and head bones hidden, with a full shadow copy. Original non-casting/hidden equipment stays excluded. Copies are removed on exit, menus, rig changes or script reset. Unsupported rigs report a fallback below.":"Padrão: mantém o corpo visível e os ossos da cabeça ocultos, com uma cópia completa da sombra. Equipamentos originais sem sombra/ocultos continuam excluídos. As cópias são removidas ao sair, em menus, trocas de rig ou reinício do script. Rigs sem suporte relatam um fallback abaixo.","Degrees above straight ahead (below is negative).":"Graus acima da linha de visão (abaixo é negativo).","Degrees below your line of sight. More puts the card lower, out of the way of the HUD.":"Graus abaixo da sua linha de visão. Mais deixa o cartão mais baixo, fora do caminho do HUD.","Degrees to the right of straight ahead (left is negative).":"Graus à direita da linha de visão (esquerda é negativo).","Depth of field":"Profundidade de campo","Depth of field and camera effects":"Profundidade de campo e efeitos de câmera","Depth-of-field fields not found":"Campos de profundidade de campo não encontrados","Desktop window":"Janela da área de trabalho","Detection details":"Detalhes da detecção","Developer playtest checklist":"Lista de verificação do desenvolvedor","Dialogue shots use a zoom lens your headset's wide view can't show, so people look small and far. This moves you nearer, per shot, so they keep this share of their 2D size. At 0 you stay at the game camera's own spot, 100 matches the 2D shot and above 100 comes closer still. Game camera in full VR only.":"As cenas de diálogo usam uma lente de zoom que a visão ampla do seu headset não consegue mostrar, então as pessoas parecem pequenas e distantes. Isto o aproxima, por cena, para que mantenham esta proporção do tamanho 2D. Em 0 você fica na posição original da câmera do jogo, 100 iguala a cena 2D e acima de 100 chega ainda mais perto. Somente câmera do jogo em VR total.","Diorama (10×)":"Diorama (10×)","Diorama (miniature world)":"Diorama (mundo em miniatura)","Diorama camera":"Câmera do diorama","Diorama is on at %.0fx. This slider edits the normal scale restored when you turn it off in WuWa Controls.":"O Diorama está ativado em %.0fx. Este controle deslizante ajusta a escala normal restaurada quando você o desliga em Controles do WuWa.","Diorama mode (optional)":"Modo diorama (opcional)","Diorama needs Native Stereo. Choose it under Stereo rendering compatibility.":"O Diorama precisa do Native Stereo. Escolha em Compatibilidade estereoscópica.","Diorama on / off":"Diorama ligar / desligar","Diorama scale":"Escala do diorama","Diorama uses a temporary miniature scale (Diorama scale on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page, 10x by default) with Native Stereo, with the portal on or off. Turning it off returns to your normal saved scale, including deliberate scale edits. It starts off each launch, settings reload and runtime reinitialization. Head movement is magnified; L3 + A recenters.":"O Diorama usa uma escala de miniatura temporária (Escala do diorama na página Rápido do menu WuWa VR, 10x por padrão) com Native Stereo, com o portal ligado ou desligado. Desligá-lo retorna à sua escala normal salva, incluindo edições de escala intencionais. Ele inicia desligado a cada inicialização, recarregamento de ajustes e reinicialização em tempo de execução. O movimento da cabeça é ampliado; L3 + A recentraliza.","Diorama: forward / back":"Diorama: frente / trás","Diorama: right / left":"Diorama: direita / esquerda","Diorama: up / down":"Diorama: cima / baixo","Direct PlayStation shortcuts are experimental. The game still receives their buttons. Steam Input is preferred when available; release all controls after changing input sources.":"Os atalhos diretos do PlayStation são experimentais. O jogo ainda recebe os botões deles. O Steam Input é preferido quando disponível; solte todos os controles após trocar as fontes de entrada.","Discard unsent note":"Descartar anotação não enviada","Distance":"Distância","Do: ":"Faça: ","Done":"Concluído","Double L3  Windows screenshot":"Dois toques em L3  captura do Windows","Double R3":"Dois cliques em R3","Double R3  Freecam on / off":"Dois toques em R3  câmera livre ligar / desligar","Draws the missing eye of the world-label stage with its own camera and depth rectangle. Requires the matching candidate DLL and native stereo without Native Stereo Fix. Unsupported layouts keep the original rendering. NPC/bubble acceptance is pending; this does not repair reflections or character materials.":"Desenha o olho ausente do estágio de rótulos do mundo com sua própria câmera e retângulo de profundidade. Requer a DLL candidata correspondente e native stereo sem Native Stereo Fix. Layouts não suportados mantêm a renderização original. A aceitação de NPC/balões está pendente; isto não corrige reflexos nem materiais dos personagens.","Drone response (higher = less drift)":"Resposta do drone (maior = menos deriva)","DualSense direct shortcuts (experimental)":"Atalhos diretos do DualSense (experimental)","DualShock 4 direct shortcuts (experimental)":"Atalhos diretos do DualShock 4 (experimental)","ESC / overlay menus (detected)":"ESC / menus sobrepostos (detectados)","EXPECT":"ESPERADO","Each eye: %u x %u pixels. Now about %.0f fps.":"Cada olho: %u x %u pixels. Agora cerca de %.0f fps.","Early stereo view setup (experimental)":"Configuração inicial da visão estéreo (experimental)","Edit the UTF-8 JSON files in your game profile's wuwa-languages folder. Missing entries fall back to English. Reload applies changes without restarting the game.":"Edite os arquivos JSON UTF-8 na pasta wuwa-languages do perfil do seu jogo. Entradas ausentes usam o inglês como padrão. Recarregar aplica as mudanças sem reiniciar o jogo.","Edit translations":"Editar traduções","Enable WuWa controller shortcuts":"Ativar atalhos do controle do WuWa","Enable automatic switching":"Ativar troca automática","Enable controller mouse shortcuts":"Ativar atalhos de mouse do controle","End run":"Encerrar corrida","End the temporary focus/motion test below before starting a comparison.":"Encerre o teste temporário de foco/movimento abaixo antes de iniciar uma comparação.","Enter first person":"Entrar em primeira pessoa","Everyday controller shortcuts":"Atalhos cotidianos do controle","Everyone":"Todos","Everything else: {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"Todo o resto: {L3}+{R3} abre o menu do WuWa VR","Exact animation":"Animação exata","Exact animation (stick does not steer view)":"Animação exata (sem giro pelo analógico)","Exit mouse mode now":"Sair do modo mouse","Expect: ":"Esperado: ","Extract additional game menus (experimental)":"Extrair mais menus do jogo (experimental)","Extract game HUD into the VR panel":"Extrair HUD para o painel VR","Eyes don't match":"Os olhos não batem","FPV camera upward tilt (degrees)":"Inclinação para cima da câmera FPV (graus)","Faces the view forward from where you are now.":"Orienta a visão para frente a partir de onde você está agora.","Fail":"Reprovado","Far trees and props switch detail together in both eyes. Recommended.":"Árvores e objetos distantes alternam o nível de detalhe juntos nos dois olhos. Recomendado.","Fill whole frame (stretch)":"Preencher quadro (esticar)","Finish only when you are done. Untested checks remain Not tested; no result is inferred from notes.":"Finalize apenas quando terminar. Verificações não testadas permanecem Não testadas; nenhum resultado é inferido das anotações.","Finish playtest":"Encerrar teste","Finished":"Concluído","Finishing the video. Please wait.":"Finalizando o vídeo. Aguarde.","First person":"Primeira pessoa","First person character visibility":"Visibilidade do personagem","First person forward offset":"Deslocamento frontal","First person height offset":"Deslocamento de altura","First person motion":"Movimento em primeira pessoa","First person on / off":"Primeira pessoa ligar / desligar","First person right offset":"Deslocamento lateral","First person: full animation":"Primeira pessoa: animação completa","First view":"Primeira visão","First-person position":"Posição em primeira pessoa","First-person script status":"Status do script de primeira pessoa","Fit to portal frame":"Ajustar ao quadro do portal","Fixed":"Fixa","Fixed camera distance (game units)":"Distância da câmera fixa (unidades do jogo)","Fixed camera height above pawn (game units)":"Altura da câmera fixa acima do pawn (unidades do jogo)","Fixed per shot":"Fixo por plano","Fixed third person":"Terceira pessoa fixa","Fixed: farther / closer":"Fixa: afastar / aproximar","Fixes":"Correções","Flat screen; easiest on the eyes":"Tela plana; mais confortável para os olhos","Flat, like a monitor":"Plano, como um monitor","Flying style":"Estilo de voo","Focus game on controller reconnect":"Focar o jogo ao reconectar o controle","Follow animated head / neck position (Custom)":"Seguir posição animada da cabeça / pescoço (Personalizado)","Follow the focus":"Seguir o foco","Follow view (player HUD)":"Seguir visão (HUD)","Follow view keeps the HUD with your head. Distance still sets its stereo depth; choose a comfortable size and distance in the headset.":"Seguir visão mantém o HUD com a sua cabeça. A distância ainda define a profundidade estéreo; escolha um tamanho e uma distância confortáveis no headset.","For exact edge alignment set WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature to 0. This HUD panel is flat; it does not bend with a curved aperture.":"Para alinhamento exato das bordas, defina WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature como 0. Este painel de HUD é plano; ele não se curva com uma abertura curva.","For the WuWa VR menu, the controls cards and notices. The game's own language is set in the game.":"Para o menu do WuWa VR, os cartões de controles e os avisos. O idioma do próprio jogo é definido no jogo.","For the whole scene":"Pela cena inteira","For troubleshooting and comparisons. Leave these alone for everyday play; opening this section changes nothing.":"Para diagnóstico e comparações. Não mexa nisso no uso normal; abrir esta seção não muda nada.","For troubleshooting. These controls can change rendering or input; opening this section changes nothing.":"Para diagnóstico. Estes controles podem alterar a renderização ou a entrada; abrir esta seção não muda nada.","Forward / back":"Frente / trás","Forward Windows focus events (test)":"Encaminhar eventos de foco do Windows (teste)","Frame coverage (1 = full size)":"Cobertura (1 = completa)","Frame rate":"Taxa de quadros","Frames per second in the video.":"Quadros por segundo no vídeo.","Framing and theatre details":"Detalhes de enquadramento e teatro","Framing candidate refused; see diagnostic log":"Candidato de enquadramento recusado; veja o log de diagnóstico","Framing matched both eyes in the owner's simulator replay. Headset comfort and rare prerecorded movies still need testing.":"O enquadramento correspondeu a ambos os olhos no replay do simulador do proprietário. O conforto no headset e filmes pré-gravados raros ainda precisam de teste.","Framing repair matched both eyes in a simulator quest replay. Headset comfort remains untested; mono theatre is still available as a manual fallback.":"O ajuste de enquadramento correspondeu a ambos os olhos em um replay de missão do simulador. O conforto no headset ainda não foi testado; o teatro mono continua disponível como alternativa manual.","Freecam":"Câmera livre","Freecam collision (experimental)":"Colisão da câmera livre (experimental)","Freecam movement speed":"Velocidade da câmera livre","Freecam movement style":"Estilo da câmera livre","Freecam on / off":"Câmera livre ligar / desligar","Freecam turning speed":"Velocidade de giro","Freecam: LB descends; double RT = turbo":"Câmera livre: LB desce; dois toques em RT = turbo","Freecam: LT rises, RT boosts speed":"Câmera livre: LT sobe, RT aumenta a velocidade","Freecam: boost / turbo":"Câmera livre: impulso / turbo","Freecam: left stick moves, right looks":"Câmera livre: analógico esquerdo move, direito olha","Freecam: move / look":"Câmera livre: mover / olhar","Freecam: rise / descend":"Câmera livre: subir / descer","Front":"Frente","Full VR":"VR completo","Full VR / stereo screen (click again to switch back)":"VR completo / tela estéreo (clique de novo para voltar)","Full VR draws two large eye images every frame, far more pixels than the stereo screen, so busy scenes such as dialogue run slower there. A lower resolution is smoother and a little softer.":"O VR completo desenha duas imagens grandes, uma por olho, a cada quadro, muito mais pixels do que a tela estéreo, então cenas cheias, como diálogos, ficam mais lentas nele. Uma resolução menor é mais fluida e um pouco mais suave.","Full VR: the game all around you. Stereo screen: a big 3D screen, for menus and scenes that look wrong in full VR. Mono theatre: a flat screen, the same picture in both eyes. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then hold R3 (hold again to go back).":"VR completo: o jogo ao seu redor. Tela estéreo: uma grande tela 3D, para menus e cenas que ficam estranhas no VR completo. Cinema mono: uma tela plana, a mesma imagem nos dois olhos. Atalho: segure LT + RT e depois segure R3 (segure de novo para voltar).","Full animation":"Animação completa","Full animation follows character turns and can be intense. L3 + D-pad Down returns to your previous motion choice.":"A animação completa segue os giros do personagem e pode ser intensa. L3 + direcional para baixo volta à escolha de movimento anterior.","Full animation is paused: headset/controller aim or Decoupled Pitch conflicts with animated head turning. Game-view rotation is being used; head position still follows the character.":"A animação completa está pausada: a mira pelo headset/controle ou a inclinação desacoplada entra em conflito com o giro animado da cabeça. A rotação da visão do jogo está sendo usada; a posição da cabeça ainda segue o personagem.","Full animation rotation (experimental)":"Rotação animada completa (experimental)","Full animation: stick override":"Animação: prioridade do analógico","Full frame at 1 fills both axes of the portal rectangle. It stretches the HUD if its proportions differ from the frame. Preserve proportions leaves space on one axis. Safe fit also leaves a margin for rounded/feathered edges. Your separate HUD layout is retained.":"O quadro completo em 1 preenche os dois eixos do retângulo do portal. Ele estica o HUD se as proporções forem diferentes das do quadro. Preservar proporções deixa espaço em um eixo. O ajuste seguro também deixa uma margem para bordas arredondadas/esfumadas. Seu layout de HUD separado é mantido.","Full speed while Polar walk is on":"Velocidade máxima com Polar walk ativo","Full-resolution translucent materials in stereo (candidate)":"Materiais translúcidos em resolução total no estéreo (candidato)","Fully hold both triggers first. R3: click to switch between full VR and the stereo screen, hold 0.8 seconds for mono theatre (hold again to go back); with the triggers still held you can click or hold R3 again. L3: click to turn blur on or off, hold 0.8 seconds for the stereo screen; release all controls before repeating an L3 shortcut. Available during dialogue; close UEVR and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first.":"Segure bem os dois gatilhos primeiro. R3: clique para alternar entre VR completo e a tela estéreo, segure 0,8 segundos para o cinema mono (segure de novo para voltar); com os gatilhos ainda segurados, você pode clicar ou segurar R3 de novo. L3: clique para ligar ou desligar o desfoque, segure 0,8 segundos para a tela estéreo; solte todos os controles antes de repetir um atalho de L3. Disponível durante o diálogo; feche o UEVR e saia do ajuste de HUD/mouse primeiro.","GAME UI HIDDEN - MENUS ARE HIDDEN TOO":"INTERFACE OCULTA - OS MENUS TAMBÉM","GAME UI IS HIDDEN":"INTERFACE OCULTA","GAME UI IS HIDDEN - menus are hidden too":"INTERFACE OCULTA - os menus também estão ocultos","GENERAL":"GERAL","Game / fixed camera":"Câmera normal / fixa","Game camera":"Câmera do jogo","Game camera follows WuWa's own camera and its dialogue camera work. Close-up match brings you nearer in zoomed-in shots, so they frame people like the 2D view does.":"A câmera do jogo segue a câmera original do WuWa e suas transições em diálogos. O ajuste para close-up aproxima a visão em cenas ampliadas, enquadrando os personagens como na visão 2D.","Game camera: WuWa's own camera. Fixed third person: a steady camera behind you. Freecam: fly the camera anywhere, for cutscenes and photos. First person: through your character's eyes. Options for each are on the Camera page.":"Câmera do jogo: usa a câmera original do WuWa. Terceira pessoa fixa: uma câmera estável atrás do personagem. Câmera livre: permite voar livremente para cutscenes e fotos. Primeira pessoa: vista pelos olhos do personagem. As opções para cada uma estão na aba Câmera.","Game focus only":"Apenas foco do jogo","Game lens":"Lente do jogo","Game lens: the stereo screen frames every shot exactly like the 2D view, in 3D. Wide: the fixed 90 degree view used in older versions.":"Lente do jogo: a tela estéreo enquadra cada cena exatamente como na visão 2D, mas em 3D. Amplo: a visão fixa de 90 graus das versões anteriores.","Game-view override shows the game's camera direction while either stick is used, then returns to animation 0.4 seconds after release. Full animation and headset view can still disagree with movement or target selection; aim alignment remains under investigation. These options never rotate or move the character for you.":"A sobreposição da visão do jogo mostra a direção da câmera do jogo enquanto qualquer analógico é usado e volta à animação 0,4 s após soltá-lo. A animação completa e a visão do headset podem discordar do movimento ou da seleção de alvos; o alinhamento da mira ainda está em investigação. Essas opções nunca rotacionam ou movem o personagem por você.","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes.":"Aplica o mesmo enquadramento a ambos os olhos em cenas com barras pretas.","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes. Leave on unless a scene looks cropped.":"Aplica o mesmo enquadramento a ambos os olhos em cenas com barras pretas. Mantenha ativado a menos que a cena pareça cortada.","HUD":"HUD","HUD / MOUSE MODE ON":"MODO HUD / MOUSE ATIVO","HUD / mouse adjustment ON (L3 + LB toggles)":"Ajuste do HUD / mouse ATIVADO (L3 + LB alterna)","HUD / mouse mode":"Modo HUD / mouse","HUD / mouse mode is ON: gameplay buttons are redirected":"Modo HUD / mouse ATIVO: botões de jogo são redirecionados","HUD POSITION":"POSIÇÃO DO HUD","HUD and focus comfort":"Conforto do HUD e do foco","HUD distance":"Distância do HUD","HUD distance (meters)":"Distância do HUD (m)","HUD down / up":"HUD baixo / cima","HUD follows decoupled pitch":"HUD segue inclinação desacoplada","HUD follows your head":"HUD segue a cabeça","HUD height (meters)":"Altura do HUD (m)","HUD in the desktop window":"HUD na janela da área de trabalho","HUD nearer / farther":"HUD mais perto / longe","HUD or menu":"HUD ou menu","HUD placement and visibility":"Posição e visibilidade do HUD","HUD refresh: done. Check the HUD in the headset.":"Atualização do HUD: concluída. Confira o HUD no headset.","HUD refresh: not possible right now. Try again in a moment; the log has the details.":"Atualização do HUD: não é possível agora. Tente de novo em instantes; o log tem os detalhes.","HUD refresh: the HUD already matches this view.":"Atualização do HUD: o HUD já corresponde a esta visão.","HUD refresh: the HUD keeps changing. Open ESC or switch views to try again.":"Atualização do HUD: o HUD não para de mudar. Abra o ESC ou troque de visão para tentar de novo.","HUD refresh: working on it.":"Atualização do HUD: em andamento.","HUD right / left (meters)":"HUD direita / esquerda (m)","HUD shape (full VR)":"Formato do HUD (VR completo)","HUD size":"Tamanho do HUD","HUD up / down (meters)":"HUD cima / baixo (m)","Hand / finger demo (optional)":"Demonstração de mãos/dedos (opcional)","Hand demo is off. Enable it only when you want to try bare-hand tracking.":"A demonstração de mãos está desativada. Ative apenas se quiser testar o rastreamento manual.","Hand tracking returned an error. Switch the demo off and on to retry.":"O rastreamento de mãos retornou um erro. Desative e ative a demonstração para tentar novamente.","Head movement also scales up. Use Recenter if the view feels displaced. Starts off each launch and after reloading settings.":"O movimento da cabeça também é escalado. Use Recentralizar se a visão parecer deslocada. Começa desativado a cada inicialização e após recarregar as configurações.","Headset aim selects Head and sends that direction to the game; the stick still turns. Right-stick pitch selects Game, disables control-rotation override and both pitch locks. Neither changes LB + Y or the selected utility.":"A mira pelo headset seleciona Cabeça e envia essa direção ao jogo; o analógico ainda gira. A inclinação pelo analógico direito seleciona Jogo, desativa a sobreposição de rotação do controle e ambos os bloqueios de inclinação. Nenhuma dessas opções altera LB + Y ou a utilidade selecionada.","Height":"Altura","Hidden":"Oculto","Hidden UI stays quiet during normal gameplay. A recovery notice appears only when the game cursor or a known menu-rendering path indicates a menu. L3 + B restores UI. An unknown menu may not be detected; UEVR settings always retain the Show game UI button.":"A interface oculta permanece silenciosa durante o jogo normal. Um aviso de recuperação aparece apenas quando o cursor do jogo ou um caminho conhecido de renderização de menu indica um menu. Use L3 + B para restaurar a interface. Um menu desconhecido pode não ser detectado; as configurações do UEVR sempre mantêm o botão Mostrar interface do jogo.","Hide Kuro material reflections (workaround candidate)":"Ocultar reflexos de materiais da Kuro (solução temporária)","Hide body":"Ocultar corpo","Hide body in first person":"Ocultar corpo em primeira pessoa","Hide body, keep shadow":"Ocultar corpo, manter sombra","Hide body; keep original shadows":"Ocultar corpo; manter sombras originais","Hide character rim lighting (optional workaround)":"Ocultar iluminação de contorno do personagem (solução temporária)","Hide characters at your eyes":"Ocultar personagens nos seus olhos","Hide characters at your eyes on / off":"Ocultar personagens nos seus olhos ligar / desligar","Hide head":"Ocultar cabeça","Hide head bones keeps the visible body, but also removes the head from its shadow. Hide body; keep full character shadow requests hidden shadows only from the game's original visible shadow casters; it does not enable unused wings or effect rigs. Shadow support depends on the character/material.":"Ocultar ossos da cabeça mantém o corpo visível, mas também remove a cabeça de sua sombra. Ocultar corpo; manter sombra completa do personagem solicita sombras ocultas apenas dos emissores de sombra visíveis originais do jogo; isso não ativa asas ou rigs de efeitos não usados. O suporte a sombras depende do personagem/material.","Hide head bones; full shadow copy":"Ocultar cabeça; cópia da sombra completa","Hide head bones; keep body":"Ocultar ossos da cabeça; manter corpo","Hide head, full shadow":"Ocultar cabeça, sombra completa","Hide player IDs":"Ocultar IDs dos jogadores","Hides the captured HUD and menus together. UEVR settings stay available; individual HUD elements cannot yet be moved separately.":"Oculta o HUD capturado e os menus juntos. As configurações do UEVR permanecem disponíveis; elementos individuais do HUD ainda não podem ser movidos separadamente.","Hiding off":"Ocultar desligado","Hiding on":"Ocultar ligado","Higher follows the game camera more closely.":"Maior valor faz com que siga a câmera do jogo mais de perto.","Hint %d of %d. It then switches off; View hints on the WuWa VR menu's HUD page turns it back on.":"Dica %d de %d. Depois ela se desliga; Dicas de visão, na página HUD do menu do WuWa VR, a liga de novo.","Hold L3, or LT + RT, for half a second: a card rises under your view and shows what each button does, lighting each one as you press it. Let go and it sinks away.":"Segure L3 ou LT + RT por meio segundo: um cartão aparece abaixo da sua visão mostrando a função de cada botão, iluminando-os conforme você pressiona. Ao soltar, ele desaparece.","Hold L3, or both triggers, for half a second: a card rises under your view and lights each button as you use it. Let go and it sinks away. L3 + Menu keeps it open. Close UEVR settings to see it; it is absent from the game's flat spectator view.":"Segure L3 ou ambos os gatilhos por meio segundo: um cartão aparece abaixo da sua visão e ilumina cada botão conforme você o usa. Ao soltar, ele desaparece. L3 + Menu mantém o cartão aberto. Feche as configurações do UEVR para vê-lo; ele não aparece na visão plana de espectador do jogo.","Hold L3, then fully squeeze LT for the portal or RT for diorama. Keep the other trigger released; release all controls before repeating. Close UEVR and game menus and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first. Physical gamepad passthrough bypasses these shortcuts.":"Segure L3 e aperte LT por completo para o portal ou RT para o diorama. Mantenha o outro gatilho solto; solte todos os controles antes de repetir. Feche os menus do UEVR e do jogo e saia do ajuste de HUD/mouse primeiro. O passthrough do controle físico ignora esses atalhos.","Hold L3: controls card":"Segure L3: cartão de controles","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for full VR / stereo screen (hold: mono theatre on / off), click L3 for blur on / off (hold: stereo screen), press Y to hide characters at your eyes. With the triggers held, R3 can be clicked again.":"Segure LT + RT: clique R3 para VR completo / tela estéreo (segurar: cinema mono liga / desliga), clique L3 para ligar / desligar o desfoque (segurar: tela estéreo), aperte Y para ocultar personagens nos seus olhos. Com os gatilhos segurados, R3 pode ser clicado de novo.","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for the next view (full VR, stereo screen, mono), hold R3 for full VR; hold L3 for 0.8 s to toggle the screen. Screen off also exits mono. Mono keeps flat menu backgrounds and controls together.":"Segure LT + RT: clique R3 para a próxima visão (VR total, tela estéreo, mono), segure R3 para VR total; segure L3 por 0,8 s para alternar a tela. Desligar a tela também sai do mono. O mono mantém os fundos planos do menu e os controles juntos.","Hold LT + RT: views card":"Segure LT + RT: cartão de visões","Hold RB":"Segure RB","Hold RB: full speed if Polar walk is on":"Segure RB: velocidade máxima se o Polar walk estiver ativo","Hold {L3} for everything else":"Segure {L3} para todo o resto","Hold {L3}, then press":"Segure {L3}, depois pressione","Hold {LT}+{RT} for views":"Segure {LT}+{RT} para as visões","Hold {LT}+{RT}, then":"Segure {LT}+{RT}, depois","Hold: mono theatre on / off":"Segurar: cinema mono liga / desliga","Horizon level removes the game's camera pitch from the VR view. Turn it off for right-stick up/down look, and disable UEVR's Decoupled Pitch below. Head aiming is an alternative; grapple selection still needs game testing.":"O nivelamento do horizonte remove a inclinação da câmera do jogo da visão VR. Desligue-o para olhar para cima/baixo com o analógico direito e desative o Desacoplar inclinação do UEVR abaixo. A mira com a cabeça é uma alternativa; a seleção de grapple ainda precisa de testes no jogo.","Hover drone":"Drone suspenso","Hover drone (inertia)":"Drone suspenso (inércia)","Hover drone: left stick moves horizontally, right stick looks, LT rises, LB descends, RT boosts. Release the stick to settle into a hover.":"Drone suspenso: o analógico esquerdo move na horizontal, o direito olha, LT sobe, LB desce, RT dá impulso. Solte o analógico para estabilizar em suspensão.","How big the world feels. Above 1 makes you smaller. Diorama uses its own scale and leaves this alone.":"O quão grande o mundo parece. Acima de 1 deixa você menor. O diorama usa a própria escala e não mexe nisso.","How far above or below your character's eyes your view sits. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"Quanto acima ou abaixo dos olhos do seu personagem fica a sua visão. No jogo: segure L3 e aperte Y / X; L3 + Y + X juntos voltam ao padrão.","How far away the HUD sits. Its stereo depth follows this distance.":"A que distância o HUD fica. Sua profundidade estéreo acompanha essa distância.","How far away the card is.":"A distância do cartão.","How far away this menu floats. UEVR's classic window uses the same distance.":"A que distância este menu flutua. A janela clássica do UEVR usa a mesma distância.","How far behind your character the camera stays, in game units (centimetres).":"A que distância atrás do personagem a câmera fica, em unidades do jogo (centímetros).","How fast the freecam moves.":"A velocidade de movimento da câmera livre.","How fast the freecam turns.":"A velocidade de giro da câmera livre.","How high above your character the camera sits, in game units. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"A altura da câmera acima do seu personagem, em unidades do jogo. No jogo: segure L3 e aperte Y / X; L3 + Y + X juntos voltam ao padrão.","How large the game's HUD and menus appear.":"O tamanho com que o HUD e os menus do jogo aparecem.","How large the game's HUD and menus appear. More HUD options are on the HUD page.":"O tamanho com que o HUD e os menus do jogo aparecem. Mais opções de HUD estão na página do HUD.","How much of its layer this menu fills. Smaller also reads as further away.":"Quanto da sua camada este menu preenche. Menor também parece mais distante.","How near Close-up match may bring you to the person in the shot. Lower comes closer. Close-up match at 100 already gives the 2D size; this only stops it short when the shot is very tight.":"O quão perto o Close-up match pode te aproximar da pessoa na cena. Valores menores aproximam mais. Close-up match em 100 já dá o tamanho 2D; isto só o limita quando o enquadramento é muito fechado.","How small the world gets in diorama. 10x is an action-figure view. The diorama has its own camera distance (Camera page).":"Quanto o mundo encolhe no diorama. 10x é uma visão de boneco de ação. O diorama tem sua própria distância de câmera (página Câmera).","How strong the 3D is on the stereo screen. 1x matches the headset's eye distance to the lens; 0 is flat.":"A intensidade do 3D na tela estéreo. 1x corresponde à distância entre os olhos e a lente do headset; 0 é plano.","How to use view toggles":"Como usar as trocas de visão","How wide the controls card is.":"A largura do cartão de controles.","I understand that untested checks remain Not tested":"Entendo que verificações não testadas permanecem como Não testado","INSERT  =  OPEN UEVR":"INSERT = ABRIR UEVR","INSERT > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"INSERT > WuWa Controls > Mostrar interface do jogo","Idle":"Inativo","Ignore motion input while OpenXR is unfocused (test)":"Ignorar entrada de movimento quando o OpenXR está sem foco (teste)","Ignores the game camera's up / down tilt, so only your head looks up and down. Steadier, and worth trying in gravity-flip areas such as Avinoleum.":"Ignora a inclinação para cima / baixo da câmera do jogo, então só a sua cabeça olha para cima e para baixo. Mais estável, e vale a pena testar em áreas de gravidade invertida, como Avinoleum.","Immersive VR":"VR imersivo","In full VR the game lays out its HUD for a 4:3 screen, which then looks squashed; 1.33 undoes that. Raise it if round icons still look like flat ovals. The stereo screen and mono theatre always keep the game's own shape.":"No VR total o jogo organiza o HUD para uma tela 4:3, que então parece achatada; 1.33 desfaz isso. Aumente se os ícones redondos ainda parecerem ovais achatados. A tela estéreo e o teatro mono sempre mantêm o formato original do jogo.","In story and dialogue shots, hold L3 and press Y to move nearer or X to move back; L3 + Y + X goes back to the game's spot. Keyboard: Page Up, Page Down and Home. It moves along the game camera's view and keeps following the shot's own camera moves. Game camera in full VR only.":"Em cenas de história e diálogo, segure L3 e aperte Y para se aproximar ou X para recuar; L3 + Y + X volta à posição do jogo. Teclado: Page Up, Page Down e Home. Move-se ao longo da visão da câmera do jogo e continua seguindo os movimentos de câmera da própria cena. Somente câmera do jogo em VR completo.","In story close-ups nothing nearer than this is drawn. It slices characters and props open, so it is off by default (10 cm, the game's own value); Hide characters at your eyes is the cleaner fix. Game camera in full VR only.":"Nos closes da história, nada mais perto que isto é desenhado. Isso corta personagens e objetos ao meio, por isso fica desligado por padrão (10 cm, o valor do próprio jogo); Ocultar personagens nos seus olhos é a solução mais limpa. Só na câmera do jogo em VR total.","In story close-ups, a character right at your eyes but outside the flat shot (VR shows more around it) is hidden whole while it is there. Anyone the flat shot shows stays. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then press Y.":"Nos closes da história, um personagem colado nos seus olhos, mas fora do enquadramento plano (o VR mostra mais ao redor), fica oculto por inteiro enquanto estiver ali. Quem aparece no enquadramento plano continua. Atalho: segure LT + RT e aperte Y.","Include camera and controller data":"Incluir dados da câmera e do controle","Input candidates start off. Their effect on WuWa's intermittent combinations is not confirmed.":"As entradas candidatas começam desligadas. Seu efeito nas combinações intermitentes do WuWa não está confirmado.","Input still pauses when WuWa loses focus. Real game menus temporarily restore the game camera and character visibility.":"A entrada ainda pausa quando o WuWa perde o foco. Menus reais do jogo restauram temporariamente a câmera do jogo e a visibilidade do personagem.","Invalid profile value: ":"Valor de perfil inválido: ","Invert acro pitch stick":"Inverter arfagem acro","Joint inspector (left-eye preview)":"Inspetor de juntas (prévia do olho esquerdo)","Just mark the moment":"Só marcar o momento","Keep WuWa VR Launcher running to record from here. Its browser tab can be closed.":"Mantenha o WuWa VR Launcher aberto para gravar daqui. A aba do navegador pode ser fechada.","Keep both triggers held to click or hold R3 again.":"Mantenha os dois gatilhos segurados para clicar ou segurar R3 de novo.","Keep camera and head hiding during Alt-Tab / UEVR settings":"Manter a câmera e o ocultamento da cabeça durante Alt-Tab / ajustes do UEVR","Keep current view":"Manter a visão atual","Keep entire character visible":"Mostrar personagem inteiro","Keep first person horizon level (Custom)":"Manter nível do horizonte em primeira pessoa (Personalizado)","Keep matched far-object detail (recommended)":"Manter nível de detalhe igual para objetos distantes (recomendado)","Keep stereo camera transitions together":"Manter transições da câmera estéreo juntas","Keep the controls card open":"Manter o card de controles aberto","Keep the mouse in the game window":"Manter o mouse na janela do jogo","Keep the nudge":"Manter o ajuste","Keep this card open":"Manter este card aberto","Keeps distant trees and props on the same level of detail in both eyes. This is the normal foliage repair; legacy comparison tests are separate.":"Mantém árvores e objetos distantes com o mesmo nível de detalhe em ambos os olhos. Esta é a correção normal da vegetação; testes legados de comparação são separados.","Keeps the HUD where you expect it while decoupled pitch is on.":"Mantém o HUD no local esperado enquanto a inclinação desacoplada estiver ativada.","Keeps the horizon level in first person. Custom motion only.":"Mantém o nível do horizonte em primeira pessoa. Apenas movimento personalizado.","Kuro character materials in both eyes (candidate)":"Materiais dos personagens da Kuro em ambos os olhos (candidato)","L grip":"Gatilho lateral L","L stick":"Analógico esquerdo","L trigger":"Gatilho L","L3 + A":"L3 + A","L3 + A     Recenter view / portal":"L3 + A     Recentralizar visão / portal","L3 + A also resets headset position (seated)":"L3 + A também redefine a posição do headset (sentado)","L3 + A resets position too":"L3 + A também redefine a posição","L3 + B":"L3 + B","L3 + B     Show / hide game UI":"L3 + B     Mostrar / ocultar interface","L3 + B  =  SHOW UI":"L3 + B = MOSTRAR INTERFACE","L3 + D-pad Down":"L3 + direcional para baixo","L3 + D-pad Down toggles full animation follow and your previous first-person motion. Custom keeps your saved settings. The other choices sample the head after animation. Animated position preserves normal stick aiming. Full animation follows character turns and bone rotation; it can be intense.":"L3 + Direcional para baixo alterna entre seguir animação completa e o movimento anterior em primeira pessoa. Personalizado mantém suas configurações salvas. As outras opções capturam a cabeça após a animação. Posição animada preserva a mira normal pelo analógico. A animação completa segue giros e rotação óssea do personagem; pode ser intenso.","L3 + D-pad Down: animation follow on / off (first person)":"L3 + Direcional para baixo: seguir animação ligar / desligar (primeira pessoa)","L3 + LB    Return to normal game controls":"L3 + LB    Voltar aos controles normais do jogo","L3 + LB    Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"L3 + LB    Alternar ajuste do HUD / mouse","L3 + LB  =  RETURN TO GAME CONTROLS":"L3 + LB = VOLTAR AO JOGO","L3 + LB exits manual adjustment. Release all controls afterwards.":"L3 + LB sai do ajuste manual. Solte todos os controles após isso.","L3 + LB, release":"L3 + LB, soltar","L3 + LT / F7":"L3 + LT / F7","L3 + LT / F7   Portal on / off":"L3 + LT / F7   Portal ligar / desligar","L3 + Menu":"L3 + Menu","L3 + Menu  Keep the controls card open":"L3 + Menu  Manter o card de controles aberto","L3 + R3":"L3 + R3","L3 + R3    WuWa VR menu":"L3 + R3    Menu do WuWa VR","L3 + RB":"L3 + RB","L3 + RB    Game / fixed camera":"L3 + RB    Câmera normal / fixa","L3 + RT":"L3 + RT","L3 + RT    Diorama on / off":"L3 + RT    Diorama ligar / desligar","L3 + View":"L3 + View","L3 + View  First person on / off":"L3 + View  Primeira pessoa ligar / desligar","L3 + View toggles first person. These settings apply when first person is active.":"L3 + View alterna entre primeira pessoa. Essas configurações se aplicam quando a primeira pessoa estiver ativa.","L3 + Y / X":"L3 + Y / X","L3 + Y/X   Height; in story: nearer / back":"L3 + Y/X   Altura; na história: aproximar / recuar","L3 means click and hold the left stick, then press B.":"Segure o clique do analógico esquerdo (L3) e aperte B.","LB + LT/RT Fixed camera farther / closer":"LB + LT/RT Câmera fixa: afastar / aproximar","LB + R3 utility shortcut remains available outside adjustment":"O atalho utilitário LB + R3 continua disponível fora do ajuste","LB + R3: V once; hold 0.8 s for Tab wheel":"LB + R3: V uma vez; segure 0,8 s para a roda Tab","LB/RB      HUD down / up":"LB/RB      HUD baixo / cima","LT + RT, L3: blur (hold: stereo screen)":"LT + RT, L3: desfoque (segure: tela estéreo)","LT + RT, R3: full VR / stereo (hold: mono)":"LT + RT, R3: VR completo / estéreo (segure: mono)","LT + RT, then Y":"LT + RT, depois Y","LT + RT, then click L3":"LT + RT, depois clique em L3","LT + RT, then click R3":"LT + RT, depois clique em R3","LT + RT, then hold L3":"LT + RT, depois segure L3","LT + RT, then hold R3":"LT + RT, depois segure R3","LT/RT      HUD nearer / farther":"LT/RT      HUD mais perto / longe","Language":"Idioma","Language / WuWa":"Idioma / WuWa","Larger menu following view":"Menu maior que segue a visão","Laser asleep: move the left controller or press a VR button.":"Laser em repouso: mova o controle esquerdo ou aperte um botão de VR.","Laser asleep: move the right controller or press a VR button.":"Laser em repouso: mova o controle direito ou aperte um botão de VR.","Laser on: point the left controller and pull its trigger.":"Laser ligado: aponte com o controle esquerdo e puxe o gatilho dele.","Laser on: point the right controller and pull its trigger.":"Laser ligado: aponte com o controle direito e puxe o gatilho dele.","Laser: no VR controllers found.":"Laser: nenhum controle de VR encontrado.","Last run: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"Última corrida: %s, andando %s, %.2f km no jogo.","Last used wins":"O último usado prevalece","Launch settings include any custom settings saved before starting this game. Supplied profile controls are the build's original choices, not UEVR factory defaults.":"Os ajustes de inicialização incluem quaisquer ajustes personalizados salvos antes de iniciar este jogo. Os controles fornecidos pelo perfil são as escolhas originais da versão, não os padrões de fábrica do UEVR.","Launch settings restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"Ajustes de inicialização restaurados. Solte todos os controles antes de continuar.","Leave first person":"Sair da primeira pessoa","Leave freecam":"Sair da câmera livre","Left":"Esquerda","Left / right":"Esquerda / direita","Left / right moves between steps without answering. Your answers stay saved.":"Esquerda / direita navega entre as etapas sem respondê-las. Suas respostas ficam salvas.","Left / right picks the kind of problem.":"Esquerda / direita escolhe o tipo de problema.","Left / right stick":"Analógico esquerdo / direito","Left stick":"Analógico esquerdo","Left stick Cursor    A Click    B Back":"Analógico esquerdo Cursor    A Clicar    B Voltar","Left stick Y (Mode 2)":"Eixo Y esquerdo (Modo 2)","Legacy automatic mouse can intercept game menu buttons. Manual L3 + LB adjustment remains the normal choice.":"O mouse automático legado pode interceptar os botões do menu do jogo. O ajuste manual L3 + LB continua sendo a escolha normal.","Legacy pitch-only override is active; choose either option above to replace it.":"A substituição legada apenas de arfagem está ativa; escolha uma das opções acima para substituí-la.","Legacy stereo comparison bench (60-second tests)":"Banco de comparação estéreo legado (testes de 60 segundos)","Level horizon":"Nivelar horizonte","Link latest recording":"Vincular gravação mais recente","Linking saves the recording ID only. Review the video and add precise timestamps in the launcher.":"Vincular salva apenas o ID da gravação. Revise o vídeo e adicione timestamps precisos no inicializador.","Live input tests. Change one option, close this menu, then repeat the same action.":"Testes de entrada ao vivo. Altere uma opção, feche este menu e repita a mesma ação.","Local controller and camera data only, about 30 samples/sec. The clean-video recorder starts this automatically. It never presses buttons. Video/sidecar alignment uses timestamps, not a claim of GPU-frame synchronization.":"Apenas dados locais de controle e câmera, cerca de 30 amostras/s. O gravador de vídeo limpo inicia isso automaticamente. Ele nunca pressiona botões. O alinhamento vídeo/dados de movimento usa timestamps, não uma alegação de sincronização de quadros da GPU.","Looks wrong? Hold LT + RT, then click R3 for the stereo screen (hold R3: mono).":"Parece errado? Segure LT + RT, depois clique em R3 para a tela estéreo (segure R3: mono).","Low":"Embaixo","Lower eye level by 5":"Baixar olhos em 5","Manual override; waiting for this scene to end":"Controle manual; aguardando o fim desta cena","Mark this moment":"Marcar este momento","Match cinematic framing":"Igualar enquadramento cinematográfico","Match cinematic framing between eyes (default on)":"Igualar enquadramento cinematográfico entre os olhos (ativado por padrão)","Match far detail between eyes":"Igualar detalhes distantes entre os olhos","Maximum pixels per eye":"Largura máxima por olho em pixels","Maximum thrust / weight":"Empuxo / peso máximo","Menu":"Menu","Menu distance":"Distância do menu","Menu left / right":"Menu esquerda / direita","Menu place":"Posição do menu","Menu size":"Tamanho do menu","Menu up / down":"Menu cima / baixo","Miniature world (this launch only)":"Mundo em miniatura (apenas nesta sessão)","Mode 2: centered left stick means 50%% throttle. An Xbox stick springs back to center; hold it down for zero throttle.":"Modo 2: o analógico esquerdo centralizado significa 50%% de aceleração. O analógico do Xbox volta ao centro; mantenha-o pressionado para aceleração zero.","Mono preserves your saved stereo-screen choice; screen off exits both screen modes. Neither changes portal or normal world scale. Manual toggles take priority over automatic cinema for the current scene.":"O modo mono preserva a tela estéreo salva; ao desativá-la, ambos os modos são encerrados. Não altera o portal nem a escala normal do mundo. Os atalhos manuais têm prioridade sobre o cinema automático na cena atual.","Mono shows the same scene and HUD to both eyes. Use it for troublesome cutscenes or flat menus.":"O modo mono exibe a mesma cena e o HUD para ambos os olhos. Use-o em cutscenes problemáticas ou menus planos.","Mono theatre":"Cinema mono","Mono theatre (flat 2D)":"Cinema mono (2D plano)","Mono theatre (no stereo)":"Cinema mono (sem estéreo)","Mono theatre on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"Cinema mono liga / desliga (segure 0,8 s)","Motion":"Movimento","Move cursor":"Mover cursor","Move map":"Mover mapa","Move menu":"Mover menu","Moves supported menus into the VR panel, including with Native Stereo Fix on. The supplied profile enables this. Some flat backgrounds still move separately; mono theatre is the manual fallback.":"Move os menus compatíveis para o painel VR, mesmo com o Native Stereo Fix ativado. O perfil fornecido já habilita isso. Alguns planos de fundo planos ainda se movem separadamente; o cinema mono é a alternativa manual.","Moves the HUD sideways.":"Move o HUD lateralmente.","Moves the HUD up or down.":"Move o HUD para cima ou para baixo.","Moves your diorama viewpoint sideways.":"Move seu ponto de vista do diorama para os lados.","Moves your diorama viewpoint up, to look down on the miniature, or down.":"Sobe seu ponto de vista do diorama para olhar a miniatura de cima, ou o desce.","Moves your viewpoint forward from the game camera. Forward brings dialogue close-ups nearer, closer to how the 2D shot frames them. Applies in normal play too.":"Move seu ponto de vista para frente em relação à câmera do jogo. Isso aproxima os close-ups de diálogo, mais próximos do enquadramento em 2D. Também se aplica ao jogo normal.","Moves your viewpoint sideways from the game camera.":"Move seu ponto de vista lateralmente em relação à câmera do jogo.","Moves your viewpoint up or down from the game camera.":"Move seu ponto de vista para cima ou para baixo em relação à câmera do jogo.","Moving the menu: point where you want it, thumbstick up / down for distance, then pull the trigger.":"Movendo o menu: aponte onde quiser, analógico para cima / baixo para a distância, depois puxe o gatilho.","Moving the menu: stick, D-pad or arrow keys. Right stick or Page Up / Down: distance. A or Enter: put it down.":"Movendo o menu: analógico, direcional ou setas. Analógico direito ou Page Up / Down: distância. A ou Enter: soltar.","Multiplies the blur in full VR. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"Multiplica o desfoque no modo VR completo. 1x é o visual da visão 2D.","Multiplies the blur on the stereo screen and mono theatre. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"Multiplica o desfoque na tela estéreo e no cinema mono. 1x é o visual da visão 2D.","NOT SAVING":"SEM SALVAR","Native Stereo":"Native Stereo","Native Stereo Fix frame timing (experimental)":"Sincronização de quadros do Native Stereo Fix (experimental)","Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix":"Native Stereo com Native Stereo Fix","Native game camera active (headset check pending)":"Câmera nativa do jogo ativa (verificação no headset pendente)","Native game camera unavailable; compatibility fallback":"Câmera nativa do jogo indisponível; modo de compatibilidade","Navigate / activate / back":"Navegar / ativar / voltar","Near clip in close-ups":"Recorte próximo em closes","New:":"Novo:","No active playtest connection. Keep the launcher running and open Developer playtests to start or resume a session.":"Nenhuma conexão de playtest ativa. Mantenha o launcher em execução e abra os testes de desenvolvedor para iniciar ou retomar uma sessão.","No run yet. Start one here, or open Reality Runner and walk.":"Nenhuma corrida ainda. Comece uma aqui, ou abra o Reality Runner e ande.","No supported direct PlayStation controller detected":"Nenhum controle PlayStation compatível detectado","Normal scale: %.3fx. Your saved scale and camera presets stay unchanged; intentional scale edits become the new normal value.":"Escala normal: %.3fx. Sua escala salva e predefinições de câmera permanecem inalteradas; edições intencionais da escala se tornam o novo valor normal.","Not saved: %s":"Não salvo: %s","Not tested":"Não testado","Note when someone is at your eyes":"Aviso quando alguém está nos seus olhos","Now: %s":"Agora: %s","Observation":"Observação","Off":"Desativado","Off: UEVR opens its classic window, as before. You can turn this menu back on under VR > WuWa Controls.":"Desativado: o UEVR abre sua janela clássica, como antes. Você pode reativar este menu em VR > Controles WuWa.","On":"Ativado","On by default. Detected story videos use mono; story pictures and story scenes use your choices above. Manual view changes take priority.":"Ativado por padrão. Vídeos da história detectados usam mono; imagens e cenas da história usam suas escolhas acima. Mudanças manuais de visão têm prioridade.","On by default: both eyes render with a symmetric view, so its shading matches on rocks, hills and roofs. Off is a little faster.":"Ligada por padrão: os dois olhos são renderizados com uma visão simétrica, então o sombreamento coincide em rochas, colinas e telhados. Desligada é um pouco mais rápido.","On uses our LGUI capture. Off shows the game's original HUD in the eye images. This does not hide the UEVR settings panel.":"Ativado: usa nossa captura LGUI. Desativado: mostra o HUD original do jogo nas imagens dos olhos. Isso não oculta o painel de configurações do UEVR.","On: full VR lays out the HUD and menus like the flat game (16:9): round icons, story pictures whole, and the mouse hits what it points at. Off: 1.2.2's taller layout, where the Terminal fits on one page and the character screen's floor reflection keeps updating, but icons look flatter (HUD shape) and the mouse can miss.":"Ativado: o VR completo organiza o HUD e os menus como no jogo plano (16:9): ícones redondos, imagens da história inteiras e o mouse acerta onde aponta. Desativado: o layout mais alto da 1.2.2, em que o Terminal cabe em uma página e o reflexo do chão na tela de personagens continua atualizando, mas os ícones parecem mais achatados (formato do HUD) e o mouse pode errar.","On: the HUD stays in front of your eyes. Off: it stays put in the world and you look at it.":"Ativado: o HUD permanece à sua frente. Desativado: ele permanece fixo no mundo e você olha para ele.","On: while the game is in front, the mouse stops at the window's edges, as in the flat game, so it cannot slip onto another monitor. Alt-Tab frees it. Off: the mouse moves freely between monitors.":"Ativado: enquanto o jogo está em primeiro plano, o mouse para nas bordas da janela, como no jogo plano, e não escapa para outro monitor. Alt-Tab o libera. Desativado: o mouse se move livremente entre os monitores.","On: your settings are saved whenever this menu opens or closes. Off: try things freely; nothing is saved, and the game starts with your saved settings next time. Turning it back on saves what you have now. For each setting, the help at the bottom says whether it is saved and what its default is.":"Ativado: suas configurações são salvas sempre que este menu abre ou fecha. Desativado: experimente à vontade; nada é salvo, e o jogo começa na próxima vez com suas configurações salvas. Ativar de novo salva o que você tem agora. Em cada configuração, a ajuda na parte de baixo diz se ela é salva e qual é o padrão.","Only in first person and the fixed camera":"Só em primeira pessoa e na câmera fixa","Only slot 0":"Apenas slot 0","Only slot 1":"Apenas slot 1","Only slot 2":"Apenas slot 2","Only slot 3":"Apenas slot 3","Only the VR controllers work while on; the Xbox pad on this slot is ignored until you turn them off.":"Apenas os controles VR funcionam quando ativado; o controle Xbox neste slot é ignorado até ser desativado.","Open / close the WuWa VR menu":"Abrir / fechar o menu WuWa VR","Open the WuWa VR menu instead of this window":"Abrir o menu WuWa VR em vez desta janela","Opens UEVR's full settings window. Every setting here edits the same values.":"Abre a janela completa de configurações do UEVR. Todas as configurações aqui editam os mesmos valores.","Optical joint data received. Headset alignment and comfort still need a physical check.":"Dados de articulação óptica recebidos. O alinhamento e o conforto do headset ainda precisam de uma verificação física.","Optional experiments and diagnostics":"Experimentos e diagnóstico","Optional workaround, off by default. Removes toon-depth rim lighting from all characters using it, including nearby characters. This hides the observed extra eye contour; it does not repair the underlying stereo cause. Restores the prior value when disabled, in 2D screen mode, or when native VR is inactive.":"Solução alternativa opcional, desativada por padrão. Remove a iluminação de contorno de profundidade toon de todos os personagens que a usam, incluindo personagens próximos. Isso oculta o contorno extra observado nos olhos; não corrige a causa estereoscópica subjacente. Restaura o valor anterior quando desativada, no modo tela 2D ou quando o VR nativo está inativo.","Or hold the left Menu button for 1 second to turn them on or off; a buzz confirms. A quick press is still Start. Controllers without a Menu button (such as Index): while off, hold both stick clicks for 1 second to turn them on.":"Ou segure o botão Menu esquerdo por 1 segundo para ligar ou desligar; uma vibração confirma. Um toque rápido ainda é Start. Controles sem botão Menu (como o Index): quando desligados, segure os dois cliques dos analógicos por 1 segundo para ligá-los.","Or: UEVR > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"Ou: UEVR > WuWa Controls > Mostrar interface do jogo","Pass":"Passar","Paused in the diorama":"Pausado no diorama","Paused: game camera in full VR only":"Pausado: só a câmera do jogo no VR completo","Physical gamepad passthrough (test)":"Passthrough de controle físico (teste)","Pick what went wrong and save. The time, the video position and your settings go into the wuwa-reports folder of the UEVR profile. Share it together with the video.":"Escolha o que deu errado e salve. O horário, a posição no vídeo e suas configurações vão para a pasta wuwa-reports do perfil UEVR. Compartilhe junto com o vídeo.","Picture size":"Tamanho da imagem","Pinned":"Fixado","Pitch / roll rate (degrees / second)":"Taxa de arfagem / rolagem (graus / segundo)","Pixels per eye compared with what your headset asks for. Lower is smoother in full VR. It changes after a moment.":"Pixels por olho em comparação com o que seu headset pede. Menor é mais fluido no VR completo. Muda depois de um instante.","Plan finished. Thank you!":"Plano concluído. Obrigado!","Plan finished. Your answers are saved for Claude in wuwa-steps / results.jsonl.":"Plano concluído. Suas respostas são salvas para o Claude em wuwa-steps / results.jsonl.","Plane":"Avião","Plane FPV":"Avião FPV","Plane cruise speed (game units / second)":"Velocidade de cruzeiro do avião (unidades do jogo / segundo)","Plane: right stick pitches/banks, left stick X steers yaw. RT increases cruise speed, LT decreases it. Hold LB to brake, RB to boost. Double R3 exits. Cruise pauses when focus or controller samples are lost; release controls then move a stick to rearm after Alt-Tab.":"Avião: o analógico direito inclina/curva, o X do analógico esquerdo controla a guinada. RT aumenta a velocidade de cruzeiro, LT diminui. Segure LB para frear, RB para acelerar. Dois cliques em R3 saem. O cruzeiro pausa quando o foco ou as amostras do controle se perdem; solte os controles e mova um analógico para reativar após Alt-Tab.","PlayStation connected; waiting for input reports and release":"PlayStation conectado; aguardando relatórios de entrada e liberação","PlayStation disconnected; waiting to reconnect":"PlayStation desconectado; aguardando reconexão","PlayStation input is unavailable or held exclusively; use Steam Input if available":"A entrada do PlayStation não está disponível ou está em uso exclusivo; use o Steam Input se disponível","PlayStation input received":"Entrada do PlayStation recebida","PlayStation reader has not started":"O leitor do PlayStation não foi iniciado","PlayStation reader stopped; use Steam Input if available":"Leitor do PlayStation parado; use o Steam Input se disponível","PlayStation reader unavailable":"Leitor do PlayStation indisponível","PlayStation reader unavailable: cannot retain backend module":"Leitor do PlayStation indisponível: não é possível manter o módulo de backend","PlayStation reports stopped; release controls after reconnecting":"Relatórios do PlayStation pararam; solte os controles após reconectar","PlayStation shortcuts paused: WuWa shortcuts disabled":"Atalhos do PlayStation pausados: atalhos do WuWa desativados","PlayStation shortcuts paused: an XInput slot is selected":"Atalhos do PlayStation pausados: um slot XInput está selecionado","PlayStation shortcuts paused: controller passthrough enabled":"Atalhos do PlayStation pausados: passthrough do controle ativado","PlayStation: L1/R1 = LB/RB, L2/R2 = LT/RT, Cross/Circle/Square/Triangle = A/B/X/Y, Share/Create = View, Options = Menu.":"PlayStation: L1/R1 = LB/RB, L2/R2 = LT/RT, Xis/Círculo/Quadrado/Triângulo = A/B/X/Y, Share/Create = View, Options = Menu.","Playtest launcher connection changed. Check whether the previous action was saved.":"A conexão com o launcher de teste mudou. Verifique se a ação anterior foi salva.","Playtest launcher is not connected.":"O launcher de teste não está conectado.","Playtest launcher status is stale or belongs to another game.":"O status do launcher de teste está desatualizado ou pertence a outro jogo.","Playtest request was not acknowledged. Check the launcher before repeating it.":"A solicitação de teste não foi confirmada. Verifique o launcher antes de repeti-la.","Point and pull the trigger, or click. Scroll to see more.":"Aponte e puxe o gatilho, ou clique. Role para ver mais.","Point with a controller and pull the trigger to put it down. Or use a stick, the D-pad, the arrow keys or WASD, and the right stick or Page Up / Down for distance; A, Enter or B puts it down. Gamepad shortcut: Y. Keyboard: M. Mouse: drag with the right button at any time.":"Aponte com um controle e puxe o gatilho para posicioná-lo. Ou use um analógico, o Direcional, as setas ou WASD, e o analógico direito ou Page Up / Down para a distância; A, Enter ou B o posicionam. Atalho do controle: Y. Teclado: M. Mouse: arraste com o botão direito a qualquer momento.","Polar fly":"Voo polar","Polar fly: left stick moves along view, right stick looks. LT rises, LB descends; RT boosts, double RT gives turbo.":"Polar fly: o analógico esquerdo move na direção da visão, o direito olha. LT sobe, LB desce; RT acelera, dois cliques em RT dão turbo.","Polar fly: simple flying. Hover drone: floats and drifts to a stop. Plane: always moves forward. Acro drone: full manual control.":"Polar fly: voo simples. Drone suspenso: flutua e desliza até parar. Avião: sempre avança. Drone acro: controle totalmente manual.","Polar shortcuts are disabled or bypassed.":"Os atalhos do Polar estão desativados ou ignorados.","Portal HUD sizing":"Tamanho do HUD do portal","Portal is off: using your separate HUD layout until it is enabled.":"Portal desligado: usando seu layout de HUD separado até que seja ativado.","Portal on / off":"Portal ligar / desligar","Portal window":"Janela do portal","Post-process block ambiguous":"Bloco de pós-processamento ambíguo","Post-process block not found in the view (try again outside a story scene)":"Bloco de pós-processamento não encontrado na visão (tente fora de uma cena da história)","PostProcessSettings not found":"PostProcessSettings não encontrado","Preserve proportions at frame edges":"Preservar proporções","Preserves both deactivation and keyboard focus events, including while this overlay is open. It applies to future events: after enabling, Alt-Tab away and back once. It does not bring the game to the foreground automatically.":"Preserva tanto os eventos de desativação quanto os de foco do teclado, inclusive enquanto esta sobreposição está aberta. Aplica-se a eventos futuros: após ativar, saia e volte uma vez com Alt-Tab. Não traz o jogo para o primeiro plano automaticamente.","Press: hide characters at your eyes":"Apertar: ocultar personagens nos seus olhos","Privacy box placement":"Posição das máscaras","Profile ID bottom":"ID do perfil na parte inferior","Profile ID left":"ID do perfil à esquerda","Profile ID right":"ID do perfil à direita","Profile ID top":"ID do perfil na parte superior","Quick":"Rápido","R grip":"Empunhadura R","R stick":"Analógico direito","R trigger":"Gatilho direito","RT / double RT":"RT / dois toques em RT","Raise eye level by 5":"Elevar olhos em 5","Readable HUD following view":"HUD legível que segue a visão","Ready":"Pronto","Reality Runner and other treadmills: keep Sharing on Both together and Controller slot on Automatic, so walking and the VR controllers work at the same time.":"Reality Runner e outras esteiras: deixe Compartilhamento em Os dois juntos e Slot do controle em Automático, para andar e usar os controles de VR ao mesmo tempo.","Reality Runner is open: 10 seconds of walking starts a run.":"O Reality Runner está aberto: 10 segundos andando iniciam uma corrida.","Recenter headset / portal":"Recentralizar headset / portal","Recenter keeps world scale and camera offsets. Simulator Home resets only the simulator, not the game's VR origin.":"Ao recentralizar, a escala do mundo e os deslocamentos da câmera são mantidos. O Início do simulador reinicia apenas o simulador, não a origem VR do jogo.","Recenter view":"Recentralizar visão","Recentering with L3 + A also moves your seated position back to the middle.":"Ao recentralizar com L3 + A, a posição sentada também é movida para o centro.","Record":"Gravar","Record camera and Xbox diagnostics":"Registrar câmera e controle Xbox","Record video":"Gravar vídeo","Recorder: failed. See WuWa Controls > Recording in the classic menu.":"Gravador: falhou. Veja WuWa Controls > Gravação no menu clássico.","Recorder: missing from this launcher package.":"Gravador: ausente neste pacote do launcher.","Recorder: open the WuWa VR app (launcher) to record.":"Gravador: abra o app WuWa VR (launcher) para gravar.","Recorder: ready.":"Gravador: pronto.","Recorder: recording. Reports and marks note the time in the video.":"Gravador: gravando. Relatórios e marcas anotam o momento no vídeo.","Recorder: saved. Open recordings from the launcher.":"Gravador: salvo. Abra as gravações pelo launcher.","Recorder: saving the video.":"Gravador: salvando o vídeo.","Recorder: starting.":"Gravador: iniciando.","Recorder: waiting for the launcher...":"Gravador: aguardando o launcher...","Recording":"Gravando","Recording and privacy":"Gravação e privacidade","Recording failed. See the message below.":"Falha na gravação. Veja a mensagem abaixo.","Recording saved. Use Open recordings in the launcher.":"Gravação salva. Use Abrir gravações no inicializador.","Recording video. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"Gravando vídeo. Feche o menu UEVR para uma visualização clara.","Records the headset view through the WuWa VR app, which must be open. Player IDs are covered while it records (Hide player IDs, on the Record page).":"Grava a visão do headset pelo aplicativo WuWa VR, que deve estar aberto. Os IDs dos jogadores são ocultados durante a gravação (Ocultar IDs dos jogadores, na página Gravação).","Refill far lighting now":"Recarregar iluminação distante agora","Reflection capture correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"A correção de captura de reflexos foi interrompida ou não pôde verificar esta versão do jogo. Veja o log de diagnóstico.","Reflection correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"A correção de reflexos foi interrompida ou não pôde verificar esta versão do jogo. Veja o log de diagnóstico.","Reflection projection correction":"Correção de projeção de reflexos","Refresh HUD layout":"Atualizar layout do HUD","Refresh far lighting":"Atualizar iluminação distante","Refresh far-lighting cache (limited workaround)":"Atualizar cache de iluminação distante (solução alternativa limitada)","Refresh position before drawing (Custom)":"Atualizar posição antes de desenhar (Personalizado)","Refresh queued; requires the supplied Comfort script.":"Atualização agendada; requer o script de Conforto fornecido.","Refreshes the far-lighting cache so distant lighting matches between eyes. A limited workaround.":"Atualiza o cache de iluminação distante para que a iluminação distante corresponda entre os olhos. Solução alternativa limitada.","Release RT (Xbox) or pull left stick fully down (Mode 2), then tap RB to arm. Tap RB again or hold LB to pause/disarm. LB + RB levels the drone and stops it. Double R3 exits. Focus loss, menus and shortcut chords pause/disarm it; arm again to resume.":"Solte RT (Xbox) ou puxe o analógico esquerdo totalmente para baixo (Modo 2), depois toque em RB para armar. Toque em RB novamente ou segure LB para pausar/desarmar. LB + RB nivela o drone e o para. Dois cliques em R3 saem. Perda de foco, menus e atalhos pausam/desarmam; arme novamente para retomar.","Release all controls after entering/leaving":"Liberar todos os controles ao entrar/sair","Reload language files":"Recarregar idiomas","Render resolution":"Resolução de renderização","Rendering comparisons (live)":"Comparações de renderização (ao vivo)","Report a problem":"Relatar um problema","Requests a HUD layout refresh without opening ESC. If this game version is unsupported, the status explains why; saved HUD size and position stay unchanged.":"Solicita a atualização do layout do HUD sem abrir o ESC. Se esta versão do jogo não for compatível, o status explicará o motivo; o tamanho e a posição salvos do HUD permanecem inalterados.","Requests a bounded cascade-lighting-volume refresh after stereo starts or resumes, after detected teleports, or on request. It helped the tested ship/wheel lighting case; it is not a general fix for dark objects or character rims. Each refill can cause a short hitch.":"Solicita a atualização limitada do volume de iluminação em cascata após o início ou retomada do estéreo, após teletransportes detectados ou sob solicitação. Isso ajudou no caso testado de iluminação de navio/roda; não é uma correção geral para objetos escuros ou contornos de personagens. Cada recarregamento pode causar uma pequena queda de desempenho.","Requires Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass. Applies the pass correction before game-side view setup. Turn off to return to the previous correction. Culling and lighting acceptance is pending.":"Requer Native Stereo Fix e Usar mesmo passe estéreo. Aplica a correção do passe antes da configuração da visão pelo jogo. Desative para retornar à correção anterior. Aceitação de culling e iluminação ainda está pendente.","Reset HUD aspect":"Redefinir proporção do HUD","Reset HUD shape":"Redefinir formato do HUD","Reset camera offset":"Redefinir deslocamento da câmera","Reset diorama camera":"Redefinir câmera do diorama","Reset headset position and direction now":"Redefinir posição e direção do headset agora","Restart plan":"Reiniciar plano","Restore all controller slots":"Restaurar todos os slots do controle","Restore controls from this launch":"Restaurar controles desta sessão","Restore input settings from before comparisons":"Restaurar ajustes de entrada de antes das comparações","Restore profile settings":"Restaurar ajustes do perfil","Restore renderer from before this comparison":"Restaurar o renderizador de antes desta comparação","Restore supplied profile controls":"Restaurar controles fornecidos","Restore this build's supplied controls, first-person/freecam settings, camera scale, aiming and HUD layout. Rendering and runtime selection are preserved. Temporary HUD/mouse mode is always turned off. You can undo the reset below.":"Restaura os controles fornecidos deste build, ajustes de primeira pessoa/câmera livre, escala da câmera, mira e layout do HUD. A renderização e a seleção de runtime são preservadas. O modo HUD/mouse temporário é sempre desativado. Você pode desfazer a restauração abaixo.","Returns Windows XInput unchanged, bypassing VR and Lua gamepad processing. Use Insert and the mouse for this settings panel; gamepad shortcuts and VR controller mapping are unavailable in this mode.":"Devolve o XInput do Windows inalterado, ignorando o processamento de controle do VR e do Lua. Use Insert e o mouse neste painel de ajustes; atalhos de controle e mapeamento do controle de VR não estão disponíveis neste modo.","Right":"Direita","Right / left":"Direita / esquerda","Right trigger (Xbox)":"Gatilho direito (Xbox)","Right-stick pitch; animated yaw and roll":"Inclinação pelo analógico direito; guinada e rolagem animadas","Rim restoration failed; the original is retained. Toggle off, then on to retry restoration first.":"Falha na restauração da borda; o original foi mantido. Desligue e ligue para tentar a restauração primeiro.","Rim suppression was not verified. Toggle off, then on to retry safely.":"A supressão da borda não foi verificada. Desligue e ligue para tentar novamente com segurança.","Rim variable is unavailable. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"A variável da borda não está disponível. Desligue e ligue para tentar novamente.","Rim workaround is off.":"A solução alternativa da borda está desligada.","Rim workaround waits for active native stereo with 2D screen off.":"A solução alternativa da borda aguarda o Native Stereo ativo com a tela 2D desligada.","Rim workaround waits for the current graphics comparison to end.":"A solução alternativa da borda aguarda a comparação gráfica atual terminar.","Room panel (stays put)":"Painel fixo no espaço","Run on: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"Corrida em andamento: %s, andando %s, %.2f km no jogo.","Safe fit inside rounded edges":"Ajuste dentro das bordas arredondadas","Save changes for next time":"Salvar alterações para a próxima vez","Save observation":"Salvar observação","Save or discard your unsent note before finishing.":"Salve ou descarte sua nota não enviada antes de finalizar.","Save report":"Salvar relatório","Saves \"skipped\" and shows the next step.":"Salva \"ignorado\" e mostra o próximo passo.","Saves the camera and controller movement next to the video, to help find what went wrong.":"Salva o movimento da câmera e do controle junto ao vídeo, para ajudar a descobrir o que deu errado.","Saves the report now. Recording first makes it easy to find in the video.":"Salva o relatório agora. Gravar antes facilita encontrá-lo no vídeo.","Saves the time and current settings, so the moment is easy to find later.":"Salva o horário e os ajustes atuais, para encontrar o momento facilmente depois.","Saves this answer with the settings now in use, then shows the next step.":"Salva esta resposta com os ajustes em uso, depois mostra o próximo passo.","Saving":"Salvando","Scene ending; restoring previous view":"A cena está terminando; restaurando a visão anterior","Screen lens":"Lente da tela","Screen view on / off":"Visão de tela ligar / desligar","Screen views and cutscene options are in VR > WuWa Controls > View modes and cutscenes.":"As opções de visão de tela e cenas estão em VR > Controles WuWa > Modos de exibição e cenas.","Screenshot":"Captura de tela","Scroll":"Rolar","Second view":"Segunda visão","Second view does not match the first":"A segunda visão não corresponde à primeira","Second view not writable; copy skipped":"Não é possível gravar na segunda visão; cópia ignorada","Seconds of smoothing in the steady desktop window. More is calmer and trails turns more.":"Segundos de suavização na janela estável da área de trabalho. Mais é mais calmo e acompanha as viradas com mais atraso.","Selected build: %s":"Build selecionado: %s","Send aim to player control rotation":"Enviar mira ao controle do jogador","Separate eyes: Synchronized Sequential":"Olhos separados: Synchronized Sequential","Separate-eye rendering produced a black scene with HUD in the September 26 playtest. Native stereo is the working baseline. Submission metadata has been repaired, but separate-eye rendering is still an experiment, not a fix for labels/reflections/materials. Return to Native if the scene disappears.":"A renderização de olhos separados produziu uma cena preta com HUD no teste de 26 de setembro. O Native Stereo é a base funcional. Os metadados de envio foram corrigidos, mas a renderização de olhos separados ainda é um experimento, não uma correção para rótulos/reflexos/materiais. Volte para o Native se a cena desaparecer.","Set portal toggle key":"Definir tecla de alternância do portal","Set show / hide UI key":"Definir tecla para mostrar / ocultar interface","Sets all three offsets back to 0, the game camera's own position.":"Define os três deslocamentos de volta para 0, a própria posição da câmera do jogo.","Settings from before the reset restored; mouse mode remains off.":"Ajustes de antes da restauração recuperados; o modo mouse permanece desligado.","Settings: D-pad selects, A activates, left stick scrolls the focused pane. Mouse wheel also scrolls. Release RT first: holding it adjusts the camera instead.":"Ajustes: o direcional seleciona, A ativa, o analógico esquerdo rola o painel em foco. A roda do mouse também rola. Solte RT primeiro: mantê-lo pressionado ajusta a câmera.","Sharing with Xbox / treadmill":"Compartilhamento com Xbox / esteira","Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then click L3 to turn the blur on or off.":"Atalho: segure LT + RT, depois clique em L3 para ligar ou desligar o desfoque.","Show / hide game HUD and menus":"Mostrar / ocultar HUD e menus","Show / hide game UI":"Mostrar / ocultar interface","Show UI to see this menu":"Mostre a interface para ver o menu","Show all":"Mostrar tudo","Show extracted game UI":"Mostrar interface extraída","Show game UI now":"Mostrar interface do jogo","Show hover-drone / plane camera roll":"Mostrar rolagem da câmera do drone suspenso / avião","Show optical hands (this launch only)":"Mostrar mãos ópticas (somente nesta sessão)","Showcase: one eye, steady, 16:9":"Vitrine: um olho, estável, 16:9","Showcase: the left eye as a normal 16:9 video, steadied, with the HUD where you see it, at the game's own frame rate. Picture size 720, 1024 or 1280 px gives 720p, 1080p or 1440p. Needs SteamVR. Side by side: both eyes, to help find what went wrong.":"Vitrine: o olho esquerdo como um vídeo 16:9 normal, estabilizado, com o HUD onde você o vê, na taxa de quadros do próprio jogo. Tamanho da imagem 720, 1024 ou 1280 px gera 720p, 1080p ou 1440p. Requer SteamVR. Lado a lado: ambos os olhos, para ajudar a encontrar o que deu errado.","Shows 3 times, then turns itself off (Cinema page).":"Aparece 3 vezes e depois se desliga (página Cinema).","Shows the L3 card without holding anything. Shortcut: L3 + Menu. A loaded test plan shows its step there instead.":"Mostra o cartão L3 sem segurar nada. Atalho: L3 + Menu. Um plano de teste carregado mostra sua etapa ali.","Shows the current step where the controls card usually is. Off shows the controls card, as a public release does; the plan stays loaded here.":"Mostra a etapa atual onde normalmente fica o cartão de controles. Desligado mostra o cartão de controles, como numa versão pública; o plano continua carregado aqui.","Shows the world as a miniature around you, with the portal on or off. Needs Native Stereo. This launch only.":"Mostra o mundo como uma miniatura ao seu redor, com o portal ligado ou desligado. Requer Native Stereo. Somente nesta sessão.","Shrinks the world by the Diorama scale (%.0fx, set on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page) for an action-figure view, seen from the diorama camera (Camera page). Turn off to return to your normal scale. Works with or without the portal window.":"Encolhe o mundo pela escala do diorama (%.0fx, ajustada na página Rápido do menu WuWa VR) para uma visão de boneco de ação, vista da câmera do diorama (página Câmera). Desligue para voltar à sua escala normal. Funciona com ou sem a janela de portal.","Simulator: keep its preview open, choose Both eyes / side-by-side, and turn Full render off. Recording uses the preview size.":"Simulador: mantenha a pré-visualização aberta, escolha Ambos os olhos / lado a lado e desligue a renderização completa. A gravação usa o tamanho da pré-visualização.","Skip this step":"Pular esta etapa","Slot 0":"Slot 0","Slot 1":"Slot 1","Slot 2":"Slot 2","Slot 3":"Slot 3","Smooth camera tilt":"Suavizar inclinação da câmera","Smooth camera turns":"Suavizar giros da câmera","Smooth transition between animation and game view":"Transição suave entre animação e visão normal","Smoothing blends stick handovers and reported movement-state changes, such as takeoff/landing. It starts enabled on the supplied profile. Head position stays current; ordinary aiming and animation are immediate after the handover. Off restores the instant switch.":"A suavização mescla a troca de controle entre analógicos e mudanças de estado de movimento reportadas, como decolagem/pouso. Ela começa ativada no perfil fornecido. A posição da cabeça permanece atual; a mira e a animação normais são imediatas após a troca. Desligado restaura a troca instantânea.","Smoothing speed":"Velocidade de suavização","Smoothness":"Suavidade","Smooths head shake out of the game window for OBS recordings. The window then trails quick head turns a little, so leave it off while you play. The headset image is not changed.":"Remove o tremor da cabeça da janela do jogo para gravações no OBS. A janela passa a acompanhar viradas rápidas com um pouco de atraso, então deixe desligado enquanto joga. A imagem do headset não muda.","Smooths head shake out of the game window, so OBS records a calm, full-resolution view with game audio. The headset image is not changed. The window shows a slightly narrower view so the picture can move inside it.":"Suaviza o tremor da cabeça na janela do jogo, para que o OBS grave uma visão calma em resolução total com o áudio do jogo. A imagem do headset não é alterada. A janela mostra uma visão um pouco mais estreita para que a imagem possa se mover dentro dela.","Smooths the game camera's left / right turns, so quick camera swings feel gentler.":"Suaviza os giros para a esquerda / direita da câmera do jogo, para que movimentos rápidos pareçam mais suaves.","Smooths the game camera's up / down tilt.":"Suaviza a inclinação para cima / baixo da câmera do jogo.","Soft contact shadows in corners and under objects. On by default. It keeps the game's own setting and renders both eyes with a symmetric view, so rocks, hills and roofs shade the same in each eye; the picture is slightly softer. Off is a little faster.":"Sombras de contato suaves em cantos e sob objetos. Ligada por padrão. Mantém a configuração do próprio jogo e renderiza os dois olhos com uma visão simétrica, para que rochas, colinas e telhados fiquem sombreados igual em cada olho; a imagem fica um pouco mais suave. Desligada é um pouco mais rápido.","Something else":"Outra coisa","Speed":"Velocidade","Stand where the far tree freezes, start a window, close the menu and look, then press what you saw. Each start or stop may cause a one-frame blur.":"Fique onde a árvore distante congela, inicie uma janela, feche o menu e olhe, então pressione o que você viu. Cada início ou parada pode causar um borrão de um quadro.","Start a developer playtest in the launcher, then save your observations here. Nothing passes automatically.":"Inicie um teste de desenvolvedor no inicializador e salve suas observações aqui. Nada passa automaticamente.","Start and end runs automatically":"Iniciar e encerrar corridas automaticamente","Start and end treadmill runs automatically":"Iniciar e encerrar corridas na esteira automaticamente","Start motion sidecar (5 minutes max)":"Iniciar dados de movimento (máx. 5 min)","Start run":"Iniciar corrida","Start video recording":"Iniciar gravação de vídeo","Starting":"Iniciando","Starting the recorder. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"Iniciando o gravador. Feche o menu UEVR para uma visão limpa.","Starts again from step 1.":"Começa de novo a partir da etapa 1.","Status: VR controllers need the OpenXR runtime.":"Status: os controles de VR precisam do runtime OpenXR.","Status: blocked by Physical gamepad passthrough. Turn passthrough off to use VR controllers.":"Status: bloqueado pelo repasse do controle físico. Desligue o repasse para usar os controles de VR.","Status: blocked by the XInput controller slot filter. Allow slot %d or choose another slot.":"Status: bloqueado pelo filtro de slot do controle XInput. Permita o slot %d ou escolha outro slot.","Status: off. Xbox only.":"Status: desligado. Somente Xbox.","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on.":"Status: ligado, aguardando os controles de VR. Ative os dois e mantenha o headset em uso.","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on; the Xbox still works.":"Status: ligado, aguardando os controles de VR. Ative os dois e mantenha o headset em uso; o Xbox ainda funciona.","Status: on, waiting for game focus. Click the game window.":"Status: ligado, aguardando o foco no jogo. Clique na janela do jogo.","Status: on, waiting for the game to read controller slot %d. It is asked again a few times a minute; keep the game window focused.":"Status: ligado, aguardando o jogo ler o slot do controle %d. O pedido se repete algumas vezes por minuto; mantenha a janela do jogo em foco.","Status: on. Every controller steers this menu; the game gets no input until it closes.":"Status: ligado. Qualquer controle controla este menu; o jogo não recebe entrada até que ele feche.","Status: on. VR controllers and Xbox both working.":"Status: ligado. Controles de VR e Xbox funcionando.","Status: on. VR controllers in control; use the Xbox to switch.":"Status: ligado. Controles de VR no comando; use o Xbox para alternar.","Status: on. VR controllers working.":"Status: ligado. Controles de VR funcionando.","Status: on. Xbox in control; use a VR control to switch.":"Status: ligado. Xbox no comando; use um controle de VR para alternar.","Status: paused by the diagnostic motion-input mute.":"Status: pausado pelo mudo de entrada de movimento do diagnóstico.","Steadiness":"Estabilidade","Steadiness (seconds of smoothing)":"Estabilidade (segundos de suavização)","Steady desktop view (for OBS and streaming)":"Visão estável da área de trabalho (para OBS e streaming)","Steady desktop window":"Janela da área de trabalho estável","SteamVR and the updated OpenXR Simulator are supported. VDXR capture is not available yet. Video has no audio and stops after five minutes. Actual frame rate depends on the game.":"SteamVR e o OpenXR Simulator atualizado são compatíveis. A captura por VDXR ainda não está disponível. O vídeo não tem áudio e para após cinco minutos. A taxa de quadros real depende do jogo.","Step":"Passo","Step card below you":"Card de passo abaixo de você","Stereo rendering compatibility":"Compatibilidade estereoscópica","Stereo screen":"Tela estéreo","Stereo screen (3D depth)":"Tela estéreo (profundidade 3D)","Stereo screen on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"Tela estéreo ligar / desligar (segure 0,8 s)","Stick expo (softens center)":"Expo do analógico (suaviza o centro)","Stop motion sidecar":"Parar dados de movimento","Stop now":"Parar agora","Stop the voice note or transcription in the launcher before finishing.":"Pare a nota de voz ou a transcrição no launcher antes de finalizar.","Stop video recording":"Parar gravação de vídeo","Stop voice activity and confirm untested checks before finishing.":"Pare a atividade de voz e confirme as verificações não testadas antes de finalizar.","Stopped":"Parado","Stopped: a write or restore failed. Restart the game before trying again.":"Parado: falha ao gravar ou restaurar. Reinicie o jogo antes de tentar de novo.","Stops the freecam at walls and the ground. Experimental.":"Para a câmera livre em paredes e no chão. Experimental.","Story camera nudge":"Ajuste da câmera na história","Story camera nudge now: %s cm":"Ajuste da câmera na história agora: %s cm","Story camera nudge: waiting for a story shot":"Ajuste da câmera na história: aguardando uma cena da história","Story cutscenes and dialogue":"Cinemáticas e diálogos da história","Story pictures":"Imagens da história","Story pictures use":"Imagens da história usam","Story scenes in 16:9":"Cenas da história em 16:9","Story scenes use":"Cenas da história usam","Story shots: camera nearer / back (L3 + Y + X resets; keyboard Page Up / Page Down / Home)":"Cenas da história: câmera mais perto / mais longe (L3 + Y + X redefine; teclado Page Up / Page Down / Home)","Streamer privacy: cover player IDs":"Privacidade: ocultar ID do jogador","Stutter or freeze":"Travamento ou congelamento","Supplied profile restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"Perfil fornecido restaurado. Solte todos os controles antes de continuar.","Swap the eyes' poses and projections (stereo looks inverted)":"Trocar as poses e projeções dos olhos (estéreo parece invertido)","Swap the eyes' render targets (stereo looks inverted)":"Trocar os alvos de renderização dos olhos (estéreo parece invertido)","Sweeps the camera against surfaces that block the game's Visibility trace. Slides along contact surfaces. Unsupported queries hold movement and report a reason below. Physical headset leaning is not constrained. Starts off; world geometry still needs live verification.":"Varre a câmera contra superfícies que bloqueiam o trace de Visibility do jogo. Desliza pelas superfícies de contato. Consultas sem suporte travam o movimento e informam um motivo abaixo. A inclinação física do headset não é limitada. Começa desativado; a geometria do mundo ainda precisa de verificação ao vivo.","Switches to a screen while a story video (mono theatre) or a story picture plays, then back to the view you had. Story scenes keep your view unless you choose otherwise below.":"Muda para uma tela enquanto um vídeo da história (cinema mono) ou uma imagem da história é exibido, e depois volta para a visão que você tinha. As cenas da história mantêm sua visão, a menos que você escolha outra coisa abaixo.","Sync left eye LOD to right eye (fix candidate)":"Sincronizar o LOD do olho esquerdo com o olho direito (correção candidata)","TEST":"TESTE","Target recording rate":"Taxa de quadros desejada","Test":"Teste","Tests the game's default texture in place of custom reflections for the two main eyes. This is an effect-removal workaround, not a projection repair, and can also remove correct custom reflections. Starts off and restores on the next rendered views when disabled.":"Testa a textura padrão do jogo no lugar dos reflexos personalizados dos dois olhos principais. É uma solução para remover um efeito, não um reparo de projeção, e também pode remover reflexos personalizados corretos. Começa desativado e restaura nas próximas visualizações renderizadas ao ser desativado.","The 2D view's background blur, in full VR and on the stereo screen. In full VR the blur is scaled for the headset's wider lens and the focus follows Close-up match.":"O desfoque de fundo da visão 2D, em VR completo e na tela estéreo. No VR completo o desfoque é escalado para as lentes mais largas do headset e o foco segue Close-up match.","The Kuro material candidate stopped or could not verify this build. See the diagnostic log.":"O candidato de material do Kuro parou ou não pôde verificar esta versão. Consulte o log de diagnóstico.","The card is blocked by FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor. Turn that off to display it.":"O card está bloqueado por FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor. Desative isso para exibi-lo.","The game builds one eye from a plain default camera, so that eye misses the shot's camera settings. Blur only copies the depth of field across; All camera effects also copies grading, vignette, exposure and the rest.":"O jogo monta um olho a partir de uma câmera padrão simples, então esse olho perde as configurações de câmera da cena. Blur apenas copia a profundidade de campo; All camera effects também copia correção de cor, vinheta, exposição e o resto.","The hand demo needs OpenXR with optical hand tracking. Xbox gameplay is unchanged.":"A demonstração de mão precisa de OpenXR com rastreamento óptico de mãos. A jogabilidade com Xbox não muda.","The hand overlay renderer is unavailable. The joint inspector remains available; see the UEVR log for details.":"O renderizador da sobreposição de mãos está indisponível. O inspetor de juntas continua disponível; consulte o log do UEVR para detalhes.","The hold gesture is unavailable while Enable motion-controller input is on; use this checkbox.":"O gesto de segurar fica indisponível enquanto Enable motion-controller input estiver ativado; use esta caixa de seleção.","The playtest session changed. Review it before saving.":"A sessão de teste mudou. Revise antes de salvar.","The previous character rim value was restored and verified.":"O valor anterior de rim do personagem foi restaurado e verificado.","The recorder is missing from this launcher package.":"O gravador está ausente deste pacote do launcher.","The rim variable changed; no old pointer was used. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"A variável de rim mudou; nenhum ponteiro antigo foi usado. Desative e reative para tentar de novo.","The selected package is recorded; this is not proof of the DLL loaded by the game.":"O pacote selecionado foi registrado; isso não prova qual DLL o jogo carregou.","The session changed. Review your unsent note before adding it to this session.":"A sessão mudou. Revise sua nota não enviada antes de adicioná-la a esta sessão.","The supplied profile enables this for Native Stereo Fix with OpenXR. Headset timing acceptance is still limited; disable only for a deliberate comparison.":"O perfil fornecido ativa isso para Native Stereo Fix com OpenXR. A aceitação de timing do headset ainda é limitada; desative apenas para uma comparação deliberada.","The top-left box normally follows the ESC/overlay menu render path, including gamepad menus. Other popups using that same path may also show it. The bottom-right UID box stays on. Check your recording; unknown menu layouts are not guaranteed to be covered. Always is a manual fallback.":"A caixa superior esquerda normalmente segue o caminho de renderização do menu ESC/sobreposto, incluindo menus de gamepad. Outros pop-ups que usam o mesmo caminho também podem exibi-la. A caixa de UID inferior direita permanece ativada. Confira sua gravação; layouts de menu desconhecidos não têm cobertura garantida. Sempre é um recurso manual alternativo.","These are UEVR's existing global aim settings, shared with VR > Input. They are not limited to first person.":"Estes são os ajustes globais de mira já existentes do UEVR, compartilhados com VR > Input. Não se limitam à primeira pessoa.","These buttons use UEVR's existing live rendering options. The image may pause while render targets rebuild. They leave camera, HUD placement and controller settings alone. Opening this section changes nothing; UEVR saves whichever renderer you leave selected.":"Estes botões usam as opções de renderização ao vivo já existentes do UEVR. A imagem pode pausar enquanto os alvos de renderização são reconstruídos. Eles não alteram a câmera, a posição do HUD nem os ajustes do controle. Abrir esta seção não muda nada; o UEVR salva o renderizador que você deixar selecionado.","These modes move the viewpoint; the character stays put. Acro is a camera flight model, without motor, propeller or battery simulation.":"Estes modos movem o ponto de vista; o personagem fica parado. Acro é um modelo de voo de câmera, sem simulação de motor, hélice ou bateria.","These old comparison tests are separate from the normal far-object repair. Some deliberately invert or duplicate eye data; they are not recommended player settings.":"Estes testes de comparação antigos são separados do reparo normal de objetos distantes. Alguns invertem ou duplicam os dados dos olhos de propósito; não são ajustes recomendados para jogar.","This OpenXR runtime or headset does not provide hand tracking.":"Este runtime OpenXR ou headset não oferece rastreamento de mãos.","This is a flat rectangular HUD: corners can extend over rounded/feathered edges. Use Safe fit to keep every corner inside, or use a rectangular portal for exact alignment.":"Este é um HUD retangular plano: os cantos podem ultrapassar as bordas arredondadas/suavizadas. Use o ajuste dentro das bordas arredondadas para manter cada canto dentro, ou use um portal retangular para alinhamento exato.","This launch only: not saved.":"Só nesta sessão: não é salvo.","This older profile has no supplied-defaults file. Reset this build in the launcher while the game is closed, or use this launch's settings below.":"Este perfil antigo não tem arquivo de padrões fornecidos. Redefina esta versão no launcher com o jogo fechado, ou use os ajustes desta sessão abaixo.","This runtime cannot identify optical hands. Controller-derived joints are not shown.":"Este runtime não consegue identificar mãos ópticas. As articulações derivadas do controle não são exibidas.","Times your run and saves your route in the game once a second, with a sync flash for OBS videos. With Reality Runner open, walking starts a run by itself (Controllers page).":"Cronometra sua corrida e salva sua rota no jogo a cada segundo, com um flash de sincronia para vídeos do OBS. Com o Reality Runner aberto, andar inicia uma corrida sozinho (página Controles).","Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"Alternar ajuste HUD / mouse","Trace mesh triangles when supported":"Traçar triângulos da malha quando compatível","Track the camera":"Seguir a câmera","Track the camera: the distance is measured at each cut, then follows only the game camera's own moves, so a focus change cannot move you. Fixed per shot: the distance stays as it was at the cut. Follow the focus: it also moves when the game changes focus.":"Seguir a câmera: a distância é medida a cada corte e depois acompanha apenas os próprios movimentos da câmera do jogo, então uma mudança de foco não pode mover você. Fixo por plano: a distância fica como estava no corte. Seguir o foco: ela também se move quando o jogo muda o foco.","Transition duration (seconds)":"Duração da transição (segundos)","Translucency correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"A correção de translucidez parou ou não conseguiu verificar esta versão do jogo. Consulte o registro de diagnóstico.","Treadmill":"Esteira","Treadmill run":"Corrida na esteira","Try headset aim":"Testar mira pelo headset","Turn speed":"Velocidade de giro","Turn this note off in the menu, Cinema page.":"Desative este aviso no menu, página Cinema.","Turn this off to isolate your physical gamepad. Head tracking stays enabled.":"Desative para isolar seu controle físico. O rastreamento da cabeça continua ativo.","UEVR > WuWa Controls > Exit mouse mode now":"UEVR > WuWa Controls > Sair do modo mouse","UI placement":"Posição da interface","UID bottom":"UID inferior","UID left":"UID esquerda","UID right":"UID direita","UID top":"UID superior","Unavailable while another graphics test runs.":"Indisponível enquanto outro teste gráfico estiver em execução.","Unavailable: %s":"Indisponível: %s","Unavailable: the eye pair is not verified yet (or this game build is not supported).":"Indisponível: o par de olhos ainda não foi verificado (ou esta versão do jogo não é compatível).","Undo last controls reset":"Desfazer última restauração","Unoccluded hand skeleton demo: hands draw over the game. No grabbing, collisions or gesture controls. Xbox remains gameplay.":"Demonstração de esqueleto das mãos sem oclusão: as mãos são desenhadas sobre o jogo. Sem agarrar, colisões ou controles por gestos. O Xbox continua nos controles do jogo.","Unsupported PlayStation input report; use Steam Input if available":"Relatório de entrada PlayStation não compatível; use o Steam Input se disponível","Until the next cut":"Até o próximo corte","Until the next cut: each shot starts at the game's spot again. For the whole scene: your nudge stays until the story shots end.":"Até o próximo corte: cada cena começa de novo na posição do jogo. Pela cena inteira: seu ajuste fica até as cenas da história terminarem.","Up / down":"Cima / baixo","Use a keyboard for text. Voice notes require explicit microphone consent in the developer web panel.":"Use um teclado para texto. Notas de voz exigem consentimento explícito do microfone no painel web do desenvolvedor.","Use game aim for full animation":"Usar mira do jogo para animação completa","Use game view while either stick moves":"Visão do jogo ao mover um analógico","Use native stereo":"Usar estéreo nativo","Use right-stick pitch":"Usar inclinação pelo analógico direito","Use separate-eye renderer":"Usar renderizador separado por olho","Use the VR controllers as an Xbox pad for walking and sightseeing. Holding the left Menu button for 1 second also turns them on or off.":"Use os controles de VR como um controle Xbox para caminhar e explorar. Segurar o botão Menu esquerdo por 1 segundo também os liga ou desliga.","Use this menu when opening UEVR":"Use este menu ao abrir o UEVR","Used instead of the offsets above while the diorama is on. The diorama makes your eyes far apart, so a camera that suits normal play puts the character too close and crosses your eyes. The default, 5 m back, shows it about an arm's length away at 10x.":"Usado no lugar dos deslocamentos acima enquanto o diorama está ligado. O diorama afasta muito os seus olhos, então uma câmera boa para o jogo normal deixa o personagem perto demais e deixa você vesgo. O padrão, 5 m para trás, mostra o personagem a cerca de um braço de distância em 10x.","Uses one game camera pose for both eyes during the same frame, while preserving headset movement and eye separation. Requires Native Stereo Fix. The owner confirmed the ultimate return-to-gameplay fix. Other scene transitions remain under test; this does not repair foliage.":"Usa uma única pose da câmera do jogo para os dois olhos no mesmo quadro, preservando o movimento do headset e a separação dos olhos. Requer o Native Stereo Fix. O autor confirmou ser a correção definitiva de retorno ao jogo. Outras transições de cena continuam em teste; isto não corrige a folhagem.","Uses the game's full-resolution translucency path for ordinary two-eye views. Compare Lynae, Mornye and Iuno in both eyes. May cost performance. Requires Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off; other renderers keep their normal behavior.":"Usa o caminho de translucidez em resolução total do jogo para visões comuns de dois olhos. Compare Lynae, Mornye e Iuno nos dois olhos. Pode custar desempenho. Requer Native Stereo com Native Stereo Fix e Compatibilidade Extrema desligada; os outros renderizadores mantêm o comportamento normal.","V once; hold 0.8 s for the Tab wheel":"V uma vez; segure 0,8 s para a roda Tab","VR controllers":"Controles de VR","VR controllers for walking (optional)":"Controles de VR para caminhar (opcional)","VR controllers on (this launch)":"Controles de VR ligados (esta sessão)","VR controllers: point and pull the trigger, or use either stick and A. B closes, the grips change page. Xbox: D-pad or stick, A, B, LB / RB. Keyboard: arrows, Enter, Esc, Tab. Mouse: click and scroll.":"Controles de VR: aponte e aperte o gatilho, ou use qualquer analógico e A. B fecha, os grips mudam de página. Xbox: direcional ou analógico, A, B, LB / RB. Teclado: setas, Enter, Esc, Tab. Mouse: clique e rolagem.","VR only (Xbox ignored)":"Somente VR (Xbox ignorado)","Video style":"Estilo do vídeo","View":"View","View hints":"Dicas de visão","View modes and cutscenes":"Modos de visão e cenas","Views hold unexpected values; copy skipped":"As visões têm valores inesperados; cópia ignorada","WHILE ADJUSTMENT IS ON":"ENQUANTO O AJUSTE ESTIVER ATIVO","Wait for an active playtest in the launcher.":"Aguarde um playtest ativo no launcher.","Wait for the launcher operation to finish.":"Aguarde a conclusão da operação no launcher.","Waiting for a close-up (lens now %s degrees)":"Aguardando um close-up (lente agora em %s graus)","Waiting for a stereo frame":"Aguardando um quadro estéreo","Waiting for a valid portal anchor.":"Aguardando um ponto de ancoragem válido para o portal.","Waiting for a verified cinematic signal":"Aguardando um sinal cinematográfico verificado","Waiting for an authored constrained camera":"Aguardando uma câmera original restrita","Waiting for fresh optical hands. Keep hands visible to the headset and enable tracking forwarding in Virtual Desktop when using VDXR.":"Aguardando mãos ópticas atualizadas. Mantenha as mãos visíveis para o headset e ative o encaminhamento de rastreamento no Virtual Desktop ao usar VDXR.","Waiting for native game camera":"Aguardando a câmera nativa do jogo","Waiting for playtest acknowledgement...":"Aguardando confirmação do playtest...","Waiting for the launcher...":"Aguardando o inicializador...","Walk by default":"Andar por padrão","Walk by default; hold RB for normal speed":"Andar por padrão; segure RB para velocidade normal","Walk instead of run; hold RB for normal speed.":"Andar em vez de correr; segure RB para velocidade normal.","Warn when a menu opens with game UI hidden":"Avisar ao abrir menu com interface oculta","What automatic switching shows during story scenes and conversations. Keep current view leaves full VR, the stereo screen or mono as you have it.":"O que a troca automática mostra durante as cenas da história e as conversas. \"Manter a visão atual\" deixa o VR completo, a tela estéreo ou o mono como você estiver usando.","What automatic switching shows while a story picture fills the screen.":"O que a troca automática mostra enquanto uma imagem da história ocupa a tela.","What happened":"O que aconteceu","What you see of your own character. Hiding the head stops it from blocking the view.":"O que você vê do seu próprio personagem. Ocultar a cabeça evita que ela bloqueie a visão.","When a letterboxed cinematic camera starts in full VR, a short note in view reminds you of the screen shortcut. A fallback for when automatic switching misses a scene.":"Quando uma câmera cinematográfica com bordas pretas iniciar no modo VR completo, uma pequena mensagem aparecerá na visão para lembrar do atalho da tela. Isso serve como alternativa caso a troca automática não detecte uma cena.","When to show the profile ID box":"Quando ocultar ID do perfil","Where this menu floats around you. Full VR and the screen views each keep their own place; on a screen view Low sits just under the picture, whatever its size and distance, and the menu always stays in front of it.":"Onde este menu flutua ao seu redor. O modo VR completo e a visualização em tela mantêm suas próprias posições; na visualização em tela, a opção Baixa fica logo abaixo da imagem, independentemente de seu tamanho ou distância, e o menu sempre permanece à frente dela.","Where your viewpoint sits in the diorama, from the game camera. Back (minus) moves the miniature farther away.":"Onde fica seu ponto de vista no diorama, a partir da câmera do jogo. Para trás (menos) afasta a miniatura.","Where: ":"Onde: ","Which Xbox controller slot the VR controllers share. Automatic uses the one with a controller, such as a treadmill's virtual pad.":"Qual slot de controle Xbox os controles VR compartilham. Automático usa o que tem um controle, como o controle virtual de uma esteira.","Whichever you used last controls the game; the other waits until you press or push something on it.":"O controle que você usou por último assume o comando do jogo; o outro fica em espera até que você pressione ou movimente algo nele.","While hiding is off: a short note with the shortcut, once per scene, when a character is right at your eyes. After 3 notes it turns itself off.":"Com a ocultação desligada: um aviso curto com o atalho, uma vez por cena, quando um personagem está colado nos seus olhos. Depois de 3 avisos, ele se desliga.","While playing in first person, hold L3 + Y to raise eye level or L3 + X to lower it. This lets you see the result with this menu closed.":"Enquanto estiver em primeira pessoa, segure L3 + Y para elevar o nível dos olhos ou L3 + X para baixá-lo. Isso permite visualizar o resultado com este menu fechado.","While recording":"Durante a gravação","While recording: the boxes appear while the WuWa VR app records and during treadmill runs. Recording with other software (OBS) at other times needs Always.":"Durante a gravação: as caixas aparecem enquanto o app WuWa VR grava e durante corridas na esteira. Gravar com outro programa (OBS) em outros momentos exige Sempre.","Wide 90 degrees":"Amplo 90 graus","Width per eye. Larger is sharper and makes bigger files.":"Largura por olho. Valores maiores resultam em uma imagem mais nítida, mas geram arquivos maiores.","Window alignment down / up":"Alinhamento da janela: baixo / cima","Window alignment left / right":"Alinhamento da janela: esquerda / direita","With Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass on, keeps the source eye's projection for supported custom reflection captures. With Native Stereo Fix off, selects verified two-eye atlas parameters. Visual acceptance is pending.":"Com o Native Stereo Fix e a opção Usar mesmo passe estéreo ativados, a projeção do olho original é mantida para capturas de reflexos personalizadas compatíveis. Com o Native Stereo Fix desativado, são selecionados parâmetros verificados para o atlas binocular. A aprovação visual ainda está pendente.","With Reality Runner open, 10 seconds of walking starts a run and 5 minutes without walking ends it. The WuWa VR menu has the same switch on its Controllers page.":"Com o Reality Runner aberto, 10 segundos andando iniciam uma corrida e 5 minutos sem andar a encerram. O menu do WuWa VR tem o mesmo interruptor na página Controles.","With Reality Runner open, 10 seconds of walking starts a run and 5 minutes without walking ends it. Your route is saved in the UEVR profile, wuwa-runs folder.":"Com o Reality Runner aberto, 10 segundos andando iniciam uma corrida e 5 minutos sem andar a encerram. Sua rota é salva no perfil do UEVR, pasta wuwa-runs.","With the 16:9 layout off: every conversation (story scenes and chats with people in the world) and story videos switch to 16:9 while they play, so story pictures show whole, then the taller layout comes back. Follows the game's own dialogue state, so it works with any controls and with the game UI hidden.":"Com o layout 16:9 desligado: toda conversa (cenas da história e papos com pessoas do mundo) e vídeos da história mudam para 16:9 enquanto tocam, para que as imagens da história apareçam inteiras, e depois o layout mais alto volta. Segue o próprio estado de diálogo do jogo, então funciona com qualquer controle e com a interface do jogo oculta.","With the 16:9 layout on: the character screen (Resonators) uses the taller layout while it is open, so its floor reflection keeps showing the current character, then 16:9 comes back. Its icons look flatter there and the mouse can miss.":"Com o layout 16:9 ativado: a tela de personagens (Ressonadores) usa o layout mais alto enquanto está aberta, para que o reflexo do chão mostre sempre o personagem atual, e depois o 16:9 volta. Ali os ícones parecem mais achatados e o mouse pode errar.","Within a shot":"Durante uma cena","World scale":"Escala do mundo","World-space labels in both eyes (candidate)":"Rótulos do mundo nos dois olhos (candidato)","Write a short observation before saving.":"Escreva uma breve observação antes de salvar.","WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"WuWa Controls > Mostrar interface do jogo","WuWa VR menu":"Menu do WuWa VR","WuWa controls and shortcut pages only. Base UEVR, game text and some technical help remain English. Translations are community-editable drafts.":"Apenas os controles e as páginas de atalhos do WuWa VR foram traduzidos. O UEVR base, o texto do jogo e algumas informações técnicas permanecem em inglês. As traduções são rascunhos editáveis pela comunidade.","X + left stick":"X + analógico esquerdo","X + stick  Scroll    D-pad Move map":"X + analógico  Rolar    Direcional Mover mapa","X or Delete: back to the default.":"X ou Delete: voltar ao padrão.","XInput controller slot (test)":"Slot do controle XInput (teste)","Xbox / Steam Input has priority; direct PlayStation shortcuts are waiting":"Xbox / Steam Input tem prioridade; os atalhos diretos do PlayStation estão em espera","Y + X together: back to default":"Y + X juntos: volta ao padrão","Yaw rate (degrees / second)":"Taxa de rotação horizontal (graus/s)","You are in the scene":"Você está na cena","Your answer: ":"Sua resposta: ","Your answers are saved. Restart it from the menu's Test page.":"Suas respostas foram salvas. Reinicie o teste na página Teste do menu.","Your body":"Seu corpo","Your route in the game is saved once a second (UEVR profile > wuwa-runs), so no map screenshots are needed. Each start and end flashes a magenta square in the desktop view, so an OBS video lines up with the route.":"Sua rota no jogo é salva a cada segundo (perfil do UEVR > wuwa-runs), então não são necessárias capturas do mapa. Cada início e fim pisca um quadrado magenta na visão da área de trabalho, para que um vídeo do OBS se alinhe com a rota.","Your unsent note is retained in this menu until the game closes.":"Sua observação não enviada será mantida neste menu até que o jogo seja fechado.","depth of field forced on":"profundidade de campo forçada","depth of field: %s":"profundidade de campo: %s","depth of field: not in this game build":"profundidade de campo: não existe nesta versão do jogo","game focus":"foco do jogo","held behind the person in front (%s m)":"parado atrás da pessoa à frente (%s m)","hiding anything nearer than %s cm":"ocultando tudo a menos de %s cm","hold {L3} or {LT}+{RT} to see what each button does · {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"segure {L3} ou {LT}+{RT} para ver a função de cada botão · {L3}+{R3} abre o menu do WuWa VR","now":"agora","stopped at the closest %s cm":"parado na distância mínima de %s cm","subject":"alvo","{LT}+{RT}, click {R3} for full VR":"{LT}+{RT}, toque {R3} para VR completo","{LT}+{RT}, click {R3} for the stereo screen":"{LT}+{RT}, toque {R3} para a tela estéreo","{LT}+{RT}, hold {R3} to leave mono":"{LT}+{RT}, segure {R3} para sair do mono"}},"ru":{"schema":1,"language":"ru","name":"Russian","direction":"ltr","font":"latin","review":"draft; native-speaker review welcome","strings":{"%+.0f cm":"%+.0f см","%+.2f m":"%+.2f м","%.0f cm":"%.0f см","%.0f deg":"%.0f°","%.0fx":"%.0fx","%.1f m":"%.1f м","%.1fx":"%.1fx","%.2f m":"%.2f м","%.2f s":"%.2f с","%.2fx":"%.2fx","%.3fx":"%.3fx","%s: %u samples":"%s: %u выборок",". Answer again to change it.":". Ответьте ещё раз, чтобы изменить.","01  HOLD L3":"01  УДЕРЖИВАТЬ L3","02  HOLD LT + RT":"02  УДЕРЖИВАТЬ LT + RT","03  CAMERAS":"03  КАМЕРЫ","04  MENUS & HUD":"04  МЕНЮ И HUD","05  WUWA VR MENU":"05  МЕНЮ WUWA VR","1024 px":"1024 px","1280 px":"1280 px","16:9 UI layout":"Раскладка интерфейса 16:9","30 fps":"30 fps","3D depth":"Глубина 3D","45 fps":"45 fps","60 fps":"60 fps","720 px":"720 px","A VR button or stick held from before is ignored until you let go of it.":"Ранее зажатая кнопка или стик VR игнорируются, пока вы их не отпустите.","A big 3D screen; best for cutscenes":"Большой 3D-экран; лучше всего для катсцен","A hidden head bone has no usable animated pose: the neck supplies an approximation. For actual head-bone tracking choose Keep entire character visible or Hide body; keep full character shadow. Separate accessories without a head bone may remain visible in head-only mode. Exit and re-enter first person in a neutral pose to recalibrate. Offsets use game units. L3 + A recenters headset/simulator displacement.":"Скрытая кость головы не имеет пригодной анимированной позы — используется приближение от шеи. Для точного отслеживания головы выберите «Показывать персонажа целиком» или «Скрыть тело, оставить исходные тени». Отдельные аксессуары без кости головы могут оставаться видимыми в режиме только головы. Выйдите и снова войдите в вид от первого лица в нейтральной позе для калибровки. Смещения указываются в игровых единицах. L3 + A центрирует смещение шлема/симулятора.","A select  ·  Left / right change  ·  LB / RB pages  ·  B close":"A — выбрать  ·  Влево/вправо — изменить  ·  LB/RB — листать страницы  ·  B — закрыть","A-D restore all controller slots for a fair comparison. Each records until stopped or 1000 changes. Close with Insert, test LB+Y before and after Alt-Tab, then return with Insert. Restore above to undo this batch. UEVR saves the current settings on exit.":"A–D — восстановить все слоты контроллера для корректного сравнения. Каждый слот записывается до остановки или до 1000 изменений. Закройте Insert, проверьте LB+Y до и после Alt-Tab, вернитесь через Insert. Восстановите настройку выше, чтобы отменить изменения. UEVR сохраняет текущие настройки при выходе.","A. Physical gamepad baseline":"A. Эталон физического геймпада","A/B/X/Y keep their labels. Triggers = LT/RT, grips = LB/RB, stick clicks = L3/R3. Left Menu tap = Start; left grip + Menu tap = View. Both stick clicks open the WuWa VR menu. D-pad actions are not mapped.":"A/B/X/Y сохраняют свои обозначения. Триггеры = LT/RT, бамперы = LB/RB, клики стиков = L3/R3. Короткое нажатие левого Menu = Start; левый бампер + Menu = View. Оба клика стиков открывают меню WuWa VR. Действия крестовины не назначены.","Acro drone":"Акродрон","Acro drone (manual)":"Акродрон (ручной)","Acro throttle control":"Управление тягой акродрона","Acro: right stick controls roll/pitch rates; left stick X controls yaw. Stick forward pitches down. Centered sticks stop rotation without levelling. Gravity, thrust and momentum keep acting while armed. Full camera roll is part of this mode.":"Акро: правый стик управляет скоростью крена/тангажа, ось X левого стика — рысканьем. Наклон стика вперёд задаёт снижение. В центральном положении стики останавливают вращение без выравнивания. Гравитация, тяга и инерция продолжают действовать при взведении. В этом режиме доступен полный крен камеры.","Action":"Действие","Activated automatically in this menu: cursor only. L3 + R3 opens the WuWa VR menu.":"Автоматически активируется в этом меню: только курсор. L3 + R3 открывает меню WuWa VR.","Active: %s (targets swapped %llu, constructed %llu)":"Активно: %s (целей обменяно: %llu, создано: %llu)","Active: %s, %llu s left, applied %llu, restored %llu":"Активно: %s, осталось %llu с, применено %llu, восстановлено %llu","Adds the missing second-eye pass for the custom material path used by Lynae, Mornye and Iuno. Preserves the first eye. Requires Native Stereo, with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off. Visual acceptance pending.":"Добавляет недостающий проход для второго глаза в кастомном материале Lynae, Mornye и Iuno. Сохраняет проход первого глаза. Требуется Native Stereo, при отключённых Native Stereo Fix и Extreme Compatibility. Визуальная проверка ожидается.","Advanced compatibility and diagnostics":"Расширенная совместимость и диагностика","Advanced rendering and script diagnostics":"Расширенный рендеринг и диагностика скриптов","After you switch views, a line shows for 3 seconds with how to go on or come back. It switches itself off after 5 switches.":"После смены вида на 3 секунды появляется строка о том, как переключиться дальше или вернуться. После 5 переключений она отключается.","Aim direction":"Направление прицеливания","Aiming and right-stick pitch":"Прицеливание и наклон правым стиком","Air drag (per second)":"Сопротивление воздуха (за секунду)","All camera effects":"Все эффекты камеры","All camera effects copied into the first view":"Все эффекты камеры скопированы в первый вид","All camera effects copied into the second view":"Все эффекты камеры скопированы во второй вид","All detected menus":"Все обнаруженные меню","All settings (classic UEVR menu)":"Все настройки (классическое меню UEVR)","All shortcut contexts":"Все команды","All slots (unchanged)":"Все слоты (без изменений)","All slots preserves normal input. Select one slot to exclude the others from WuWa's XInput state calls. Check the raw controller states below while pressing a button to identify your pad. Slot numbers can change after reconnecting; this does not hide Windows devices or filter other input APIs. Vibration commands stay available, including motor stop requests.":"Режим «Все слоты» сохраняет обычный ввод. Выберите один слот, чтобы исключить остальные из вызовов XInput игры WuWa. Нажимайте кнопки и смотрите необработанные состояния контроллера ниже, чтобы определить нужный слот. Номера слотов могут меняться при переподключении; это не скрывает устройства Windows и не фильтрует другие API ввода. Команды вибрации остаются доступными, включая остановку моторов.","All stick overrides (includes legacy pitch-only)":"Все переопределения стика (включая устаревший режим только тангажа)","Allow VR motion-controller input":"Разрешить ввод с VR-контроллеров","Also cover the ESC profile ID row":"Также скрывать ID в меню ESC","Also hide the profile ID row":"Также скрывать строку ID профиля","Alternating / AFR":"Чередование / AFR","Always":"Всегда","Always (manual mask)":"Всегда (ручная маска)","Ambient occlusion":"Фоновое затенение","Ambient occlusion (soft contact shadows)":"Фоновое затенение (мягкие контактные тени)","An automated stereo comparison is active. These three settings return to your choices when it ends (at most 60 seconds).":"Выполняется автоматическое стереосравнение. Эти три настройки вернутся к выбранным значениям по окончании (не более 60 секунд).","Animated":"По анимации","Animated position + stick pitch":"Позиция по анимации + наклон стиком","Animation comfort":"Комфорт анимации","Animation off: stable height relative to the character root. On: follow the head, or reconstruct it from a visible parent bone when the head is hidden. This follows leaning and sprinting but can add bobbing. Missing rig support falls back to the stable anchor; see the status below.":"Анимация выключена: стабильная высота относительно корня персонажа. Включена: следует за головой либо восстанавливает её по видимой родительской кости, если голова скрыта. Отслеживает наклоны и бег, но может добавлять покачивание. При отсутствии поддержки рига используется стабильный якорь — см. статус ниже.","Another playtest request is pending. Wait for the launcher.":"Ожидается другой запрос на плейтест. Дождитесь запуска лаунчера.","Another setting changed the rim value; it was left untouched. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"Другое изменение уже затронуло значение каймы — оно оставлено без изменений. Отключите и включите настройку повторно.","Answer in the menu: L3 + R3 (or Insert), Test page.":"Ответ в меню: L3 + R3 (или Insert), тестовая страница.","As in the headset":"Как в шлеме","As in the headset: the HUD sits where you see it in VR, at its distance and size. Flat: the HUD fills the window like on a monitor, a steady reference while you play. Full VR only; the stereo screen and mono theatre always show it flat.":"Как в шлеме: HUD находится там, где вы видите его в VR, на том же расстоянии и того же размера. Плоский: HUD заполняет окно, как на мониторе, — устойчивый ориентир во время игры. Только полный VR; стереоэкран и монотеатр всегда показывают его плоским.","Asks the game to lay out its HUD again. Try it if the HUD looks stretched or cut off after switching views.":"Просит игру пересчитать расположение HUD. Попробуйте, если HUD растянут или обрезан после смены вида.","Authored framing applied (headset check pending)":"Применено авторское кадрирование (ожидает проверки в шлеме)","Auto":"Авто","Auto uses the eye that has the camera's focus. If both eyes stay sharp or look wrong, try First or Second.":"Авто выбирает глаз, в котором камера держит фокус. Если оба глаза чёткие или изображение выглядит странно — попробуйте Первый или Второй.","Automatic":"Автоматически","Automatic cinematic screen":"Автовыбор экрана в кат-сценах","Automatic cinematic screen (experimental)":"Автовыбор экрана в кат-сценах (эксперимент)","Automatic cutscene switching":"Автовыбор вида в кат-сценах","Automatic lease expired; restoration waits for the next game tick":"Автоматическая аренда истекла; восстановление ждёт следующего игрового такта","Automatic mono theatre active":"Автоматический монотеатр включён","Automatic presentation lease expired; previous view restored":"Автоматический показ истёк; прежний вид восстановлен","Automatic slot: using slot %d.":"Автоматический слот: используется слот %d.","Automatic stereo screen active":"Автоматический стереоэкран включён","Automatic story switching did not activate in the latest reported replay. Prerecorded video switching has not been tested. Missing or changed signals leave the normal view unchanged.":"Автоматическое переключение в сюжетных сценах не сработало в последнем проверенном реплее. Переключение для предзаписанного видео не тестировалось. Если сигналы отсутствуют или изменились, вид остаётся прежним.","Automatic uses the slot that has a controller, such as a treadmill's virtual pad while the real pad is hidden. Choose a fixed slot only if it picks the wrong one: launcher Troubleshooting > Controller check lists them.":"Автоматически выбирается слот, где есть контроллер, например виртуальный геймпад беговой дорожки, пока настоящий скрыт. Фиксированный слот выбирайте, только если автоматика ошибается: список слотов — в лаунчере, «Устранение неполадок > Проверка контроллера».","Automatically use mouse in game menus (legacy)":"Автоматически использовать мышь в меню игры (устар.)","B. Windows focus forwarding":"B. Передача фокуса в Windows","Back to 1.33, the full VR default.":"Вернуть 1.33 — значение по умолчанию для полного VR.","Back to the WuWa VR menu":"Вернуться в меню WuWa VR","Back to the diorama defaults: 5 m back, centred. The normal offsets stay as they are.":"Вернуть значения диорамы по умолчанию: 5 м назад, по центру. Обычные смещения не меняются.","Back to the game camera.":"Вернуться к камере игры.","Black bars":"Чёрные полосы","Black bars in cutscenes? In WuWa's graphics settings, change Cinematic from Cutscene to Fullscreen. The bars go and cutscenes fill your view.":"Чёрные полосы в кат-сценах? В графических настройках WuWa смените Cinematic с Cutscene на Fullscreen — полосы исчезнут, кат-сцены заполнят поле зрения.","Black boxes cover the bottom-right UID and the ESC profile ID row in the extracted game UI, including its VR/portal and spectator copies. Check a short recording before sharing: other layouts, names, chat and diagnostics are not anonymized.":"Чёрные прямоугольники закрывают UID в правом нижнем углу и строку с ID профиля в меню ESC во всём извлечённом интерфейсе (включая версии для VR/портала и для просмотра со стороны). Перед публикацией записи проверьте короткий ролик: другие слои, имена, чат и диагностика не скрываются.","Black boxes over your UID in the corner and the profile ID row in menus. While recording: while the WuWa VR app records or a treadmill run is on, so the boxes never cover HUD you need in play. Always: for OBS and other recorders at any time. The boxes are approximate; check a short video before sharing. Other names and chat are not hidden.":"Чёрные прямоугольники поверх вашего UID в углу и строки ID профиля в меню. Во время записи: пока приложение WuWa VR записывает или идёт пробежка на дорожке, чтобы прямоугольники не закрывали нужный в игре HUD. Всегда: для OBS и других программ записи в любое время. Прямоугольники приблизительны; перед публикацией проверьте короткое видео. Другие имена и чат не скрываются.","Blocked":"Заблокировано","Blur (depth of field) on / off":"Размытие (глубина резкости): вкл. / выкл.","Blur copied into the first view":"Размытие скопировано в первый вид","Blur copied into the second view":"Размытие скопировано во второй вид","Blur off":"Размытие выкл.","Blur on":"Размытие вкл.","Blur only":"Только размытие","Blur strength, full VR":"Сила размытия (полный VR)","Blur strength, screens":"Сила размытия (экраны)","Both eyes get":"Оба глаза получают","Both eyes, side by side":"Оба глаза рядом","Both eyes: %s":"Оба глаза: %s","Both together":"Оба вместе","Both together: buttons combine and each stick follows whichever is pushed further, so treadmill walking keeps working while you look around with VR. Last used wins: the other waits until you use it. VR only: the Xbox pad is ignored while VR controllers are on.":"Оба вместе: кнопки объединяются, а каждый стик следует за тем, который отклонён сильнее, поэтому ходьба на дорожке работает, пока вы осматриваетесь в VR. Последний использованный: другой ждёт, пока вы им не воспользуетесь. Только VR: геймпад Xbox игнорируется, пока включены VR-контроллеры.","Both work at once: buttons combine and each stick follows whichever is pushed further, so treadmill walking keeps working.":"Работают одновременно: кнопки объединяются, а каждый стик управляется по тому, который отклонён сильнее — так ходьба на беговой дорожке сохраняет работоспособность.","Build left view like the first eye (K5)":"Сформировать левый вид как первый глаз (K5)","Buttons":"Кнопки","C. Gamepad passthrough":"C. Проброс геймпада","CAMERA":"КАМЕРА","Camera":"Камера","Camera / HUD layouts: LuaLoader > Script UI > WuWa VR comfort controls.":"Компоновки камеры и HUD: LuaLoader > Script UI > WuWa VR comfort controls.","Camera and controller data":"Данные камеры и контроллера","Camera and gameplay controls":"Камера и управление","Camera collision radius (game units)":"Радиус столкновения камеры (в единицах игры)","Camera customization":"Настройка камеры","Camera position":"Положение камеры","Camera up / down":"Камера вверх / вниз","Camera view":"Режим камеры","Cannot write playtest request.":"Не удалось записать запрос на плейтест.","Card distance":"Расстояние до карточки","Card height":"Высота карточки","Card size":"Размер карточки","Card width (meters)":"Ширина карточки (м)","Change page":"Сменить страницу","Character screen in the taller layout":"Экран персонажа в более высокой раскладке","Character toon-depth rim is suppressed; the previous value is retained.":"Контурное тонирование по глубине для персонажа отключено; предыдущее значение сохранено.","Character toon-depth rim was already zero; no write was needed.":"Кромка toon-depth персонажа уже была нулевой; запись не потребовалась.","Character visibility details":"Подробности видимости персонажа","Characters in the shot":"Персонажи в кадре","Characters in the shot: the person the game focuses on (or nearest the middle of the 2D frame), and Close-up match stops behind anyone in front of them, as in over-the-shoulder shots. Game focus only: aims by the game's focus distance alone and does not look for people.":"Персонажи в кадре: тот, на кого фокусируется игра (или ближайший к центру 2D-кадра), а Совмещение крупного плана останавливается позади любого, кто перед ними, как при съёмке через плечо. Только фокус игры: наводится лишь по дистанции фокуса игры и не ищет людей.","Checklist item":"Пункт чек-листа","Choose First person under View modes if wanted; camera and aiming settings stay unchanged.":"При желании выберите «От первого лица» в разделе «Режимы обзора»; настройки камеры и прицеливания не изменятся.","Choose a checklist item in this playtest.":"Выберите пункт чек-листа в этом тесте.","Cinema":"Кино","Cinematic scene":"Кинематографическая сцена","Cinematic scene note":"Примечание к кинематографической сцене","Click / go back":"Нажать / назад","Click left stick + left bumper, then release all controls.":"Нажмите левый стик + левый бампер, затем всё отпустите.","Click twice":"Нажать дважды","Click: blur on / off":"Клик: размытие вкл. / выкл.","Click: full VR / stereo screen":"Клик: полный VR / стереоэкран","Close UEVR before using these shortcuts. L3/R3 mean clicking the sticks; View is the two-squares button and Menu is the three-lines button.":"Закройте UEVR перед использованием этих команд. L3/R3 означают нажатие стиков; View — кнопка с двумя квадратами, а Menu — кнопка с тремя линиями.","Close UEVR, press L3 + LB once, then release the controller. Left stick moves the cursor; A clicks, B goes back, X + stick scrolls. LT/RT moves the HUD nearer/farther; LB/RB lowers/raises it. L3 + LB again returns to normal controls. Adjustment pauses freecam flight and starts off each launch.":"Закройте UEVR, нажмите L3 + LB один раз, затем отпустите контроллер. Левый стик перемещает курсор; A — клик, B — назад, X + стик — прокрутка. LT/RT приближает/отдаляет HUD; LB/RB опускает/поднимает его. Повторное L3 + LB возвращает обычное управление. Режим настройки приостанавливает полёт свободной камеры и отключён при каждом запуске.","Close-up aims at":"Крупный план нацелен на","Close-up at %s degrees: %s %s m away, moved %s m nearer":"Крупный план, %s градусов: %s в %s м, приближено на %s м","Close-up at %s degrees: the game sets no focus in this shot, view at the game camera":"Крупный план, %s градусов: игра не задаёт фокус в этом кадре, вид от игровой камеры","Close-up match":"Совмещение крупного плана","Closest distance":"Ближайшее расстояние","Collide with the world":"Столкновение с миром","Comfort":"Комфорт","Comfort keeps your height steady and the horizon level. Animated follows your character's head as it moves. Full animation also follows its turns (experimental). Custom uses the options in the classic menu.":"Комфорт сохраняет постоянную высоту и ровный горизонт. Анимация следует за головой персонажа при движении. Полная анимация также следует за его поворотами (эксперимент). Режим «Свои» использует параметры классического меню.","Comfort: stable height, level horizon":"Комфорт: постоянная высота и горизонт","Compare controller fixes in this run":"Сравнить исправления контроллера в этом сеансе","Confirming cinematic signal":"Подтверждение кинематографического сигнала","Controller shortcuts":"Команды контроллера","Controller slot":"Слот контроллера","Controllers":"Контроллеры","Controls":"Управление","Controls cards":"Карточки управления","Controls cards (hold L3, or LT + RT)":"Карточки управления (удерживать L3 или LT + RT)","Copy failed":"Не удалось скопировать","Copy from":"Копировать из","Covers the ID row on the ESC profile screen too.":"Также скрывает строку ID на экране профиля ESC.","Current renderer: %s":"Текущий рендерер: %s","Current result: %s":"Текущий результат: %s","Custom":"Свои","Custom / saved behavior":"Свои / сохранённые настройки","Custom motion settings":"Свои настройки движения","Custom-reflection comparison stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"Сравнение пользовательских отражений остановлено или не удалось проверить эту сборку игры. Смотрите журнал диагностики.","Custom: Extreme Compatibility":"Свои: максимальная совместимость","D-pad":"Крестовина","D-pad / A / B":"Крестовина / A / B","D. Focus forwarding + passthrough":"D. Передача фокуса + сквозной вид","DO":"ДЕЛАТЬ","Decouple game camera pitch":"Отвязать наклон камеры игры","Decoupled pitch":"Отвязанный наклон","Default: %s. Saved for next time.":"По умолчанию: %s. Сохраняется на следующий раз.","Default: F7. Xbox: hold L3, then squeeze LT. Release both before repeating. Portal size and curvature are preserved; enabling anchors it in front of you.":"По умолчанию: F7. Xbox: удерживайте L3, затем нажмите LT. Отпустите обе перед повтором. Размер и кривизна портала сохраняются; при включении он закрепляется перед вами.","Default: keeps the body visible and head bones hidden, with a full shadow copy. Original non-casting/hidden equipment stays excluded. Copies are removed on exit, menus, rig changes or script reset. Unsupported rigs report a fallback below.":"По умолчанию: тело остаётся видимым, кости головы скрыты, создаётся полная копия тени. Исходное оборудование без теней или скрытое остаётся исключённым. Копии удаляются при выходе, открытии меню, смене рига или сбросе скрипта. Для неподдерживаемых ригов ниже указан резервный вариант.","Degrees above straight ahead (below is negative).":"Градусы выше направления вперёд (ниже — отрицательно).","Degrees below your line of sight. More puts the card lower, out of the way of the HUD.":"На сколько градусов ниже линии взгляда. Чем больше, тем ниже карточка и тем меньше она мешает HUD.","Degrees to the right of straight ahead (left is negative).":"Градусы вправо от направления вперёд (влево — отрицательно).","Depth of field":"Глубина резкости","Depth of field and camera effects":"Глубина резкости и эффекты камеры","Depth-of-field fields not found":"Поля глубины резкости не найдены","Desktop window":"Окно на мониторе","Detection details":"Подробности обнаружения","Developer playtest checklist":"Чек-лист плейтеста разработчика","Dialogue shots use a zoom lens your headset's wide view can't show, so people look small and far. This moves you nearer, per shot, so they keep this share of their 2D size. At 0 you stay at the game camera's own spot, 100 matches the 2D shot and above 100 comes closer still. Game camera in full VR only.":"В диалоговых кадрах используется зум-объектив, который широкий обзор шлема не передаёт, поэтому люди кажутся маленькими и далёкими. Эта настройка приближает вас в каждом кадре, чтобы они сохраняли эту долю своего 2D-размера. При 0 вы остаётесь на месте камеры игры, 100 соответствует 2D-кадру, а выше 100 — ещё ближе. Только для камеры игры в полном VR.","Diorama (10×)":"Диорама (10×)","Diorama (miniature world)":"Диорама (миниатюрный мир)","Diorama camera":"Камера диорамы","Diorama is on at %.0fx. This slider edits the normal scale restored when you turn it off in WuWa Controls.":"Диорама включена на %.0fx. Этот ползунок задаёт обычный масштаб, который восстанавливается при её отключении в WuWa Controls.","Diorama mode (optional)":"Режим диорамы (необязательно)","Diorama needs Native Stereo. Choose it under Stereo rendering compatibility.":"Диораме нужен Native Stereo. Выберите его в разделе «Совместимость стереорендера».","Diorama on / off":"Диорама: вкл. / выкл.","Diorama scale":"Масштаб диорамы","Diorama uses a temporary miniature scale (Diorama scale on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page, 10x by default) with Native Stereo, with the portal on or off. Turning it off returns to your normal saved scale, including deliberate scale edits. It starts off each launch, settings reload and runtime reinitialization. Head movement is magnified; L3 + A recenters.":"Диорама использует временный масштаб миниатюры (масштаб диорамы на странице «Быстрые» меню WuWa VR, по умолчанию 10x) с Native Stereo, при включённом или выключенном портале. Отключение возвращает ваш обычный сохранённый масштаб, включая намеренные правки масштаба. Она выключается при каждом запуске, перезагрузке настроек и переинициализации среды выполнения. Движение головы усиливается; L3 + A центрирует.","Diorama: forward / back":"Диорама: вперёд / назад","Diorama: right / left":"Диорама: вправо / влево","Diorama: up / down":"Диорама: вверх / вниз","Direct PlayStation shortcuts are experimental. The game still receives their buttons. Steam Input is preferred when available; release all controls after changing input sources.":"Прямые ярлыки PlayStation экспериментальны. Игра всё равно получает их кнопки. Steam Input предпочтителен, когда доступен; отпустите все элементы управления после смены источников ввода.","Discard unsent note":"Удалить неотправленную заметку","Distance":"Расстояние","Do: ":"Сделайте: ","Done":"Готово","Double L3  Windows screenshot":"Дважды L3  скриншот Windows","Double R3":"Дважды R3","Double R3  Freecam on / off":"Дважды R3  Свободная камера: вкл. / выкл.","Draws the missing eye of the world-label stage with its own camera and depth rectangle. Requires the matching candidate DLL and native stereo without Native Stereo Fix. Unsupported layouts keep the original rendering. NPC/bubble acceptance is pending; this does not repair reflections or character materials.":"Дорисовывает недостающий глаз этапа world-label собственной камерой и прямоугольником глубины. Требует соответствующей DLL-кандидата и native stereo без Native Stereo Fix. Неподдерживаемые раскладки сохраняют исходный рендеринг. Приёмка NPC/пузырей ещё не выполнена; это не исправляет отражения и материалы персонажей.","Drone response (higher = less drift)":"Отзывчивость дрона (выше = меньше дрейфа)","DualSense direct shortcuts (experimental)":"Прямые ярлыки DualSense (эксперимент)","DualShock 4 direct shortcuts (experimental)":"Прямые ярлыки DualShock 4 (эксперимент)","ESC / overlay menus (detected)":"ESC / наложенные меню (по обнаружению)","EXPECT":"ОЖИДАЕТСЯ","Each eye: %u x %u pixels. Now about %.0f fps.":"Каждый глаз: %u x %u пикселей. Сейчас около %.0f fps.","Early stereo view setup (experimental)":"Ранняя настройка стереовида (эксперимент)","Edit the UTF-8 JSON files in your game profile's wuwa-languages folder. Missing entries fall back to English. Reload applies changes without restarting the game.":"Редактируйте файлы UTF-8 JSON в папке wuwa-languages вашего игрового профиля. Отсутствующие записи заменяются английскими. Перезагрузка применяет изменения без перезапуска игры.","Edit translations":"Редактировать переводы","Enable WuWa controller shortcuts":"Включить ярлыки контроллера WuWa","Enable automatic switching":"Включить автоматическое переключение","Enable controller mouse shortcuts":"Включить ярлыки мыши контроллера","End run":"Завершить пробежку","End the temporary focus/motion test below before starting a comparison.":"Завершите временный тест фокуса/движения ниже, прежде чем начинать сравнение.","Enter first person":"Включить вид от первого лица","Everyday controller shortcuts":"Повседневные ярлыки контроллера","Everyone":"Все","Everything else: {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"Всё остальное: {L3}+{R3} открывает меню WuWa VR","Exact animation":"Точная анимация","Exact animation (stick does not steer view)":"Точная анимация (стик не меняет вид)","Exit mouse mode now":"Выйти из режима мыши","Expect: ":"Ожидается: ","Extract additional game menus (experimental)":"Извлекать другие меню (эксперимент)","Extract game HUD into the VR panel":"Извлекать HUD на VR-панель","Eyes don't match":"Глаза не совпадают","FPV camera upward tilt (degrees)":"Наклон камеры FPV вверх (градусы)","Faces the view forward from where you are now.":"Направляет вид вперёд из вашего текущего положения.","Fail":"Провал","Far trees and props switch detail together in both eyes. Recommended.":"Далеко расположенные деревья и объекты переключают детализацию синхронно в обоих глазах. Рекомендуется.","Fill whole frame (stretch)":"Заполнить рамку (растянуть)","Finish only when you are done. Untested checks remain Not tested; no result is inferred from notes.":"Завершайте только когда всё сделано. Непроверенные пункты остаются «Не проверено»: результат не выводится из заметок.","Finish playtest":"Завершить тестирование","Finished":"Готово","Finishing the video. Please wait.":"Сохранение видео. Подождите.","First person":"От первого лица","First person character visibility":"Видимость персонажа","First person forward offset":"Смещение вперёд","First person height offset":"Смещение по высоте","First person motion":"Движение в первом лице","First person on / off":"Первое лицо: вкл. / выкл.","First person right offset":"Смещение вправо","First person: full animation":"Первое лицо: полная анимация","First view":"Первый вид","First-person position":"Позиция от первого лица","First-person script status":"Статус скрипта первого лица","Fit to portal frame":"Подогнать под рамку портала","Fixed":"Фиксированная","Fixed camera distance (game units)":"Дистанция фиксированной камеры (игровые единицы)","Fixed camera height above pawn (game units)":"Высота фиксированной камеры над персонажем (игровые единицы)","Fixed per shot":"Фиксировано для кадра","Fixed third person":"Фиксированный вид от третьего лица","Fixed: farther / closer":"Фикс.: дальше / ближе","Fixes":"Исправления","Flat screen; easiest on the eyes":"Плоский экран; самый щадящий для глаз","Flat, like a monitor":"Плоский, как на мониторе","Flying style":"Стиль полёта","Focus game on controller reconnect":"Фокусировать игру при переподключении контроллера","Follow animated head / neck position (Custom)":"Следовать анимированной позиции головы / шеи (свои)","Follow the focus":"Следовать за фокусом","Follow view (player HUD)":"Следовать за взглядом (HUD)","Follow view keeps the HUD with your head. Distance still sets its stereo depth; choose a comfortable size and distance in the headset.":"Режим следования держит HUD перед вашей головой. Расстояние по-прежнему задаёт его стереоглубину; выберите комфортный размер и расстояние в шлеме.","For exact edge alignment set WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature to 0. This HUD panel is flat; it does not bend with a curved aperture.":"Для точного совмещения краёв задайте в WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature значение 0. Эта панель HUD плоская; она не изгибается вместе с изогнутой апертурой.","For the WuWa VR menu, the controls cards and notices. The game's own language is set in the game.":"Для меню WuWa VR, карточек управления и уведомлений. Язык самой игры задаётся в игре.","For the whole scene":"На всю сцену","For troubleshooting and comparisons. Leave these alone for everyday play; opening this section changes nothing.":"Для диагностики и сравнений. Не трогайте их в обычной игре; открытие этого раздела ничего не меняет.","For troubleshooting. These controls can change rendering or input; opening this section changes nothing.":"Для диагностики. Эти настройки могут влиять на рендеринг или ввод; открытие этого раздела ничего не меняет.","Forward / back":"Вперёд / назад","Forward Windows focus events (test)":"Передавать события фокуса Windows (тест)","Frame coverage (1 = full size)":"Заполнение рамки (1 = полностью)","Frame rate":"Частота кадров","Frames per second in the video.":"Кадров в секунду в видео.","Framing and theatre details":"Кадрирование и детали театра","Framing candidate refused; see diagnostic log":"Кандидат кадрирования отклонён; см. диагностический журнал","Framing matched both eyes in the owner's simulator replay. Headset comfort and rare prerecorded movies still need testing.":"Кадрирование совпало для обоих глаз в симуляторе автора. Комфорт в шлеме и редкие заранее записанные ролики ещё требуют проверки.","Framing repair matched both eyes in a simulator quest replay. Headset comfort remains untested; mono theatre is still available as a manual fallback.":"Исправление кадрирования совпало для обоих глаз в симуляторе квеста. Комфорт в шлеме пока не проверен; монотеатр по-прежнему доступен как ручной запасной вариант.","Freecam":"Свободная камера","Freecam collision (experimental)":"Столкновения камеры (эксперимент)","Freecam movement speed":"Скорость свободной камеры","Freecam movement style":"Режим свободной камеры","Freecam on / off":"Свободная камера: вкл. / выкл.","Freecam turning speed":"Скорость поворота","Freecam: LB descends; double RT = turbo":"Своб. камера: LB — вниз; дважды RT = турбо","Freecam: LT rises, RT boosts speed":"Своб. камера: LT — вверх, RT ускоряет","Freecam: boost / turbo":"Своб. камера: ускорение / турбо","Freecam: left stick moves, right looks":"Своб. камера: левый стик — движение, правый — обзор","Freecam: move / look":"Своб. камера: движение / обзор","Freecam: rise / descend":"Своб. камера: вверх / вниз","Front":"Спереди","Full VR":"Полный VR","Full VR / stereo screen (click again to switch back)":"Полный VR / стереоэкран (нажмите ещё раз, чтобы вернуться)","Full VR draws two large eye images every frame, far more pixels than the stereo screen, so busy scenes such as dialogue run slower there. A lower resolution is smoother and a little softer.":"Полный VR каждый кадр рисует два больших изображения для глаз — гораздо больше пикселей, чем стереоэкран, поэтому насыщенные сцены, например диалоги, идут там медленнее. Снижение разрешения даёт плавность и небольшую мягкость картинки.","Full VR: the game all around you. Stereo screen: a big 3D screen, for menus and scenes that look wrong in full VR. Mono theatre: a flat screen, the same picture in both eyes. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then hold R3 (hold again to go back).":"Полный VR: игра вокруг вас. Стереоэкран: большой 3D-экран для меню и сцен, которые плохо выглядят в полном VR. Монотеатр: плоский экран, одна и та же картинка для обоих глаз. Горячая клавиша: удерживайте LT + RT, затем удерживайте R3 (удерживайте снова, чтобы вернуться).","Full animation":"Полная анимация","Full animation follows character turns and can be intense. L3 + D-pad Down returns to your previous motion choice.":"Полная анимация повторяет повороты персонажа и может быть утомительной. L3 + крестовина вниз возвращает к предыдущему варианту движения.","Full animation is paused: headset/controller aim or Decoupled Pitch conflicts with animated head turning. Game-view rotation is being used; head position still follows the character.":"Полная анимация приостановлена: прицеливание шлемом/контроллером или отвязанный наклон конфликтует с анимированным поворотом головы. Используется поворот камеры игры; положение головы по-прежнему следует за персонажем.","Full animation rotation (experimental)":"Полный поворот по анимации (эксперимент)","Full animation: stick override":"Анимация: приоритет стика","Full frame at 1 fills both axes of the portal rectangle. It stretches the HUD if its proportions differ from the frame. Preserve proportions leaves space on one axis. Safe fit also leaves a margin for rounded/feathered edges. Your separate HUD layout is retained.":"Заполнение рамки на 1 заполняет обе оси прямоугольника портала. Это растягивает HUD, если его пропорции отличаются от рамки. Сохранение пропорций оставляет место на одной оси. Безопасное вписывание также оставляет отступ для скруглённых/размытых краёв. Ваша отдельная раскладка HUD сохраняется.","Full speed while Polar walk is on":"Полная скорость при включённом Polar walk","Full-resolution translucent materials in stereo (candidate)":"Прозрачные материалы полного разрешения в стерео (кандидат)","Fully hold both triggers first. R3: click to switch between full VR and the stereo screen, hold 0.8 seconds for mono theatre (hold again to go back); with the triggers still held you can click or hold R3 again. L3: click to turn blur on or off, hold 0.8 seconds for the stereo screen; release all controls before repeating an L3 shortcut. Available during dialogue; close UEVR and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first.":"Сначала полностью удерживайте оба триггера. R3: нажатие переключает между полным VR и стереоэкраном, удержание 0,8 секунды включает монотеатр (удерживайте снова, чтобы вернуться); пока триггеры удерживаются, R3 можно нажимать или удерживать снова. L3: нажатие включает или выключает размытие, удержание 0,8 секунды переключает на стереоэкран; отпустите все элементы управления перед повтором сочетания с L3. Доступно во время диалога; сначала закройте UEVR и выйдите из режима настройки HUD/мыши.","GAME UI HIDDEN - MENUS ARE HIDDEN TOO":"ИНТЕРФЕЙС СКРЫТ - МЕНЮ ТОЖЕ","GAME UI IS HIDDEN":"ИНТЕРФЕЙС СКРЫТ","GAME UI IS HIDDEN - menus are hidden too":"ИНТЕРФЕЙС СКРЫТ - МЕНЮ ТОЖЕ","GENERAL":"ОБЩЕЕ","Game / fixed camera":"Камера игры / фиксированная","Game camera":"Камера игры","Game camera follows WuWa's own camera and its dialogue camera work. Close-up match brings you nearer in zoomed-in shots, so they frame people like the 2D view does.":"Камера игры следует за собственной камерой WuWa и её камерой в диалогах. Режим близкого соответствия приближает вас в зумированных кадрах, чтобы персонажи кадрировались так же, как в 2D.","Game camera: WuWa's own camera. Fixed third person: a steady camera behind you. Freecam: fly the camera anywhere, for cutscenes and photos. First person: through your character's eyes. Options for each are on the Camera page.":"Камера игры: собственная камера WuWa. Фиксированный вид от третьего лица: стабильная камера за спиной. Свободная камера: позволяет летать камерой где угодно — для катсцен и фото. От первого лица: вид глазами вашего персонажа. Настройки каждого режима находятся на вкладке «Камера».","Game focus only":"Только фокус игры","Game lens":"Объектив игры","Game lens: the stereo screen frames every shot exactly like the 2D view, in 3D. Wide: the fixed 90 degree view used in older versions.":"Объектив игры: стереоэкран кадрирует каждый план точно как в 2D, но в 3D. Широкий: фиксированный обзор 90°, как в старых версиях.","Game-view override shows the game's camera direction while either stick is used, then returns to animation 0.4 seconds after release. Full animation and headset view can still disagree with movement or target selection; aim alignment remains under investigation. These options never rotate or move the character for you.":"Переопределение вида игры показывает направление камеры игры при использовании любого стика и возвращается к анимации через 0,4 с после отпускания. Полная анимация и вид в шлеме могут не совпадать с движением или выбором цели; выравнивание прицеливания пока исследуется. Эти опции никогда не поворачивают и не перемещают персонажа за вас.","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes.":"Одинаковая кадрировка для обоих глаз в сценах с чёрными полосами.","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes. Leave on unless a scene looks cropped.":"Одинаковая кадрировка для обоих глаз в сценах с чёрными полосами. Оставьте включённым, если только сцена не выглядит обрезанной.","HUD":"HUD","HUD / MOUSE MODE ON":"РЕЖИМ HUD / МЫШИ ВКЛЮЧЁН","HUD / mouse adjustment ON (L3 + LB toggles)":"Настройка HUD / мыши включена (L3 + LB — переключить)","HUD / mouse mode":"Режим HUD / мыши","HUD / mouse mode is ON: gameplay buttons are redirected":"Режим HUD / мыши включён: кнопки управления перенаправлены","HUD POSITION":"ПОЛОЖЕНИЕ HUD","HUD and focus comfort":"Комфорт HUD и фокуса","HUD distance":"Расстояние HUD","HUD distance (meters)":"Расстояние HUD (м)","HUD down / up":"HUD вниз / вверх","HUD follows decoupled pitch":"HUD следует за отвязанным наклоном","HUD follows your head":"HUD следует за головой","HUD height (meters)":"Высота HUD (м)","HUD in the desktop window":"HUD в окне на мониторе","HUD nearer / farther":"HUD ближе / дальше","HUD or menu":"HUD или меню","HUD placement and visibility":"Положение и видимость HUD","HUD refresh: done. Check the HUD in the headset.":"Обновление HUD: готово. Проверьте HUD в шлеме.","HUD refresh: not possible right now. Try again in a moment; the log has the details.":"Обновление HUD: сейчас невозможно. Попробуйте чуть позже; подробности в журнале.","HUD refresh: the HUD already matches this view.":"Обновление HUD: HUD уже соответствует этому виду.","HUD refresh: the HUD keeps changing. Open ESC or switch views to try again.":"Обновление HUD: HUD постоянно меняется. Откройте ESC или смените вид и попробуйте снова.","HUD refresh: working on it.":"Обновление HUD: выполняется.","HUD right / left (meters)":"HUD вправо / влево (м)","HUD shape (full VR)":"Форма HUD (полный VR)","HUD size":"Размер HUD","HUD up / down (meters)":"HUD вверх / вниз (м)","Hand / finger demo (optional)":"Демонстрация рук/пальцев (необязательно)","Hand demo is off. Enable it only when you want to try bare-hand tracking.":"Демонстрация рук отключена. Включайте только тогда, когда хотите попробовать отслеживание рук.","Hand tracking returned an error. Switch the demo off and on to retry.":"Ошибка отслеживания рук. Отключите и снова включите демонстрацию, чтобы повторить попытку.","Head movement also scales up. Use Recenter if the view feels displaced. Starts off each launch and after reloading settings.":"Движение головы также масштабируется. Используйте центрирование, если вид сместился. Отключается при каждом запуске и после перезагрузки настроек.","Headset aim selects Head and sends that direction to the game; the stick still turns. Right-stick pitch selects Game, disables control-rotation override and both pitch locks. Neither changes LB + Y or the selected utility.":"Прицел по шлему: выбирает «Голова» и передаёт это направление в игру; стик при этом продолжает поворачивать. Наклон правым стиком: выбирает «Игра», отключает переопределение поворота управления и обе блокировки наклона. Не влияет на LB + Y и не меняет выбранную вспомогательную функцию.","Height":"Высота","Hidden":"Скрыто","Hidden UI stays quiet during normal gameplay. A recovery notice appears only when the game cursor or a known menu-rendering path indicates a menu. L3 + B restores UI. An unknown menu may not be detected; UEVR settings always retain the Show game UI button.":"Скрытый интерфейс не мешает во время обычной игры. Уведомление о восстановлении появляется только когда курсор игры или известный путь отрисовки меню указывает на наличие меню. L3 + B восстанавливает интерфейс. Неизвестное меню может не быть обнаружено; в настройках UEVR всегда остаётся кнопка «Показать интерфейс игры».","Hide Kuro material reflections (workaround candidate)":"Скрыть отражения материалов Kuro (потенциальное обходное решение)","Hide body":"Скрыть тело","Hide body in first person":"Скрыть тело в первом лице","Hide body, keep shadow":"Скрыть тело, оставить тень","Hide body; keep original shadows":"Скрыть тело, оставить исходные тени","Hide character rim lighting (optional workaround)":"Скрыть подсветку контура персонажа (необязательное обходное решение)","Hide characters at your eyes":"Скрывать персонажей у глаз","Hide characters at your eyes on / off":"Скрывать персонажей у глаз вкл. / выкл.","Hide head":"Скрыть голову","Hide head bones keeps the visible body, but also removes the head from its shadow. Hide body; keep full character shadow requests hidden shadows only from the game's original visible shadow casters; it does not enable unused wings or effect rigs. Shadow support depends on the character/material.":"Скрытие костей головы оставляет тело видимым, но убирает голову из её тени. Режим «Скрыть тело, оставить полную тень персонажа» запрашивает скрытие теней только от исходных видимых объектов, отбрасывающих тень; он не включает неиспользуемые крылья или эффекты. Поддержка теней зависит от персонажа и материалов.","Hide head bones; full shadow copy":"Скрыть кости головы, полная копия тени","Hide head bones; keep body":"Скрыть кости головы, оставить тело","Hide head, full shadow":"Скрыть голову, полная тень","Hide player IDs":"Скрыть ID игроков","Hides the captured HUD and menus together. UEVR settings stay available; individual HUD elements cannot yet be moved separately.":"Скрывает захваченные HUD и меню вместе. Настройки UEVR остаются доступными; отдельные элементы HUD пока нельзя перемещать по отдельности.","Hiding off":"Скрытие выкл.","Hiding on":"Скрытие вкл.","Higher follows the game camera more closely.":"Большее значение — HUD точнее следует за камерой игры.","Hint %d of %d. It then switches off; View hints on the WuWa VR menu's HUD page turns it back on.":"Подсказка %d из %d. Затем она отключится; включить снова: «Подсказки видов» на странице HUD меню WuWa VR.","Hold L3, or LT + RT, for half a second: a card rises under your view and shows what each button does, lighting each one as you press it. Let go and it sinks away.":"Удерживайте L3 или LT + RT полсекунды: под вашим взглядом появится карточка с назначением каждой кнопки; при нажатии кнопки будут подсвечиваться. Отпустите — карточка исчезнет.","Hold L3, or both triggers, for half a second: a card rises under your view and lights each button as you use it. Let go and it sinks away. L3 + Menu keeps it open. Close UEVR settings to see it; it is absent from the game's flat spectator view.":"Удерживайте L3 или оба триггера полсекунды: под вашим взглядом появится карточка с подсветкой кнопок при их использовании. Отпустите — карточка исчезнет. L3 + Menu оставит её открытой. Закройте настройки UEVR, чтобы её увидеть; в плоском режиме зрителя она не отображается.","Hold L3, then fully squeeze LT for the portal or RT for diorama. Keep the other trigger released; release all controls before repeating. Close UEVR and game menus and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first. Physical gamepad passthrough bypasses these shortcuts.":"Удерживайте L3, затем полностью нажмите LT для портала или RT для диорамы. Держите второй триггер отпущенным; отпустите все элементы управления перед повторением. Сначала закройте меню UEVR и игры и выйдите из настройки HUD/мыши. Проброс физического геймпада отключает эти ярлыки.","Hold L3: controls card":"Удерживайте L3: карточка управления","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for full VR / stereo screen (hold: mono theatre on / off), click L3 for blur on / off (hold: stereo screen), press Y to hide characters at your eyes. With the triggers held, R3 can be clicked again.":"Удерживайте LT + RT: нажмите R3 для полного VR / стереоэкрана (удерживать: монотеатр вкл. / выкл.), нажмите L3 для размытия вкл. / выкл. (удерживать: стереоэкран), нажмите Y, чтобы скрыть персонажей у глаз. Пока триггеры удерживаются, R3 можно нажать снова.","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for the next view (full VR, stereo screen, mono), hold R3 for full VR; hold L3 for 0.8 s to toggle the screen. Screen off also exits mono. Mono keeps flat menu backgrounds and controls together.":"Удерживайте LT + RT: нажмите R3 для следующего вида (полный VR, стереоэкран, моно), удерживайте R3 для полного VR; удерживайте L3 0,8 с для переключения экрана. Выключение экрана также выходит из моно. Моно сохраняет плоские фоны меню и элементы управления вместе.","Hold LT + RT: views card":"Удерживайте LT + RT: карточка видов","Hold RB":"Удерживать RB","Hold RB: full speed if Polar walk is on":"Удерживайте RB: полная скорость, если включён Polar walk","Hold {L3} for everything else":"Удерживайте {L3} для всего остального","Hold {L3}, then press":"Удерживайте {L3}, затем нажмите","Hold {LT}+{RT} for views":"Удерживайте {LT}+{RT} для видов","Hold {LT}+{RT}, then":"Удерживайте {LT}+{RT}, затем","Hold: mono theatre on / off":"Удерживать: монотеатр вкл. / выкл.","Horizon level removes the game's camera pitch from the VR view. Turn it off for right-stick up/down look, and disable UEVR's Decoupled Pitch below. Head aiming is an alternative; grapple selection still needs game testing.":"Выравнивание горизонта убирает наклон камеры игры из VR-вида. Отключите его для обзора правым стиком вверх/вниз и отключите «Отвязанный наклон» UEVR ниже. Прицеливание головой — альтернатива; выбор крюка-кошки всё ещё требует тестирования в игре.","Hover drone":"Ховер-дрон","Hover drone (inertia)":"Зависание дрона (инерция)","Hover drone: left stick moves horizontally, right stick looks, LT rises, LB descends, RT boosts. Release the stick to settle into a hover.":"Ховер-дрон: левый стик перемещает по горизонтали, правый стик — обзор, LT — подъём, LB — спуск, RT — ускорение. Отпустите стик, чтобы перейти в зависание.","How big the world feels. Above 1 makes you smaller. Diorama uses its own scale and leaves this alone.":"Насколько большим ощущается мир. Больше 1 делает вас меньше. Диорама использует свой масштаб и не трогает это.","How far above or below your character's eyes your view sits. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"Насколько выше или ниже глаз персонажа находится ваш взгляд. В игре: удерживайте L3 и нажимайте Y / X; L3 + Y + X вместе возвращают значение по умолчанию.","How far away the HUD sits. Its stereo depth follows this distance.":"Как далеко расположен HUD. Его стереоглубина зависит от этого расстояния.","How far away the card is.":"Как далеко находится карточка.","How far away this menu floats. UEVR's classic window uses the same distance.":"Как далеко парит это меню. Классическое окно UEVR использует то же расстояние.","How far behind your character the camera stays, in game units (centimetres).":"Насколько далеко за персонажем остаётся камера, в единицах игры (сантиметрах).","How fast the freecam moves.":"Как быстро движется свободная камера.","How fast the freecam turns.":"Как быстро поворачивается свободная камера.","How high above your character the camera sits, in game units. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"Насколько высоко над персонажем находится камера, в игровых единицах. В игре: удерживайте L3 и нажимайте Y / X; L3 + Y + X вместе возвращают значение по умолчанию.","How large the game's HUD and menus appear.":"Насколько крупными выглядят HUD и меню игры.","How large the game's HUD and menus appear. More HUD options are on the HUD page.":"Насколько крупными выглядят HUD и меню игры. Больше настроек HUD — на странице HUD.","How much of its layer this menu fills. Smaller also reads as further away.":"Какую часть своего слоя заполняет это меню. Меньший размер также воспринимается как дальше.","How near Close-up match may bring you to the person in the shot. Lower comes closer. Close-up match at 100 already gives the 2D size; this only stops it short when the shot is very tight.":"Насколько близко «Совмещение крупного плана» может подвести вас к человеку в кадре. Меньше — ближе. Совмещение крупного плана на 100 уже даёт 2D-размер; это лишь останавливает его раньше, когда кадр очень тесный.","How small the world gets in diorama. 10x is an action-figure view. The diorama has its own camera distance (Camera page).":"Насколько уменьшается мир в диораме. 10x — вид коллекционной фигурки. У диорамы своё расстояние камеры (страница «Камера»).","How strong the 3D is on the stereo screen. 1x matches the headset's eye distance to the lens; 0 is flat.":"Насколько сильна 3D на стереоэкране. 1x соответствует расстоянию между глазами и линзами шлема; 0 — плоско.","How to use view toggles":"Как пользоваться переключением видов","How wide the controls card is.":"Какой ширины карточка управления.","I understand that untested checks remain Not tested":"Я понимаю, что непроверенные пункты останутся «Не проверено»","INSERT  =  OPEN UEVR":"INSERT = ОТКРЫТЬ UEVR","INSERT > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"INSERT > WuWa Controls > Показать интерфейс игры","Idle":"Бездействие","Ignore motion input while OpenXR is unfocused (test)":"Игнорировать ввод движения, пока OpenXR не в фокусе (тест)","Ignores the game camera's up / down tilt, so only your head looks up and down. Steadier, and worth trying in gravity-flip areas such as Avinoleum.":"Игнорирует наклон камеры игры вверх / вниз, так что вверх и вниз смотрит только ваша голова. Устойчивее, стоит попробовать в зонах с перевёрнутой гравитацией, таких как Avinoleum.","Immersive VR":"Иммерсивный VR","In full VR the game lays out its HUD for a 4:3 screen, which then looks squashed; 1.33 undoes that. Raise it if round icons still look like flat ovals. The stereo screen and mono theatre always keep the game's own shape.":"В полном VR игра размещает свой HUD под экран 4:3, из-за чего тот выглядит сплюснутым; 1.33 это исправляет. Увеличьте значение, если круглые значки всё ещё выглядят как плоские овалы. Стереоэкран и монотеатр всегда сохраняют собственную форму игры.","In story and dialogue shots, hold L3 and press Y to move nearer or X to move back; L3 + Y + X goes back to the game's spot. Keyboard: Page Up, Page Down and Home. It moves along the game camera's view and keeps following the shot's own camera moves. Game camera in full VR only.":"В сюжетных кадрах и диалогах удерживайте L3 и нажмите Y, чтобы приблизиться, или X, чтобы отойти; L3 + Y + X возвращает к точке игры. Клавиатура: Page Up, Page Down и Home. Сдвиг идёт вдоль взгляда камеры игры и продолжает следовать собственным движениям камеры в кадре. Только камера игры в полном VR.","In story close-ups nothing nearer than this is drawn. It slices characters and props open, so it is off by default (10 cm, the game's own value); Hide characters at your eyes is the cleaner fix. Game camera in full VR only.":"На сюжетных крупных планах ничего ближе этого не рисуется. Это разрезает персонажей и предметы, поэтому по умолчанию выключено (10 см, собственное значение игры); «Скрывать персонажей у глаз» решает это чище. Только игровая камера в полном VR.","In story close-ups, a character right at your eyes but outside the flat shot (VR shows more around it) is hidden whole while it is there. Anyone the flat shot shows stays. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then press Y.":"На сюжетных крупных планах персонаж прямо у ваших глаз, но вне плоского кадра (в VR видно больше вокруг), скрывается целиком, пока он там. Все, кого показывает плоский кадр, остаются. Сочетание: удерживайте LT + RT, затем нажмите Y.","Include camera and controller data":"Включить данные камеры и контроллера","Input candidates start off. Their effect on WuWa's intermittent combinations is not confirmed.":"Кандидаты ввода изначально отключены. Их влияние на периодические комбинации WuWa не подтверждено.","Input still pauses when WuWa loses focus. Real game menus temporarily restore the game camera and character visibility.":"Ввод по-прежнему приостанавливается, когда WuWa теряет фокус. Настоящие игровые меню временно возвращают игровую камеру и видимость персонажа.","Invalid profile value: ":"Недопустимое значение профиля: ","Invert acro pitch stick":"Инвертировать тангаж акродрона","Joint inspector (left-eye preview)":"Инспектор сочленений (предпросмотр левого глаза)","Just mark the moment":"Просто отметить момент","Keep WuWa VR Launcher running to record from here. Its browser tab can be closed.":"Держите WuWa VR Launcher запущенным, чтобы записывать отсюда. Его вкладку в браузере можно закрыть.","Keep both triggers held to click or hold R3 again.":"Удерживайте оба триггера, чтобы снова нажать или удержать R3.","Keep camera and head hiding during Alt-Tab / UEVR settings":"Сохранять скрытие камеры и головы во время Alt-Tab / настроек UEVR","Keep current view":"Оставить текущий вид","Keep entire character visible":"Показывать персонажа целиком","Keep first person horizon level (Custom)":"Сохранять ровный горизонт в первом лице (Свои)","Keep matched far-object detail (recommended)":"Сохранять одинаковую детализацию дальних объектов (рекомендуется)","Keep stereo camera transitions together":"Сохранять переходы стереокамер синхронными","Keep the controls card open":"Сохранять карточку управления открытой","Keep the mouse in the game window":"Удерживать мышь в окне игры","Keep the nudge":"Сохранять сдвиг","Keep this card open":"Сохранять эту карточку открытой","Keeps distant trees and props on the same level of detail in both eyes. This is the normal foliage repair; legacy comparison tests are separate.":"Сохраняет одинаковую детализацию дальних деревьев и объектов в обоих глазах. Это обычное исправление листвы; устаревшие тесты сравнения отдельны.","Keeps the HUD where you expect it while decoupled pitch is on.":"Сохраняет HUD там, где вы его ожидаете, при включённом отвязанном наклоне.","Keeps the horizon level in first person. Custom motion only.":"Сохраняет горизонт ровным в первом лице. Только для движения «Свои».","Kuro character materials in both eyes (candidate)":"Материалы персонажей Kuro в обоих глазах (кандидат)","L grip":"Левый грип","L stick":"Левый стик","L trigger":"Левый триггер","L3 + A":"L3 + A","L3 + A     Recenter view / portal":"L3 + A     Центрировать вид / портал","L3 + A also resets headset position (seated)":"L3 + A также сбрасывает положение шлема (сидя)","L3 + A resets position too":"L3 + A тоже сбрасывает положение","L3 + B":"L3 + B","L3 + B     Show / hide game UI":"L3 + B     Показать / скрыть интерфейс","L3 + B  =  SHOW UI":"L3 + B = ПОКАЗАТЬ ИНТЕРФЕЙС","L3 + D-pad Down":"L3 + крестовина вниз","L3 + D-pad Down toggles full animation follow and your previous first-person motion. Custom keeps your saved settings. The other choices sample the head after animation. Animated position preserves normal stick aiming. Full animation follows character turns and bone rotation; it can be intense.":"L3 + крестовина вниз переключает следование полной анимации и ваш предыдущий режим движения от первого лица. «Свои» сохраняют ваши настройки. Остальные варианты считывают голову после анимации. Позиция по анимации сохраняет обычное прицеливание стиком. Полная анимация следует за поворотами персонажа и вращением костей; может быть слишком интенсивной.","L3 + D-pad Down: animation follow on / off (first person)":"L3 + крестовина вниз: следование анимации вкл. / выкл. (первое лицо)","L3 + LB    Return to normal game controls":"L3 + LB    Вернуть обычное управление игры","L3 + LB    Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"L3 + LB    Переключить настройку HUD / мыши","L3 + LB  =  RETURN TO GAME CONTROLS":"L3 + LB = ВЕРНУТЬ УПРАВЛЕНИЕ","L3 + LB exits manual adjustment. Release all controls afterwards.":"L3 + LB выходит из ручной настройки. После этого отпустите все элементы управления.","L3 + LB, release":"L3 + LB, отпустить","L3 + LT / F7":"L3 + LT / F7","L3 + LT / F7   Portal on / off":"L3 + LT / F7   Портал: вкл. / выкл.","L3 + Menu":"L3 + Menu","L3 + Menu  Keep the controls card open":"L3 + Menu  Сохранять карточку управления открытой","L3 + R3":"L3 + R3","L3 + R3    WuWa VR menu":"L3 + R3    Меню WuWa VR","L3 + RB":"L3 + RB","L3 + RB    Game / fixed camera":"L3 + RB    Камера игры / фиксированная","L3 + RT":"L3 + RT","L3 + RT    Diorama on / off":"L3 + RT    Диорама: вкл. / выкл.","L3 + View":"L3 + View","L3 + View  First person on / off":"L3 + View  Первое лицо: вкл. / выкл.","L3 + View toggles first person. These settings apply when first person is active.":"L3 + View переключает первое лицо. Эти настройки применяются, когда первое лицо активно.","L3 + Y / X":"L3 + Y / X","L3 + Y/X   Height; in story: nearer / back":"L3 + Y/X   Высота; в сюжете: ближе / дальше","L3 means click and hold the left stick, then press B.":"Удерживайте нажатым левый стик (L3), затем нажмите B.","LB + LT/RT Fixed camera farther / closer":"LB + LT/RT Фикс. камера дальше / ближе","LB + R3 utility shortcut remains available outside adjustment":"Служебное сочетание LB + R3 доступно и вне режима настройки","LB + R3: V once; hold 0.8 s for Tab wheel":"LB + R3: V один раз; удерживать 0,8 с для колеса Tab","LB/RB      HUD down / up":"LB/RB      HUD вниз / вверх","LT + RT, L3: blur (hold: stereo screen)":"LT + RT, L3: размытие (удерживать: стереоэкран)","LT + RT, R3: full VR / stereo (hold: mono)":"LT + RT, R3: полный VR / стерео (удерживать: моно)","LT + RT, then Y":"LT + RT, затем Y","LT + RT, then click L3":"LT + RT, затем нажать L3","LT + RT, then click R3":"LT + RT, затем нажать R3","LT + RT, then hold L3":"LT + RT, затем удерживать L3","LT + RT, then hold R3":"LT + RT, затем удерживать R3","LT/RT      HUD nearer / farther":"LT/RT      HUD ближе / дальше","Language":"Язык","Language / WuWa":"Язык / WuWa","Larger menu following view":"Крупное меню вслед за взглядом","Laser asleep: move the left controller or press a VR button.":"Лазер спит: пошевелите левым контроллером или нажмите кнопку VR.","Laser asleep: move the right controller or press a VR button.":"Лазер спит: пошевелите правым контроллером или нажмите кнопку VR.","Laser on: point the left controller and pull its trigger.":"Лазер включён: укажите левым контроллером и нажмите его курок.","Laser on: point the right controller and pull its trigger.":"Лазер включён: укажите правым контроллером и нажмите его курок.","Laser: no VR controllers found.":"Лазер: VR-контроллеры не найдены.","Last run: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"Последняя пробежка: %s, ходьба %s, %.2f км в игре.","Last used wins":"Побеждает последнее использованное","Launch settings include any custom settings saved before starting this game. Supplied profile controls are the build's original choices, not UEVR factory defaults.":"Настройки запуска включают все пользовательские настройки, сохранённые до запуска игры. Комплектные настройки профиля — это исходный выбор сборки, а не заводские настройки UEVR.","Launch settings restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"Настройки запуска восстановлены. Отпустите все кнопки, прежде чем продолжить.","Leave first person":"Выйти из первого лица","Leave freecam":"Выйти из свободной камеры","Left":"Слева","Left / right":"Влево / вправо","Left / right moves between steps without answering. Your answers stay saved.":"Влево / вправо переключают шаги без ответа. Ваши ответы сохраняются.","Left / right picks the kind of problem.":"Влево / вправо выбирают тип проблемы.","Left / right stick":"Левый / правый стик","Left stick":"Левый стик","Left stick Cursor    A Click    B Back":"Левый стик Курсор    A Клик    B Назад","Left stick Y (Mode 2)":"Ось Y левого стика (Mode 2)","Legacy automatic mouse can intercept game menu buttons. Manual L3 + LB adjustment remains the normal choice.":"Устаревшая автоматическая мышь может перехватывать кнопки меню игры. Ручная настройка L3 + LB остаётся обычным выбором.","Legacy pitch-only override is active; choose either option above to replace it.":"Активно устаревшее переопределение только тангажа; выберите любой из вариантов выше, чтобы заменить его.","Legacy stereo comparison bench (60-second tests)":"Устаревший стенд сравнения стерео (тесты по 60 секунд)","Level horizon":"Выровнять горизонт","Link latest recording":"Связать последнюю запись","Linking saves the recording ID only. Review the video and add precise timestamps in the launcher.":"Связывание сохраняет только ID записи. Просмотрите видео и добавьте точные метки времени в лаунчере.","Live input tests. Change one option, close this menu, then repeat the same action.":"Тесты ввода в реальном времени. Измените один параметр, закройте это меню, затем повторите то же действие.","Local controller and camera data only, about 30 samples/sec. The clean-video recorder starts this automatically. It never presses buttons. Video/sidecar alignment uses timestamps, not a claim of GPU-frame synchronization.":"Только локальные данные контроллера и камеры, около 30 замеров/с. Рекордер чистого видео запускает это автоматически. Он никогда не нажимает кнопки. Синхронизация видео и дорожки движений использует метки времени, а не заявление о синхронизации кадров GPU.","Looks wrong? Hold LT + RT, then click R3 for the stereo screen (hold R3: mono).":"Выглядит неправильно? Удерживайте LT + RT, затем нажмите R3 для стереоэкрана (удерживать R3: моно).","Low":"Внизу","Lower eye level by 5":"Опустить глаза на 5","Manual override; waiting for this scene to end":"Ручное управление; ожидание конца этой сцены","Mark this moment":"Отметить этот момент","Match cinematic framing":"Совместить кинематографичное кадрирование","Match cinematic framing between eyes (default on)":"Совместить кинематографичное кадрирование между глазами (по умолчанию вкл.)","Match far detail between eyes":"Совместить дальние детали между глазами","Maximum pixels per eye":"Максимальная ширина на глаз в пикселях","Maximum thrust / weight":"Максимальная тяга / вес","Menu":"Меню","Menu distance":"Расстояние меню","Menu left / right":"Меню влево / вправо","Menu place":"Размещение меню","Menu size":"Размер меню","Menu up / down":"Меню вверх / вниз","Miniature world (this launch only)":"Миниатюрный мир (только в этом сеансе)","Mode 2: centered left stick means 50%% throttle. An Xbox stick springs back to center; hold it down for zero throttle.":"Режим 2: центральное положение левого стика — это 50%% тяги. Стик Xbox возвращается в центр; удерживайте его внизу для нулевой тяги.","Mono preserves your saved stereo-screen choice; screen off exits both screen modes. Neither changes portal or normal world scale. Manual toggles take priority over automatic cinema for the current scene.":"Mono сохраняет выбранный вами режим стереоэкрана; выключение экрана отключает оба экранных режима. Ни то, ни другое не меняет масштаб портала или мира. Ручные переключения имеют приоритет над автоматическим кинотеатром для текущей сцены.","Mono shows the same scene and HUD to both eyes. Use it for troublesome cutscenes or flat menus.":"Mono показывает одну и ту же сцену и HUD обоим глазам. Используйте его для проблемных катсцен или плоских меню.","Mono theatre":"Монотеатр","Mono theatre (flat 2D)":"Монотеатр (плоское 2D)","Mono theatre (no stereo)":"Монотеатр (без стерео)","Mono theatre on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"Монотеатр вкл. / выкл. (удерживать 0,8 с)","Motion":"Движение","Move cursor":"Переместить курсор","Move map":"Переместить карту","Move menu":"Переместить меню","Moves supported menus into the VR panel, including with Native Stereo Fix on. The supplied profile enables this. Some flat backgrounds still move separately; mono theatre is the manual fallback.":"Переносит поддерживаемые меню в VR-панель, в том числе при включённом Native Stereo Fix. Комплектный профиль включает это. Некоторые плоские фоны всё ещё перемещаются отдельно; монотеатр — ручной запасной вариант.","Moves the HUD sideways.":"Смещает HUD в сторону.","Moves the HUD up or down.":"Смещает HUD вверх или вниз.","Moves your diorama viewpoint sideways.":"Сдвигает точку обзора в диораме вбок.","Moves your diorama viewpoint up, to look down on the miniature, or down.":"Поднимает точку обзора в диораме, чтобы смотреть на миниатюру сверху, или опускает её.","Moves your viewpoint forward from the game camera. Forward brings dialogue close-ups nearer, closer to how the 2D shot frames them. Applies in normal play too.":"Смещает точку обзора вперёд от камеры игры. Вперёд приближает крупные планы диалогов, ближе к тому, как их кадрирует 2D-кадр. Работает и в обычной игре.","Moves your viewpoint sideways from the game camera.":"Смещает точку обзора в сторону от камеры игры.","Moves your viewpoint up or down from the game camera.":"Смещает точку обзора вверх или вниз от камеры игры.","Moving the menu: point where you want it, thumbstick up / down for distance, then pull the trigger.":"Перемещение меню: укажите нужное место, стик вверх / вниз меняет расстояние, затем нажмите курок.","Moving the menu: stick, D-pad or arrow keys. Right stick or Page Up / Down: distance. A or Enter: put it down.":"Перемещение меню: стик, крестовина или стрелки. Правый стик или Page Up / Down: расстояние. A или Enter: поставить.","Multiplies the blur in full VR. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"Умножает размытие в полном VR. 1x — вид как в 2D.","Multiplies the blur on the stereo screen and mono theatre. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"Умножает размытие на стереоэкране и в монотеатре. 1x — вид как в 2D.","NOT SAVING":"НЕ СОХРАНЯЕТСЯ","Native Stereo":"Native Stereo","Native Stereo Fix frame timing (experimental)":"Тайминги кадров Native Stereo Fix (эксперимент)","Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix":"Native Stereo с Native Stereo Fix","Native game camera active (headset check pending)":"Родная камера игры включена (ожидает проверки в шлеме)","Native game camera unavailable; compatibility fallback":"Родная камера игры недоступна; режим совместимости","Navigate / activate / back":"Выбор / включить / назад","Near clip in close-ups":"Ближняя плоскость отсечения на крупных планах","New:":"Новое:","No active playtest connection. Keep the launcher running and open Developer playtests to start or resume a session.":"Нет активного подключения к плейтесту. Не закрывайте лаунчер и откройте Developer playtests, чтобы начать или продолжить сеанс.","No run yet. Start one here, or open Reality Runner and walk.":"Пробежек пока нет. Начните здесь или откройте Reality Runner и идите.","No supported direct PlayStation controller detected":"Поддерживаемый прямой контроллер PlayStation не обнаружен","Normal scale: %.3fx. Your saved scale and camera presets stay unchanged; intentional scale edits become the new normal value.":"Обычный масштаб: %.3fx. Ваш сохранённый масштаб и пресеты камеры остаются без изменений; намеренные изменения масштаба становятся новым обычным значением.","Not saved: %s":"Не сохранено: %s","Not tested":"Не проверено","Note when someone is at your eyes":"Уведомление, когда кто-то у глаз","Now: %s":"Сейчас: %s","Observation":"Наблюдение","Off":"Выкл.","Off: UEVR opens its classic window, as before. You can turn this menu back on under VR > WuWa Controls.":"Выкл.: UEVR открывает классическое окно, как раньше. Вы можете снова включить это меню в разделе VR > WuWa Controls.","On":"Вкл.","On by default. Detected story videos use mono; story pictures and story scenes use your choices above. Manual view changes take priority.":"Включено по умолчанию. Распознанные сюжетные видео идут в монотеатре; сюжетные картинки и сюжетные сцены используют выбор выше. Ручная смена вида имеет приоритет.","On by default: both eyes render with a symmetric view, so its shading matches on rocks, hills and roofs. Off is a little faster.":"По умолчанию включено: оба глаза отрисовываются с симметричным обзором, поэтому затенение скал, холмов и крыш совпадает. Выключение немного ускоряет игру.","On uses our LGUI capture. Off shows the game's original HUD in the eye images. This does not hide the UEVR settings panel.":"Вкл. использует наш захват LGUI. Выкл. показывает исходный HUD игры в изображениях для глаз. Это не скрывает панель настроек UEVR.","On: full VR lays out the HUD and menus like the flat game (16:9): round icons, story pictures whole, and the mouse hits what it points at. Off: 1.2.2's taller layout, where the Terminal fits on one page and the character screen's floor reflection keeps updating, but icons look flatter (HUD shape) and the mouse can miss.":"Вкл.: полный VR располагает HUD и меню как в плоской игре (16:9): круглые значки круглые, сюжетные картинки целые, а мышь попадает туда, куда указывает. Выкл.: более высокая раскладка из 1.2.2 — терминал помещается на одной странице и отражение пола на экране персонажа продолжает обновляться, но значки выглядят более плоскими (форма HUD), а мышь может промахиваться.","On: the HUD stays in front of your eyes. Off: it stays put in the world and you look at it.":"Вкл.: HUD остаётся перед глазами. Выкл.: он закреплён в мире, и вы смотрите на него.","On: while the game is in front, the mouse stops at the window's edges, as in the flat game, so it cannot slip onto another monitor. Alt-Tab frees it. Off: the mouse moves freely between monitors.":"Вкл.: пока игра на переднем плане, мышь останавливается у краёв окна, как в плоской игре, и не уходит на другой монитор. Alt-Tab освобождает её. Выкл.: мышь свободно перемещается между мониторами.","On: your settings are saved whenever this menu opens or closes. Off: try things freely; nothing is saved, and the game starts with your saved settings next time. Turning it back on saves what you have now. For each setting, the help at the bottom says whether it is saved and what its default is.":"Вкл.: настройки сохраняются при каждом открытии и закрытии этого меню. Выкл.: пробуйте что угодно — ничего не сохраняется, и в следующий раз игра запустится с сохранёнными настройками. Повторное включение сохраняет текущие настройки. Для каждой настройки подсказка внизу говорит, сохраняется ли она и какое у неё значение по умолчанию.","Only in first person and the fixed camera":"Только от первого лица и с фиксированной камерой","Only slot 0":"Только слот 0","Only slot 1":"Только слот 1","Only slot 2":"Только слот 2","Only slot 3":"Только слот 3","Only the VR controllers work while on; the Xbox pad on this slot is ignored until you turn them off.":"Пока включено, работают только VR-контроллеры; геймпад Xbox на этом слоте игнорируется, пока вы их не выключите.","Open / close the WuWa VR menu":"Открыть / закрыть меню WuWa VR","Open the WuWa VR menu instead of this window":"Открывать меню WuWa VR вместо этого окна","Opens UEVR's full settings window. Every setting here edits the same values.":"Открывает полное окно настроек UEVR. Каждая настройка здесь изменяет одни и те же значения.","Optical joint data received. Headset alignment and comfort still need a physical check.":"Данные оптического трекинга суставов получены. Выравнивание и удобство шлема всё ещё требуют физической проверки.","Optional experiments and diagnostics":"Эксперименты и диагностика","Optional workaround, off by default. Removes toon-depth rim lighting from all characters using it, including nearby characters. This hides the observed extra eye contour; it does not repair the underlying stereo cause. Restores the prior value when disabled, in 2D screen mode, or when native VR is inactive.":"Необязательное решение, по умолчанию выключено. Убирает контурное освещение toon-depth у всех использующих его персонажей, включая ближних. Это скрывает замеченный лишний контур глаз, но не устраняет основную причину проблемы стерео. Возвращает прежнее значение при отключении, в режиме 2D-экрана или когда нативный VR неактивен.","Or hold the left Menu button for 1 second to turn them on or off; a buzz confirms. A quick press is still Start. Controllers without a Menu button (such as Index): while off, hold both stick clicks for 1 second to turn them on.":"Или удерживайте левую кнопку Menu 1 секунду, чтобы включить или выключить их; подтверждает вибрация. Короткое нажатие по-прежнему выполняет Start. Контроллеры без кнопки Menu (например, Index): когда выключено, удерживайте оба нажатия стиков 1 секунду, чтобы включить.","Or: UEVR > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"Или: UEVR > WuWa Controls > Показать интерфейс игры","Pass":"Пройдено","Paused in the diorama":"Пауза в диораме","Paused: game camera in full VR only":"Пауза: только игровая камера в полном VR","Physical gamepad passthrough (test)":"Проброс физического геймпада (тест)","Pick what went wrong and save. The time, the video position and your settings go into the wuwa-reports folder of the UEVR profile. Share it together with the video.":"Выберите, что пошло не так, и сохраните. Время, позиция видео и ваши настройки попадут в папку wuwa-reports профиля UEVR. Приложите их вместе с видео.","Picture size":"Размер изображения","Pinned":"Закреплено","Pitch / roll rate (degrees / second)":"Скорость тангажа / крена (градусы / секунда)","Pixels per eye compared with what your headset asks for. Lower is smoother in full VR. It changes after a moment.":"Пикселей на глаз по сравнению с тем, что запрашивает ваш шлем. Чем ниже, тем плавнее в полноценном VR. Изменяется через мгновение.","Plan finished. Thank you!":"План завершён. Спасибо!","Plan finished. Your answers are saved for Claude in wuwa-steps / results.jsonl.":"План завершён. Ваши ответы сохранены для Claude в wuwa-steps / results.jsonl.","Plane":"Самолёт","Plane FPV":"Самолёт FPV","Plane cruise speed (game units / second)":"Крейсерская скорость самолёта (игровые единицы / секунда)","Plane: right stick pitches/banks, left stick X steers yaw. RT increases cruise speed, LT decreases it. Hold LB to brake, RB to boost. Double R3 exits. Cruise pauses when focus or controller samples are lost; release controls then move a stick to rearm after Alt-Tab.":"Самолёт: правый стик — тангаж/крен, ось X левого стика — рыскание. RT увеличивает крейсерскую скорость, LT уменьшает. Удерживайте LB для торможения, RB для ускорения. Дважды R3 — выход. Крейсерский режим приостанавливается при потере фокуса или данных контроллера; отпустите управление и сдвиньте стик, чтобы снова включить после Alt-Tab.","PlayStation connected; waiting for input reports and release":"PlayStation подключён; ожидание отчётов ввода и освобождения","PlayStation disconnected; waiting to reconnect":"PlayStation отключён; ожидание переподключения","PlayStation input is unavailable or held exclusively; use Steam Input if available":"Ввод PlayStation недоступен или занят монопольно; используйте Steam Input, если он доступен","PlayStation input received":"Ввод PlayStation получен","PlayStation reader has not started":"Считыватель PlayStation не запущен","PlayStation reader stopped; use Steam Input if available":"Считыватель PlayStation остановлен; используйте Steam Input, если он доступен","PlayStation reader unavailable":"Считыватель PlayStation недоступен","PlayStation reader unavailable: cannot retain backend module":"Считыватель PlayStation недоступен: не удаётся удержать модуль бэкенда","PlayStation reports stopped; release controls after reconnecting":"Отчёты PlayStation остановлены; отпустите управление после переподключения","PlayStation shortcuts paused: WuWa shortcuts disabled":"Команды PlayStation приостановлены: команды WuWa отключены","PlayStation shortcuts paused: an XInput slot is selected":"Команды PlayStation приостановлены: выбран слот XInput","PlayStation shortcuts paused: controller passthrough enabled":"Команды PlayStation приостановлены: включён проброс контроллера","PlayStation: L1/R1 = LB/RB, L2/R2 = LT/RT, Cross/Circle/Square/Triangle = A/B/X/Y, Share/Create = View, Options = Menu.":"PlayStation: L1/R1 = LB/RB, L2/R2 = LT/RT, Крест/Круг/Квадрат/Треугольник = A/B/X/Y, Share/Create = View, Options = Menu.","Playtest launcher connection changed. Check whether the previous action was saved.":"Соединение с лаунчером плейтеста изменилось. Проверьте, сохранено ли предыдущее действие.","Playtest launcher is not connected.":"Лаунчер плейтеста не подключён.","Playtest launcher status is stale or belongs to another game.":"Статус лаунчера плейтеста устарел или относится к другой игре.","Playtest request was not acknowledged. Check the launcher before repeating it.":"Запрос плейтеста не подтверждён. Проверьте лаунчер, прежде чем повторять.","Point and pull the trigger, or click. Scroll to see more.":"Наведите и нажмите триггер или щёлкните. Прокрутите, чтобы увидеть больше.","Point with a controller and pull the trigger to put it down. Or use a stick, the D-pad, the arrow keys or WASD, and the right stick or Page Up / Down for distance; A, Enter or B puts it down. Gamepad shortcut: Y. Keyboard: M. Mouse: drag with the right button at any time.":"Наведите контроллером и нажмите триггер, чтобы поставить. Или используйте стик, крестовину, клавиши со стрелками или WASD, а правый стик либо Page Up / Down — для расстояния; A, Enter или B ставит. Сочетание на геймпаде: Y. Клавиатура: M. Мышь: перетаскивайте правой кнопкой в любой момент.","Polar fly":"Полярный полёт","Polar fly: left stick moves along view, right stick looks. LT rises, LB descends; RT boosts, double RT gives turbo.":"Polar fly: левый стик движет по направлению взгляда, правый — обзор. LT поднимает, LB опускает; RT ускоряет, двойной RT — турбо.","Polar fly: simple flying. Hover drone: floats and drifts to a stop. Plane: always moves forward. Acro drone: full manual control.":"Polar fly: простое управление полётом. Зависание дрона: парит и плавно останавливается. Самолёт: всегда движется вперёд. Акродрон: полностью ручное управление.","Polar shortcuts are disabled or bypassed.":"Сочетания Polar отключены или обходятся.","Portal HUD sizing":"Размер HUD портала","Portal is off: using your separate HUD layout until it is enabled.":"Портал выключен: используется отдельная раскладка HUD, пока он не включён.","Portal on / off":"Портал: вкл. / выкл.","Portal window":"Окно портала","Post-process block ambiguous":"Блок постобработки неоднозначен","Post-process block not found in the view (try again outside a story scene)":"Блок постобработки не найден в виде (попробуйте вне сюжетной сцены)","PostProcessSettings not found":"PostProcessSettings не найден","Preserve proportions at frame edges":"Сохранить пропорции","Preserves both deactivation and keyboard focus events, including while this overlay is open. It applies to future events: after enabling, Alt-Tab away and back once. It does not bring the game to the foreground automatically.":"Сохраняет как события деактивации, так и события фокуса клавиатуры, в том числе пока это наложение открыто. Применяется к будущим событиям: после включения один раз переключитесь через Alt-Tab и обратно. Оно не выводит игру на передний план автоматически.","Press: hide characters at your eyes":"Нажать: скрыть персонажей у глаз","Privacy box placement":"Положение масок","Profile ID bottom":"ID профиля снизу","Profile ID left":"ID профиля слева","Profile ID right":"ID профиля справа","Profile ID top":"ID профиля сверху","Quick":"Быстро","R grip":"Правый хват","R stick":"Правый стик","R trigger":"Правый триггер","RT / double RT":"RT / дважды RT","Raise eye level by 5":"Поднять глаза на 5","Readable HUD following view":"Читаемый HUD вслед за взглядом","Ready":"Готово","Reality Runner and other treadmills: keep Sharing on Both together and Controller slot on Automatic, so walking and the VR controllers work at the same time.":"Reality Runner и другие беговые дорожки: оставьте «Совместно» на «Оба вместе» и слот контроллера на «Автоматически», чтобы ходьба и VR-контроллеры работали одновременно.","Reality Runner is open: 10 seconds of walking starts a run.":"Reality Runner открыт: 10 секунд ходьбы начинают пробежку.","Recenter headset / portal":"Центрировать шлем / портал","Recenter keeps world scale and camera offsets. Simulator Home resets only the simulator, not the game's VR origin.":"Центрирование сохраняет масштаб мира и смещения камеры. Home симулятора сбрасывает только симулятор, а не исходную точку VR в игре.","Recenter view":"Центрировать вид","Recentering with L3 + A also moves your seated position back to the middle.":"Центрирование с L3 + A также возвращает вашу сидячую позицию в центр.","Record":"Запись","Record camera and Xbox diagnostics":"Записать диагностику камеры и Xbox","Record video":"Запись видео","Recorder: failed. See WuWa Controls > Recording in the classic menu.":"Рекордер: ошибка. См. WuWa Controls > Запись в классическом меню.","Recorder: missing from this launcher package.":"Рекордер: отсутствует в этом пакете лаунчера.","Recorder: open the WuWa VR app (launcher) to record.":"Рекордер: откройте приложение WuWa VR (лаунчер), чтобы записывать.","Recorder: ready.":"Рекордер: готов.","Recorder: recording. Reports and marks note the time in the video.":"Рекордер: идёт запись. Отчёты и метки отмечают время в видео.","Recorder: saved. Open recordings from the launcher.":"Рекордер: сохранено. Открывайте записи из лаунчера.","Recorder: saving the video.":"Рекордер: сохранение видео.","Recorder: starting.":"Рекордер: запуск.","Recorder: waiting for the launcher...":"Рекордер: ожидание лаунчера...","Recording":"Идёт запись","Recording and privacy":"Запись и конфиденциальность","Recording failed. See the message below.":"Запись не удалась. См. сообщение ниже.","Recording saved. Use Open recordings in the launcher.":"Запись сохранена. Используйте «Открыть записи» в лаунчере.","Recording video. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"Идёт запись видео. Закройте меню UEVR для чистого вида.","Records the headset view through the WuWa VR app, which must be open. Player IDs are covered while it records (Hide player IDs, on the Record page).":"Записывает вид из шлема через приложение WuWa VR, которое должно быть открыто. Во время записи ID игроков закрываются (скрыть ID игроков на странице «Запись»).","Refill far lighting now":"Обновить дальнее освещение сейчас","Reflection capture correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"Коррекция захвата отражений остановлена или не смогла проверить эту сборку игры. См. журнал диагностики.","Reflection correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"Коррекция отражений остановлена или не смогла проверить эту сборку игры. См. журнал диагностики.","Reflection projection correction":"Коррекция проекции отражений","Refresh HUD layout":"Обновить разметку HUD","Refresh far lighting":"Обновить дальнее освещение","Refresh far-lighting cache (limited workaround)":"Обновить кэш дальнего освещения (ограниченный обходной способ)","Refresh position before drawing (Custom)":"Обновлять позицию перед отрисовкой (Свои)","Refresh queued; requires the supplied Comfort script.":"Обновление в очереди; требуется комплектный скрипт Comfort.","Refreshes the far-lighting cache so distant lighting matches between eyes. A limited workaround.":"Обновляет кэш дальнего освещения, чтобы дальнее освещение совпадало между глазами. Ограниченный обходной способ.","Release RT (Xbox) or pull left stick fully down (Mode 2), then tap RB to arm. Tap RB again or hold LB to pause/disarm. LB + RB levels the drone and stops it. Double R3 exits. Focus loss, menus and shortcut chords pause/disarm it; arm again to resume.":"Отпустите RT (Xbox) или полностью отклоните левый стик вниз (Mode 2), затем нажмите RB для взведения. Нажмите RB снова или удерживайте LB для паузы/снятия. LB + RB выравнивает дрон и останавливает его. Двойное R3 — выход. Потеря фокуса, меню и сочетания команд ставят на паузу/снимают; взведите снова, чтобы продолжить.","Release all controls after entering/leaving":"Отпускать все элементы управления после входа/выхода","Reload language files":"Перезагрузить языковые файлы","Render resolution":"Разрешение рендеринга","Rendering comparisons (live)":"Сравнение рендеринга (в игре)","Report a problem":"Сообщить о проблеме","Requests a HUD layout refresh without opening ESC. If this game version is unsupported, the status explains why; saved HUD size and position stay unchanged.":"Запрашивает обновление разметки HUD без открытия ESC. Если эта версия игры не поддерживается, состояние объяснит причину; сохранённые размер и положение HUD не изменятся.","Requests a bounded cascade-lighting-volume refresh after stereo starts or resumes, after detected teleports, or on request. It helped the tested ship/wheel lighting case; it is not a general fix for dark objects or character rims. Each refill can cause a short hitch.":"Запрашивает ограниченное обновление объёма каскадного освещения после запуска или возобновления стереорежима, после обнаруженных телепортов или по запросу. Это помогло в протестированном случае освещения корабля/колеса; это не общее решение для тёмных объектов или контуров персонажа. Каждое обновление может вызвать короткое подвисание.","Requires Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass. Applies the pass correction before game-side view setup. Turn off to return to the previous correction. Culling and lighting acceptance is pending.":"Требуется Native Stereo Fix и Use Same Stereo Pass. Применяет коррекцию прохода до настройки вида на стороне игры. Отключите, чтобы вернуться к предыдущей коррекции. Проверка отсечения и освещения ещё не завершена.","Reset HUD aspect":"Сбросить пропорции HUD","Reset HUD shape":"Сбросить форму HUD","Reset camera offset":"Сбросить смещение камеры","Reset diorama camera":"Сбросить камеру диорамы","Reset headset position and direction now":"Сбросить положение и направление шлема","Restart plan":"Начать план заново","Restore all controller slots":"Восстановить все слоты контроллеров","Restore controls from this launch":"Восстановить настройки начала сеанса","Restore input settings from before comparisons":"Восстановить управление до сравнений","Restore profile settings":"Восстановить настройки профиля","Restore renderer from before this comparison":"Восстановить рендер до этого сравнения","Restore supplied profile controls":"Восстановить комплектные настройки","Restore this build's supplied controls, first-person/freecam settings, camera scale, aiming and HUD layout. Rendering and runtime selection are preserved. Temporary HUD/mouse mode is always turned off. You can undo the reset below.":"Восстановить комплектное управление этой сборки, настройки первого лица/свободной камеры, масштаб камеры, прицеливание и расположение HUD. Настройки рендеринга и среды сохраняются. Временный режим HUD/мыши всегда выключается. Сброс можно отменить ниже.","Returns Windows XInput unchanged, bypassing VR and Lua gamepad processing. Use Insert and the mouse for this settings panel; gamepad shortcuts and VR controller mapping are unavailable in this mode.":"Передаёт Windows XInput без изменений, минуя обработку геймпада через VR и Lua. Для этой панели настроек используйте Insert и мышь; в этом режиме сочетания геймпада и привязки VR-контроллеров недоступны.","Right":"Справа","Right / left":"Вправо / влево","Right trigger (Xbox)":"Правый триггер (Xbox)","Right-stick pitch; animated yaw and roll":"Наклон правым стиком; рыскание и крен по анимации","Rim restoration failed; the original is retained. Toggle off, then on to retry restoration first.":"Не удалось восстановить обод; сохранён исходный вариант. Выключите и снова включите, чтобы сначала повторить восстановление.","Rim suppression was not verified. Toggle off, then on to retry safely.":"Скрытие обода не подтверждено. Выключите и снова включите для безопасного повтора.","Rim variable is unavailable. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"Переменная обода недоступна. Выключите и снова включите для повтора.","Rim workaround is off.":"Обход обода выключен.","Rim workaround waits for active native stereo with 2D screen off.":"Обход обода ждёт активного Native Stereo с выключенным 2D-экраном.","Rim workaround waits for the current graphics comparison to end.":"Обход обода ждёт завершения текущего сравнения графики.","Room panel (stays put)":"Панель в пространстве","Run on: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"Пробежка идёт: %s, ходьба %s, %.2f км в игре.","Safe fit inside rounded edges":"Вписать внутри скруглённых краёв","Save changes for next time":"Сохранять изменения на следующий раз","Save observation":"Сохранить наблюдение","Save or discard your unsent note before finishing.":"Сохраните или удалите неотправленную заметку перед завершением.","Save report":"Сохранить отчёт","Saves \"skipped\" and shows the next step.":"Сохраняет «пропущено» и показывает следующий шаг.","Saves the camera and controller movement next to the video, to help find what went wrong.":"Сохраняет движение камеры и контроллера рядом с видео, чтобы помочь найти проблему.","Saves the report now. Recording first makes it easy to find in the video.":"Сохраняет отчёт сейчас. Если сначала включить запись, его будет легко найти на видео.","Saves the time and current settings, so the moment is easy to find later.":"Сохраняет время и текущие настройки, чтобы позже было легко найти нужный момент.","Saves this answer with the settings now in use, then shows the next step.":"Сохраняет этот ответ с текущими настройками, затем показывает следующий шаг.","Saving":"Сохранение","Scene ending; restoring previous view":"Сцена заканчивается; восстанавливается прежний вид","Screen lens":"Линза экрана","Screen view on / off":"Вид экрана: вкл. / выкл.","Screen views and cutscene options are in VR > WuWa Controls > View modes and cutscenes.":"Виды экрана и параметры катсцен находятся в VR > WuWa Controls > View modes and cutscenes.","Screenshot":"Скриншот","Scroll":"Прокрутка","Second view":"Второй вид","Second view does not match the first":"Второй вид не совпадает с первым","Second view not writable; copy skipped":"Второй вид недоступен для записи; копирование пропущено","Seconds of smoothing in the steady desktop window. More is calmer and trails turns more.":"Секунды сглаживания в стабильном окне на мониторе. Больше — спокойнее, но повороты отстают сильнее.","Selected build: %s":"Выбранная сборка: %s","Send aim to player control rotation":"Передавать направление в управление","Separate eyes: Synchronized Sequential":"Раздельные глаза: Synchronized Sequential","Separate-eye rendering produced a black scene with HUD in the September 26 playtest. Native stereo is the working baseline. Submission metadata has been repaired, but separate-eye rendering is still an experiment, not a fix for labels/reflections/materials. Return to Native if the scene disappears.":"Раздельный рендеринг по глазам дал чёрную сцену с HUD в плейтесте 26 сентября. Native Stereo — рабочий базовый вариант. Метаданные отправки исправлены, но раздельный рендеринг по глазам по-прежнему эксперимент, а не исправление для надписей/отражений/материалов. Вернитесь к Native, если сцена исчезнет.","Set portal toggle key":"Задать клавишу портала","Set show / hide UI key":"Задать клавишу показа / скрытия интерфейса","Sets all three offsets back to 0, the game camera's own position.":"Сбрасывает все три смещения в 0, к собственному положению камеры игры.","Settings from before the reset restored; mouse mode remains off.":"Настройки до сброса восстановлены; режим мыши остаётся выключенным.","Settings: D-pad selects, A activates, left stick scrolls the focused pane. Mouse wheel also scrolls. Release RT first: holding it adjusts the camera instead.":"Настройки: крестовина выбирает, A включает, левый стик прокручивает активную панель. Колесо мыши тоже прокручивает. Сначала отпустите RT: при удержании она настраивает камеру.","Sharing with Xbox / treadmill":"Совместно с Xbox / беговой дорожкой","Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then click L3 to turn the blur on or off.":"Сочетание: удерживайте LT + RT, затем нажмите L3, чтобы включить или выключить размытие.","Show / hide game HUD and menus":"Показать / скрыть HUD и меню","Show / hide game UI":"Показать / скрыть интерфейс","Show UI to see this menu":"Включите интерфейс, чтобы увидеть меню","Show all":"Показать все","Show extracted game UI":"Показать извлечённый интерфейс","Show game UI now":"Показать интерфейс игры","Show hover-drone / plane camera roll":"Показывать крен камеры дрона / самолёта","Show optical hands (this launch only)":"Показывать оптические руки (только этот сеанс)","Showcase: one eye, steady, 16:9":"Витрина: один глаз, стабильно, 16:9","Showcase: the left eye as a normal 16:9 video, steadied, with the HUD where you see it, at the game's own frame rate. Picture size 720, 1024 or 1280 px gives 720p, 1080p or 1440p. Needs SteamVR. Side by side: both eyes, to help find what went wrong.":"Витрина: левый глаз как обычное видео 16:9, стабилизированное, с HUD там, где вы его видите, с собственной частотой кадров игры. Размер изображения 720, 1024 или 1280 px даёт 720p, 1080p или 1440p. Нужен SteamVR. Рядом: оба глаза, чтобы помочь найти, что пошло не так.","Shows 3 times, then turns itself off (Cinema page).":"Показывается 3 раза, затем отключается сам (вкладка «Кино»).","Shows the L3 card without holding anything. Shortcut: L3 + Menu. A loaded test plan shows its step there instead.":"Показывает карточку L3 без удержания кнопок. Команда: L3 + Menu. Если загружен план теста, вместо неё показывается его шаг.","Shows the current step where the controls card usually is. Off shows the controls card, as a public release does; the plan stays loaded here.":"Показывает текущий шаг там, где обычно находится карточка управления. Выкл. показывает карточку управления, как в публичном релизе; план остаётся загруженным.","Shows the world as a miniature around you, with the portal on or off. Needs Native Stereo. This launch only.":"Показывает мир как миниатюру вокруг вас, с порталом или без него. Требуется Native Stereo. Только этот сеанс.","Shrinks the world by the Diorama scale (%.0fx, set on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page) for an action-figure view, seen from the diorama camera (Camera page). Turn off to return to your normal scale. Works with or without the portal window.":"Уменьшает мир на масштаб диорамы (%.0fx, задаётся на странице «Быстрые» меню WuWa VR) для вида коллекционной фигурки, видимого из камеры диорамы (страница «Камера»). Отключите, чтобы вернуться к обычному масштабу. Работает как с окном портала, так и без него.","Simulator: keep its preview open, choose Both eyes / side-by-side, and turn Full render off. Recording uses the preview size.":"Симулятор: оставьте окно предпросмотра открытым, выберите «Оба глаза / бок о бок» и отключите «Полный рендер». Запись использует размер предпросмотра.","Skip this step":"Пропустить шаг","Slot 0":"Слот 0","Slot 1":"Слот 1","Slot 2":"Слот 2","Slot 3":"Слот 3","Smooth camera tilt":"Плавный наклон камеры","Smooth camera turns":"Плавные повороты камеры","Smooth transition between animation and game view":"Плавный переход между анимацией и видом игры","Smoothing blends stick handovers and reported movement-state changes, such as takeoff/landing. It starts enabled on the supplied profile. Head position stays current; ordinary aiming and animation are immediate after the handover. Off restores the instant switch.":"Сглаживание смешивает переходы управления стиком и сообщаемые смены состояния движения, например взлёт/посадку. На комплектном профиле оно включено изначально. Положение головы обновляется без задержки; обычное прицеливание и анимация срабатывают сразу после передачи. Выкл. возвращает мгновенное переключение.","Smoothing speed":"Скорость сглаживания","Smoothness":"Плавность","Smooths head shake out of the game window for OBS recordings. The window then trails quick head turns a little, so leave it off while you play. The headset image is not changed.":"Убирает тряску головы из окна игры для записей OBS. Окно тогда немного отстаёт при быстрых поворотах головы, поэтому во время игры оставьте его выключенным. Изображение в шлеме не меняется.","Smooths head shake out of the game window, so OBS records a calm, full-resolution view with game audio. The headset image is not changed. The window shows a slightly narrower view so the picture can move inside it.":"Убирает тряску головы в окне игры, чтобы OBS записывал спокойную картинку в полном разрешении со звуком игры. Изображение в шлеме при этом не меняется. Окно показывает чуть более узкий обзор, чтобы картинка могла двигаться внутри него.","Smooths the game camera's left / right turns, so quick camera swings feel gentler.":"Сглаживает повороты камеры игры влево / вправо, чтобы резкие движения камеры ощущались мягче.","Smooths the game camera's up / down tilt.":"Сглаживает наклон камеры игры вверх / вниз.","Soft contact shadows in corners and under objects. On by default. It keeps the game's own setting and renders both eyes with a symmetric view, so rocks, hills and roofs shade the same in each eye; the picture is slightly softer. Off is a little faster.":"Мягкие контактные тени в углах и под предметами. По умолчанию включено. Сохраняет собственную настройку игры и отрисовывает оба глаза с симметричным обзором, чтобы скалы, холмы и крыши затенялись одинаково в каждом глазу; изображение становится чуть мягче. Выключение немного ускоряет игру.","Something else":"Другое","Speed":"Скорость","Stand where the far tree freezes, start a window, close the menu and look, then press what you saw. Each start or stop may cause a one-frame blur.":"Встаньте там, где дальнее дерево замирает, запустите окно, закройте меню и посмотрите, затем нажмите то, что увидели. Каждый запуск или остановка могут вызвать размытие на один кадр.","Start a developer playtest in the launcher, then save your observations here. Nothing passes automatically.":"Запустите в лаунчере тестирование для разработчиков, затем сохраните здесь свои наблюдения. Ничего не засчитывается автоматически.","Start and end runs automatically":"Начинать и завершать пробежки автоматически","Start and end treadmill runs automatically":"Начинать и завершать пробежки на дорожке автоматически","Start motion sidecar (5 minutes max)":"Запись движений (до 5 минут)","Start run":"Начать пробежку","Start video recording":"Начать запись видео","Starting":"Запуск","Starting the recorder. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"Запуск записи. Закройте меню UEVR для чистого обзора.","Starts again from step 1.":"Начинается заново с шага 1.","Status: VR controllers need the OpenXR runtime.":"Статус: для VR-контроллеров требуется среда выполнения OpenXR.","Status: blocked by Physical gamepad passthrough. Turn passthrough off to use VR controllers.":"Статус: заблокировано пробросом физического геймпада. Отключите проброс, чтобы использовать VR-контроллеры.","Status: blocked by the XInput controller slot filter. Allow slot %d or choose another slot.":"Статус: заблокировано фильтром слотов контроллеров XInput. Разрешите слот %d или выберите другой слот.","Status: off. Xbox only.":"Статус: выкл. Только Xbox.","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on.":"Статус: вкл., ожидание VR-контроллеров. Разбудите оба и не снимайте шлем.","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on; the Xbox still works.":"Статус: вкл., ожидание VR-контроллеров. Разбудите оба и не снимайте шлем; Xbox по-прежнему работает.","Status: on, waiting for game focus. Click the game window.":"Статус: вкл., ожидание фокуса игры. Нажмите на окно игры.","Status: on, waiting for the game to read controller slot %d. It is asked again a few times a minute; keep the game window focused.":"Статус: вкл., ожидание, пока игра прочитает слот контроллера %d. Запрос повторяется несколько раз в минуту; держите окно игры в фокусе.","Status: on. Every controller steers this menu; the game gets no input until it closes.":"Статус: вкл. Любой контроллер управляет этим меню; игра не получает ввод, пока оно не закроется.","Status: on. VR controllers and Xbox both working.":"Статус: вкл. VR-контроллеры и Xbox работают.","Status: on. VR controllers in control; use the Xbox to switch.":"Статус: вкл. Управляют VR-контроллеры; используйте Xbox для переключения.","Status: on. VR controllers working.":"Статус: вкл. VR-контроллеры работают.","Status: on. Xbox in control; use a VR control to switch.":"Статус: вкл. Управляет Xbox; используйте VR-контроллер для переключения.","Status: paused by the diagnostic motion-input mute.":"Статус: приостановлено из-за отключения ввода движений в диагностике.","Steadiness":"Стабильность","Steadiness (seconds of smoothing)":"Стабильность (секунды сглаживания)","Steady desktop view (for OBS and streaming)":"Стабильный вид на мониторе (для OBS и стриминга)","Steady desktop window":"Стабильное окно на мониторе","SteamVR and the updated OpenXR Simulator are supported. VDXR capture is not available yet. Video has no audio and stops after five minutes. Actual frame rate depends on the game.":"SteamVR и обновлённый OpenXR Simulator поддерживаются. Запись через VDXR пока недоступна. Видео идёт без звука и останавливается через пять минут. Фактическая частота кадров зависит от игры.","Step":"Шаг","Step card below you":"Шаг карточки под вами","Stereo rendering compatibility":"Совместимость стереорендера","Stereo screen":"Стереоэкран","Stereo screen (3D depth)":"Стереоэкран (3D-глубина)","Stereo screen on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"Стереоэкран: вкл. / выкл. (удерживать 0,8 с)","Stick expo (softens center)":"Экспо стика (смягчает центр)","Stop motion sidecar":"Остановить запись движений","Stop now":"Остановить сейчас","Stop the voice note or transcription in the launcher before finishing.":"Остановите голосовую заметку или транскрипцию в лаунчере перед завершением.","Stop video recording":"Остановить запись видео","Stop voice activity and confirm untested checks before finishing.":"Остановите голосовую активность и подтвердите непроверенные пункты перед завершением.","Stopped":"Остановлено","Stopped: a write or restore failed. Restart the game before trying again.":"Остановлено: запись или восстановление не удалось. Перезапустите игру, прежде чем повторять.","Stops the freecam at walls and the ground. Experimental.":"Останавливает свободную камеру у стен и земли. Эксперимент.","Story camera nudge":"Сдвиг сюжетной камеры","Story camera nudge now: %s cm":"Сдвиг сюжетной камеры сейчас: %s см","Story camera nudge: waiting for a story shot":"Сдвиг сюжетной камеры: ожидание сюжетного кадра","Story cutscenes and dialogue":"Сюжетные катсцены и диалоги","Story pictures":"Сюжетные картинки","Story pictures use":"Для сюжетных картинок используется","Story scenes in 16:9":"Сюжетные сцены в 16:9","Story scenes use":"В сюжетных сценах используется","Story shots: camera nearer / back (L3 + Y + X resets; keyboard Page Up / Page Down / Home)":"Сюжетные кадры: камера ближе / дальше (L3 + Y + X сбрасывает; клавиатура Page Up / Page Down / Home)","Streamer privacy: cover player IDs":"Приватность: скрыть ID игрока","Stutter or freeze":"Рывки или зависание","Supplied profile restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"Комплектный профиль восстановлен. Отпустите все элементы управления, прежде чем продолжить.","Swap the eyes' poses and projections (stereo looks inverted)":"Поменять местами положение и проекции глаз (стерео выглядит инвертированным)","Swap the eyes' render targets (stereo looks inverted)":"Поменять местами цели рендеринга глаз (стерео выглядит инвертированным)","Sweeps the camera against surfaces that block the game's Visibility trace. Slides along contact surfaces. Unsupported queries hold movement and report a reason below. Physical headset leaning is not constrained. Starts off; world geometry still needs live verification.":"Проверяет камеру на столкновение с поверхностями, блокирующими трассировку Visibility игры. Скользит вдоль поверхностей контакта. При неподдерживаемых запросах движение блокируется и ниже указывается причина. Физический наклон шлема не ограничивается. По умолчанию выключено; геометрия мира всё ещё требует проверки в игре.","Switches to a screen while a story video (mono theatre) or a story picture plays, then back to the view you had. Story scenes keep your view unless you choose otherwise below.":"Переключает на экран, пока идёт сюжетное видео (монотеатр) или сюжетная картинка, а затем возвращает прежний вид. Сюжетные сцены сохраняют ваш вид, если ниже не выбрано другое.","Sync left eye LOD to right eye (fix candidate)":"Синхронизировать LOD левого глаза с правым (кандидат на исправление)","TEST":"ТЕСТ","Target recording rate":"Целевая частота кадров записи","Test":"Тест","Tests the game's default texture in place of custom reflections for the two main eyes. This is an effect-removal workaround, not a projection repair, and can also remove correct custom reflections. Starts off and restores on the next rendered views when disabled.":"Проверяет стандартную текстуру игры вместо пользовательских отражений для двух основных глаз. Это обходной путь с удалением эффекта, а не исправление проекции, и он также может убрать корректные пользовательские отражения. По умолчанию выключено и восстанавливается на следующих отрисованных видах при отключении.","The 2D view's background blur, in full VR and on the stereo screen. In full VR the blur is scaled for the headset's wider lens and the focus follows Close-up match.":"Размытие фона 2D-вида в полном VR и на стереоэкране. В полном VR размытие масштабируется под более широкую линзу шлема, а фокус следует за Close-up match.","The Kuro material candidate stopped or could not verify this build. See the diagnostic log.":"Кандидат материала Kuro остановлен или не смог проверить эту сборку. См. журнал диагностики.","The card is blocked by FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor. Turn that off to display it.":"Карточка заблокирована FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor. Отключите это, чтобы её отобразить.","The game builds one eye from a plain default camera, so that eye misses the shot's camera settings. Blur only copies the depth of field across; All camera effects also copies grading, vignette, exposure and the rest.":"Игра строит один глаз из обычной стандартной камеры, поэтому этот глаз теряет настройки камеры кадра. Blur копирует только глубину резкости; All camera effects также копирует цветокоррекцию, виньетку, экспозицию и остальное.","The hand demo needs OpenXR with optical hand tracking. Xbox gameplay is unchanged.":"Для демонстрации рук нужен OpenXR с оптическим трекингом рук. Управление на Xbox не меняется.","The hand overlay renderer is unavailable. The joint inspector remains available; see the UEVR log for details.":"Оверлей рук недоступен. Инспектор суставов остаётся доступным; подробности см. в журнале UEVR.","The hold gesture is unavailable while Enable motion-controller input is on; use this checkbox.":"Жест удержания недоступен, пока включён параметр Enable motion-controller input; используйте этот флажок.","The playtest session changed. Review it before saving.":"Сессия плейтеста изменилась. Проверьте её перед сохранением.","The previous character rim value was restored and verified.":"Предыдущее значение контура персонажа восстановлено и проверено.","The recorder is missing from this launcher package.":"Записывающее устройство отсутствует в этом пакете лаунчера.","The rim variable changed; no old pointer was used. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"Переменная контура изменилась; старый указатель не использовался. Отключите, затем включите снова, чтобы повторить.","The selected package is recorded; this is not proof of the DLL loaded by the game.":"Выбранный пакет записан; это не доказывает, какую DLL загрузила игра.","The session changed. Review your unsent note before adding it to this session.":"Сессия изменилась. Проверьте неотправленную заметку, прежде чем добавить её в эту сессию.","The supplied profile enables this for Native Stereo Fix with OpenXR. Headset timing acceptance is still limited; disable only for a deliberate comparison.":"Комплектный профиль включает это для Native Stereo Fix с OpenXR. Приём синхронизации шлема пока ограничен; отключайте только для намеренного сравнения.","The top-left box normally follows the ESC/overlay menu render path, including gamepad menus. Other popups using that same path may also show it. The bottom-right UID box stays on. Check your recording; unknown menu layouts are not guaranteed to be covered. Always is a manual fallback.":"Верхний левый блок обычно следует по пути рендеринга меню ESC/оверлея, включая меню геймпада. Другие всплывающие окна, использующие тот же путь, тоже могут его показывать. Нижний правый блок UID остаётся включённым. Проверьте свою запись; неизвестные раскладки меню не гарантированно перекрываются. Всегда — это ручной запасной вариант.","These are UEVR's existing global aim settings, shared with VR > Input. They are not limited to first person.":"Это глобальные настройки прицеливания UEVR, общие с разделом VR > Ввод. Они не ограничены видом от первого лица.","These buttons use UEVR's existing live rendering options. The image may pause while render targets rebuild. They leave camera, HUD placement and controller settings alone. Opening this section changes nothing; UEVR saves whichever renderer you leave selected.":"Эти кнопки используют встроенные варианты рендеринга в реальном времени от UEVR. Изображение может на время остановиться при пересоздании целей рендеринга. Настройки камеры, положения HUD и контроллеров при этом не меняются. Открытие этого раздела ничего не изменяет — UEVR сохранит выбранный вами вариант рендерера.","These modes move the viewpoint; the character stays put. Acro is a camera flight model, without motor, propeller or battery simulation.":"Эти режимы перемещают точку обзора, персонаж при этом остаётся на месте. Acro — это модель полёта камеры без имитации мотора, пропеллера или батареи.","These old comparison tests are separate from the normal far-object repair. Some deliberately invert or duplicate eye data; they are not recommended player settings.":"Эти старые тесты сравнения не относятся к обычному исправлению дальних объектов. Некоторые из них намеренно инвертируют или дублируют данные для глаз — их не рекомендуется использовать в игровых настройках.","This OpenXR runtime or headset does not provide hand tracking.":"Данный OpenXR runtime или гарнитура не поддерживает отслеживание рук.","This is a flat rectangular HUD: corners can extend over rounded/feathered edges. Use Safe fit to keep every corner inside, or use a rectangular portal for exact alignment.":"HUD представляет собой плоский прямоугольник — его углы могут выходить за скруглённые или растушёванные края. Используйте «Safe fit», чтобы все углы оставались внутри, либо примените прямоугольный портал для точного выравнивания.","This launch only: not saved.":"Только этот запуск: не сохраняется.","This older profile has no supplied-defaults file. Reset this build in the launcher while the game is closed, or use this launch's settings below.":"У этого старого профиля нет файла с предустановленными значениями. Сбросьте эту сборку в лаунчере, пока игра закрыта, или воспользуйтесь настройками текущего запуска ниже.","This runtime cannot identify optical hands. Controller-derived joints are not shown.":"Этот runtime не может определить оптические руки. Суставы, рассчитанные по контроллерам, не отображаются.","Times your run and saves your route in the game once a second, with a sync flash for OBS videos. With Reality Runner open, walking starts a run by itself (Controllers page).":"Засекает время пробежки и каждую секунду сохраняет ваш маршрут в игре, со вспышкой синхронизации для видео OBS. Если открыт Reality Runner, ходьба сама начинает пробежку (страница «Контроллеры»).","Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"Переключить HUD / мышь","Trace mesh triangles when supported":"Отслеживать треугольники мешей (если поддерживается)","Track the camera":"Отслеживать камеру","Track the camera: the distance is measured at each cut, then follows only the game camera's own moves, so a focus change cannot move you. Fixed per shot: the distance stays as it was at the cut. Follow the focus: it also moves when the game changes focus.":"Отслеживать камеру: расстояние измеряется при каждой склейке, а затем следует только за собственными движениями игровой камеры, поэтому смена фокуса не сдвинет вас. Фиксировано для кадра: расстояние остаётся таким, как при склейке. Следовать за фокусом: оно также меняется, когда игра меняет фокус.","Transition duration (seconds)":"Длительность перехода (секунды)","Translucency correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"Исправление полупрозрачности остановлено или не удалось проверить эту сборку игры. Смотрите журнал диагностики.","Treadmill":"Беговая дорожка","Treadmill run":"Пробежка на дорожке","Try headset aim":"Попробовать прицеливание шлемом","Turn speed":"Скорость поворота","Turn this note off in the menu, Cinema page.":"Отключить это уведомление можно в меню на вкладке «Кино».","Turn this off to isolate your physical gamepad. Head tracking stays enabled.":"Отключите это, чтобы изолировать физический геймпад. Отслеживание головы при этом останется включённым.","UEVR > WuWa Controls > Exit mouse mode now":"UEVR > WuWa Controls > Выйти из режима мыши","UI placement":"Размещение интерфейса","UID bottom":"UID снизу","UID left":"UID слева","UID right":"UID справа","UID top":"UID сверху","Unavailable while another graphics test runs.":"Недоступно во время выполнения другого графического теста.","Unavailable: %s":"Недоступно: %s","Unavailable: the eye pair is not verified yet (or this game build is not supported).":"Недоступно: пара глаз ещё не проверена (или эта сборка игры не поддерживается).","Undo last controls reset":"Отменить последний сброс","Unoccluded hand skeleton demo: hands draw over the game. No grabbing, collisions or gesture controls. Xbox remains gameplay.":"Демо-режим открытого скелета рук: руки отрисовываются поверх игры. Захват, столкновения и жесты не работают. Управление Xbox остаётся игровым.","Unsupported PlayStation input report; use Steam Input if available":"Неподдерживаемый отчёт ввода PlayStation. Используйте Steam Input, если доступен.","Until the next cut":"До следующей склейки","Until the next cut: each shot starts at the game's spot again. For the whole scene: your nudge stays until the story shots end.":"До следующей склейки: каждый кадр снова начинается с точки игры. На всю сцену: ваш сдвиг сохраняется, пока не закончатся сюжетные кадры.","Up / down":"Вверх / вниз","Use a keyboard for text. Voice notes require explicit microphone consent in the developer web panel.":"Для ввода текста используйте клавиатуру. Голосовые заметки требуют явного согласия на использование микрофона в веб-панели разработчика.","Use game aim for full animation":"Использовать прицел игры для полной анимации","Use game view while either stick moves":"Вид игры при движении любого стика","Use native stereo":"Использовать Native Stereo","Use right-stick pitch":"Наклон правым стиком","Use separate-eye renderer":"Использовать рендерер для каждого глаза отдельно","Use the VR controllers as an Xbox pad for walking and sightseeing. Holding the left Menu button for 1 second also turns them on or off.":"Использовать VR-контроллеры как геймпад Xbox для ходьбы и осмотра. Удержание левой кнопки Menu в течение 1 секунды включает или выключает этот режим.","Use this menu when opening UEVR":"Использовать это меню при открытии UEVR","Used instead of the offsets above while the diorama is on. The diorama makes your eyes far apart, so a camera that suits normal play puts the character too close and crosses your eyes. The default, 5 m back, shows it about an arm's length away at 10x.":"Используется вместо смещений выше, пока диорама включена. Диорама сильно разносит глаза, поэтому камера, удобная для обычной игры, ставит персонажа слишком близко и сводит глаза. По умолчанию 5 м назад — при 10x персонаж примерно на расстоянии вытянутой руки.","Uses one game camera pose for both eyes during the same frame, while preserving headset movement and eye separation. Requires Native Stereo Fix. The owner confirmed the ultimate return-to-gameplay fix. Other scene transitions remain under test; this does not repair foliage.":"Использует одну позу игровой камеры для обоих глаз в одном кадре, сохраняя при этом движение гарнитуры и межзрачковое расстояние. Требуется Native Stereo Fix. Разработчик подтвердил, что это окончательное решение для возврата к игровому процессу. Другие переходы между сценами ещё тестируются — этот режим не исправляет листву.","Uses the game's full-resolution translucency path for ordinary two-eye views. Compare Lynae, Mornye and Iuno in both eyes. May cost performance. Requires Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off; other renderers keep their normal behavior.":"Использует полноразмерный путь рендеринга полупрозрачности игры для обычного стереовида. Сравните персонажей Lynae, Mornye и Iuno в обоих глазах. Может снизить производительность. Требуется Native Stereo с включённым Native Stereo Fix и выключенной опцией Extreme Compatibility — другие рендереры работают в обычном режиме.","V once; hold 0.8 s for the Tab wheel":"V один раз; удерживайте 0,8 с для колеса Tab","VR controllers":"VR-контроллеры","VR controllers for walking (optional)":"VR-контроллеры для ходьбы (дополнительно)","VR controllers on (this launch)":"VR-контроллеры включены (этот запуск)","VR controllers: point and pull the trigger, or use either stick and A. B closes, the grips change page. Xbox: D-pad or stick, A, B, LB / RB. Keyboard: arrows, Enter, Esc, Tab. Mouse: click and scroll.":"VR-контроллеры: наведите и нажмите триггер либо используйте любой стик и кнопку A. Кнопка B закрывает меню, хват изменяет страницу. Xbox: крестовина или стик, A, B, LB / RB. Клавиатура: стрелки, Enter, Esc, Tab. Мышь: клики и прокрутка.","VR only (Xbox ignored)":"Только VR (Xbox игнорируется)","Video style":"Стиль видео","View":"Вид","View hints":"Подсказки видов","View modes and cutscenes":"Режимы камеры и кат-сцены","Views hold unexpected values; copy skipped":"В видах неожиданные значения; копирование пропущено","WHILE ADJUSTMENT IS ON":"ПОКА ВКЛЮЧЕНА НАСТРОЙКА","Wait for an active playtest in the launcher.":"Дождитесь активного плейтеста в лаунчере.","Wait for the launcher operation to finish.":"Дождитесь завершения работы лаунчера.","Waiting for a close-up (lens now %s degrees)":"Ожидание крупного плана (объектив сейчас %s градусов)","Waiting for a stereo frame":"Ожидание стереокадра","Waiting for a valid portal anchor.":"Ожидание корректной точки привязки портала.","Waiting for a verified cinematic signal":"Ожидание подтверждённого кинематографического сигнала","Waiting for an authored constrained camera":"Ожидание авторской камеры с ограниченным кадром","Waiting for fresh optical hands. Keep hands visible to the headset and enable tracking forwarding in Virtual Desktop when using VDXR.":"Ожидание оптического трекинга рук. Держите руки в поле зрения гарнитуры и включите перенаправление трекинга в Virtual Desktop при использовании VDXR.","Waiting for native game camera":"Ожидание родной камеры игры","Waiting for playtest acknowledgement...":"Ожидание подтверждения плейтеста...","Waiting for the launcher...":"Ожидание программы запуска…","Walk by default":"Ходьба по умолчанию","Walk by default; hold RB for normal speed":"Ходьба по умолчанию; удерживайте RB для обычной скорости","Walk instead of run; hold RB for normal speed.":"Ходьба вместо бега; удерживайте RB для обычной скорости.","Warn when a menu opens with game UI hidden":"Предупреждать о меню при скрытом UI","What automatic switching shows during story scenes and conversations. Keep current view leaves full VR, the stereo screen or mono as you have it.":"Что показывает автопереключение во время сюжетных сцен и разговоров. «Оставить текущий вид» сохраняет полный VR, стереоэкран или моно таким, как у вас сейчас.","What automatic switching shows while a story picture fills the screen.":"Что показывает автопереключение, пока сюжетная картинка заполняет экран.","What happened":"Что произошло","What you see of your own character. Hiding the head stops it from blocking the view.":"Видимость собственного персонажа. Скрытие головы предотвращает её перекрытие обзора.","When a letterboxed cinematic camera starts in full VR, a short note in view reminds you of the screen shortcut. A fallback for when automatic switching misses a scene.":"Когда в полном VR начинается широкоэкранная кинематографичная камера, в поле зрения появляется подсказка о сочетании для экрана. Резервный вариант, если автопереключение не сработало.","When to show the profile ID box":"Когда скрывать ID профиля","Where this menu floats around you. Full VR and the screen views each keep their own place; on a screen view Low sits just under the picture, whatever its size and distance, and the menu always stays in front of it.":"Местоположение этого меню. В полном VR и на экране меню сохраняет своё положение. В режиме экрана «Низко» меню размещается прямо под картинкой вне зависимости от её размера и расстояния и всегда остаётся перед ней.","Where your viewpoint sits in the diorama, from the game camera. Back (minus) moves the miniature farther away.":"Где находится точка обзора в диораме относительно камеры игры. Назад (минус) отодвигает миниатюру дальше.","Where: ":"Где: ","Which Xbox controller slot the VR controllers share. Automatic uses the one with a controller, such as a treadmill's virtual pad.":"Слот контроллера Xbox, который делят VR-контроллеры. Автоматически — слот, где есть контроллер, например виртуальный геймпад беговой дорожки.","Whichever you used last controls the game; the other waits until you press or push something on it.":"Управление игрой берёт тот контроллер, которым вы пользовались последним; второй ждёт, пока вы нажмёте или сдвинете что-либо на нём.","While hiding is off: a short note with the shortcut, once per scene, when a character is right at your eyes. After 3 notes it turns itself off.":"Пока скрытие выключено: короткое уведомление с сочетанием клавиш, раз за сцену, когда персонаж прямо у ваших глаз. После 3 уведомлений оно отключается само.","While playing in first person, hold L3 + Y to raise eye level or L3 + X to lower it. This lets you see the result with this menu closed.":"В первом лице удерживайте L3 + Y, чтобы поднять уровень глаз, или L3 + X, чтобы опустить его. Это позволяет оценить результат с закрытым меню.","While recording":"Во время записи","While recording: the boxes appear while the WuWa VR app records and during treadmill runs. Recording with other software (OBS) at other times needs Always.":"Во время записи: прямоугольники появляются, пока записывает приложение WuWa VR, и во время пробежек на дорожке. Для записи другой программой (OBS) в остальное время нужно «Всегда».","Wide 90 degrees":"Широкий 90°","Width per eye. Larger is sharper and makes bigger files.":"Ширина на глаз. Больше — резче, но файлы крупнее.","Window alignment down / up":"Смещение окна вниз / вверх","Window alignment left / right":"Смещение окна влево / вправо","With Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass on, keeps the source eye's projection for supported custom reflection captures. With Native Stereo Fix off, selects verified two-eye atlas parameters. Visual acceptance is pending.":"При включённых Native Stereo Fix и «Один стереопроход» сохраняется проекция исходного глаза для поддерживаемых пользовательских отражений. Если Native Stereo Fix выключен, выбираются проверенные параметры двухглазного атласа. Оценка визуального результата ещё не завершена.","With Reality Runner open, 10 seconds of walking starts a run and 5 minutes without walking ends it. The WuWa VR menu has the same switch on its Controllers page.":"Если открыт Reality Runner, 10 секунд ходьбы начинают пробежку, а 5 минут без ходьбы завершают её. В меню WuWa VR тот же переключатель есть на странице «Контроллеры».","With Reality Runner open, 10 seconds of walking starts a run and 5 minutes without walking ends it. Your route is saved in the UEVR profile, wuwa-runs folder.":"Если открыт Reality Runner, 10 секунд ходьбы начинают пробежку, а 5 минут без ходьбы завершают её. Маршрут сохраняется в профиле UEVR, папка wuwa-runs.","With the 16:9 layout off: every conversation (story scenes and chats with people in the world) and story videos switch to 16:9 while they play, so story pictures show whole, then the taller layout comes back. Follows the game's own dialogue state, so it works with any controls and with the game UI hidden.":"Когда раскладка 16:9 выключена: каждый разговор (сюжетные сцены и беседы с людьми в мире) и сюжетные видео на время показа переключаются на 16:9, чтобы сюжетные картинки были видны целиком, затем возвращается более высокая раскладка. Следует собственному состоянию диалога в игре, поэтому работает с любым управлением и со скрытым интерфейсом игры.","With the 16:9 layout on: the character screen (Resonators) uses the taller layout while it is open, so its floor reflection keeps showing the current character, then 16:9 comes back. Its icons look flatter there and the mouse can miss.":"При включённой раскладке 16:9: экран персонажа (Резонаторы), пока он открыт, использует более высокую раскладку, чтобы отражение пола всегда показывало текущего персонажа, затем возвращается 16:9. Значки там выглядят более плоскими, а мышь может промахиваться.","Within a shot":"В кадре","World scale":"Масштаб мира","World-space labels in both eyes (candidate)":"Надписи мира в обоих глазах (кандидат)","Write a short observation before saving.":"Напишите короткое описание перед сохранением.","WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"WuWa Controls > Показать интерфейс игры","WuWa VR menu":"Меню WuWa VR","WuWa controls and shortcut pages only. Base UEVR, game text and some technical help remain English. Translations are community-editable drafts.":"Только управление WuWa и страницы сочетаний клавиш. Базовый интерфейс UEVR, текст игры и часть технической справки остаются на английском. Перевод — черновой, редактируется сообществом.","X + left stick":"X + левый стик","X + stick  Scroll    D-pad Move map":"X + стик  Прокрутка    Крестовина Переместить карту","X or Delete: back to the default.":"X или Delete: вернуть значение по умолчанию.","XInput controller slot (test)":"Слот контроллера XInput (тест)","Xbox / Steam Input has priority; direct PlayStation shortcuts are waiting":"Xbox / Steam Input имеют приоритет; прямые сочетания для PlayStation пока недоступны","Y + X together: back to default":"Y + X вместе: по умолчанию","Yaw rate (degrees / second)":"Скорость рыскания (°/с)","You are in the scene":"Вы в сцене","Your answer: ":"Ваш ответ: ","Your answers are saved. Restart it from the menu's Test page.":"Ответы сохранены. Перезапустите тест на странице «Тест» в меню.","Your body":"Тело","Your route in the game is saved once a second (UEVR profile > wuwa-runs), so no map screenshots are needed. Each start and end flashes a magenta square in the desktop view, so an OBS video lines up with the route.":"Ваш маршрут в игре сохраняется каждую секунду (профиль UEVR > wuwa-runs), поэтому скриншоты карты не нужны. При каждом начале и конце в виде на мониторе мигает пурпурный квадрат, чтобы видео OBS совпало с маршрутом.","Your unsent note is retained in this menu until the game closes.":"Непросмотренная заметка сохранится в этом меню до закрытия игры.","depth of field forced on":"глубина резкости включена принудительно","depth of field: %s":"глубина резкости: %s","depth of field: not in this game build":"глубина резкости: нет в этой версии игры","game focus":"фокус игры","held behind the person in front (%s m)":"остановлено за человеком впереди (%s м)","hiding anything nearer than %s cm":"скрыто всё ближе %s см","hold {L3} or {LT}+{RT} to see what each button does · {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"удерживайте {L3} или {LT}+{RT}, чтобы увидеть назначение кнопок · {L3}+{R3} открывает меню WuWa VR","now":"сейчас","stopped at the closest %s cm":"остановлено на минимальном расстоянии %s см","subject":"объект","{LT}+{RT}, click {R3} for full VR":"{LT}+{RT}, нажмите {R3} для полного VR","{LT}+{RT}, click {R3} for the stereo screen":"{LT}+{RT}, нажмите {R3} для стереоэкрана","{LT}+{RT}, hold {R3} to leave mono":"{LT}+{RT}, удерживайте {R3}, чтобы выйти из моно"}},"zh-Hans":{"schema":1,"language":"zh-Hans","name":"Chinese (Simplified)","direction":"ltr","font":"sc","review":"draft; native-speaker review welcome","strings":{"%+.0f cm":"%+.0f 厘米","%+.2f m":"%+.2f 米","%.0f cm":"%.0f 厘米","%.0f deg":"%.0f 度","%.0fx":"%.0f 倍","%.1f m":"%.1f 米","%.1fx":"%.1f 倍","%.2f m":"%.2f 米","%.2f s":"%.2f 秒","%.2fx":"%.2f 倍","%.3fx":"%.3f 倍","%s: %u samples":"%s：%u 个采样",". Answer again to change it.":"。再次作答即可更改。","01  HOLD L3":"01  按住 L3","02  HOLD LT + RT":"02  按住 LT + RT","03  CAMERAS":"03  镜头","04  MENUS & HUD":"04  菜单与 HUD","05  WUWA VR MENU":"05  WuWa VR 菜单","1024 px":"1024 px","1280 px":"1280 px","16:9 UI layout":"16:9 界面布局","30 fps":"30 fps","3D depth":"3D 深度","45 fps":"45 fps","60 fps":"60 fps","720 px":"720 px","A VR button or stick held from before is ignored until you let go of it.":"之前已按住的 VR 按键或摇杆会被忽略，松开后恢复。","A big 3D screen; best for cutscenes":"大型 3D 屏幕；最适合过场动画","A hidden head bone has no usable animated pose: the neck supplies an approximation. For actual head-bone tracking choose Keep entire character visible or Hide body; keep full character shadow. Separate accessories without a head bone may remain visible in head-only mode. Exit and re-enter first person in a neutral pose to recalibrate. Offsets use game units. L3 + A recenters headset/simulator displacement.":"隐藏的头部骨骼无法提供可用动画姿态，因此改用颈部估算。如需跟踪真实头部骨骼，请选择保留整个角色，或隐藏身体并保留原始阴影。仅隐藏头部时，没有头部骨骼的独立配饰可能仍然可见。可在角色姿态自然时退出并重新进入第一人称以校准。偏移使用游戏单位；L3 + A 可重新居中头显／模拟器位移。","A select  ·  Left / right change  ·  LB / RB pages  ·  B close":"A 确认  ·  左／右切换  ·  LB／RB 翻页  ·  B 关闭","A-D restore all controller slots for a fair comparison. Each records until stopped or 1000 changes. Close with Insert, test LB+Y before and after Alt-Tab, then return with Insert. Restore above to undo this batch. UEVR saves the current settings on exit.":"A-D 会恢复所有手柄槽位，以便公平对比。每个槽位会记录到停止或达到 1000 次更改为止。用 Insert 关闭，在 Alt-Tab 前后测试 LB+Y，然后用 Insert 返回。用上方的还原选项可撤销本批次。UEVR 退出时会保存当前设置。","A. Physical gamepad baseline":"A. 实体手柄基准","A/B/X/Y keep their labels. Triggers = LT/RT, grips = LB/RB, stick clicks = L3/R3. Left Menu tap = Start; left grip + Menu tap = View. Both stick clicks open the WuWa VR menu. D-pad actions are not mapped.":"A／B／X／Y 按键名称一一对应。扳机 = LT／RT，握持键 = LB／RB，按下摇杆 = L3／R3。短按左侧 Menu 键 = Start；左握持键 + 短按 Menu = View。同时按下两侧摇杆打开 WuWa VR 菜单。不映射十字键操作。","Acro drone":"Acro 无人机","Acro drone (manual)":"Acro 无人机（手动）","Acro throttle control":"Acro 油门控制","Acro: right stick controls roll/pitch rates; left stick X controls yaw. Stick forward pitches down. Centered sticks stop rotation without levelling. Gravity, thrust and momentum keep acting while armed. Full camera roll is part of this mode.":"Acro：右摇杆控制滚转／俯仰速率，左摇杆横轴控制偏航。摇杆前推为俯冲。摇杆回中即停止旋转且不会自动回正。解锁状态下重力、推力和惯性持续生效。完整镜头滚转属于此模式。","Action":"功能","Activated automatically in this menu: cursor only. L3 + R3 opens the WuWa VR menu.":"在此菜单中自动启用：仅光标。L3 + R3 打开 WuWa VR 菜单。","Active: %s (targets swapped %llu, constructed %llu)":"生效中：%s（已交换目标 %llu，已构造 %llu）","Active: %s, %llu s left, applied %llu, restored %llu":"生效中：%s，剩余 %llu 秒，已应用 %llu，已还原 %llu","Adds the missing second-eye pass for the custom material path used by Lynae, Mornye and Iuno. Preserves the first eye. Requires Native Stereo, with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off. Visual acceptance pending.":"为 Lynae、Mornye 和 Iuno 使用的自定义材质通道补上缺失的第二眼渲染通道。保留第一眼。需要 Native Stereo，且需关闭 Native Stereo Fix 和极致兼容。视觉效果待验收。","Advanced compatibility and diagnostics":"高级兼容性与诊断","Advanced rendering and script diagnostics":"高级渲染与脚本诊断","After you switch views, a line shows for 3 seconds with how to go on or come back. It switches itself off after 5 switches.":"切换视图后，会显示 3 秒提示，说明如何继续切换或返回。切换 5 次后自动关闭。","Aim direction":"瞄准方向","Aiming and right-stick pitch":"瞄准与右摇杆俯仰","Air drag (per second)":"空气阻力（每秒）","All camera effects":"所有镜头效果","All camera effects copied into the first view":"所有镜头效果已复制到第一视图","All camera effects copied into the second view":"所有镜头效果已复制到第二视图","All detected menus":"所有检测到的菜单","All settings (classic UEVR menu)":"所有设置（经典 UEVR 菜单）","All shortcut contexts":"全部快捷键","All slots (unchanged)":"所有槽位（未更改）","All slots preserves normal input. Select one slot to exclude the others from WuWa's XInput state calls. Check the raw controller states below while pressing a button to identify your pad. Slot numbers can change after reconnecting; this does not hide Windows devices or filter other input APIs. Vibration commands stay available, including motor stop requests.":"所有槽位会保留正常输入。选择一个槽位可将其他槽位从 WuWa 的 XInput 状态调用中排除。按下按钮时查看下方的原始手柄状态即可识别你的手柄。槽位编号在重新连接后可能改变；这不会隐藏 Windows 设备，也不会过滤其他输入 API。震动指令仍然可用，包括停止马达的请求。","All stick overrides (includes legacy pitch-only)":"所有摇杆覆盖（含旧版仅俯仰）","Allow VR motion-controller input":"允许 VR 运动控制器输入","Also cover the ESC profile ID row":"同时遮挡 ESC 菜单资料 ID","Also hide the profile ID row":"同时隐藏资料 ID 行","Alternating / AFR":"交替／AFR","Always":"始终","Always (manual mask)":"始终（手动遮挡）","Ambient occlusion":"环境光遮蔽","Ambient occlusion (soft contact shadows)":"环境光遮蔽（柔和的接触阴影）","An automated stereo comparison is active. These three settings return to your choices when it ends (at most 60 seconds).":"自动立体对比正在进行。结束后这三项设置会恢复为你的选择（最多 60 秒）。","Animated":"动画","Animated position + stick pitch":"动画位置＋摇杆俯仰","Animation comfort":"动画与舒适度","Animation off: stable height relative to the character root. On: follow the head, or reconstruct it from a visible parent bone when the head is hidden. This follows leaning and sprinting but can add bobbing. Missing rig support falls back to the stable anchor; see the status below.":"关闭动画跟随时，视角相对角色根节点保持稳定高度。开启时跟随头部；若头部被隐藏，则从可见的父骨骼重建位置。这样能跟随倾身和冲刺，但可能增加晃动。不支持的骨架会退回稳定锚点，详情见脚本状态。","Another playtest request is pending. Wait for the launcher.":"另一个测试请求尚未完成。请等待启动器处理。","Another setting changed the rim value; it was left untouched. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"其他设置更改了边缘光数值；本选项未覆盖该更改。关闭后重新开启可重试。","Answer in the menu: L3 + R3 (or Insert), Test page.":"在菜单中作答：L3 + R3（或 Insert），测试页面。","As in the headset":"与头显中一致","As in the headset: the HUD sits where you see it in VR, at its distance and size. Flat: the HUD fills the window like on a monitor, a steady reference while you play. Full VR only; the stereo screen and mono theatre always show it flat.":"与头显中一致：HUD 位于你在 VR 中看到的位置，距离和大小相同。平面：HUD 像在显示器上一样铺满窗口，游玩时可作为稳定参照。仅限完整 VR；立体屏幕和单目影院始终以平面显示。","Asks the game to lay out its HUD again. Try it if the HUD looks stretched or cut off after switching views.":"请求游戏重新布局其 HUD。如果切换视图后 HUD 看起来被拉伸或被截断，可试试这个。","Authored framing applied (headset check pending)":"已应用原作取景（待头显确认）","Auto":"自动","Auto uses the eye that has the camera's focus. If both eyes stay sharp or look wrong, try First or Second.":"自动使用镜头焦点所在的那只眼。如果双眼都保持清晰或看起来不对，可试试第一只眼或第二只眼。","Automatic":"自动","Automatic cinematic screen":"自动电影屏幕","Automatic cinematic screen (experimental)":"自动过场屏幕（实验性）","Automatic cutscene switching":"自动切换过场视图","Automatic lease expired; restoration waits for the next game tick":"自动租约已过期；恢复将在下一次游戏更新时进行","Automatic mono theatre active":"自动单目影院已启用","Automatic presentation lease expired; previous view restored":"自动呈现租约已过期；已恢复之前的视图","Automatic slot: using slot %d.":"自动槽位：正在使用槽位 %d。","Automatic stereo screen active":"自动立体屏幕已启用","Automatic story switching did not activate in the latest reported replay. Prerecorded video switching has not been tested. Missing or changed signals leave the normal view unchanged.":"最新反馈的剧情重播中，自动剧情切换没有触发。预录视频的自动切换尚未测试。信号缺失或变化时，保持原有视图。","Automatic uses the slot that has a controller, such as a treadmill's virtual pad while the real pad is hidden. Choose a fixed slot only if it picks the wrong one: launcher Troubleshooting > Controller check lists them.":"自动会使用接有手柄的槽位，例如真实手柄被隐藏时跑步机的虚拟手柄。只有选错时才需指定固定槽位：启动器的“故障排除 > 手柄检查”会列出各槽位。","Automatically use mouse in game menus (legacy)":"在游戏菜单中自动使用鼠标（旧版）","B. Windows focus forwarding":"B. Windows 焦点转发","Back to 1.33, the full VR default.":"恢复为 1.33，即完整 VR 默认值。","Back to the WuWa VR menu":"返回 WuWa VR 菜单","Back to the diorama defaults: 5 m back, centred. The normal offsets stay as they are.":"恢复微缩视角的默认值：后退 5 米，居中。常规偏移保持不变。","Back to the game camera.":"返回游戏镜头。","Black bars":"黑边","Black bars in cutscenes? In WuWa's graphics settings, change Cinematic from Cutscene to Fullscreen. The bars go and cutscenes fill your view.":"过场动画有黑边？在 WuWa 的画面设置中将「电影模式」从「过场动画」改为「全屏」，黑边就会消失，过场动画将填满视野。","Black boxes cover the bottom-right UID and the ESC profile ID row in the extracted game UI, including its VR/portal and spectator copies. Check a short recording before sharing: other layouts, names, chat and diagnostics are not anonymized.":"黑框会遮盖提取出的游戏界面右下角的 UID 以及 ESC 菜单资料 ID 行，包括其 VR／空间窗口与观众副本。分享前请先检查一段短录像：其他布局、名字、聊天和诊断信息均未匿名化。","Black boxes over your UID in the corner and the profile ID row in menus. While recording: while the WuWa VR app records or a treadmill run is on, so the boxes never cover HUD you need in play. Always: for OBS and other recorders at any time. The boxes are approximate; check a short video before sharing. Other names and chat are not hidden.":"用黑框遮住角落里的 UID 和菜单中的个人资料 ID 行。录制时：在 WuWa VR 应用录制或跑步机跑步进行时显示，因此黑框不会在游玩时挡住你需要的 HUD。始终：适用于 OBS 等其他录制软件，任何时候都显示。黑框位置是近似的；分享前请先检查一段短视频。其他名字和聊天不会被隐藏。","Blocked":"受阻","Blur (depth of field) on / off":"开关模糊（景深）","Blur copied into the first view":"模糊已复制到第一视图","Blur copied into the second view":"模糊已复制到第二视图","Blur off":"模糊关闭","Blur on":"模糊开启","Blur only":"仅模糊","Blur strength, full VR":"模糊强度，完整 VR","Blur strength, screens":"模糊强度，屏幕","Both eyes get":"双眼获得","Both eyes, side by side":"双眼并排","Both eyes: %s":"双眼：%s","Both together":"同时使用","Both together: buttons combine and each stick follows whichever is pushed further, so treadmill walking keeps working while you look around with VR. Last used wins: the other waits until you use it. VR only: the Xbox pad is ignored while VR controllers are on.":"同时使用：按键合并，每根摇杆以推得更远的一方为准，因此用 VR 环顾四周时跑步机行走仍然有效。以最后使用为准：另一方会等待你使用它。仅 VR：VR 手柄开启时忽略 Xbox 手柄。","Both work at once: buttons combine and each stick follows whichever is pushed further, so treadmill walking keeps working.":"两者同时生效：按键叠加，每个摇杆采用推得更远的一方，因此跑步机行走不受影响。","Build left view like the first eye (K5)":"将左眼视图按第一只眼构建（K5）","Buttons":"按键","C. Gamepad passthrough":"C. 手柄直通","CAMERA":"镜头","Camera":"镜头","Camera / HUD layouts: LuaLoader > Script UI > WuWa VR comfort controls.":"镜头／HUD 布局：LuaLoader > Script UI > WuWa VR 舒适控制。","Camera and controller data":"镜头和手柄数据","Camera and gameplay controls":"镜头与游玩控制","Camera collision radius (game units)":"镜头碰撞半径（游戏单位）","Camera customization":"镜头自定义","Camera position":"镜头位置","Camera up / down":"镜头上／下","Camera view":"镜头模式","Cannot write playtest request.":"无法写入测试请求。","Card distance":"卡片距离","Card height":"卡片高度","Card size":"卡片尺寸","Card width (meters)":"卡片宽度（米）","Change page":"切换页面","Character screen in the taller layout":"角色界面使用较高布局","Character toon-depth rim is suppressed; the previous value is retained.":"已抑制角色卡通深度边缘光；已保留之前的数值。","Character toon-depth rim was already zero; no write was needed.":"角色卡通深度边缘光原本为零，无需修改。","Character visibility details":"角色显示详情","Characters in the shot":"画面中的角色","Characters in the shot: the person the game focuses on (or nearest the middle of the 2D frame), and Close-up match stops behind anyone in front of them, as in over-the-shoulder shots. Game focus only: aims by the game's focus distance alone and does not look for people.":"画面中的角色：游戏聚焦的角色（或最接近 2D 画面中心者），而「特写匹配」会停在位于其前方的任何人身后，如同过肩镜头。仅游戏焦点：只按游戏的对焦距离瞄准，不寻找人物。","Checklist item":"检查项目","Choose First person under View modes if wanted; camera and aiming settings stay unchanged.":"如需第一人称，请在视图模式中选择；镜头和瞄准设置保持不变。","Choose a checklist item in this playtest.":"请选择本次测试中的检查项目。","Cinema":"影院","Cinematic scene":"电影场景","Cinematic scene note":"电影场景备注","Click / go back":"点击／返回","Click left stick + left bumper, then release all controls.":"按下左摇杆＋左肩键，然后松开所有按键。","Click twice":"点击两次","Click: blur on / off":"点击：开关模糊","Click: full VR / stereo screen":"点击：完整 VR / 立体屏幕","Close UEVR before using these shortcuts. L3/R3 mean clicking the sticks; View is the two-squares button and Menu is the three-lines button.":"使用这些快捷键前请先关闭 UEVR。L3/R3 指按下摇杆；View 是双方块按钮，Menu 是三横线按钮。","Close UEVR, press L3 + LB once, then release the controller. Left stick moves the cursor; A clicks, B goes back, X + stick scrolls. LT/RT moves the HUD nearer/farther; LB/RB lowers/raises it. L3 + LB again returns to normal controls. Adjustment pauses freecam flight and starts off each launch.":"关闭 UEVR，按一次 L3 + LB 后松开手柄。左摇杆移动光标，A 点击，B 返回，X + 摇杆滚动。LT／RT 将 HUD 拉近／推远，LB／RB 将其降低／升高。再次按 L3 + LB 恢复正常操作。调整时暂停自由镜头飞行，每次启动默认关闭。","Close-up aims at":"特写瞄准目标","Close-up at %s degrees: %s %s m away, moved %s m nearer":"特写 %s 度：%s 距离 %s 米，已前移 %s 米","Close-up at %s degrees: the game sets no focus in this shot, view at the game camera":"特写 %s 度：本镜头游戏未设焦点，视角保持在游戏镜头","Close-up match":"特写匹配","Closest distance":"最近距离","Collide with the world":"与世界碰撞","Comfort":"舒适","Comfort keeps your height steady and the horizon level. Animated follows your character's head as it moves. Full animation also follows its turns (experimental). Custom uses the options in the classic menu.":"舒适模式保持你的高度稳定、视线水平。动画会跟随角色头部的移动。完整动画还会跟随其转身（实验）。自定义则使用经典菜单中的选项。","Comfort: stable height, level horizon":"舒适：固定高度、水平视线","Compare controller fixes in this run":"比较本次运行中的手柄修复","Confirming cinematic signal":"正在确认过场信号","Controller shortcuts":"手柄快捷操作","Controller slot":"手柄槽位","Controllers":"手柄","Controls":"操作","Controls cards":"操作卡片","Controls cards (hold L3, or LT + RT)":"操作卡片（按住 L3，或 LT + RT）","Copy failed":"复制失败","Copy from":"复制自","Covers the ID row on the ESC profile screen too.":"同时遮挡 ESC 菜单资料界面的 ID 行。","Current renderer: %s":"当前渲染器：%s","Current result: %s":"当前结果：%s","Custom":"自定义","Custom / saved behavior":"自定义／已保存设置","Custom motion settings":"自定义运动设置","Custom-reflection comparison stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"自定义反射对比已停止，或无法验证此游戏版本。请查看诊断日志。","Custom: Extreme Compatibility":"自定义：极致兼容","D-pad":"十字键","D-pad / A / B":"十字键 / A / B","D. Focus forwarding + passthrough":"D. 焦点转发＋透视","DO":"操作","Decouple game camera pitch":"分离游戏镜头俯仰","Decoupled pitch":"分离俯仰","Default: %s. Saved for next time.":"默认：%s。会保存到下次。","Default: F7. Xbox: hold L3, then squeeze LT. Release both before repeating. Portal size and curvature are preserved; enabling anchors it in front of you.":"默认 F7。Xbox：按住 L3，再将 LT 按到底；再次操作前请松开两者。窗口大小和曲率保持不变，开启时锚定在你面前。","Default: keeps the body visible and head bones hidden, with a full shadow copy. Original non-casting/hidden equipment stays excluded. Copies are removed on exit, menus, rig changes or script reset. Unsupported rigs report a fallback below.":"默认保留身体、隐藏头部骨骼，并使用完整阴影副本。原本不投影或隐藏的装备仍被排除。退出此模式、打开菜单、更换骨架或重置脚本时会移除副本。不支持的骨架会在脚本状态中报告备用处理。","Degrees above straight ahead (below is negative).":"正前方之上角度（下方为负）。","Degrees below your line of sight. More puts the card lower, out of the way of the HUD.":"低于视线的角度。数值越大，卡片越低，不会挡住 HUD。","Degrees to the right of straight ahead (left is negative).":"正前方右侧角度（左侧为负）。","Depth of field":"景深","Depth of field and camera effects":"景深与镜头效果","Depth-of-field fields not found":"找不到景深字段","Desktop window":"桌面窗口","Detection details":"检测详情","Developer playtest checklist":"开发者测试检查表","Dialogue shots use a zoom lens your headset's wide view can't show, so people look small and far. This moves you nearer, per shot, so they keep this share of their 2D size. At 0 you stay at the game camera's own spot, 100 matches the 2D shot and above 100 comes closer still. Game camera in full VR only.":"对话镜头使用头显的广角视野无法呈现的长焦镜头，因此人物看起来又小又远。此选项会按每个镜头把你拉近，使其保持原有的 2D 画面占比。0 时停留在游戏镜头自身位置，100 与 2D 镜头一致，超过 100 则更近。仅在完整 VR 的游戏镜头下生效。","Diorama (10×)":"微缩景观（10 倍）","Diorama (miniature world)":"微缩景观（微缩世界）","Diorama camera":"微缩视角镜头","Diorama is on at %.0fx. This slider edits the normal scale restored when you turn it off in WuWa Controls.":"微缩模式已开启，使用 %.0f 倍比例。此滑块修改常规比例，关闭 WuWa Controls 中的微缩模式后恢复该值。","Diorama mode (optional)":"微缩景观模式（可选）","Diorama needs Native Stereo. Choose it under Stereo rendering compatibility.":"微缩模式需要 Native Stereo，请在立体渲染兼容性中选择。","Diorama on / off":"开关微缩视角","Diorama scale":"微缩比例","Diorama uses a temporary miniature scale (Diorama scale on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page, 10x by default) with Native Stereo, with the portal on or off. Turning it off returns to your normal saved scale, including deliberate scale edits. It starts off each launch, settings reload and runtime reinitialization. Head movement is magnified; L3 + A recenters.":"微缩视角临时使用微缩比例（在 WuWa VR 菜单的快捷页设置，默认 10 倍），需要 Native Stereo；空间窗口开关均可。关闭后恢复普通已保存比例，主动修改的比例也会保留。每次启动、重新加载设置或重新初始化运行时后默认关闭。头部移动会放大；L3 + A 可重新居中。","Diorama: forward / back":"微缩：前进／后退","Diorama: right / left":"微缩：右 / 左","Diorama: up / down":"微缩：上／下","Direct PlayStation shortcuts are experimental. The game still receives their buttons. Steam Input is preferred when available; release all controls after changing input sources.":"PlayStation 直连快捷操作为实验功能，游戏仍会收到相应按键。可用时优先使用 Steam Input；切换输入来源后请松开所有按键。","Discard unsent note":"丢弃未发送的备注","Distance":"距离","Do: ":"操作： ","Done":"完成","Double L3  Windows screenshot":"双击 L3  Windows 截图","Double R3":"双击 R3","Double R3  Freecam on / off":"双击 R3  开关自由镜头","Draws the missing eye of the world-label stage with its own camera and depth rectangle. Requires the matching candidate DLL and native stereo without Native Stereo Fix. Unsupported layouts keep the original rendering. NPC/bubble acceptance is pending; this does not repair reflections or character materials.":"用独立的相机和深度矩形绘制世界标签阶段缺失的那只眼。需要匹配的候选 DLL，并在不使用 Native Stereo Fix 的情况下启用原生立体。不支持的布局保留原始渲染。NPC／气泡的验收尚待完成；此功能不会修复反射或角色材质。","Drone response (higher = less drift)":"无人机响应（越高漂移越小）","DualSense direct shortcuts (experimental)":"DualSense 直连快捷操作（实验功能）","DualShock 4 direct shortcuts (experimental)":"DualShock 4 直连快捷操作（实验功能）","ESC / overlay menus (detected)":"ESC／叠加菜单（检测）","EXPECT":"预期","Each eye: %u x %u pixels. Now about %.0f fps.":"每只眼睛：%u x %u 像素。当前约 %.0f fps。","Early stereo view setup (experimental)":"早期立体视图设置（实验）","Edit the UTF-8 JSON files in your game profile's wuwa-languages folder. Missing entries fall back to English. Reload applies changes without restarting the game.":"编辑游戏配置的 wuwa-languages 文件夹中的 UTF-8 JSON 文件。缺失的条目将回退为英文。重新加载可应用更改，无需重启游戏。","Edit translations":"编辑翻译","Enable WuWa controller shortcuts":"启用鸣潮手柄快捷操作","Enable automatic switching":"启用自动切换","Enable controller mouse shortcuts":"启用手柄鼠标快捷操作","End run":"结束跑步","End the temporary focus/motion test below before starting a comparison.":"开始对比前，请先结束下方的临时焦点／运动测试。","Enter first person":"进入第一人称","Everyday controller shortcuts":"常用手柄快捷操作","Everyone":"所有人","Everything else: {L3}+{R3} opens the WuWa VR menu":"其他功能：{L3}+{R3} 打开 WuWa VR 菜单","Exact animation":"完整跟随动画","Exact animation (stick does not steer view)":"完整动画（摇杆不控制视角）","Exit mouse mode now":"立即退出鼠标模式","Expect: ":"预期： ","Extract additional game menus (experimental)":"提取其他游戏菜单（实验）","Extract game HUD into the VR panel":"提取游戏 HUD 到 VR 面板","Eyes don't match":"双眼画面不一致","FPV camera upward tilt (degrees)":"FPV 镜头向上倾斜（度）","Faces the view forward from where you are now.":"视图从你当前所在位置朝前。","Fail":"失败","Far trees and props switch detail together in both eyes. Recommended.":"远处的树木和道具在双眼同步切换细节。推荐。","Fill whole frame (stretch)":"填满边框（拉伸）","Finish only when you are done. Untested checks remain Not tested; no result is inferred from notes.":"完成测试后再结束会话。未检查的项目仍为“未测试”；不会根据备注推断结果。","Finish playtest":"结束测试","Finished":"已完成","Finishing the video. Please wait.":"正在保存视频，请稍候。","First person":"第一人称","First person character visibility":"第一人称角色显示","First person forward offset":"第一人称前后偏移","First person height offset":"第一人称高度偏移","First person motion":"第一人称运动","First person on / off":"开关第一人称","First person right offset":"第一人称左右偏移","First person: full animation":"第一人称：完整动画","First view":"第一视图","First-person position":"第一人称位置","First-person script status":"第一人称脚本状态","Fit to portal frame":"适配传送门边框","Fixed":"固定","Fixed camera distance (game units)":"固定镜头距离（游戏单位）","Fixed camera height above pawn (game units)":"角色上方固定镜头高度（游戏单位）","Fixed per shot":"每个镜头固定","Fixed third person":"固定第三人称","Fixed: farther / closer":"固定镜头：远／近","Fixes":"修复","Flat screen; easiest on the eyes":"平面屏幕；最护眼","Flat, like a monitor":"平面，如显示器","Flying style":"飞行方式","Focus game on controller reconnect":"手柄重新连接时聚焦游戏","Follow animated head / neck position (Custom)":"跟随动画中的头部／颈部位置（自定义）","Follow the focus":"跟随焦点","Follow view (player HUD)":"跟随视线（玩家 HUD）","Follow view keeps the HUD with your head. Distance still sets its stereo depth; choose a comfortable size and distance in the headset.":"跟随视线会让 HUD 随头部移动。距离仍决定其立体深度；请在头显中选择舒适的尺寸和距离。","For exact edge alignment set WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature to 0. This HUD panel is flat; it does not bend with a curved aperture.":"如需精确边缘对齐，请将 WindowMode > Horizontal Curvature 设为 0。此 HUD 面板是平面的，不会随曲面光圈弯曲。","For the WuWa VR menu, the controls cards and notices. The game's own language is set in the game.":"用于 WuWa VR 菜单、操作卡片和提示。游戏本身的语言请在游戏中设置。","For the whole scene":"整个场景","For troubleshooting and comparisons. Leave these alone for everyday play; opening this section changes nothing.":"用于故障排查和对比。日常游玩时请勿改动；打开此分区不会改变任何设置。","For troubleshooting. These controls can change rendering or input; opening this section changes nothing.":"用于排查问题。这些选项会影响渲染或输入；仅展开此区域不会改变设置。","Forward / back":"前进／后退","Forward Windows focus events (test)":"转发 Windows 焦点事件（测试）","Frame coverage (1 = full size)":"边框覆盖率（1＝完整尺寸）","Frame rate":"帧率","Frames per second in the video.":"视频的每秒帧数。","Framing and theatre details":"画面构图与影院模式详情","Framing candidate refused; see diagnostic log":"取景候选被拒绝；请查看诊断日志","Framing matched both eyes in the owner's simulator replay. Headset comfort and rare prerecorded movies still need testing.":"作者已在模拟器剧情回放中确认双眼构图一致。头显舒适度和少见的预渲染视频仍待测试。","Framing repair matched both eyes in a simulator quest replay. Headset comfort remains untested; mono theatre is still available as a manual fallback.":"取景修复已在模拟器的任务重播中实现双眼匹配。头显舒适度仍待测试；需要时仍可手动切换单目影院。","Freecam":"自由镜头","Freecam collision (experimental)":"自由镜头碰撞（实验）","Freecam movement speed":"自由镜头移动速度","Freecam movement style":"自由镜头移动方式","Freecam on / off":"开关自由镜头","Freecam turning speed":"自由镜头转向速度","Freecam: LB descends; double RT = turbo":"自由镜头：LB 下降；双击 RT＝涡轮加速","Freecam: LT rises, RT boosts speed":"自由镜头：LT 上升，RT 加速","Freecam: boost / turbo":"自由镜头：加速／极速","Freecam: left stick moves, right looks":"自由镜头：左摇杆移动，右摇杆环视","Freecam: move / look":"自由镜头：移动／观察","Freecam: rise / descend":"自由镜头：上升／下降","Front":"前方","Full VR":"完整 VR","Full VR / stereo screen (click again to switch back)":"完整 VR / 立体屏幕（再次点击切换回来）","Full VR draws two large eye images every frame, far more pixels than the stereo screen, so busy scenes such as dialogue run slower there. A lower resolution is smoother and a little softer.":"完整 VR 每帧绘制两幅大型眼图，像素远超立体屏幕，因此对话等复杂场景在其中运行更慢。较低分辨率更流畅，但会略微柔和。","Full VR: the game all around you. Stereo screen: a big 3D screen, for menus and scenes that look wrong in full VR. Mono theatre: a flat screen, the same picture in both eyes. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then hold R3 (hold again to go back).":"完整 VR：游戏环绕在你四周。立体屏幕：一块大 3D 屏幕，适合菜单和在完整 VR 中显示异常的场面。单目影院：平面屏幕，双眼画面相同。快捷键：按住 LT + RT，然后长按 R3（再次长按返回）。","Full animation":"完整动画","Full animation follows character turns and can be intense. L3 + D-pad Down returns to your previous motion choice.":"完整动画会跟随角色转身，可能引起不适。L3 + 十字键下可恢复之前的运动选项。","Full animation is paused: headset/controller aim or Decoupled Pitch conflicts with animated head turning. Game-view rotation is being used; head position still follows the character.":"完整动画已暂停：头显／手柄瞄准或分离俯仰与动画头部转向冲突。正在使用游戏视图旋转；头部位置仍跟随角色。","Full animation rotation (experimental)":"完整动画旋转（实验）","Full animation: stick override":"完整动画：摇杆覆盖","Full frame at 1 fills both axes of the portal rectangle. It stretches the HUD if its proportions differ from the frame. Preserve proportions leaves space on one axis. Safe fit also leaves a margin for rounded/feathered edges. Your separate HUD layout is retained.":"填满边框设为 1 时占满传送门矩形的两个轴。如果 HUD 的比例与边框不同，画面会被拉伸。保持比例会在一轴上留出空间。安全适配还会为圆角／羽化边缘留出边距。你单独的 HUD 布局会保留。","Full speed while Polar walk is on":"Polar 步行开启时全速","Full-resolution translucent materials in stereo (candidate)":"立体模式下的全分辨率半透明材质（候选）","Fully hold both triggers first. R3: click to switch between full VR and the stereo screen, hold 0.8 seconds for mono theatre (hold again to go back); with the triggers still held you can click or hold R3 again. L3: click to turn blur on or off, hold 0.8 seconds for the stereo screen; release all controls before repeating an L3 shortcut. Available during dialogue; close UEVR and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first.":"先完全按住两侧扳机。R3：点按在完整 VR 和立体屏幕之间切换，按住 0.8 秒进入单目影院（再次按住返回）；保持按住扳机即可再次点按或按住 R3。L3：点按开关模糊，按住 0.8 秒切换到立体屏幕；重复 L3 快捷键前请先松开所有控件。对话期间可用；请先关闭 UEVR 并退出 HUD／鼠标调整。","GAME UI HIDDEN - MENUS ARE HIDDEN TOO":"游戏界面已隐藏 - 菜单也会隐藏","GAME UI IS HIDDEN":"游戏界面已隐藏","GAME UI IS HIDDEN - menus are hidden too":"游戏界面已隐藏 - 菜单也已隐藏","GENERAL":"通用","Game / fixed camera":"游戏／固定镜头","Game camera":"游戏镜头","Game camera follows WuWa's own camera and its dialogue camera work. Close-up match brings you nearer in zoomed-in shots, so they frame people like the 2D view does.":"游戏镜头跟随 WuWa 自身的镜头及其对话运镜。特写匹配会在拉近镜头时让你更靠近，从而像 2D 视角那样框住人物。","Game camera: WuWa's own camera. Fixed third person: a steady camera behind you. Freecam: fly the camera anywhere, for cutscenes and photos. First person: through your character's eyes. Options for each are on the Camera page.":"游戏镜头：使用 WuWa 自身的镜头。固定第三人称：稳定地跟随在你身后。自由镜头：自由飞行镜头，适用于过场动画和拍照。第一人称：透过角色的眼睛观看。各项选项都在镜头页面。","Game focus only":"仅游戏焦点","Game lens":"游戏镜头","Game lens: the stereo screen frames every shot exactly like the 2D view, in 3D. Wide: the fixed 90 degree view used in older versions.":"游戏镜头：立体屏幕会像 2D 视角那样以 3D 方式精确框住每个镜头。广角：旧版本使用的固定 90 度视角。","Game-view override shows the game's camera direction while either stick is used, then returns to animation 0.4 seconds after release. Full animation and headset view can still disagree with movement or target selection; aim alignment remains under investigation. These options never rotate or move the character for you.":"使用任一摇杆时，游戏视角接管会采用游戏镜头方向；松开后 0.4 秒恢复动画跟随。完整动画和头显视角仍可能与移动方向或目标选择不一致，瞄准对齐仍在调查中。这些选项不会替你转动或移动角色。","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes.":"在带黑边的场景中让双眼获得相同的取景。","Gives both eyes the same framing during letterboxed scenes. Leave on unless a scene looks cropped.":"在带黑边的场景中让双眼获得相同的取景。除非某场景看起来被裁切，否则请保持开启。","HUD":"HUD","HUD / MOUSE MODE ON":"HUD／鼠标模式已启用","HUD / mouse adjustment ON (L3 + LB toggles)":"HUD／鼠标调整已启用（L3 + LB 切换）","HUD / mouse mode":"HUD／鼠标模式","HUD / mouse mode is ON: gameplay buttons are redirected":"HUD／鼠标模式已启用：游玩按键已被重定向","HUD POSITION":"HUD 位置","HUD and focus comfort":"HUD 与窗口切换","HUD distance":"HUD 距离","HUD distance (meters)":"HUD 距离（米）","HUD down / up":"HUD 降低／升高","HUD follows decoupled pitch":"HUD 跟随分离俯仰","HUD follows your head":"HUD 跟随头部","HUD height (meters)":"HUD 高度（米）","HUD in the desktop window":"桌面窗口中的 HUD","HUD nearer / farther":"HUD 拉近／推远","HUD or menu":"HUD 或菜单","HUD placement and visibility":"HUD 位置与显示","HUD refresh: done. Check the HUD in the headset.":"HUD 刷新：已完成。请在头显中检查 HUD。","HUD refresh: not possible right now. Try again in a moment; the log has the details.":"HUD 刷新：暂时无法进行。请稍后再试；详情见日志。","HUD refresh: the HUD already matches this view.":"HUD 刷新：HUD 已与当前视图匹配。","HUD refresh: the HUD keeps changing. Open ESC or switch views to try again.":"HUD 刷新：HUD 一直在变化。请打开 ESC 或切换视图后重试。","HUD refresh: working on it.":"HUD 刷新：正在处理。","HUD right / left (meters)":"HUD 左右位置（米）","HUD shape (full VR)":"HUD 形状（完整 VR）","HUD size":"HUD 尺寸","HUD up / down (meters)":"HUD 上下位置（米）","Hand / finger demo (optional)":"手部／手指演示（可选）","Hand demo is off. Enable it only when you want to try bare-hand tracking.":"手部演示已关闭。需要体验裸手追踪时再开启。","Hand tracking returned an error. Switch the demo off and on to retry.":"手部追踪返回错误。关闭后重新开启演示可重试。","Head movement also scales up. Use Recenter if the view feels displaced. Starts off each launch and after reloading settings.":"头部移动也会被放大。如视角偏移，可使用重新居中。每次启动或重新加载设置后默认关闭。","Headset aim selects Head and sends that direction to the game; the stick still turns. Right-stick pitch selects Game, disables control-rotation override and both pitch locks. Neither changes LB + Y or the selected utility.":"头显瞄准选择“头部”，并将该方向传给游戏；摇杆仍负责转向。右摇杆俯仰选择“游戏”，会关闭控制旋转覆盖和两个俯仰锁定。两者都不会改变 LB + Y 或所选功能。","Height":"高度","Hidden":"隐藏","Hidden UI stays quiet during normal gameplay. A recovery notice appears only when the game cursor or a known menu-rendering path indicates a menu. L3 + B restores UI. An unknown menu may not be detected; UEVR settings always retain the Show game UI button.":"正常游玩时隐藏 UI 不会显示提示。仅当游戏光标或已知菜单渲染路径表明菜单已打开时，才显示恢复提示。L3 + B 恢复 UI。未知菜单可能无法检测；UEVR 设置中始终保留“显示游戏 UI”按钮。","Hide Kuro material reflections (workaround candidate)":"隐藏 Kuro 材质反射（候选变通方案）","Hide body":"隐藏身体","Hide body in first person":"第一人称隐藏身体","Hide body, keep shadow":"隐藏身体，保留阴影","Hide body; keep original shadows":"隐藏身体，保留原阴影","Hide character rim lighting (optional workaround)":"隐藏角色轮廓光（可选临时方案）","Hide characters at your eyes":"隐藏眼前的角色","Hide characters at your eyes on / off":"开关隐藏眼前的角色","Hide head":"隐藏头部","Hide head bones keeps the visible body, but also removes the head from its shadow. Hide body; keep full character shadow requests hidden shadows only from the game's original visible shadow casters; it does not enable unused wings or effect rigs. Shadow support depends on the character/material.":"隐藏头部骨骼会保留可见身体，但也会从阴影中去掉头部。隐藏身体并保留原始阴影，只会请求原本可见且投影的组件继续投影，不会启用未使用的翅膀或特效骨架。阴影支持取决于角色和材质。","Hide head bones; full shadow copy":"隐藏头部骨骼，复制完整阴影","Hide head bones; keep body":"隐藏头部骨骼，保留身体","Hide head, full shadow":"隐藏头部，复制完整阴影","Hide player IDs":"隐藏玩家 ID","Hides the captured HUD and menus together. UEVR settings stay available; individual HUD elements cannot yet be moved separately.":"将捕获的 HUD 和菜单一起隐藏。UEVR 设置仍可使用；单个 HUD 元素尚无法单独移动。","Hiding off":"隐藏关闭","Hiding on":"隐藏开启","Higher follows the game camera more closely.":"数值越高，镜头越贴近游戏镜头。","Hint %d of %d. It then switches off; View hints on the WuWa VR menu's HUD page turns it back on.":"提示 %d／%d。之后将自动关闭；可在 WuWa VR 菜单的 HUD 页面通过“视图提示”重新开启。","Hold L3, or LT + RT, for half a second: a card rises under your view and shows what each button does, lighting each one as you press it. Let go and it sinks away.":"按住 L3 或 LT + RT 半秒：你视野下方会升起一张卡片，显示每个按键的功能，按下时对应键会亮起。松开后卡片会下沉消失。","Hold L3, or both triggers, for half a second: a card rises under your view and lights each button as you use it. Let go and it sinks away. L3 + Menu keeps it open. Close UEVR settings to see it; it is absent from the game's flat spectator view.":"按住 L3 或双扳机半秒：你视野下方会升起一张卡片，使用时对应按键会亮起。松开后卡片会下沉消失。L3 + Menu 可让其保持展开。关闭 UEVR 设置即可看到它；游戏的平面观战视图中不会显示。","Hold L3, then fully squeeze LT for the portal or RT for diorama. Keep the other trigger released; release all controls before repeating. Close UEVR and game menus and leave HUD/mouse adjustment first. Physical gamepad passthrough bypasses these shortcuts.":"按住 L3，再将 LT 按到底切换空间窗口，或将 RT 按到底切换微缩视角。保持另一侧扳机松开；再次操作前松开所有按键。请先关闭 UEVR 和游戏菜单，并退出 HUD／鼠标调整。手柄直通会绕过这些快捷键。","Hold L3: controls card":"按住 L3：操作卡片","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for full VR / stereo screen (hold: mono theatre on / off), click L3 for blur on / off (hold: stereo screen), press Y to hide characters at your eyes. With the triggers held, R3 can be clicked again.":"按住 LT + RT：单击 R3 切换完整 VR / 立体屏幕（按住：开关单目影院），单击 L3 开关模糊（按住：立体屏幕），按 Y 隐藏眼前的角色。保持按住扳机即可再次单击 R3。","Hold LT + RT: click R3 for the next view (full VR, stereo screen, mono), hold R3 for full VR; hold L3 for 0.8 s to toggle the screen. Screen off also exits mono. Mono keeps flat menu backgrounds and controls together.":"按住 LT + RT：单击 R3 切换下一个视图（完整 VR、立体屏幕、单眼），按住 R3 切回完整 VR；按住 L3 0.8 秒开关屏幕。关闭屏幕也会退出单眼。单眼会保持平面菜单背景与操作一同显示。","Hold LT + RT: views card":"按住 LT + RT：视图卡片","Hold RB":"按住 RB","Hold RB: full speed if Polar walk is on":"按住 RB：开启极地行走时以全速移动","Hold {L3} for everything else":"其他功能请按住 {L3}","Hold {L3}, then press":"按住 {L3}，然后按","Hold {LT}+{RT} for views":"按住 {LT}+{RT} 切换视图","Hold {LT}+{RT}, then":"按住 {LT}+{RT}，然后","Hold: mono theatre on / off":"按住：开关单目影院","Horizon level removes the game's camera pitch from the VR view. Turn it off for right-stick up/down look, and disable UEVR's Decoupled Pitch below. Head aiming is an alternative; grapple selection still needs game testing.":"保持地平线水平会移除 VR 视角中的游戏镜头俯仰。如需用右摇杆上下看，请关闭此项，并在瞄准设置中关闭 UEVR 的俯仰分离。也可尝试头部瞄准；钩锁目标选择仍需实测。","Hover drone":"悬停无人机","Hover drone (inertia)":"悬停无人机（惯性）","Hover drone: left stick moves horizontally, right stick looks, LT rises, LB descends, RT boosts. Release the stick to settle into a hover.":"悬停无人机：左摇杆水平移动，右摇杆观察，LT 上升，LB 下降，RT 加速。松开摇杆即悬停。","How big the world feels. Above 1 makes you smaller. Diorama uses its own scale and leaves this alone.":"世界的大小感受。大于 1 会让你变小。微缩景观使用自己的缩放，不受此项影响。","How far above or below your character's eyes your view sits. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"视角相对角色眼睛的高低。游戏中：按住 L3 再按 Y / X；L3 + Y + X 同时按可恢复默认。","How far away the HUD sits. Its stereo depth follows this distance.":"HUD 的距离。其立体景深会跟随此距离。","How far away the card is.":"卡片离你多远。","How far away this menu floats. UEVR's classic window uses the same distance.":"此菜单悬浮的距离。UEVR 经典窗口使用相同距离。","How far behind your character the camera stays, in game units (centimetres).":"镜头停留在角色后方的距离，以游戏单位（厘米）计。","How fast the freecam moves.":"自由镜头的移动速度。","How fast the freecam turns.":"自由镜头的转向速度。","How high above your character the camera sits, in game units. In the game: hold L3 and press Y / X; L3 + Y + X together puts it back to the default.":"镜头在角色上方的高度，单位为游戏单位。游戏中：按住 L3 再按 Y / X；L3 + Y + X 同时按可恢复默认。","How large the game's HUD and menus appear.":"游戏 HUD 和菜单的显示大小。","How large the game's HUD and menus appear. More HUD options are on the HUD page.":"游戏 HUD 和菜单的显示大小。更多 HUD 选项在 HUD 页面。","How much of its layer this menu fills. Smaller also reads as further away.":"此菜单在其图层中所占的比例。数值越小也会显得越远。","How near Close-up match may bring you to the person in the shot. Lower comes closer. Close-up match at 100 already gives the 2D size; this only stops it short when the shot is very tight.":"特写匹配可将你拉近到镜头中人物的最近距离。数值越低越近。特写匹配设为 100 时已等同 2D 尺寸；此数值仅在画面极度紧凑时会提前停住。","How small the world gets in diorama. 10x is an action-figure view. The diorama has its own camera distance (Camera page).":"微缩视角中世界缩小的程度。10 倍为手办般的视角。微缩视角有自己的镜头距离（镜头页）。","How strong the 3D is on the stereo screen. 1x matches the headset's eye distance to the lens; 0 is flat.":"立体屏幕上 3D 的强度。1x 与头显双眼到镜片的距离一致；0 为平面。","How to use view toggles":"视图切换操作说明","How wide the controls card is.":"操作卡片的宽度。","I understand that untested checks remain Not tested":"我理解未检查的项目仍为“未测试”","INSERT  =  OPEN UEVR":"INSERT＝打开 UEVR","INSERT > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"INSERT > WuWa Controls > 显示游戏界面","Idle":"空闲","Ignore motion input while OpenXR is unfocused (test)":"OpenXR 未聚焦时忽略动作输入（测试）","Ignores the game camera's up / down tilt, so only your head looks up and down. Steadier, and worth trying in gravity-flip areas such as Avinoleum.":"忽略游戏镜头的上下倾斜，因此只有你的头部会上下看。更稳定，值得在阿维诺勒姆等重力翻转区域尝试。","Immersive VR":"沉浸式 VR","In full VR the game lays out its HUD for a 4:3 screen, which then looks squashed; 1.33 undoes that. Raise it if round icons still look like flat ovals. The stereo screen and mono theatre always keep the game's own shape.":"在完整 VR 模式下，游戏按 4:3 屏幕排布 HUD，看起来会被压扁；1.33 可以抵消这一变形。如果圆形图标仍像是扁平椭圆，就调高该值。立体屏幕和单眼影院始终保留游戏本身的画面比例。","In story and dialogue shots, hold L3 and press Y to move nearer or X to move back; L3 + Y + X goes back to the game's spot. Keyboard: Page Up, Page Down and Home. It moves along the game camera's view and keeps following the shot's own camera moves. Game camera in full VR only.":"在剧情和对话镜头中，按住 L3 并按 Y 靠近，按 X 后退；L3 + Y + X 回到游戏原位。键盘：Page Up、Page Down 和 Home。沿游戏镜头的视线移动，并继续跟随该镜头自身的运镜。仅限完整 VR 中的游戏镜头。","In story close-ups nothing nearer than this is drawn. It slices characters and props open, so it is off by default (10 cm, the game's own value); Hide characters at your eyes is the cleaner fix. Game camera in full VR only.":"在剧情特写中，比此距离更近的物体不会绘制。它会把角色和道具切开，因此默认关闭（10 厘米，即游戏自身的数值）；“隐藏眼前的角色”是更干净的解决方法。仅限完整 VR 下的游戏镜头。","In story close-ups, a character right at your eyes but outside the flat shot (VR shows more around it) is hidden whole while it is there. Anyone the flat shot shows stays. Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then press Y.":"在剧情特写中，紧贴你眼前但位于平面画面之外（VR 能看到画面周围更多内容）的角色，在那里时会被整个隐藏。平面画面中出现的人都会保留。快捷键：按住 LT + RT，然后按 Y。","Include camera and controller data":"包含相机和手柄数据","Input candidates start off. Their effect on WuWa's intermittent combinations is not confirmed.":"输入候选项默认关闭。它们对 WuWa 间歇性组合键的影响尚未确认。","Input still pauses when WuWa loses focus. Real game menus temporarily restore the game camera and character visibility.":"鸣潮失去焦点时仍会暂停输入。打开实际游戏菜单时，会暂时恢复游戏镜头和角色显示。","Invalid profile value: ":"配置值无效： ","Invert acro pitch stick":"反转 Acro 俯仰摇杆","Joint inspector (left-eye preview)":"关节查看器（左眼预览）","Just mark the moment":"仅标记此刻","Keep WuWa VR Launcher running to record from here. Its browser tab can be closed.":"保持 WuWa VR 启动器运行才能从这里录制。其浏览器标签页可以关闭。","Keep both triggers held to click or hold R3 again.":"保持按住两侧扳机即可再次点按或按住 R3。","Keep camera and head hiding during Alt-Tab / UEVR settings":"切换窗口／打开 UEVR 设置时保留镜头与头部隐藏","Keep current view":"保持当前视图","Keep entire character visible":"显示整个角色","Keep first person horizon level (Custom)":"保持第一人称地平线水平（自定义）","Keep matched far-object detail (recommended)":"保持双眼远处物体细节一致（推荐）","Keep stereo camera transitions together":"保持双眼镜头过渡同步","Keep the controls card open":"保持操作卡片打开","Keep the mouse in the game window":"鼠标限制在游戏窗口内","Keep the nudge":"保留微调","Keep this card open":"保持此卡片打开","Keeps distant trees and props on the same level of detail in both eyes. This is the normal foliage repair; legacy comparison tests are separate.":"让双眼中的远处树木和物体使用相同细节等级。这是常规植被修复，与旧版对比测试相互独立。","Keeps the HUD where you expect it while decoupled pitch is on.":"开启分离俯仰时，让 HUD 保持在预期位置。","Keeps the horizon level in first person. Custom motion only.":"在第一人称下保持视线水平。仅限自定义运动。","Kuro character materials in both eyes (candidate)":"双眼使用 Kuro 角色材质（候选项）","L grip":"左握把","L stick":"左摇杆","L trigger":"左扳机","L3 + A":"L3 + A","L3 + A     Recenter view / portal":"L3 + A     视角／空间窗口归中","L3 + A also resets headset position (seated)":"L3 + A 也会重置头显位置（坐姿）","L3 + A resets position too":"L3 + A 也会重置位置","L3 + B":"L3 + B","L3 + B     Show / hide game UI":"L3 + B     显示／隐藏游戏界面","L3 + B  =  SHOW UI":"L3 + B＝显示界面","L3 + D-pad Down":"L3 + 十字键下","L3 + D-pad Down toggles full animation follow and your previous first-person motion. Custom keeps your saved settings. The other choices sample the head after animation. Animated position preserves normal stick aiming. Full animation follows character turns and bone rotation; it can be intense.":"L3 + 十字键下可在完整动画跟随与之前的第一人称运动选项间切换。自定义保留已保存设置，其他选项会在动画更新后读取头部位置。动画位置模式保留正常摇杆瞄准。完整动画会跟随角色转身和骨骼旋转，可能引起不适。","L3 + D-pad Down: animation follow on / off (first person)":"L3 + D-pad Down：开关动画跟随（第一人称）","L3 + LB    Return to normal game controls":"L3 + LB    恢复普通游戏操作","L3 + LB    Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"L3 + LB    切换 HUD／鼠标调整","L3 + LB  =  RETURN TO GAME CONTROLS":"L3 + LB＝恢复游戏操作","L3 + LB exits manual adjustment. Release all controls afterwards.":"L3 + LB 退出手动调整。之后请松开所有按键。","L3 + LB, release":"L3 + LB，松开","L3 + LT / F7":"L3 + LT / F7","L3 + LT / F7   Portal on / off":"L3 + LT / F7   开关空间窗口","L3 + Menu":"L3 + Menu","L3 + Menu  Keep the controls card open":"L3 + Menu  保持操作卡片打开","L3 + R3":"L3 + R3","L3 + R3    WuWa VR menu":"L3 + R3    WuWa VR 菜单","L3 + RB":"L3 + RB","L3 + RB    Game / fixed camera":"L3 + RB    游戏／固定镜头","L3 + RT":"L3 + RT","L3 + RT    Diorama on / off":"L3 + RT    开关微缩视角","L3 + View":"L3 + View","L3 + View  First person on / off":"L3 + View  开关第一人称","L3 + View toggles first person. These settings apply when first person is active.":"L3 + View 切换第一人称。这些设置在第一人称启用时生效。","L3 + Y / X":"L3 + Y / X","L3 + Y/X   Height; in story: nearer / back":"L3 + Y/X   高度；剧情中：靠近 / 后退","L3 means click and hold the left stick, then press B.":"按住左摇杆（L3），再按 B。","LB + LT/RT Fixed camera farther / closer":"LB + LT/RT 固定镜头拉远／拉近","LB + R3 utility shortcut remains available outside adjustment":"LB + R3 快捷功能在调整模式之外仍然可用","LB + R3: V once; hold 0.8 s for Tab wheel":"LB + R3：按一次 V；按住 0.8 s 呼出 Tab 轮盘","LB/RB      HUD down / up":"LB/RB      HUD 向下／向上","LT + RT, L3: blur (hold: stereo screen)":"LT + RT, L3：模糊（长按：立体屏幕）","LT + RT, R3: full VR / stereo (hold: mono)":"LT + RT, R3：完整 VR / 立体（长按：单目）","LT + RT, then Y":"LT + RT，然后按 Y","LT + RT, then click L3":"LT + RT，然后按下 L3","LT + RT, then click R3":"按住 LT + RT，再轻按 R3","LT + RT, then hold L3":"按住 LT + RT，再按住 L3","LT + RT, then hold R3":"LT + RT，然后长按 R3","LT/RT      HUD nearer / farther":"LT/RT      HUD 拉近／拉远","Language":"语言","Language / WuWa":"语言 / WuWa","Larger menu following view":"使用更大的跟随式菜单","Laser asleep: move the left controller or press a VR button.":"激光休眠：移动左手柄或按下 VR 按键。","Laser asleep: move the right controller or press a VR button.":"激光休眠：移动右手柄或按下 VR 按键。","Laser on: point the left controller and pull its trigger.":"激光已开启：用左手柄指向并扣动扳机。","Laser on: point the right controller and pull its trigger.":"激光已开启：用右手柄指向并扣动扳机。","Laser: no VR controllers found.":"激光：未找到 VR 手柄。","Last run: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"上次跑步：%s，行走 %s，游戏内 %.2f 公里。","Last used wins":"以最后使用的为准","Launch settings include any custom settings saved before starting this game. Supplied profile controls are the build's original choices, not UEVR factory defaults.":"启动设置包含本游戏启动前保存的所有自定义设置。此版本的默认操作是该版本原本的选择，而非 UEVR 的出厂默认值。","Launch settings restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"已恢复启动设置。继续前请松开所有按键。","Leave first person":"退出第一人称","Leave freecam":"退出自由镜头","Left":"左侧","Left / right":"左／右","Left / right moves between steps without answering. Your answers stay saved.":"左／右可在不回答的情况下切换步骤。你的回答会保留。","Left / right picks the kind of problem.":"左／右用于选择问题类型。","Left / right stick":"左／右摇杆","Left stick":"左摇杆","Left stick Cursor    A Click    B Back":"左摇杆 光标    A 点击    B 返回","Left stick Y (Mode 2)":"左摇杆纵轴（Mode 2）","Legacy automatic mouse can intercept game menu buttons. Manual L3 + LB adjustment remains the normal choice.":"旧版自动鼠标可能拦截游戏菜单按键。日常使用建议通过 L3 + LB 手动开启调整模式。","Legacy pitch-only override is active; choose either option above to replace it.":"当前启用旧版仅俯仰接管；选择上方任一选项即可替换。","Legacy stereo comparison bench (60-second tests)":"旧版立体渲染对比（每项 60 秒）","Level horizon":"水平视线","Link latest recording":"关联最近的录像","Linking saves the recording ID only. Review the video and add precise timestamps in the launcher.":"关联仅保存录像 ID。请在启动器中检查视频并添加准确时间戳。","Live input tests. Change one option, close this menu, then repeat the same action.":"实时输入测试。更改一个选项，关闭此菜单，然后重复相同的操作。","Local controller and camera data only, about 30 samples/sec. The clean-video recorder starts this automatically. It never presses buttons. Video/sidecar alignment uses timestamps, not a claim of GPU-frame synchronization.":"仅本地手柄和相机数据，约每秒 30 个采样。纯净视频录像器会自动启动此项。它绝不会按下任何按键。视频／附属文件的对齐使用时间戳，并不代表 GPU 帧同步。","Looks wrong? Hold LT + RT, then click R3 for the stereo screen (hold R3: mono).":"看起来不对？长按 LT + RT，然后按下 R3 切换到立体屏幕（长按 R3：单目）。","Low":"低处","Lower eye level by 5":"视点降低 5","Manual override; waiting for this scene to end":"手动覆盖；等待此场景结束","Mark this moment":"标记此刻","Match cinematic framing":"匹配电影镜头构图","Match cinematic framing between eyes (default on)":"匹配双眼过场取景（默认开启）","Match far detail between eyes":"匹配双眼的远景细节","Maximum pixels per eye":"每眼最大像素宽度","Maximum thrust / weight":"最大推重比","Menu":"菜单","Menu distance":"菜单距离","Menu left / right":"菜单左右","Menu place":"菜单位置","Menu size":"菜单大小","Menu up / down":"菜单上下","Miniature world (this launch only)":"微缩世界（仅本次启动）","Mode 2: centered left stick means 50%% throttle. An Xbox stick springs back to center; hold it down for zero throttle.":"Mode 2：左摇杆居中表示 50%% 油门。Xbox 摇杆会自动弹回居中；将其按住下方则油门为零。","Mono preserves your saved stereo-screen choice; screen off exits both screen modes. Neither changes portal or normal world scale. Manual toggles take priority over automatic cinema for the current scene.":"单目影院保留已保存的立体屏幕选项；关闭屏幕会退出两种屏幕模式。两者都不改变空间窗口或常规世界比例。在当前场景中，手动切换优先于自动影院模式。","Mono shows the same scene and HUD to both eyes. Use it for troublesome cutscenes or flat menus.":"单目影院向双眼显示相同的场景和 HUD，适用于显示异常的过场动画或平面菜单。","Mono theatre":"单目影院","Mono theatre (flat 2D)":"单目影院（平面 2D）","Mono theatre (no stereo)":"单目影院（无立体深度）","Mono theatre on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"开关单目影院（长按 0.8 秒）","Motion":"运动","Move cursor":"移动指针","Move map":"移动地图","Move menu":"移动菜单","Moves supported menus into the VR panel, including with Native Stereo Fix on. The supplied profile enables this. Some flat backgrounds still move separately; mono theatre is the manual fallback.":"将支持的菜单移入 VR 面板，也支持启用 Native Stereo Fix 时使用。随附配置已启用此项。部分平面背景仍会独立移动，可手动切换到单目影院作为临时处理。","Moves the HUD sideways.":"左右移动 HUD。","Moves the HUD up or down.":"上下移动 HUD。","Moves your diorama viewpoint sideways.":"左右移动你在微缩视角中的视点。","Moves your diorama viewpoint up, to look down on the miniature, or down.":"向上移动你在微缩视角中的视点以俯视微缩世界，或向下移动。","Moves your viewpoint forward from the game camera. Forward brings dialogue close-ups nearer, closer to how the 2D shot frames them. Applies in normal play too.":"将你的视点从游戏镜头向前移动。向前可使对话特写更近，更接近 2D 画面的构图。在正常游玩时同样适用。","Moves your viewpoint sideways from the game camera.":"将你的视点从游戏镜头左右移动。","Moves your viewpoint up or down from the game camera.":"将你的视点从游戏镜头上下移动。","Moving the menu: point where you want it, thumbstick up / down for distance, then pull the trigger.":"正在移动菜单：指向想放的位置，摇杆上下调整距离，然后扣动扳机。","Moving the menu: stick, D-pad or arrow keys. Right stick or Page Up / Down: distance. A or Enter: put it down.":"正在移动菜单：摇杆、十字键或方向键。右摇杆或 Page Up / Down：距离。A 或 Enter：放下。","Multiplies the blur in full VR. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"乘以完整 VR 中的模糊程度。1x 为 2D 视图的效果。","Multiplies the blur on the stereo screen and mono theatre. 1x is the 2D view's look.":"乘以立体屏幕和单眼影院中的模糊程度。1x 为 2D 视图的效果。","NOT SAVING":"未保存","Native Stereo":"Native Stereo","Native Stereo Fix frame timing (experimental)":"Native Stereo Fix 帧时序（实验）","Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix":"Native Stereo 搭配 Native Stereo Fix","Native game camera active (headset check pending)":"游戏原生摄像机已启用（待头显确认）","Native game camera unavailable; compatibility fallback":"游戏原生摄像机不可用；使用兼容方式","Navigate / activate / back":"选择／确认／返回","Near clip in close-ups":"特写中的近裁剪","New:":"新功能：","No active playtest connection. Keep the launcher running and open Developer playtests to start or resume a session.":"未连接到活动测试会话。请保持启动器运行，并打开“开发者测试”以开始或继续会话。","No run yet. Start one here, or open Reality Runner and walk.":"还没有跑步。可在这里开始，或打开 Reality Runner 后行走。","No supported direct PlayStation controller detected":"未检测到支持的 PlayStation 直连手柄","Normal scale: %.3fx. Your saved scale and camera presets stay unchanged; intentional scale edits become the new normal value.":"常规比例：%.3f 倍。已保存的比例和相机预设保持不变；主动修改比例后会使用新的常规值。","Not saved: %s":"未保存：%s","Not tested":"未测试","Note when someone is at your eyes":"有人在眼前时提示","Now: %s":"当前：%s","Observation":"观察备注","Off":"关闭","Off: UEVR opens its classic window, as before. You can turn this menu back on under VR > WuWa Controls.":"关闭：UEVR 会像以前一样打开经典窗口。你可以在 VR > WuWa 操作 下重新开启此菜单。","On":"开启","On by default. Detected story videos use mono; story pictures and story scenes use your choices above. Manual view changes take priority.":"默认开启。检测到的剧情视频使用单目影院；剧情图片和剧情场景使用上方的选择。手动切换视图优先。","On by default: both eyes render with a symmetric view, so its shading matches on rocks, hills and roofs. Off is a little faster.":"默认开启：两只眼睛以对称视野渲染，因此岩石、山丘和屋顶上的阴影一致。关闭会稍快一些。","On uses our LGUI capture. Off shows the game's original HUD in the eye images. This does not hide the UEVR settings panel.":"开启时使用我们的 LGUI 截取。关闭时在左右眼画面中显示游戏原始 HUD。这不会隐藏 UEVR 设置面板。","On: full VR lays out the HUD and menus like the flat game (16:9): round icons, story pictures whole, and the mouse hits what it points at. Off: 1.2.2's taller layout, where the Terminal fits on one page and the character screen's floor reflection keeps updating, but icons look flatter (HUD shape) and the mouse can miss.":"开启：完整 VR 会像平面游戏一样（16:9）排布 HUD 和菜单：图标是圆的，剧情图片完整，鼠标指哪点哪。关闭：使用 1.2.2 的较高布局，终端能在一页内显示，角色界面的地面倒影也会持续更新，但图标看起来更扁（HUD 形状），鼠标也可能点偏。","On: the HUD stays in front of your eyes. Off: it stays put in the world and you look at it.":"开启：HUD 始终位于眼前。关闭：HUD 固定在世界中，由你转头查看。","On: while the game is in front, the mouse stops at the window's edges, as in the flat game, so it cannot slip onto another monitor. Alt-Tab frees it. Off: the mouse moves freely between monitors.":"开启：游戏窗口在前台时，鼠标会停在窗口边缘，和平面游戏一样，不会滑到另一台显示器上。Alt-Tab 可解除。关闭：鼠标可在多台显示器之间自由移动。","On: your settings are saved whenever this menu opens or closes. Off: try things freely; nothing is saved, and the game starts with your saved settings next time. Turning it back on saves what you have now. For each setting, the help at the bottom says whether it is saved and what its default is.":"开启：每次打开或关闭此菜单时都会保存你的设置。关闭：可以随意尝试，不会保存任何内容，下次游戏仍以你已保存的设置启动。重新开启时会保存当前设置。对于每项设置，底部的说明会告诉你它是否会保存以及默认值是多少。","Only in first person and the fixed camera":"仅在第一人称和固定镜头中有效","Only slot 0":"仅槽位 0","Only slot 1":"仅槽位 1","Only slot 2":"仅槽位 2","Only slot 3":"仅槽位 3","Only the VR controllers work while on; the Xbox pad on this slot is ignored until you turn them off.":"开启期间仅 VR 控制器生效；关闭前会忽略此槽位上的 Xbox 手柄。","Open / close the WuWa VR menu":"打开／关闭 WuWa VR 菜单","Open the WuWa VR menu instead of this window":"打开 WuWa VR 菜单，而不是此窗口","Opens UEVR's full settings window. Every setting here edits the same values.":"打开 UEVR 的完整设置窗口。这里的每项设置编辑的都是相同的值。","Optical joint data received. Headset alignment and comfort still need a physical check.":"已收到光学关节数据。头显内的对齐效果与舒适度仍需实机确认。","Optional experiments and diagnostics":"可选实验与诊断","Optional workaround, off by default. Removes toon-depth rim lighting from all characters using it, including nearby characters. This hides the observed extra eye contour; it does not repair the underlying stereo cause. Restores the prior value when disabled, in 2D screen mode, or when native VR is inactive.":"可选临时应对方法，默认关闭。移除所有使用卡通深度边缘光的角色的此类效果，包括近处角色。这可隐藏已观察到的单眼额外轮廓，但并未修复立体渲染的根本原因。关闭此选项、进入二维屏幕模式或原生 VR 停用时，会恢复之前的数值。","Or hold the left Menu button for 1 second to turn them on or off; a buzz confirms. A quick press is still Start. Controllers without a Menu button (such as Index): while off, hold both stick clicks for 1 second to turn them on.":"也可按住左侧 Menu 键 1 秒来开启或关闭，手柄会振动确认。短按仍为 Start。没有 Menu 键的控制器（如 Index）：关闭状态下同时按住两侧摇杆 1 秒即可开启。","Or: UEVR > WuWa Controls > Show game UI now":"或：UEVR > WuWa Controls > 显示游戏界面","Pass":"通过","Paused in the diorama":"已在微缩景观中暂停","Paused: game camera in full VR only":"已暂停：仅限完整 VR 中的游戏镜头","Physical gamepad passthrough (test)":"实体手柄直通（测试）","Pick what went wrong and save. The time, the video position and your settings go into the wuwa-reports folder of the UEVR profile. Share it together with the video.":"选择出了什么问题并保存。时间、视频位置和你的设置会保存到 UEVR 配置的 wuwa-reports 文件夹。请连同视频一起分享。","Picture size":"画面尺寸","Pinned":"已固定","Pitch / roll rate (degrees / second)":"俯仰／横滚速率（度／秒）","Pixels per eye compared with what your headset asks for. Lower is smoother in full VR. It changes after a moment.":"每眼像素相对头显请求量的比例。在完整 VR 中越低越流畅。稍等片刻后生效。","Plan finished. Thank you!":"计划已完成。谢谢！","Plan finished. Your answers are saved for Claude in wuwa-steps / results.jsonl.":"计划已完成。你的回答已为 Claude 保存到 wuwa-steps / results.jsonl。","Plane":"固定翼","Plane FPV":"固定翼 FPV","Plane cruise speed (game units / second)":"固定翼巡航速度（游戏单位／秒）","Plane: right stick pitches/banks, left stick X steers yaw. RT increases cruise speed, LT decreases it. Hold LB to brake, RB to boost. Double R3 exits. Cruise pauses when focus or controller samples are lost; release controls then move a stick to rearm after Alt-Tab.":"固定翼：右摇杆俯仰／侧倾，左摇杆横向控制偏航。RT 提高巡航速度，LT 降低巡航速度。按住 LB 刹车，RB 加速。双击 R3 退出。失去焦点或手柄采样时巡航会暂停；Alt-Tab 后松开按键再拨动摇杆即可重新激活。","PlayStation connected; waiting for input reports and release":"PlayStation 已连接；等待输入报告并松开按键","PlayStation disconnected; waiting to reconnect":"PlayStation 已断开；等待重新连接","PlayStation input is unavailable or held exclusively; use Steam Input if available":"PlayStation 输入不可用或被独占；可用时请使用 Steam Input","PlayStation input received":"已收到 PlayStation 输入","PlayStation reader has not started":"PlayStation 输入读取尚未启动","PlayStation reader stopped; use Steam Input if available":"PlayStation 输入读取已停止；可用时请使用 Steam Input","PlayStation reader unavailable":"PlayStation 输入读取不可用","PlayStation reader unavailable: cannot retain backend module":"PlayStation 输入不可用：无法保留后端模块","PlayStation reports stopped; release controls after reconnecting":"PlayStation 输入报告已停止；重新连接后请松开所有按键","PlayStation shortcuts paused: WuWa shortcuts disabled":"PlayStation 快捷操作已暂停：鸣潮快捷操作已禁用","PlayStation shortcuts paused: an XInput slot is selected":"PlayStation 快捷操作已暂停：已选择固定的 XInput 槽位","PlayStation shortcuts paused: controller passthrough enabled":"PlayStation 快捷操作已暂停：手柄直通已启用","PlayStation: L1/R1 = LB/RB, L2/R2 = LT/RT, Cross/Circle/Square/Triangle = A/B/X/Y, Share/Create = View, Options = Menu.":"PlayStation：L1／R1 = LB／RB，L2／R2 = LT／RT，叉／圆／方／三角 = A／B／X／Y，Share／Create = View，Options = Menu。","Playtest launcher connection changed. Check whether the previous action was saved.":"测试启动器连接已更改。请检查上一次操作是否已保存。","Playtest launcher is not connected.":"测试启动器未连接。","Playtest launcher status is stale or belongs to another game.":"测试启动器状态已过期或属于另一个游戏进程。","Playtest request was not acknowledged. Check the launcher before repeating it.":"测试请求未收到确认。请先检查启动器，再决定是否重试。","Point and pull the trigger, or click. Scroll to see more.":"用手柄指向并扣动扳机，或点击。滚动查看更多。","Point with a controller and pull the trigger to put it down. Or use a stick, the D-pad, the arrow keys or WASD, and the right stick or Page Up / Down for distance; A, Enter or B puts it down. Gamepad shortcut: Y. Keyboard: M. Mouse: drag with the right button at any time.":"用手柄指向并扣动扳机放置。也可使用摇杆、D-pad、方向键或 WASD，并用右摇杆或 Page Up / Down 调整距离；A、Enter 或 B 放置。手柄快捷键：Y。键盘：M。鼠标：随时按住右键拖动。","Polar fly":"极地飞行","Polar fly: left stick moves along view, right stick looks. LT rises, LB descends; RT boosts, double RT gives turbo.":"极地飞行：左摇杆沿视线方向移动，右摇杆转动视角。LT 上升，LB 下降；RT 加速，双击 RT 进入涡轮加速。","Polar fly: simple flying. Hover drone: floats and drifts to a stop. Plane: always moves forward. Acro drone: full manual control.":"极地飞行：简单飞行。悬停无人机：漂浮并逐渐减速停下。固定翼：始终向前飞行。Acro 无人机：完全手动控制。","Polar shortcuts are disabled or bypassed.":"Polar 快捷键已禁用或被绕过。","Portal HUD sizing":"传送门 HUD 尺寸","Portal is off: using your separate HUD layout until it is enabled.":"空间窗口已关闭：在启用前使用你独立的 HUD 布局。","Portal on / off":"开关空间窗口","Portal window":"空间窗口","Post-process block ambiguous":"后期处理块不唯一","Post-process block not found in the view (try again outside a story scene)":"在视图中找不到后期处理块（请在剧情场景外重试）","PostProcessSettings not found":"找不到 PostProcessSettings","Preserve proportions at frame edges":"保持比例适配边框","Preserves both deactivation and keyboard focus events, including while this overlay is open. It applies to future events: after enabling, Alt-Tab away and back once. It does not bring the game to the foreground automatically.":"同时保留失活和键盘焦点事件，包括此叠加界面打开期间。它只对后续事件生效：启用后，Alt-Tab 切出再切回一次。它不会自动将游戏切换到前台。","Press: hide characters at your eyes":"按下：隐藏眼前的角色","Privacy box placement":"隐私遮挡框位置","Profile ID bottom":"配置 ID 底部","Profile ID left":"配置 ID 左侧","Profile ID right":"配置 ID 右侧","Profile ID top":"配置 ID 顶部","Quick":"快速","R grip":"右握把","R stick":"R 摇杆","R trigger":"R 扳机","RT / double RT":"RT／双击 RT","Raise eye level by 5":"视点升高 5","Readable HUD following view":"使用清晰的跟随式 HUD","Ready":"就绪","Reality Runner and other treadmills: keep Sharing on Both together and Controller slot on Automatic, so walking and the VR controllers work at the same time.":"Reality Runner 等跑步机：请将共用设为“同时使用”、手柄槽位设为“自动”，这样行走和 VR 手柄可以同时工作。","Reality Runner is open: 10 seconds of walking starts a run.":"Reality Runner 已打开：行走 10 秒即开始跑步。","Recenter headset / portal":"重新居中头显 / 空间窗口","Recenter keeps world scale and camera offsets. Simulator Home resets only the simulator, not the game's VR origin.":"重新居中保留世界比例和镜头偏移。模拟器的 Home 键仅重置模拟器，不会重置游戏中的 VR 原点。","Recenter view":"重新居中视角","Recentering with L3 + A also moves your seated position back to the middle.":"使用 L3 + A 重新居中时，也会把你的坐姿位置移回中间。","Record":"录制","Record camera and Xbox diagnostics":"录制镜头和 Xbox 诊断数据","Record video":"录制视频","Recorder: failed. See WuWa Controls > Recording in the classic menu.":"录制器：失败。请查看经典菜单中的 WuWa Controls > 录制。","Recorder: missing from this launcher package.":"录制器：此启动器包中缺少录制器。","Recorder: open the WuWa VR app (launcher) to record.":"录制器：请打开 WuWa VR 应用（启动器）以录制。","Recorder: ready.":"录制器：就绪。","Recorder: recording. Reports and marks note the time in the video.":"录制器：正在录制。报告和标记会记下视频中的时间。","Recorder: saved. Open recordings from the launcher.":"录制器：已保存。可从启动器打开录像。","Recorder: saving the video.":"录制器：正在保存视频。","Recorder: starting.":"录制器：正在启动。","Recorder: waiting for the launcher...":"录制器：正在等待启动器……","Recording":"录制中","Recording and privacy":"录制与隐私","Recording failed. See the message below.":"录制失败。请查看下方信息。","Recording saved. Use Open recordings in the launcher.":"录制已保存。请在启动器中使用“打开录像”。","Recording video. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"正在录制视频。关闭 UEVR 菜单以获得清晰画面。","Records the headset view through the WuWa VR app, which must be open. Player IDs are covered while it records (Hide player IDs, on the Record page).":"通过 WuWa VR 应用录制头显画面，该应用必须处于打开状态。录制时玩家 ID 会被遮挡（玩家 ID 遮挡，位于录制页面）。","Refill far lighting now":"立即刷新远处光照缓存","Reflection capture correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"反射捕获修正已停止，或无法验证此游戏版本。请查看诊断日志。","Reflection correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"反射修正已停止，或无法验证此游戏版本。请查看诊断日志。","Reflection projection correction":"反射投影校正","Refresh HUD layout":"刷新 HUD 布局","Refresh far lighting":"刷新远景光照","Refresh far-lighting cache (limited workaround)":"刷新远处光照缓存（适用范围有限）","Refresh position before drawing (Custom)":"绘制前刷新位置（自定义）","Refresh queued; requires the supplied Comfort script.":"已排队刷新；需要随包 Comfort 脚本。","Refreshes the far-lighting cache so distant lighting matches between eyes. A limited workaround.":"刷新远景光照缓存，使双眼看到的远处光照保持一致。一种有限的变通方案。","Release RT (Xbox) or pull left stick fully down (Mode 2), then tap RB to arm. Tap RB again or hold LB to pause/disarm. LB + RB levels the drone and stops it. Double R3 exits. Focus loss, menus and shortcut chords pause/disarm it; arm again to resume.":"松开 RT（Xbox）或将左摇杆完全推到底（Mode 2），然后轻按 RB 进入待命。再次轻按 RB 或按住 LB 暂停／解除待命。LB + RB 可使无人机保持水平并停下。双击 R3 退出。焦点丢失、菜单和快捷键组合会使其暂停／解除待命；再次待命即可继续。","Release all controls after entering/leaving":"进入／离开后释放所有操作","Reload language files":"重新加载语言文件","Render resolution":"渲染分辨率","Rendering comparisons (live)":"渲染对比（实时）","Report a problem":"报告问题","Requests a HUD layout refresh without opening ESC. If this game version is unsupported, the status explains why; saved HUD size and position stay unchanged.":"请求刷新 HUD 布局，无需打开 ESC 菜单。若当前游戏版本不受支持，状态会说明原因；已保存的 HUD 大小和位置保持不变。","Requests a bounded cascade-lighting-volume refresh after stereo starts or resumes, after detected teleports, or on request. It helped the tested ship/wheel lighting case; it is not a general fix for dark objects or character rims. Each refill can cause a short hitch.":"在立体渲染开始或恢复、检测到传送或手动请求时，进行有限次数的级联光照体积刷新。它改善了已测试的船体／车轮光照问题，并非所有暗物体或角色边缘光的通用修复。每次刷新可能造成短暂卡顿。","Requires Native Stereo Fix and Use Same Stereo Pass. Applies the pass correction before game-side view setup. Turn off to return to the previous correction. Culling and lighting acceptance is pending.":"需要 Native Stereo Fix 和 Use Same Stereo Pass。在游戏端视图设置之前应用通道修正。关闭可恢复到之前的修正。剔除和光照的验收仍在进行中。","Reset HUD aspect":"重置 HUD 宽高比","Reset HUD shape":"重置 HUD 形状","Reset camera offset":"重置镜头偏移","Reset diorama camera":"重置微缩视角镜头","Reset headset position and direction now":"立即重置头显位置和方向","Restart plan":"重新开始计划","Restore all controller slots":"恢复所有手柄配置槽","Restore controls from this launch":"恢复本次启动时的操作","Restore input settings from before comparisons":"恢复对比前的输入设置","Restore profile settings":"恢复配置设置","Restore renderer from before this comparison":"恢复本次对比前的渲染器","Restore supplied profile controls":"恢复此版本的默认操作","Restore this build's supplied controls, first-person/freecam settings, camera scale, aiming and HUD layout. Rendering and runtime selection are preserved. Temporary HUD/mouse mode is always turned off. You can undo the reset below.":"恢复此版本默认提供的操作、第一人称／自由镜头设置、镜头缩放、瞄准和 HUD 布局。渲染和运行时选择会保留。临时 HUD／鼠标模式始终关闭。你可以在下方撤销此重置。","Returns Windows XInput unchanged, bypassing VR and Lua gamepad processing. Use Insert and the mouse for this settings panel; gamepad shortcuts and VR controller mapping are unavailable in this mode.":"原样返回 Windows XInput，绕过 VR 和 Lua 手柄处理。此设置面板请使用 Insert 和鼠标；此模式下无法使用手柄快捷键和 VR 手柄映射。","Right":"右侧","Right / left":"右 / 左","Right trigger (Xbox)":"右扳机（Xbox）","Right-stick pitch; animated yaw and roll":"右摇杆俯仰；动画偏航与翻滚","Rim restoration failed; the original is retained. Toggle off, then on to retry restoration first.":"边缘光恢复失败；原值仍被保留。关闭后重新开启此选项，将先重试恢复。","Rim suppression was not verified. Toggle off, then on to retry safely.":"未能核实边缘光抑制结果。关闭后重新开启此选项可安全重试。","Rim variable is unavailable. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"边缘光变量不可用。关闭后重新开启此选项可重试。","Rim workaround is off.":"边缘光临时应对选项已关闭。","Rim workaround waits for active native stereo with 2D screen off.":"等待原生立体 VR 启用且二维屏幕关闭。","Rim workaround waits for the current graphics comparison to end.":"等待当前图形对比测试结束。","Room panel (stays put)":"房间面板（固定位置）","Run on: %s, walking %s, %.2f km in the game.":"跑步中：%s，行走 %s，游戏内 %.2f 公里。","Safe fit inside rounded edges":"适配圆角内侧","Save changes for next time":"保存更改到下次","Save observation":"保存观察备注","Save or discard your unsent note before finishing.":"请先保存或丢弃未发送的备注，再结束会话。","Save report":"保存报告","Saves \"skipped\" and shows the next step.":"保存“已跳过”并显示下一步。","Saves the camera and controller movement next to the video, to help find what went wrong.":"将镜头和手柄的移动数据与视频一起保存，帮助你找到出错的地方。","Saves the report now. Recording first makes it easy to find in the video.":"立即保存报告。先录制视频可以方便地在视频中找到对应位置。","Saves the time and current settings, so the moment is easy to find later.":"保存时间和当前设置，方便以后轻松找到这一刻。","Saves this answer with the settings now in use, then shows the next step.":"保存此答案及当前使用的设置，然后显示下一步。","Saving":"正在保存","Scene ending; restoring previous view":"场景即将结束；正在恢复之前的视图","Screen lens":"屏幕透镜","Screen view on / off":"开关屏幕视图","Screen views and cutscene options are in VR > WuWa Controls > View modes and cutscenes.":"屏幕视图和过场选项位于 VR > 鸣潮控制 > 视图模式与过场动画。","Screenshot":"截图","Scroll":"滚动","Second view":"第二视图","Second view does not match the first":"第二视图与第一视图不一致","Second view not writable; copy skipped":"第二视图不可写入；已跳过复制","Seconds of smoothing in the steady desktop window. More is calmer and trails turns more.":"稳定桌面窗口的平滑秒数。越大越平稳，转头时的滞后也越多。","Selected build: %s":"所选版本：%s","Send aim to player control rotation":"将瞄准方向传递给角色控制","Separate eyes: Synchronized Sequential":"分离双眼：同步顺序","Separate-eye rendering produced a black scene with HUD in the September 26 playtest. Native stereo is the working baseline. Submission metadata has been repaired, but separate-eye rendering is still an experiment, not a fix for labels/reflections/materials. Return to Native if the scene disappears.":"在 9 月 26 日的测试中，分离双眼渲染产生了带 HUD 的黑屏画面。Native Stereo 是当前可用的基准。提交元数据已修复，但分离双眼渲染仍属实验性功能，并不能修复标签／反射／材质问题。如果画面消失，请返回 Native Stereo。","Set portal toggle key":"设置空间窗口切换键","Set show / hide UI key":"设置显示／隐藏界面按键","Sets all three offsets back to 0, the game camera's own position.":"将三个偏移全部归零，即游戏镜头的自身位置。","Settings from before the reset restored; mouse mode remains off.":"已恢复重置前的设置；鼠标模式保持关闭。","Settings: D-pad selects, A activates, left stick scrolls the focused pane. Mouse wheel also scrolls. Release RT first: holding it adjusts the camera instead.":"设置操作：十字键选择，A 确认，左摇杆滚动当前面板，也可使用鼠标滚轮。请先松开 RT；按住时会改为调整镜头。","Sharing with Xbox / treadmill":"与 Xbox／跑步机共用","Shortcut: hold LT + RT, then click L3 to turn the blur on or off.":"快捷键：按住 LT + RT，然后按 L3 开关模糊效果。","Show / hide game HUD and menus":"显示／隐藏游戏 HUD 和菜单","Show / hide game UI":"显示／隐藏游戏界面","Show UI to see this menu":"显示界面才能看到菜单","Show all":"全部显示","Show extracted game UI":"显示提取的游戏界面","Show game UI now":"显示游戏界面","Show hover-drone / plane camera roll":"显示悬停无人机／固定翼镜头翻滚","Show optical hands (this launch only)":"显示光学追踪的双手（仅本次启动）","Showcase: one eye, steady, 16:9":"展示：单眼、稳定、16:9","Showcase: the left eye as a normal 16:9 video, steadied, with the HUD where you see it, at the game's own frame rate. Picture size 720, 1024 or 1280 px gives 720p, 1080p or 1440p. Needs SteamVR. Side by side: both eyes, to help find what went wrong.":"展示：将左眼录为普通 16:9 视频，经过稳定处理，HUD 位于你看到的位置，按游戏自身的帧率录制。画面尺寸 720、1024 或 1280 px 对应 720p、1080p 或 1440p。需要 SteamVR。双眼并排：录制双眼，便于查找问题。","Shows 3 times, then turns itself off (Cinema page).":"显示 3 次后自动关闭（影院页面）。","Shows the L3 card without holding anything. Shortcut: L3 + Menu. A loaded test plan shows its step there instead.":"无需按住任何按键即可显示 L3 卡片。快捷键：L3 + Menu。加载测试计划后，该处会改为显示计划步骤。","Shows the current step where the controls card usually is. Off shows the controls card, as a public release does; the plan stays loaded here.":"在通常显示操作卡片的位置显示当前步骤。关闭后显示操作卡片，与公开发行版一致；测试计划仍保留在此处。","Shows the world as a miniature around you, with the portal on or off. Needs Native Stereo. This launch only.":"将周围世界显示为微缩景观，空间窗口可开可关。需要 Native Stereo。仅本次启动有效。","Shrinks the world by the Diorama scale (%.0fx, set on the WuWa VR menu's Quick page) for an action-figure view, seen from the diorama camera (Camera page). Turn off to return to your normal scale. Works with or without the portal window.":"按微缩比例（%.0f 倍，在 WuWa VR 菜单的快捷页设置）缩小世界，营造手办般的微缩观感，并从微缩视角镜头（镜头页）观看。关闭后恢复常规比例，可与空间窗口同时使用，也可单独使用。","Simulator: keep its preview open, choose Both eyes / side-by-side, and turn Full render off. Recording uses the preview size.":"模拟器：保持其预览窗口打开，选择双眼／并排，并关闭完整渲染。录制使用预览窗口的尺寸。","Skip this step":"跳过此步骤","Slot 0":"槽位 0","Slot 1":"槽位 1","Slot 2":"槽位 2","Slot 3":"槽位 3","Smooth camera tilt":"平滑镜头俯仰","Smooth camera turns":"平滑镜头转向","Smooth transition between animation and game view":"平滑切换动画与游戏视角","Smoothing blends stick handovers and reported movement-state changes, such as takeoff/landing. It starts enabled on the supplied profile. Head position stays current; ordinary aiming and animation are immediate after the handover. Off restores the instant switch.":"平滑处理会混合摇杆接管和已报告的运动状态切换，例如起跳／落地。随附配置默认启用。头部位置持续更新；过渡结束后，普通瞄准和动画立即响应。关闭则恢复瞬间切换。","Smoothing speed":"平滑速度","Smoothness":"平滑度","Smooths head shake out of the game window for OBS recordings. The window then trails quick head turns a little, so leave it off while you play. The headset image is not changed.":"为 OBS 录制去除游戏窗口中的头部晃动。快速转头时窗口会稍有滞后，因此游玩时请保持关闭。头显中的画面不受影响。","Smooths head shake out of the game window, so OBS records a calm, full-resolution view with game audio. The headset image is not changed. The window shows a slightly narrower view so the picture can move inside it.":"消除游戏窗口中的头部晃动，让 OBS 能录制到带游戏音频的平稳全分辨率画面。头显中的画面不受影响。窗口显示的画面略窄，以便画面在其中移动。","Smooths the game camera's left / right turns, so quick camera swings feel gentler.":"平滑游戏镜头的左右转向，让快速转动的镜头更柔和。","Smooths the game camera's up / down tilt.":"平滑游戏镜头的上下俯仰。","Soft contact shadows in corners and under objects. On by default. It keeps the game's own setting and renders both eyes with a symmetric view, so rocks, hills and roofs shade the same in each eye; the picture is slightly softer. Off is a little faster.":"角落和物体下方柔和的接触阴影。默认开启。保留游戏自己的设置，并以对称视野渲染两只眼睛，使岩石、山丘和屋顶在两只眼睛中的阴影一致；画面会略微变软。关闭会稍快一些。","Something else":"其他","Speed":"速度","Stand where the far tree freezes, start a window, close the menu and look, then press what you saw. Each start or stop may cause a one-frame blur.":"站在远处树木静止的位置，开启一个窗口，关闭菜单后观察，然后按下你看到的结果。每次开始或停止都可能造成一帧模糊。","Start a developer playtest in the launcher, then save your observations here. Nothing passes automatically.":"先在启动器中开始开发者测试，再在此保存观察结果。不会自动判定通过。","Start and end runs automatically":"自动开始和结束跑步","Start and end treadmill runs automatically":"自动开始和结束跑步机跑步","Start motion sidecar (5 minutes max)":"开始动作数据记录（最长 5 分钟）","Start run":"开始跑步","Start video recording":"开始录制视频","Starting":"正在启动","Starting the recorder. Close the UEVR menu for a clear view.":"正在启动录制器。关闭 UEVR 菜单以获得清晰画面。","Starts again from step 1.":"从步骤 1 重新开始。","Status: VR controllers need the OpenXR runtime.":"状态：VR 控制器需要 OpenXR 运行时。","Status: blocked by Physical gamepad passthrough. Turn passthrough off to use VR controllers.":"状态：被实体手柄直通阻止。请关闭直通以使用 VR 控制器。","Status: blocked by the XInput controller slot filter. Allow slot %d or choose another slot.":"状态：被 XInput 手柄槽位过滤器阻止。请允许槽位 %d 或选择其他槽位。","Status: off. Xbox only.":"状态：关闭。仅 Xbox。","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on.":"状态：开启，正在等待 VR 控制器。请唤醒两只手柄并戴好头显。","Status: on, waiting for VR controllers. Wake both and keep the headset on; the Xbox still works.":"状态：开启，正在等待 VR 控制器。请唤醒两只手柄并戴好头显；Xbox 仍可使用。","Status: on, waiting for game focus. Click the game window.":"状态：开启，正在等待游戏获得焦点。请点击游戏窗口。","Status: on, waiting for the game to read controller slot %d. It is asked again a few times a minute; keep the game window focused.":"状态：开启，正在等待游戏读取手柄槽位 %d。每分钟会再请求几次；请保持游戏窗口处于焦点。","Status: on. Every controller steers this menu; the game gets no input until it closes.":"状态：开启。所有控制器都可操作此菜单；菜单关闭前游戏不会收到输入。","Status: on. VR controllers and Xbox both working.":"状态：开启。VR 控制器和 Xbox 均可使用。","Status: on. VR controllers in control; use the Xbox to switch.":"状态：开启。当前由 VR 控制器控制；使用 Xbox 即可切换。","Status: on. VR controllers working.":"状态：开启。VR 控制器可用。","Status: on. Xbox in control; use a VR control to switch.":"状态：开启。当前由 Xbox 控制；使用 VR 控制器即可切换。","Status: paused by the diagnostic motion-input mute.":"状态：已被诊断用的运动输入屏蔽暂停。","Steadiness":"稳定程度","Steadiness (seconds of smoothing)":"稳定度（平滑秒数）","Steady desktop view (for OBS and streaming)":"稳定的桌面视图（用于 OBS 和串流）","Steady desktop window":"稳定桌面窗口","SteamVR and the updated OpenXR Simulator are supported. VDXR capture is not available yet. Video has no audio and stops after five minutes. Actual frame rate depends on the game.":"支持 SteamVR 和更新后的 OpenXR Simulator。VDXR 捕获暂不可用。视频没有音频，且会在五分钟后停止。实际帧率取决于游戏。","Step":"步骤","Step card below you":"下方步骤卡片","Stereo rendering compatibility":"立体渲染兼容性","Stereo screen":"立体屏幕","Stereo screen (3D depth)":"立体屏幕（3D 深度）","Stereo screen on / off (hold 0.8 s)":"开关立体屏幕（按住 0.8 秒）","Stick expo (softens center)":"摇杆指数曲线（柔化中心）","Stop motion sidecar":"停止动作数据记录","Stop now":"立即停止","Stop the voice note or transcription in the launcher before finishing.":"请先在启动器中停止语音录制或转写，再结束会话。","Stop video recording":"停止录制视频","Stop voice activity and confirm untested checks before finishing.":"请先停止语音操作，并确认未测试项目，再结束会话。","Stopped":"已停止","Stopped: a write or restore failed. Restart the game before trying again.":"已停止：写入或恢复失败。请重启游戏后再试。","Stops the freecam at walls and the ground. Experimental.":"让自由镜头在墙壁和地面处停下。实验性功能。","Story camera nudge":"剧情镜头微调","Story camera nudge now: %s cm":"剧情镜头微调：当前 %s 厘米","Story camera nudge: waiting for a story shot":"剧情镜头微调：等待剧情镜头","Story cutscenes and dialogue":"剧情过场与对话","Story pictures":"剧情图片","Story pictures use":"剧情图片使用","Story scenes in 16:9":"剧情场景使用 16:9","Story scenes use":"剧情场景使用","Story shots: camera nearer / back (L3 + Y + X resets; keyboard Page Up / Page Down / Home)":"剧情镜头：镜头靠近 / 后退（L3 + Y + X 复位；键盘 Page Up / Page Down / Home）","Streamer privacy: cover player IDs":"直播隐私：遮挡玩家 ID","Stutter or freeze":"卡顿或冻结","Supplied profile restored. Release all controls before continuing.":"已恢复随附配置。继续前请松开所有控制键。","Swap the eyes' poses and projections (stereo looks inverted)":"交换双眼的位姿和投影（立体看起来反转）","Swap the eyes' render targets (stereo looks inverted)":"交换双眼的渲染目标（立体看起来反转）","Sweeps the camera against surfaces that block the game's Visibility trace. Slides along contact surfaces. Unsupported queries hold movement and report a reason below. Physical headset leaning is not constrained. Starts off; world geometry still needs live verification.":"让镜头沿阻挡游戏 Visibility 射线的表面扫掠，并沿接触面滑动。不支持的查询会阻止移动并在下方报告原因。实际头显的倾斜不受限制。默认关闭；世界几何体仍需实机验证。","Switches to a screen while a story video (mono theatre) or a story picture plays, then back to the view you had. Story scenes keep your view unless you choose otherwise below.":"播放剧情视频（单目影院）或剧情图片时切换到屏幕，结束后回到你原来的视图。除非你在下方另选，剧情场景会保持你的视图。","Sync left eye LOD to right eye (fix candidate)":"将左眼 LOD 同步到右眼（候选修复）","TEST":"测试","Target recording rate":"目标录制帧率","Test":"测试","Tests the game's default texture in place of custom reflections for the two main eyes. This is an effect-removal workaround, not a projection repair, and can also remove correct custom reflections. Starts off and restores on the next rendered views when disabled.":"在两个主眼上用游戏默认贴图替代自定义反射进行测试。这是一种移除效果的权宜方案，而非投影修复，也可能移除正确的自定义反射。默认关闭，禁用后会在接下来的渲染画面中恢复。","The 2D view's background blur, in full VR and on the stereo screen. In full VR the blur is scaled for the headset's wider lens and the focus follows Close-up match.":"2D 视图的背景模糊，在完整 VR 和立体屏幕上均生效。在完整 VR 中，模糊会按头显更宽的镜片缩放，对焦跟随近景匹配。","The Kuro material candidate stopped or could not verify this build. See the diagnostic log.":"Kuro 材质候选已停止，或无法验证此版本。请查看诊断日志。","The card is blocked by FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor. Turn that off to display it.":"该卡片被 FrameworkConfig > Always Show Cursor 阻挡。将其关闭即可显示。","The game builds one eye from a plain default camera, so that eye misses the shot's camera settings. Blur only copies the depth of field across; All camera effects also copies grading, vignette, exposure and the rest.":"游戏用纯默认相机构建其中一只眼，因此该眼会缺失镜头画面的相机设置。模糊仅复制景深；全部相机效果还会复制调色、暗角、曝光等其余设置。","The hand demo needs OpenXR with optical hand tracking. Xbox gameplay is unchanged.":"手部演示需要支持光学手部追踪的 OpenXR 运行时。Xbox 游戏操作保持不变。","The hand overlay renderer is unavailable. The joint inspector remains available; see the UEVR log for details.":"手部叠加渲染暂不可用。仍可使用关节查看器；详情请查看 UEVR 日志。","The hold gesture is unavailable while Enable motion-controller input is on; use this checkbox.":"开启“启用体感控制器输入”时无法使用长按手势，请使用此复选框。","The playtest session changed. Review it before saving.":"测试会话已更改。请先检查当前会话，再保存。","The previous character rim value was restored and verified.":"已恢复并核实之前的角色边缘光数值。","The recorder is missing from this launcher package.":"此启动器包中缺少录制器。","The rim variable changed; no old pointer was used. Toggle off, then on to retry.":"边缘光变量已改变；未使用旧指针。关闭后重新开启此选项可重试。","The selected package is recorded; this is not proof of the DLL loaded by the game.":"记录的是所选安装包，不代表游戏实际加载了该 DLL。","The session changed. Review your unsent note before adding it to this session.":"会话已更改。请先检查未发送的备注，再将其添加到当前会话。","The supplied profile enables this for Native Stereo Fix with OpenXR. Headset timing acceptance is still limited; disable only for a deliberate comparison.":"随附配置已为 Native Stereo Fix 与 OpenXR 启用此项。头显时序的实际验证仍有限；仅在有意进行对比测试时关闭。","The top-left box normally follows the ESC/overlay menu render path, including gamepad menus. Other popups using that same path may also show it. The bottom-right UID box stays on. Check your recording; unknown menu layouts are not guaranteed to be covered. Always is a manual fallback.":"左上角方框通常跟随 ESC／叠加菜单的渲染路径，包括手柄菜单。使用同一路径的其他弹窗也可能显示它。右下角 UID 方框保持启用。请检查你的录像；未知的菜单布局不保证被遮挡。始终 是手动备选方案。","These are UEVR's existing global aim settings, shared with VR > Input. They are not limited to first person.":"这些是 UEVR 现有的全局瞄准设置，与 VR > Input 共享。它们不限于第一人称。","These buttons use UEVR's existing live rendering options. The image may pause while render targets rebuild. They leave camera, HUD placement and controller settings alone. Opening this section changes nothing; UEVR saves whichever renderer you leave selected.":"这些按钮使用 UEVR 现有的实时渲染选项。重建渲染目标时画面可能暂停。它们不会改动镜头、HUD 位置和手柄设置。打开此区段不会有任何改变；UEVR 会保存你最终选定的渲染器。","These modes move the viewpoint; the character stays put. Acro is a camera flight model, without motor, propeller or battery simulation.":"这些模式移动视点；角色原地不动。Acro 是一种相机飞行模型，没有电机、螺旋桨或电池模拟。","These old comparison tests are separate from the normal far-object repair. Some deliberately invert or duplicate eye data; they are not recommended player settings.":"这些旧版对比测试与常规远处物体修复相互独立。部分测试会故意交换或复制单眼数据，不建议作为日常游玩设置。","This OpenXR runtime or headset does not provide hand tracking.":"当前 OpenXR 运行时或头显不提供手部追踪。","This is a flat rectangular HUD: corners can extend over rounded/feathered edges. Use Safe fit to keep every corner inside, or use a rectangular portal for exact alignment.":"这是一个扁平矩形 HUD：四角可能超出圆角／羽化边缘。使用安全适配让每个角落都保持在内部，或使用矩形空间窗口实现精确对齐。","This launch only: not saved.":"仅限本次启动：不会保存。","This older profile has no supplied-defaults file. Reset this build in the launcher while the game is closed, or use this launch's settings below.":"此旧配置没有随附的默认文件。请在游戏关闭时于启动器中重置此版本，或使用下方的本次启动设置。","This runtime cannot identify optical hands. Controller-derived joints are not shown.":"当前运行时无法确认光学追踪来源，因此不显示由控制器模拟的手部关节。","Times your run and saves your route in the game once a second, with a sync flash for OBS videos. With Reality Runner open, walking starts a run by itself (Controllers page).":"为你的跑步计时，并每秒保存一次你在游戏中的路线，同时为 OBS 视频提供同步闪光。打开 Reality Runner 时，行走会自动开始跑步（手柄页面）。","Toggle HUD / mouse adjustment":"切换 HUD／鼠标调整模式","Trace mesh triangles when supported":"在支持时追踪网格三角形","Track the camera":"跟随镜头","Track the camera: the distance is measured at each cut, then follows only the game camera's own moves, so a focus change cannot move you. Fixed per shot: the distance stays as it was at the cut. Follow the focus: it also moves when the game changes focus.":"跟随镜头：每次切换时测量距离，之后仅跟随游戏镜头自身的移动，因此焦点变化不会移动你。每个镜头固定：距离保持切换时的值。跟随焦点：游戏改变焦点时也会随之移动。","Transition duration (seconds)":"过渡时长（秒）","Translucency correction stopped or could not verify this game build. See the diagnostic log.":"半透明校正已停止，或无法验证此游戏版本。请查看诊断日志。","Treadmill":"跑步机","Treadmill run":"跑步机跑步","Try headset aim":"试用头显瞄准","Turn speed":"转向速度","Turn this note off in the menu, Cinema page.":"在菜单的影院页面中关闭此提示。","Turn this off to isolate your physical gamepad. Head tracking stays enabled.":"将其关闭可隔离你的实体游戏手柄。头部追踪保持启用。","UEVR > WuWa Controls > Exit mouse mode now":"UEVR > WuWa Controls > 立即退出鼠标模式","UI placement":"界面位置","UID bottom":"UID 下","UID left":"UID 左","UID right":"UID 右","UID top":"UID 上","Unavailable while another graphics test runs.":"另一个图形测试运行期间不可用。","Unavailable: %s":"不可用：%s","Unavailable: the eye pair is not verified yet (or this game build is not supported).":"不可用：眼对尚未验证（或此游戏版本不受支持）。","Undo last controls reset":"撤销上次操作重置","Unoccluded hand skeleton demo: hands draw over the game. No grabbing, collisions or gesture controls. Xbox remains gameplay.":"无遮挡手部骨架演示：双手叠加显示在游戏画面上，不支持抓取、碰撞或手势操作。游戏仍使用 Xbox 手柄。","Unsupported PlayStation input report; use Steam Input if available":"不支持此 PlayStation 输入报告；可用时请使用 Steam Input","Until the next cut":"直到下一个镜头切换","Until the next cut: each shot starts at the game's spot again. For the whole scene: your nudge stays until the story shots end.":"直到下一个镜头切换：每个镜头都从游戏原位重新开始。整个场景：你的微调会保留到剧情镜头结束。","Up / down":"上／下","Use a keyboard for text. Voice notes require explicit microphone consent in the developer web panel.":"请用键盘输入文字。语音备注需要在开发者网页面板中明确同意使用麦克风。","Use game aim for full animation":"完整动画使用游戏瞄准","Use game view while either stick moves":"任一摇杆移动时使用游戏视角","Use native stereo":"使用原生立体","Use right-stick pitch":"使用右摇杆俯仰","Use separate-eye renderer":"使用分眼渲染器","Use the VR controllers as an Xbox pad for walking and sightseeing. Holding the left Menu button for 1 second also turns them on or off.":"将 VR 手柄用作 Xbox 手柄来行走和观光。按住左手 Menu 键 1 秒也可开启或关闭。","Use this menu when opening UEVR":"打开 UEVR 时使用此菜单","Used instead of the offsets above while the diorama is on. The diorama makes your eyes far apart, so a camera that suits normal play puts the character too close and crosses your eyes. The default, 5 m back, shows it about an arm's length away at 10x.":"微缩视角开启时代替上方的偏移使用。微缩视角会让双眼间距变得很大，因此适合正常游玩的镜头会让角色离得太近，让你对眼。默认的后退 5 米在 10 倍时会让角色大约在一臂之外。","Uses one game camera pose for both eyes during the same frame, while preserving headset movement and eye separation. Requires Native Stereo Fix. The owner confirmed the ultimate return-to-gameplay fix. Other scene transitions remain under test; this does not repair foliage.":"同一帧的双眼使用同一游戏镜头姿态，同时保留头显移动和双眼间距。需要 Native Stereo Fix。作者已确认大招结束回到游玩时的错位得到修复。其他场景过渡仍待测试；此项不修复植被。","Uses the game's full-resolution translucency path for ordinary two-eye views. Compare Lynae, Mornye and Iuno in both eyes. May cost performance. Requires Native Stereo with Native Stereo Fix and Extreme Compatibility off; other renderers keep their normal behavior.":"普通双眼视图使用游戏的全分辨率半透明路径。用双眼对比 Lynae、Mornye 和 Iuno。可能影响性能。需要原生立体、原生立体修复和极致兼容均已关闭；其他渲染器保持其正常行为。","V once; hold 0.8 s for the Tab wheel":"按一次 V；按住 0.8 秒打开 Tab 轮盘","VR controllers":"VR 手柄","VR controllers for walking (optional)":"VR 控制器漫游（可选）","VR controllers on (this launch)":"启用 VR 控制器（本次启动）","VR controllers: point and pull the trigger, or use either stick and A. B closes, the grips change page. Xbox: D-pad or stick, A, B, LB / RB. Keyboard: arrows, Enter, Esc, Tab. Mouse: click and scroll.":"VR 手柄：指向并扣动扳机，或使用任意摇杆和 A。按 B 关闭，按握把切换页面。Xbox：D-pad 或摇杆、A、B、LB / RB。键盘：方向键、Enter、Esc、Tab。鼠标：点击和滚轮。","VR only (Xbox ignored)":"仅 VR（忽略 Xbox）","Video style":"视频样式","View":"视图","View hints":"视图提示","View modes and cutscenes":"视图模式与过场动画","Views hold unexpected values; copy skipped":"视图中的数值异常；已跳过复制","WHILE ADJUSTMENT IS ON":"调整中","Wait for an active playtest in the launcher.":"请等待启动器中出现活动测试会话。","Wait for the launcher operation to finish.":"请等待启动器操作完成。","Waiting for a close-up (lens now %s degrees)":"等